udience to step out of their comfort zone and book an unforgettable winter journey.","audience":"Adventure seekers, nature lovers, and travelers looking for an otherworldly winter escape.","tone":"majestic, serene, awe-inspiring, inviting","goal":"Inspire the viewer to book a winter trip to Iceland to experience its raw natural beauty firsthand.","keyMessages":["Discover the surreal beauty of Iceland's winter landscapes.","Contrast freezing glacial lagoons with the warmth of steaming hot springs.","Witness the spectacular dance of the northern lights over black sand beaches."],"mustIncludeFacts":["glacial lagoons","black sand beaches","northern lights","steaming hot springs"],"brandColors":["#0D1B2A","#E0E1DD","#415A77","#52B788"],"suggestedFramePack":"biennale-yellow","suggestedDuration":20,"musicMood":"ethereal ambient neoclassical","voProfile":"female, warm, low-register, awe-struck and inviting"},"script":{"title":"Iceland Winter: A Surreal Escape","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":4,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Some places defy imagination.","onScreenText":["A WORLD APART","ICELAND IN WINTER"],"visualDirection":"A majestic wide aerial shot of a snowy Icelandic mountain emerging through soft winter mist.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"iceland winter mountain aerial","role":"background"}],"sfx":["low wind howl"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":4,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Where glacial lagoons meet dramatic black sand beaches.","onScreenText":["GLACIAL LAGOONS","BLACK SAND BEACHES"],"visualDirection":"A cinematic split-screen contrasting glowing blue glacial ice with dark waves crashing on black sand.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"glacial lagoon ice","role":"background"},{"type":"video","query":"black sand beach waves","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["ocean swell"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":8.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"And steaming hot springs melt the winter cold.","onScreenText":[