k, high-precision demonstration of Nimbus's minute-by-minute hyper-local radar, and closes with a bold, high-contrast call to action to download the app for free.","audience":"Urban commuters, pedestrians, and daily walkers who need precise, hyper-local weather forecasting.","tone":"playful, confident, fast, energetic","goal":"Convince the viewer to download the Nimbus app to avoid getting caught in sudden rain.","keyMessages":["Nimbus predicts rain to the minute for your exact street.","Never get caught unprepared in a downpour again.","Download Nimbus for free today."],"mustIncludeFacts":["Nimbus predicts rain to the minute for your exact street.","Download Nimbus free."],"brandColors":["#00D2FF","#FFD200","#1A1A1A"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":20,"musicMood":"punchy electronic pop","voProfile":"female, late 20s, energetic, relatable, fast-paced"},"script":{"title":"Nimbus: Never Get Caught in the Rain","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Hate getting soaked on your commute?","onScreenText":["SOAKED AGAIN?"],"visualDirection":"Split-screen layout showing a frustrated, wet commuter holding a broken umbrella in a sudden city downpour.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"wet commuter rain street","role":"background"}],"sfx":["heavy rain"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Generic forecasts don't save you from sudden downpours.","onScreenText":["GENERIC FORECASTS","DON'T WORK"],"visualDirection":"A hand holding a smartphone showing a generic rain cloud icon while real rain heavily blurs the background.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"hand holding phone rain","role":"inset"}],"sfx":[],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":7.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"But Nimbus predicts rain to the minute for your exact street.","onScreenText":["NIMBUS","TO THE MINUTE","YOUR STREET"],"visualDirection":"A sleek smartphone mockup sli