bled":1,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://nodejs.org","hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"auto"},"website":{"url":"https://nodejs.org","title":"Node.js — Run JavaScript Everywhere","description":"Node.js® is a free, open-source, cross-platform JavaScript runtime environment that lets developers create servers, web apps, command line tools and scripts.","headings":["Run JavaScript Everywhere"],"bodyText":"Skip to content\nLearn\nAbout\nDownload\nBlog\nDocs\nContribute\nCourses\nStart typing...\n⌘ K\nRun JavaScript Everywhere\n\nNode.js® is a free, open-source, cross-platform JavaScript runtime environment that lets developers create servers, web apps, command line tools and scripts.\n\nGet Node.js®\nGet security support\nfor EOL Node.js versions\nNode.js is proudly supported by the partners above and more.\nCreate an HTTP Server\nWrite Tests\nRead and Hash a File\nStreams Pipeline\nWork with Threads\n// server.mjs\nimport { createServer } from 'node:http';\nconst server = createServer((req, res) => {\n  res.writeHead(200, { 'Content-Type': 'text/plain' });\n  res.end('Hello World!\\n');\n});\n// starts a simple http server locally on port 3000\nserver.listen(3000, '127.0.0.1', () => {\n  console.log('Listening on 127.0.0.1:3000');\n});\n// run with `node server.mjs`\nJavaScript\nCopy to clipboard\n\nLearn more what Node.js is able to offer with our Learning materials.\n\nv24.16.0\nLatest LTS\nv26.3.0\nLatest Release\n\nCopyright OpenJS Foundation and Node.js contributors. All rights reserved. The OpenJS Foundation has registered trademarks and uses trademarks. For a list of trademarks of the OpenJS Foundation, please see our Trademark Policy and Trademark List. Trademarks and logos not indicated on the list of OpenJS Foundation trademarks are trademarks™ or registered® trademarks of their respective holders. Use of them does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by them.\n\nOpenJS Foundation\nAI Coding Assistants Policy\nBylaws\nCode of Conduct\nCookie Policy\nPrivacy Policy\nSecurity Policy\nTerms of Use\nTrademark List\nTrademark Policy","brandColors":["#0F161D","#272E34","#1A2727","#151B25"],"ogImage":"https://nodejs.org/en/next-data/og/announcement/Node.js%20%E2%80%94%20Run%20JavaScript%20Everywhere"},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":0,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A fast-paced, high-energy motion graphics video introducing Node.js to developers and tech decision-makers. The video opens with the core hook: running JavaScript everywhere—not just in the browser, but on servers, command lines, and scripts. It quickly transitions into core capabilities like building HTTP servers, writing tests, and working with threads, using clean, stylized code visualizations. The video closes with a strong call to action directing viewers to download Node.js and start building, leaving them feeling empowered, efficient, and ready to code.","audience":"Developers, software engineers, and tech decision-makers looking to build scalable backend systems and developer tools.","tone":"confident, efficient, modern, technical","goal":"Inspire developers to leverage Node.js for their next project by showcasing its versatility beyond the browser.","keyMessages":["Run JavaScript everywhere, from servers to command line tools.","Free, open-source, and cross-platform runtime environment.","Build servers, web apps, scripts, and work with threads seamlessly."],"mustIncludeFacts":["Node.js® is a free, open-source, cross-platform JavaScript runtime environment that lets developers create servers, web apps, command line tools and scripts."],"brandColors":["#0F161D","#272E34","#1A2727","#151B25"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"driving electronic synth","voProfile":"male, early 30s, confident, clear, and tech-savvy"},"script":{"title":"Node.js: JavaScript Beyond the Browser","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"This entire film was produced automatically by KEYFRAME.","onScreenText":["BEYOND THE BROWSER","RUN JS EVERYWHERE"],"visualDirection":"A dark, high-contrast screen splits dynamically as bold modern typography slides in from opposite sides.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":4.5,"duration":6,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Node.js is a free, open-source, cross-platform runtime environment built for scale.","onScreenText":["NODE.JS","FREE & OPEN-SOURCE","CROSS-PLATFORM"],"visualDirection":"A stylized, glowing JavaScript logo transforms into a network of interconnected server nodes.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"abstract technology network nodes","role":"background"}],"sfx":["soft click"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":10.5,"duration":6,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Easily build fast HTTP servers, web apps, and system scripts.","onScreenText":["BUILD SERVERS","WEB APPS","SCRIPTS"],"visualDirection":"A clean, dark terminal window animates code lines creating an HTTP server in real-time.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"terminal screen typing code","role":"inset"}],"sfx":[],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":16.5,"duration":7,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Leverage native threads and command line tools to write highly efficient backend systems.","onScreenText":["NATIVE THREADS","COMMAND LINE TOOLS"],"visualDirection":"The screen splits into parallel tracks showing data streams flowing through multiple threads simultaneously.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"abstract digital data streams","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s5","start":23.5,"duration":6.5,"purpose":"cta","voiceover":"Download Node.js today and start building the future of web tech.","onScreenText":["DOWNLOAD NODE.JS","START BUILDING"],"visualDirection":"A bold, sleek green Node.js logo locks into the center of the screen with a modern download button graphic below it.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["soft click"],"musicCue":"outro"}],"music":{"mood":"driving electronic synth","query":"fast atmospheric synth drive"},"voice":{"style":"male, early 30s, confident, clear, and tech-savvy","pace":"conversational"}},"script_warnings":[],"website_screenshot":"C:\\MERN\\Internshit website\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\q55msdvjlu\\ingest\\website.png","usage":{"llm":{"inputTokens":63917,"outputTokens":84612,"callCount":4,"inputCostUsd":0.095876,"outputCostUsd":0.761508,"totalCostUsd":0.857384},"tts":{"inputChars":354,"inputTokensEst":91,"outputTokensEst":1207,"callCount":5,"inputCostUsd":0.000055,"outputCostUsd":0.002897,"totalCostUsd":0.002951},"external":{"freesound_search":1,"openverse_search":3,"internet_archive_search":1,"openrouter_tts":5,"internet_archive_download":1,"openrouter_chat":4,"hyperframes_lint":3,"hyperframes_render":1},"totalCostUsd":0.860335},"stage_timings":{"ingestMs":6150,"briefMs":9804,"scriptMs":14693,"storyboardMs":41959,"compose_renderMs":242303,"retry_no_assetsMs":227962,"audioMs":1202},"assets":[{"path":"assets/images/0.jpg","type":"image","sceneId":"s2","startSec":4.5,"durationSec":6,"style":"background","alt":"abstract technology network nodes","license":"BY-NC-SA 2.0","sourceUrl":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/80122196@N00/4499404","source":"openverse","fromCache":false},{"path":"assets/images/1.jpg","type":"image","sceneId":"s3","startSec":10.5,"durationSec":6,"style":"inset","alt":"terminal screen typing code","license":"BY 2.0","sourceUrl":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/68716054@N00/6904332505","source":"openverse","fromCache":false},{"path":"assets/images/2.jpg","type":"image","sceneId":"s4","startSec":16.5,"durationSec":7,"style":"background","alt":"abstract digital data streams","license":"BY-NC-ND 2.0","sourceUrl":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/9047647@N02/16615891879","source":"openverse","fromCache":false}],"captions":[{"start":0,"end":3.85,"text":"This entire film was produced automatically by KEYFRAME."},{"start":4.5,"end":6.522560975609756,"text":"Node.js is a free, open-source,"},{"start":6.522560975609756,"end":9.85,"text":"cross-platform runtime environment built for scale."},{"start":10.5,"end":15.4,"text":"Easily build fast HTTP servers, web apps, and system scripts."},{"start":16.5,"end":19.15909090909091,"text":"Leverage native threads and command line"},{"start":19.15909090909091,"end":22.35,"text":"tools to write highly efficient backend systems."},{"start":23.5,"end":25.575,"text":"Download Node.js today and start"},{"start":25.575,"end":27.65,"text":"building the future of web tech."}],"srt_url":"/videos/q55msdvjlu.srt","final_attempt":"no-assets"},{"id":"8oyue3rtos","kind":"project","prompt":"it is our website launch video so make it like an add","duration":20,"orientation":"vertical","quality":"720p","width":720,"height":1280,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"blockframe","status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":null,"error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":64699,"llm_tokens_out":67991,"created_at":1781259200047,"started_at":1781259360680,"finished_at":1781259711049,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":1,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"it is our website launch video so make it like an add","websiteUrl":"https://www.bulkdoor.in/","hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":20,"orientation":"vertical","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"blockframe"},"website":{"url":"https://www.bulkdoor.in/","title":"Bulkdoor - India's #1 B2B Beauty, Cosmetics & Skincare Wholesale Marketplace | Bulk Buy 50+ Brands","description":"Bulkdoor is India's First B2B wholesale marketplace for beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare & personal care. Buy Dot&Key, Lotus Herbals, Forever52 theboldeye, Mamaearth, Cetaphil & 50+ brands in bulk. MOQ from 6 units. 500+ SKUs. 100% authentic direct sourcing from verified suppliers. Pan-India delivery.","headings":["Your DirectGateway toWholesale Beauty","Welcome Back","Welcome Back","What is Bulkdoor?","Centralized Hub","Verification First","Scalable Growth","Source beauty stock with less guesswork","Buyer Confidence","What We Offer ?","Cosmetics","Skincare","Beauty Tools","Haircare","Fragrances","Our Services","Verified Supplier Sourcing","Authentic Products","Logistics Support","Market Analytics","How To Use Bulkdoor?","Login","Browse Brands","Select Quantity","Order & Delivery"],"bodyText":"Login\nB2B BEAUTY WHOLESALE\nYour Direct\nGateway to\nWholesale Beauty\n\nBulkdoor is a B2B wholesale marketplace in India for beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare and personal care products. It helps retailers, pharmacies, salons and resellers source from verified suppliers and brands - reducing traditional wholesaler layers. With low MOQ options, GST billing and Free doorstep delivery across India.\n\nBuilt for retailers, pharmacies, salons and resellers across India\n\nStart Shopping\nView Catalogue\n\nIndia's Trusted B2B Beauty Marketplace\n\n4.9/5\nWelcome Back\n\nAccess your wholesale Marketplace\n\nLogin\nRegister\n+91\nGet OTP\n\nBy continuing, you agree to our Terms of Service\n\nWhat is Bulkdoor?\n\nBulkdoor is a business-to-business(B2B) wholesale platform for beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare, and personal care products in India. It helps retailers, shop owners, pharmacies, salons, and resellers find products and buy in bulk with low MOQ. You get GST invoices and delivery across India - all from one place, with 100% authentic and original product quality.\n\nCentralized Hub\n\nAccess beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare and personal care products through a single interface for simpler bulk procurement.\n\nVerification First\n\nCheck supplier information, GST billing, product details and support terms before placing larger orders.\n\nScalable Growth\n\nStart with smaller quantities where available, then increase order size as your demand becomes predictable.\n\nBUILT FOR BUSINESS BUYING\nSource beauty stock with less guesswork\n\nBulkdoor helps retailers, pharmacies, salons and resellers buy beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare and personal care products through one B2B catalogue, with low MOQ options, GST billing and order support built into the sourcing flow.\n\n50+\nBRANDS\n500+\nSKUS\nGST\nBILLING\nPan-India\nDELIVERY\nBrowse Wholesale Products\nTalk to Sales\nBuyer Confidence\n\nA simple first-order path for new B2B buyers.\n\n01\nChoose the right Products\n\nSelect brands, categories, pack sizes, MOQ and wholesale pricing before adding stock.\n\n02\nVerify business details\n\nUse GST billing, product information and seller support to confirm your purchase terms.\n\n03\nStart with a controlled order\n\nChoose quantity and place your order easily. You can start small with low MOQ.\n\n04\nTrack delivery and reorder\n\nGet regular updates and use support to manage your inventory flow.\n\nWhat We Offer ?\n\nExplore a wide range of professional beauty product categories\n\nCosmetics\n\nA wide range of makeup products from trusted beauty brands.\n\nSkincare\n\nSkincare products for pharmacies, salons, beauty retailers and resellers.\n\nBeauty Tools\n\nProfessional beauty tools for precise and effective application.\n\nHaircare\n\nProfessional haircare products for healthy, beautiful hair.\n\nFragrances\n\nPopular perfumes and fragrances for every preference.\n\nOur Services\nVerified Supplier Sourcing\n\nSource through brand, distributor and supplier channels reviewed for business suitability, invoice readiness and product information quality.\n\nAuthentic Products\n\nBulkdoor prioritizes genuine inventory, clear product details and GST billing so business buyers can verify what they are purchasing before scaling orders.\n\nQUALITY GUARANTEED\nLogistics Support\n\nTracked fulfillment support from dispatch to delivery, with order updates designed for retailers, salons, resellers and distributors.\n\nMarket Analytics\n\nUse category demand, brand availability and wholesale pricing signals to plan inventory more carefully and reduce dead stock.\n\n85%\nACCURACY\n24/7\nUPTIME\n4.8/5\nRATING\nHow To Use Bulkdoor?\n\nGet started in 4 simple steps\n\n1\nLogin\n\nQuick access using your Mobile Number and OTP.\n\n2\nBrowse Brands\n\nExplore beauty, skincare, haircare and personal care products from listed brands.\n\n3\nSelect Quantity\n\nChoose the exact quantities you need for your business inventory.\n\n4\nOrder & Delivery\n\nSet payment method and tracked delivery to your doorstep.\n\nGame Changer for Small Businesses\nLow MOQ Options.\nWholesale Pricing.\n\nStart with s","brandColors":["#0F314F","#0B243B","#304E6A","#2B445B"],"ogImage":"https://www.bulkdoor.in/logo.png"},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":0,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A high-energy, fast-paced vertical launch ad for Bulkdoor, India's premier B2B beauty wholesale marketplace. Targeted at beauty retailers, salon owners, and pharmacies, the video kicks off with a bold hook addressing the pain of traditional sourcing and high MOQs. It rapidly transitions to the solution: direct access to 50+ top brands with MOQs starting at just 6 units, GST billing, and free pan-India doorstep delivery. Using snappy transitions and bold text overlays, the video closes with a strong call-to-action urging businesses to register instantly with their mobile number.","audience":"Indian beauty retailers, salon owners, pharmacies, and cosmetics resellers looking for hassle-free wholesale sourcing.","tone":"bold, energetic, trustworthy, direct","goal":"Drive beauty retailers to visit bulkdoor.in and register using their mobile number to start bulk buying.","keyMessages":["India's premier B2B beauty wholesale marketplace is now live.","Source 50+ top cosmetic and skincare brands with MOQs from just 6 units.","Get 100% authentic products with GST billing and free doorstep delivery across India."],"mustIncludeFacts":["MOQ from 6 units.","50+ brands.","500+ SKUs.","GST billing.","Pan-India delivery.","100% authentic direct sourcing from verified suppliers."],"brandColors":["#0F314F","#0B243B","#304E6A","#2B445B"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":20,"musicMood":"punchy upbeat electronic pop","voProfile":"male, late 20s, energetic, confident, direct Indian English accent"},"script":{"title":"Bulkdoor B2B Beauty Sourcing Launch","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":4,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Tired of high MOQs and wholesale sourcing hassles?","onScreenText":["High MOQs?","Sourcing Hassles?"],"visualDirection":"Split screen shows a frustrated shop owner looking at towering boxes on one side, and empty shelves on the other.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"frustrated store owner shop","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":4,"duration":4,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Bulkdoor is live. India's premier B2B beauty marketplace.","onScreenText":["BULKDOOR IS LIVE","B2B Beauty Marketplace"],"visualDirection":"Bold, high-energy typography scales up rapidly on screen with a premium dark blue and gold aesthetic.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["soft click"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":8,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Source fifty plus top brands with MOQs from just six units.","onScreenText":["50+ Brands","500+ SKUs","MOQ From 6 Units"],"visualDirection":"Grid of popular cosmetics and skincare products rapidly populates the screen with massive numbers overlaying the grid.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"cosmetics skincare flatlay","role":"background"}],"sfx":[],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":12,"duration":4,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Get authentic direct sourcing, GST billing, and free doorstep delivery.","onScreenText":["100% Authentic","GST Billing","Pan-India Delivery"],"visualDirection":"A delivery truck speeds across an abstract map of India, transitioning to a close-up of a verified invoice.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"delivery truck road","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"lift