s and payment methods supported\n\nUS$1.9tn\n\nin payments volume processed in 2025\n\n99.999%\n\nhistorical uptime for Stripe services\n\n200M+\n\nactive subscriptions managed on Stripe Billing\nPowering businesses of all sizes.\n\nRun your business on a reliable platform that adapts to your needs.\n\nTransform your enterprise with agile financial infrastructure\nStripe for enterprises\n\n50% of Fortune 100 companies have used Stripe to grow their businesses – from expanding internationally to reimagining the customer experience.\n\nHertz unifies commerce with Stripe.\nRead the story\n\n160\n\n countries\n\n11K+\n\n locations globally\n\nProducts used\n\n Payments, Terminal, Connect, Radar and Stripe Sigma\nURBN consolidates $5 billion in online and in-store revenue onto Stripe.\nRead the story\nInstacart powers online grocery delivery with Stripe.\nRead the story\nLe Monde improves local and international payments with Stripe.\nRead the story\nRealise value faster with dedicated experts\nProfessional services.\n\nGet tailored guidance from Stripe on implementation, complex integrations, or major migrations.\n\nView services \nStripe-certified experts.\n\nWork with a Stripe consulting partner that can integrate and deploy Stripe solutions on your behalf.\n\nView partners \nSupport plans.\n\nReceive ongoing assistance and day-to-day support for technical questions with tiered plans based on your needs.\n\nView plans \nBuild a foundation for your ","brandColors":["#FE9316","#FA86E6","#FE8F28","#FEB06F"],"ogImage":"https://images.stripeassets.com/fzn2n1nzq965/XtX984S1GJVsVOXFC7kMu/01988281e867728dfb09aa7793a6e3b9/Stripe.jpg?q=80","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A sleek, high-energy motion graphics video designed for enterprise leaders and fast-growing startups, showcasing Stripe as the ultimate financial infrastructure. The video opens with a striking hook about the sheer scale of global commerce running on Stripe, transitions into its flexible capabilities—from global payment optimization to complex billing models—and closes with a powerful call to action showing how businesses can scale from their first transaction to their billionth with confidence.","audience":"Enterprise financial leaders, product managers, and startup founders seeking scalable payment infrastructure.","tone":"confident, ambitious, precise, global","goal":"Inspire trust in Stripe as the robust, highly scalable backbone for any global business model.","keyMessages":["Stripe is the financial infrastructure to grow your revenue globally.","Power any business model with flexible billing, payments, and money movement.","Scale with confidence on a platform built for enterprise-grade reliability."],"mustIncludeFacts":["Businesses on Stripe generated US$1.9tn in 2025.","50% of Fortune 100 companies have used Stripe to grow their businesses.","Stripe services have a 99.999% historical uptime.","URBN consolidates $5 billion in online and in-store revenue onto Stripe."],"brandColors":["#FE9316","#FA86E6","#FE8F28","#FEB06F"],"suggestedFramePack":"midnight-glass","suggestedDuration":25,"musicMood":"driving electronic pulse","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, assured, calm, authoritative"},"script":{"title":"Stripe: Financial Infrastructure at Scale","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"How does the world's economy scale?","onScreenText":["SCALE","WITHOUT LIMITS"],"visualDirection":"A dark, sleek abstract globe spins slowly with glowing connection lines pulsing across continents.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"glowing global digital network","role":"background"}],"sfx":["deep sub drop"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"With over one-point-nine trillion dollars in transaction volume.","onScreenText":["$1.9 TRILLION","Processed in 2025"],"visualDirection":"Large, bold 3D typography of '$1.9T' rotates slowly on a dark glass pe