","Reliable, extensible infrastructure for every stack.","Connect to existing systems.","Scale with confidence.","Choose an integration path.","What's happening","Businesses on Stripe generated US$1.9tn in 2025.","150K+ users have their best day ever on Stripe."],"bodyText":"Products\nSolutions\nDevelopers\nResources\nPricing\nSign in\nSign in\nContact sales\nGlobal GDP running on Stripe: 1.66280806%\n1.66280807%\nFinancial infrastructure to grow your revenue. Accept payments, offer financial services and implement custom revenue models – from your first transaction to your billionth.\nFinancial infrastructure to grow your revenue. Accept payments, offer financial services and implement custom revenue models – from your first transaction to your billionth.\nRequest an invite\nFlexible solutions for every business model.\n\nGrow your business with a comprehensive set of payments and financial tools⁠ – designed to work individually or together.\n\nAccept and optimise payments globally – online and in person\nPay Roastery\nCartsy bezahlen\nShowflix に支払う\nPay Roastery\nUS$5.46\n€26.89\nJP¥5,000\nUS$5.46\nTap, insert or swipe to pay\nZum Bezahlen Karte auflegen, einführen oder durchziehen\nタップ、挿入、またはスワイプして支払う\nTap, insert or swipe to pay\nMocha Latte\nUS$5.50\nLoyalty (10% off)\n-US$0.55\nTax\nUS$0.51\nTotal\nUS$5.46\nDeluxe-Hemd\n€22.60\nVAT\n€4.29\nSumme\n€26.89\nギフトカード\nJP¥5,000\n合計\nJP¥5,000\nMocha Latte\nUS$5.50\nLoyalty (10% off)\n-US$0.55\nTax\nUS$0.51\nTotal\nUS$5.46\nContinue\nWeiter\n続行\nContinue\nroastery.com/checkout\ncartsy.com/checkout\nshowflixapp.com/checkout\nroastery.com/checkout\nEmail\nE-Mail\nメールアドレス\nEmail\njane.diaz@stripe.com\ndamian.michelfelder@example.com\ntaro.yamada@example.com\njane.diaz@stripe.com\nor\noder\nまたは\nor\nPayment method\nZahlungsmethode\n支払い方法\nPayment method\nCard\nKarte\nカード\nCard\nカード番号\n有効期限\nセキュリティコード\nKlarna\nZahlen Sie jetzt oder in 4 zinsfreien Raten zu je €50.28.\nAffirm\nPay now or in 4 interest-free payments of US$40.