0,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"blockframe","status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":null,"error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":83152,"llm_tokens_out":45805,"created_at":1781268050311,"started_at":1781268345008,"finished_at":1781268707745,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":1,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://www.bulkdoor.in/","hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":10,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"blockframe"},"website":{"url":"https://www.bulkdoor.in/","title":"Bulkdoor - India's #1 B2B Beauty, Cosmetics & Skincare Wholesale Marketplace | Bulk Buy 50+ Brands","description":"Bulkdoor is India's First B2B wholesale marketplace for beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare & personal care. Buy Dot&Key, Lotus Herbals, Forever52 theboldeye, Mamaearth, Cetaphil & 50+ brands in bulk. MOQ from 6 units. 500+ SKUs. 100% authentic direct sourcing from verified suppliers. Pan-India delivery.","headings":["Your DirectGateway toWholesale Beauty","Welcome Back","Welcome Back","What is Bulkdoor?","Centralized Hub","Verification First","Scalable Growth","Source beauty stock with less guesswork","Buyer Confidence","What We Offer ?","Cosmetics","Skincare","Beauty Tools","Haircare","Fragrances","Our Services","Verified Supplier Sourcing","Authentic Products","Logistics Support","Market Analytics","How To Use Bulkdoor?","Login","Browse Brands","Select Quantity","Order & Delivery"],"bodyText":"Login\nB2B BEAUTY WHOLESALE\nYour Direct\nGateway to\nWholesale Beauty\n\nBulkdoor is a B2B wholesale marketplace in India for beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare and personal care products. It helps retailers, pharmacies, salons and resellers source from verified suppliers and brands - reducing traditional wholesaler layers. With low MOQ options, GST billing and Free doorstep delivery across India.\n\nBuilt for retailers, pharmacies, salons and resellers across India\n\nStart Shopping\nView Catalogue\n\nIndia's Trusted B2B Beauty Marketplace\n\n4.9/5\nWelcome Back\n\nAccess your wholesale Marketplace\n\nLogin\nRegister\n+91\nGet OTP\n\nBy continuing, you agree to our Terms of Service\n\nWhat is Bulkdoor?\n\nBulkdoor is a business-to-business(B2B) wholesale platform for beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare, and personal care products in India. It helps retailers, shop owners, pharmacies, salons, and resellers find products and buy in bulk with low MOQ. You get GST invoices and delivery across India - all from one place, with 100% authentic and original product quality.\n\nCentralized Hub\n\nAccess beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare and personal care products through a single interface for simpler bulk procurement.\n\nVerification First\n\nCheck supplier information, GST billing, product details and support terms before placing larger orders.\n\nScalable Growth\n\nStart with smaller quantities where available, then increase order size as your demand becomes predictable.\n\nBUILT FOR BUSINESS BUYING\nSource beauty stock with less guesswork\n\nBulkdoor helps retailers, pharmacies, salons and resellers buy beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare and personal care products through one B2B catalogue, with low MOQ options, GST billing and order support built into the sourcing flow.\n\n50+\nBRANDS\n500+\nSKUS\nGST\nBILLING\nPan-India\nDELIVERY\nBrowse Wholesale Products\nTalk to Sales\nBuyer Confidence\n\nA simple first-order path for new B2B buyers.\n\n01\nChoose the right Products\n\nSelect brands, categories, pack sizes, MOQ and wholesale pricing before adding stock.\n\n02\nVerify business details\n\nUse GST billing, product information and seller support to confirm your purchase terms.\n\n03\nStart with a controlled order\n\nChoose quantity and place your order easily. You can start small with low MOQ.\n\n04\nTrack delivery and reorder\n\nGet regular updates and use support to manage your inventory flow.\n\nWhat We Offer ?\n\nExplore a wide range of professional beauty product categories\n\nCosmetics\n\nA wide range of makeup products from trusted beauty brands.\n\nSkincare\n\nSkincare products for pharmacies, salons, beauty retailers and resellers.\n\nBeauty Tools\n\nProfessional beauty tools for precise and effective application.\n\nHaircare\n\nProfessional haircare products for healthy, beautiful hair.\n\nFragrances\n\nPopular perfumes and fragrances for every preference.\n\nOur Services\nVerified Supplier Sourcing\n\nSource through brand, distributor and supplier channels reviewed for business suitability, invoice readiness and product information quality.\n\nAuthentic Products\n\nBulkdoor prioritizes genuine inventory, clear product details and GST billing so business buyers can verify what they are purchasing before scaling orders.\n\nQUALITY GUARANTEED\nLogistics Support\n\nTracked fulfillment support from dispatch to delivery, with order updates designed for retailers, salons, resellers and distributors.\n\nMarket Analytics\n\nUse category demand, brand availability and wholesale pricing signals to plan inventory more carefully and reduce dead stock.\n\n85%\nACCURACY\n24/7\nUPTIME\n4.8/5\nRATING\nHow To Use Bulkdoor?\n\nGet started in 4 simple steps\n\n1\nLogin\n\nQuick access using your Mobile Number and OTP.\n\n2\nBrowse Brands\n\nExplore beauty, skincare, haircare and personal care products from listed brands.\n\n3\nSelect Quantity\n\nChoose the exact quantities you need for your business inventory.\n\n4\nOrder & Delivery\n\nSet payment method and tracked delivery to your doorstep.\n\nGame Changer for Small Businesses\nLow MOQ Options.\nWholesale Pricing.\n\nStart with s","brandColors":["#0F314F","#0B243B","#2F4E6A","#2B445B"],"ogImage":"https://www.bulkdoor.in/logo.png","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":0,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A fast-paced, high-energy 10-second promo targeting Indian beauty retailers, salons, and pharmacies, introducing Bulkdoor as their ultimate wholesale marketplace. The video kicks off with the bold hook of sourcing 50+ top beauty brands with ultra-low MOQs of just 6 units. It rapidly transitions to showcase core business benefits—100% authentic direct sourcing, GST billing, and free pan-India doorstep delivery—before closing on a strong call to action to register and start bulk buying today.","audience":"Indian beauty retailers, salon owners, pharmacies, and cosmetics resellers looking for authentic wholesale stock with low minimum orders.","tone":"confident, energetic, efficient, professional","goal":"Get beauty business owners to register on Bulkdoor to source authentic brands with low MOQs.","keyMessages":["India's trusted B2B marketplace for beauty, cosmetics, and skincare.","Source 50+ top brands like Dot&Key, Cetaphil, and Mamaearth directly.","Start small with low minimum order quantities starting from just 6 units.","Get 100% authentic products with GST invoicing and free pan-India doorstep delivery."],"mustIncludeFacts":["India's First B2B wholesale marketplace for beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare & personal care.","Buy Dot&Key, Lotus Herbals, Forever52 theboldeye, Mamaearth, Cetaphil & 50+ brands in bulk.","MOQ from 6 units.","500+ SKUs.","GST billing and Free doorstep delivery across India.","100% authentic direct sourcing from verified suppliers."],"brandColors":["#0F314F","#0B243B","#2F4E6A","#2B445B"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":10,"musicMood":"upbeat punchy electronic","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, confident, crisp business delivery"},"script":{"title":"Bulkdoor: India's B2B Beauty Marketplace","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Sourcing beauty brands for your retail shop?","onScreenText":["INDIA'S FIRST B2B","BEAUTY MARKETPLACE"],"visualDirection":"Bold, high-energy typography overlays on a background of modern Indian retail cosmetics shelves.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"cosmetics store shelves retail","role":"background"}],"sf