tration of Lumen's magic: instant capture, automatic tagging, and semantic search. It builds momentum with impressive social proof and closes with a clear, compelling invitation to try the app for free.","audience":"Busy professionals, creatives, students, and knowledge workers overwhelmed by digital clutter.","tone":"confident, playful, energetic, efficient","goal":"Excite viewers about a frictionless note-taking experience and drive them to try Lumen for free.","keyMessages":["Lumen is the note-taking app that organizes itself.","Capture thoughts instantly and let automatic tagging do the work.","Search by meaning, not just keywords, to find anything instantly."],"mustIncludeFacts":["4.8 stars from 1,200 reviews","Try Lumen free","instant capture","automatic tagging","search that understands meaning"],"brandColors":["#FF6B6B","#4ECDC4","#FFE66D","#1A1A1A"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":25,"musicMood":"upbeat minimal electronica","voProfile":"female, mid-20s, conversational, energetic, and clear"},"script":{"title":"Lumen: Organize Your Mind Instantly","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Buried under digital clutter?","onScreenText":["Drowning in clutter?","Too many notes?"],"visualDirection":"A fast-paced collage of chaotic, overlapping browser tabs and messy digital folders flying across the screen.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"messy computer desktop screens","role":"background"}],"sfx":["riser"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Meet Lumen, the note-taking app that organizes itself.","onScreenText":["Meet Lumen","It organizes itself"],"visualDirection":"The chaos instantly resolves into a calm, minimalist canvas featuring a clean glowing orb in the center.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"glowing sphere abstract motion","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"fea