"mood":"upbeat minimal electronica","query":"energetic minimal techno synth"},"voice":{"style":"female, mid-20s, conversational, energetic, and clear","pace":"brisk"}},"script_warnings":[],"usage":{"llm":{"inputTokens":2462,"outputTokens":5295,"callCount":2,"inputCostUsd":0.003693,"outputCostUsd":0.047655,"totalCostUsd":0.051348},"tts":{"inputChars":0,"inputTokensEst":0,"outputTokensEst":0,"callCount":0,"inputCostUsd":0,"outputCostUsd":0,"totalCostUsd":0},"external":{"openrouter_chat":2},"totalCostUsd":0.051348},"stage_timings":{"briefMs":10391,"scriptMs":18788}},{"id":"dtacex7ne9","kind":"project","prompt":"","duration":20,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"720p","width":1280,"height":720,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"midnight-glass","status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":null,"error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":53447,"llm_tokens_out":34082,"created_at":1781517648853,"started_at":1781517740790,"finished_at":1781518166610,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":1,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://bulkdoor.in/","hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":20,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"auto"},"website":{"url":"https://bulkdoor.in/","title":"Bulkdoor - India's #1 B2B Beauty, Cosmetics & Skincare Wholesale Marketplace | Bulk Buy 50+ Brands","description":"Bulkdoor is India's First B2B wholesale marketplace for beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare & personal care. Buy Dot&Key, Lotus Herbals, Forever52 theboldeye, Mamaearth, Cetaphil & 50+ brands in bulk. MOQ from 6 units. 500+ SKUs. 100% authentic direct sourcing from verified suppliers. Pan-India delivery.","headings":["Your DirectGateway toWholesale Beauty","Welcome Back","Welcome Back","What is Bulkdoor?","Centralized Hub","Verification First","Scalable Growth","Source beauty stock with less guesswork","Buyer Confidence","What We Offer ?","Cosmetics","Skincare","Beauty Tools","Haircare","Fragrances","Our Services","Verified Supplier Sourcing","Authentic Products","Logistics Support","Market Analytics","How To Use Bulkdoor?","Login","Browse Brands","Select Quantity","Order & Delivery"],"bodyText":"Login\nB2B BEAUTY WHOLESALE\nYour Direct\nGateway to\nWholesale Beauty\n\nBulkdoor is a B2B wholesale marketplace in India for beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare and personal care products. It helps retailers, pharmacies, salons and resellers source from verified suppliers and brands - reducing traditional wholesaler layers. With low MOQ options, GST billing and Free doorstep delivery across India.\n\nBuilt for retailers, pharmacies, salons and resellers across India\n\nStart Shopping\nView Catalogue\n\nIndia's Trusted B2B Beauty Marketplace\n\n4.9/5\nWelcome Back\n\nAccess your wholesale Marketplace\n\nLogin\nRegister\n+91\nGet OTP\n\nBy continuing, you agree to our Terms of Service\n\nWhat is Bulkdoor?\n\nBulkdoor is a business-to-business(B2B) wholesale platform for beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare, and personal care products in India. It helps retailers, shop owners, pharmacies, salons, and resellers find products and buy in bulk with low MOQ. You get GST invoices and delivery across India - all from one place, with 100% authentic and original product quality.\n\nCentralized Hub\n\nAccess beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare and personal care products through a single interface for simpler bulk procurement.\n\nVerification First\n\nCheck supplier information, GST billing, product details and support terms before placing larger orders.\n\nScalable Growth\n\nStart with smaller quantities where available, then increase order size as your demand becomes predictable.\n\nBUILT FOR BUSINESS BUYING\nSource beauty stock with less guesswork\n\nBulkdoor helps retailers, pharmacies, salons and resellers buy beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare and personal care products through one B2B catalogue, with low MOQ options, GST billing and order support built into the sourcing flow.\n\n50+\nBRANDS\n500+\nSKUS\nGST\nBILLING\nPan-India\nDELIVERY\nBrowse Wholesale Products\nTalk to Sales\nBuyer Confidence\n\nA simple first-order path for new B2B buyers.\n\n01\nChoose the right Products\n\nSelect brands, categories, pack sizes, MOQ and wholesale pricing before adding stock.\n\n02\nVerify business details\n\nUse GST billing, product information and seller support to confirm your purchase terms.\n\n03\nStart with a controlled order\n\nChoose quantity and place your order easily. You can start small with low MOQ.\n\n04\nTrack delivery and reorder\n\nGet regular updates and use support to manage your inventory flow.\n\nWhat We Offer ?\n\nExplore a wide range of professional beauty product categories\n\nCosmetics\n\nA wide range of makeup products from trusted beauty brands.\n\nSkincare\n\nSkincare products for pharmacies, salons, beauty retailers and resellers.\n\nBeauty Tools\n\nProfessional beauty tools for precise and effective application.\n\nHaircare\n\nProfessional haircare products for healthy, beautiful hair.\n\nFragrances\n\nPopular perfumes and fragrances for every preference.\n\nOur Services\nVerified Supplier Sourcing\n\nSource through brand, distributor and supplier channels reviewed for business suitability, invoice readiness and product information quality.\n\nAuthentic Products\n\nBulkdoor prioritizes genuine inventory, clear product details and GST billing so business buyers can verify what they are purchasing before scaling orders.\n\nQUALITY GUARANTEED\nLogistics Support\n\nTracked fulfillment support from dispatch to delivery, with order updates designed for retailers, salons, resellers and distributors.\n\nMarket Analytics\n\nUse category demand, brand availability and wholesale pricing signals to plan inventory more carefully and reduce dead stock.\n\n85%\nACCURACY\n24/7\nUPTIME\n4.8/5\nRATING\nHow To Use Bulkdoor?\n\nGet started in 4 simple steps\n\n1\nLogin\n\nQuick access using your Mobile Number and OTP.\n\n2\nBrowse Brands\n\nExplore beauty, skincare, haircare and personal care products from listed brands.\n\n3\nSelect Quantity\n\nChoose the exact quantities you need for your business inventory.\n\n4\nOrder & Delivery\n\nSet payment method and tracked delivery to your doorstep.\n\nGame Changer for Small Businesses\nLow MOQ Options.\nWholesale Pricing.\n\nStart with s","brandColors":["#0F314F","#0B243B","#304E6A","#2A445B"],"ogImage":"https://www.bulkdoor.in/logo.png","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":0,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A fast-paced, high-conversion 20-second B2B promo targeting Indian retail and salon owners. The video opens with the pain of traditional wholesale layers, quickly transitioning to Bulkdoor as the ultimate direct gateway to 50+ authentic beauty brands like Dot&Key and Cetaphil. Dynamic motion graphics highlight key business perks: a low MOQ of just 6 units, official GST billing, and reliable Pan-India delivery. It closes with a clear call-to-action to register with a mobile OTP and start sourcing stock with less guesswork.","audience":"Indian beauty retailers, salon owners, pharmacy buyers, and cosmetics resellers.","tone":"confident, efficient, professional, trustworthy","goal":"Get B2B beauty buyers to register on Bulkdoor and place their first low-MOQ order.","keyMessages":["Direct B2B access to 50+ top beauty and skincare brands.","Eliminate wholesale layers with a low MOQ of just 6 units.","Hassle-free procurement with GST billing and Pan-India doorstep delivery."],"mustIncludeFacts":["50+ brands","500+ SKUs","MOQ from 6 units","GST billing","Pan-India delivery","100% authentic direct sourcing"],"brandColors":["#0F314F","#0B243B","#304E6A","#2A445B"],"suggestedFramePack":"midnight-glass","suggestedDuration":20,"musicMood":"sleek minimal tech beats","voProfile":"Mid-30s, professional, clear Indian English accent, warm and business-savvy"},"script":{"title":"Direct B2B Beauty Sourcing with Bulkdoor","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3