 Pan-India delivery."},{"start":17,"end":20.1,"text":"Register with OTP to grow your margins."}],"srt_url":"/videos/dtacex7ne9.srt","final_attempt":"main","qa":{"pass":true,"score":9,"issues":[{"atSec":0.6,"severity":"minor","issue":"The main title 'Cut the Middlemen' is heavily blurred, which may delay readability during the transition.","fix":"Slightly reduce the blur duration or start the transition earlier so the text becomes sharp faster."},{"atSec":8.6,"severity":"minor","issue":"The browser mockup on the right is clipped on its right edge, and this scene lacks the glass card container background used in other scenes, creating a slight visual inconsistency.","fix":"Adjust the browser mockup width to prevent internal clipping and wrap the scene content in the standard midnight-glass card container."}]}},{"id":"5a5bhp2mke","kind":"project","prompt":"","duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"720p","width":1280,"height":720,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"blockframe","status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":null,"error":null,"used_fallback":1,"llm_tokens_in":77803,"llm_tokens_out":60851,"created_at":1781525897231,"started_at":1781526920705,"finished_at":1781527542565,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":1,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://bulkdoor.in/","hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"blockframe"},"website":{"url":"https://bulkdoor.in/","title":"Bulkdoor - India's #1 B2B Beauty, Cosmetics & Skincare Wholesale Marketplace | Bulk Buy 50+ Brands","description":"Bulkdoor is India's First B2B wholesale marketplace for beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare & personal care. Buy Dot&Key, Lotus Herbals, Forever52 theboldeye, Mamaearth, Cetaphil & 50+ brands in bulk. MOQ from 6 units. 500+ SKUs. 100% authentic direct sourcing from verified suppliers. Pan-India delivery.","headings":["Your DirectGateway toWholesale Beauty","Welcome Back","Welcome Back","What is Bulkdoor?","Centralized Hub","Verification First","Scalable Growth","Source beauty stock with less guesswork","Buyer Confidence","What We Offer ?","Cosmetics","Skincare","Beauty Tools","Haircare","Fragrances","Our Services","Verified Supplier Sourcing","Authentic Products","Logistics Support","Market Analytics","How To Use Bulkdoor?","Login","Browse Brands","Select Quantity","Order & Delivery"],"bodyText":"Login\nB2B BEAUTY WHOLESALE\nYour Direct\nGateway to\nWholesale Beauty\n\nBulkdoor is a B2B wholesale marketplace in India for beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare and personal care products. It helps retailers, pharmacies, salons and resellers source from verified suppliers and brands - reducing traditional wholesaler layers. With low MOQ options, GST billing and Free doorstep delivery across India.\n\nBuilt for retailers, pharmacies, salons and resellers across India\n\nStart Shopping\nView Catalogue\n\nIndia's Trusted B2B Beauty Marketplace\n\n4.9/5\nWelcome Back\n\nAccess your wholesale Marketplace\n\nLogin\nRegister\n+91\nGet OTP\n\nBy continuing, you agree to our Terms of Service\n\nWhat is Bulkdoor?\n\nBulkdoor is a business-to-business(B2B) wholesale platform for beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare, and personal care products in India. It helps retailers, shop owners, pharmacies, salons, and resellers find products and buy in bulk with low MOQ. You get GST invoices and delivery across India - all from one place, with 100% authentic and original product quality.\n\nCentralized Hub\n\nAccess beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare and personal care products through a single interface for simpler bulk procurement.\n\nVerification First\n\nCheck supplier information, GST billing, product details and support terms before placing larger orders.\n\nScalable Growth\n\nStart with smaller quantities where available, then increase order size as your demand becomes predictable.\n\nBUILT FOR BUSINESS BUYING\nSource beauty stock with less guesswork\n\nBulkdoor helps retailers, pharmacies, salons and resellers buy beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare and personal care products through one B2B catalogue, with low MOQ options, GST billing and order support built into the sourcing flow.\n\n50+\nBRANDS\n500+\nSKUS\nGST\nBILLING\nPan-India\nDELIVERY\nBrowse Wholesale Products\nTalk to Sales\nBuyer Confidence\n\nA simple first-order path for new B2B buyers.\n\n01\nChoose the right Products\n\nSelect brands, categories, pack sizes, MOQ and wholesale pricing before adding stock.\n\n02\nVerify business details\n\nUse GST billing, product information and seller support to confirm your purchase terms.\n\n03\nStart with a controlled order\n\nChoose quantity and place your order easily. You can start small with low MOQ.\n\n04\nTrack delivery and reorder\n\nGet regular updates and use support to manage your inventory flow.\n\nWhat We Offer ?\n\nExplore a wide range of professional beauty product categories\n\nCosmetics\n\nA wide range of makeup products from trusted beauty brands.\n\nSkincare\n\nSkincare products for pharmacies, salons, beauty retailers and resellers.\n\nBeauty Tools\n\nProfessional beauty tools for precise and effective application.\n\nHaircare\n\nProfessional haircare products for healthy, beautiful hair.\n\nFragrances\n\nPopular perfumes and fragrances for every preference.\n\nOur Services\nVerified Supplier Sourcing\n\nSource through brand, distributor and supplier channels reviewed for business suitability, invoice readiness and product information quality.\n\nAuthentic Products\n\nBulkdoor prioritizes genuine inventory, clear product details and GST billing so business buyers can verify what they are purchasing before scaling orders.\n\nQUALITY GUARANTEED\nLogistics Support\n\nTracked fulfillment support from dispatch to delivery, with order updates designed for retailers, salons, resellers and distributors.\n\nMarket Analytics\n\nUse category demand, brand availability and wholesale pricing signals to plan inventory more carefully and reduce dead stock.\n\n85%\nACCURACY\n24/7\nUPTIME\n4.8/5\nRATING\nHow To Use Bulkdoor?\n\nGet started in 4 simple steps\n\n1\nLogin\n\nQuick access using your Mobile Number and OTP.\n\n2\nBrowse Brands\n\nExplore beauty, skincare, haircare and personal care products from listed brands.\n\n3\nSelect Quantity\n\nChoose the exact quantities you need for your business inventory.\n\n4\nOrder & Delivery\n\nSet payment method and tracked delivery to your doorstep.\n\nGame Changer for Small Businesses\nLow MOQ Options.\nWholesale Pricing.\n\nStart with s","brandColors":["#0F314F","#0B243B","#304E6A","#2A445B"],"ogImage":"https://www.bulkdoor.in/logo.png","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":0,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A high-energy, fast-paced motion graphics video introducing Indian beauty retailers, salons, and pharmacies to Bulkdoor, the ultimate B2B wholesale marketplace. The video kicks off with the frustration of high minimum orders and complex supply chains, then pivots to show how Bulkdoor simplifies procurement with low MOQs starting at just 6 units. We showcase authentic top brands like Dot&Key and Cetaphil, highlight seamless GST billing, and close with a strong call to action to register and start shopping with free Pan-India doorstep delivery. The vibe is modern, efficient, and highly empowering for small business owners.","audience":"Indian beauty retailers, salon owners, pharmacies, and cosmetics resellers looking for hassle-free direct wholesale sourcing.","tone":"efficient, empowering, professional, modern","goal":"Encourage retail business owners to register on Bulkdoor and place their first low-MOQ beauty wholesale order.","keyMessages":["Direct access to 50+ genuine beauty brands with zero middleman hassle.","Start small with low MOQs starting from just 6 units.","Get 100% authentic products with GST billing and free Pan-India doorstep delivery."],"mustIncludeFacts":["MOQ from 6 units","50+ brands","500+ SKUs","GST billing","Pan-India delivery","Dot&Key, Lotus Herbals, Forever52, Mamaearth, Cetaphil"],"brandColors":["#0F314F","#0B243B","#304E6A","#2A445B"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"upbeat corporate electronic","voProfile":"Male, mid-30s, warm, professional, encouraging Indian-English accent"},"script":{"title":"Bulkdoor: Smart B2B Beauty Sourcing","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Tired of high minimum orders and middleman hassle?","onScreenText":["High MOQs?","Supply Chain Stress?"],"visualDirection":"A graphic grid of generic shipping boxes piles up rapidly against a dark background, creating a sense of overwhelming inventory.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"cardboard boxes warehouse clutter","role":"background"}],"sfx":["riser","impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Meet Bulkdoor, your direct beauty wholesale marketplace.","onScreenText":["Introducing","Bulkdoor"],"visualDirection":"The cluttered boxes dissolve into a clean, modern interface showing a bold brand logo sliding smoothly into view.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"modern abstract logo","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":7,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Get low MOQs starting from just six units.","onScreenText":["MOQs From","6 Units Only"],"visualDirection":"A single product box splits elegantly into exactly six glowing, neatly arranged retail units on a sleek dark platform.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"cosmetic bottle packaging clean","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":10.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Source fifty plus top brands and over five hundred SKUs.","onScreenText":["50+ Brands","500+ SKUs"],"visualDirection":"A rapid, stylish carousel of premium cosmetics packaging rotates dynamically across the scree