' header text is black and overlaps directly with the dark car background, resulting in poor readability.","fix":"Add a solid background card behind the 'AUTOMATED EXECUTION' text to separate it from the background image."}]}},{"id":"9xrl14mrix","kind":"project","prompt":"A 20-second launch video for Nimbus, a team collaboration platform that drives business growth and revenue. Show teamwork, a rising growth chart, and a strong call to action.","duration":20,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"720p","width":1280,"height":720,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"midnight-glass","status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":null,"error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":84193,"llm_tokens_out":41276,"created_at":1781593922741,"started_at":1781593945610,"finished_at":1781594647111,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":1,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"A 20-second launch video for Nimbus, a team collaboration platform that drives business growth and revenue. Show teamwork, a rising growth chart, and a strong call to action.","websiteUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":20,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"midnight-glass"}},"autopilot":1,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A high-energy, premium 20-second launch film for Nimbus, a team collaboration platform designed for fast-growing businesses. The video targets modern team leads and executives, opening with a dynamic visualization of seamless teamwork and connected workflows. It transitions into a striking, upward-trending growth chart that directly links collaboration to business revenue. The piece closes with an urgent, confident call to action, driving viewers to adopt Nimbus to accelerate their growth.","audience":"Modern team leads, business executives, and growth-focused organizations.","tone":"confident, collaborative, growth-oriented, premium","goal":"Convince viewers that Nimbus is the essential collaboration tool to drive business revenue and growth.","keyMessages":["Nimbus connects teams to accelerate business growth.","Streamlined collaboration directly drives revenue.","Transform teamwork into measurable business success."],"mustIncludeFacts":["Nimbus is a team collaboration platform.","Nimbus drives business growth and revenue."],"brandColors":["#0B132B","#00F5D4","#1C2541"],"suggestedFramePack":"midnight-glass","suggestedDuration":20,"musicMood":"driving premium electronica","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, confident, energetic yet professional"},"script":{"title":"Nimbus: Accelerate Business Growth","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"How does your team drive real growth?","onScreenText":["Drive","Real Growth"],"visualDirection":"Bold, dark midnight-blue background with a sudden, energetic burst of teal light framing the typography.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Meet Nimbus. The collaboration platform built for speed.","onScreenText":["Meet Nimbus.","Built for Speed."],"visualDirection":"Smooth camera pan showcasing the real product UI in a sleek, glassmorphic browser frame.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":7,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"We connect your workflows to accelerate your business.","onScreenText":["Connected Workflows"],"visualDirection":"Split screen showing modern professionals collaborating, connected by glowing digital lines.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"office teamwork meeting","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":10.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Streamlined collaboration directly drives revenue.","onScreenText":["Drives Revenue"],"visualDirection":"A clean, upward-trending financial chart glows in bright teal against a dark glass background.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"upward trending chart","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["din