o the screen, transitioning from warm sunrise colors to cooler tones. Energy builds.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact","riser"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":4.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Introducing Lumen: your intelligent AI note-taking companion.","onScreenText":["Lumen","AI Note-Taking"],"visualDirection":"The word 'Lumen' animates in with a clean, modern feel. The background subtly shifts to a deeper sunrise hue.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"abstract AI brain","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":8.5,"duration":5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Experience seamless organization and intelligent insights, automatically.","onScreenText":["Seamless Organization","Intelligent Insights"],"visualDirection":"Animated lines connect scattered text elements, forming organized blocks. Subtle data visualizations appear, highlighting 'insights'.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"clean organized digital notes","role":"background"}],"sfx":["transition","sparkle"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":13.5,"duration":5.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Lumen's powerful features unlock your true productivity potential.","onScreenText":["Unlock Productivity","Powerful Features"],"visualDirection":"Fast-paced kinetic typography showcases words like 'focus', 'create', 'achieve'. The color palette is now transitioning towards night.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"rocket launching","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["whoosh","pop"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s5","start":19,"duration":5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"It's more than notes; it's your AI-powered thinking partner.","onScreenText":["Your AI Partner","Smart Thinking"],"visualDirection":"A stylized, abstract representation of AI interacting with notes. The background is now a deep night blue.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"glowing neural network","role":"background"}],"sfx":["transition"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s5.5","start":24