oth lattes,"},{"start":17.165853658536587,"end":19.800000000000004,"text":"there's a perfect cup for every coffee lover."},{"start":20,"end":24.3,"text":"Lala Coffee is here to elevate your daily coffee ritual."},{"start":25,"end":29.2,"text":"Discover your new favorite brew. Try Lala Coffee today!"}],"srt_url":"/videos/nxmg979tlp.srt","final_attempt":"fallback","qa":{"pass":true,"issues":[],"skipped":true}},{"id":"jurm9qqlr5","kind":"project","prompt":"make a Ai app launch video for advertisement","duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"720p","width":1280,"height":720,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"blockframe","status":"script_review","progress":"script_review","video_url":null,"error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":0,"llm_tokens_out":0,"created_at":1781686427472,"started_at":1781686427980,"finished_at":null,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":1,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"make a Ai app launch video for advertisement","websiteUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"blockframe"}},"autopilot":0,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second horizontal video launching a new AI application. The video should highlight the app's innovative features and benefits, aiming to excite and inform potential users about its capabilities. The tone should be energetic and forward-thinking, showcasing the transformative power of AI. It needs to be visually dynamic and engaging, fitting a product launch scenario.","audience":"Early adopters and tech enthusiasts interested in cutting-edge AI applications.","tone":"energetic, innovative, bold, exciting","goal":"Generate excitement and drive downloads/sign-ups for the new AI app.","keyMessages":["Introducing the future of AI applications","Unlock new possibilities with our revolutionary AI","Experience unparalleled innovation","Download now and transform your workflow"],"mustIncludeFacts":["AI app launch for advertisement"],"brandColors":["#FF0000","#00FF00","#0000FF"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"upbeat, driving, futuristic electronic","voProfile":"male, 30s, confident, clear, energetic"},"script":{"title":"Future of AI: Transform Your Workflow","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":4,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"The future of AI applications is here.","onScreenText":["The Future of AI"],"visualDirection":"Abstract, energetic light trails in brand colors swirl and coalesce, forming a dynamic opening.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact","riser"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":4,"duration":6,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Introducing a revolutionary AI, built to unlock new possibilities.","onScreenText":["Unlock New Possibilities"],"visualDirection":"Geometric shapes and data streams flow and connect, illustrating complex systems simplifying.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"glowing abstract network icon","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":10,"duration":7,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Experience unparalleled innovation with cutting-edge intelligence.","onScreenText":["Unparalleled Innovation"],"visualDirection":"A sleek, modern UI element animates, showcasing a key feature with vibrant brand colors.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"futuristic AI interface glowing","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["pop","sparkle"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":17,"duration":6,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Transform your workflow with AI that understands your needs.","onScreenText":["Transform Your Workflow"],"visualDirection":"Animated graphics show tasks being completed rapidly and efficiently, with data flowing smoothly.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"gears turning rapidly","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh","click"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s5","start":23,"duration":7,"purpose":"cta","voiceover":"Download now and step into the future.","onScreenText":["Download Now","AI App Launch"],"visualDirection":"The app logo appears prominently, with a clear call-to-action button pulsing. Brand colors explode outwards.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["riser","ding"],"musicCue":"outro"}],"music":{"mood":"upbeat, driving, futuristic electronic","query":"energetic futuristic electronic"},"voice":{"style":"male, 30s, confident, clear, energetic","pace":"brisk"}},"script_warnings":[],"usage":{"llm":{"inputTokens":4538,"outputTokens":1184,"callCount":2,"inputCostUsd":0.006807,"outputCostUsd":0.010656,"totalCostUsd":0.017463},"tts":{"inputChars":0,"inputTokensEst":0,"outputTokensEst":0,"callCount":0,"inputCostUsd":0,"outputCostUsd":0,"totalCostUsd":0},"external":{"openrouter_chat":2},"totalCostUsd":0.017463},"stage_timings":{"briefMs":1678,"scriptMs":3008}},{"id":"jlv86e6qua","kind":"project","prompt":"Create a 60-second cinematic launch film for an AI operating system called \"Atlas\".\n\nAtlas is an AI teammate that automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting.\n\nThe tone should feel like a mix of Apple, Linear, Arc Browser, and Stripe.\n\nThe audience is startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives.\n\nDo not create a feature slideshow.\n\nCreate an emotional narrative.\n\nThe video should begin by showing the chaos of modern work.\n\nHundreds of notifications.\n\nTabs multiplying.\n\nMeetings stacking.\n\nDocuments scattered.\n\nPeople drowning in busywork.\n\nThen introduce Atlas as the solution.\n\nShow Atlas understanding context across tools.\n\nAutomating tasks.\n\nWriting reports.\n\nSummarizing meetings.\n\nFinding information instantly.\n\nCoordinating projects.\n\nEnd with the idea that humans should focus on thinking while Atlas handles execution.\n\nUse premium motion design.\n\nUse kinetic typography.\n\nUse dynamic camera movement.\n\nUse depth, particles, animated gradients, and cinematic transitions.\n\nThe final feeling should be:\n\n\"Work just changed forever.\"\n\nDuration: 60 seconds.\n\nExpected Script Output\nScene 1 — The Chaos\n\nVoiceover:\n\nWork was supposed to get easier. Instead, it became noise.\n\nVisuals:\n\nNotification storm\nSlack bubbles\nEmail floods\nCalendar collisions\nBrowser tabs multiplying endlessly\n\nMotion:\n\nFast camera movement\nParallax layers\nAlert explosions\nScene 2 — Drowning\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery day begins with a hundred decisions that shouldn't exist.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEndless task cards\nDocuments stacking\nMeeting windows expanding\n\nMotion:\n\nCards overwhelm screen\nCamera trapped in clutter\nScene 3 — The Breaking Point\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe problem isn't effort. It's fragmentation.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWork apps floating apart\nData scattered everywhere\n\nMotion:\n\nSystems drifting apart in 3D space\nScene 4 — Atlas Appears\n\nVoiceover:\n\nMeet Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nCalm light emerges\nNoise fades\nElegant AI core appears\n\nMotion:\n\nMassive cinematic reveal\nParticle convergence\nScene 5 — Understanding Everything\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas understands your work the way a teammate does.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEmails\nDocs\nMeetings\nTasks\n\nall connecting into one intelligence layer\n\nMotion:\n\nNeural network animations\nData flowing\nScene 6 — Meetings\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery meeting summarized before you ask.\n\nVisuals:\n\nTranscript transforms into insights\n\nMotion:\n\nText morphing\nHighlight extraction\nScene 7 — Research\n\nVoiceover:\n\nHours of research condensed into seconds.\n\nVisuals:\n\nHundreds of pages collapsing into one answer\n\nMotion:\n\nDocuments flying toward center\nScene 8 — Projects\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas keeps every project moving.\n\nVisuals:\n\nRoadmaps\nTimelines\nTeam coordination\n\nMotion:\n\nDynamic progress systems\nScene 9 — The Transformation\n\nVoiceover:\n\nLess management. More momentum.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWorkspace becomes clean\nFocus returns\n\nMotion:\n\nClutter dissolves\nScene 10 — Future of Work\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe future isn't working harder. It's working with Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nBeautiful hero shot\nGlobal network\nProduct UI showcase\n\nMotion:\n\nEpic pullback\nCinematic ending","duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"720p","width":1280,"height":720,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"blockframe","status":"failed","progress":"storyboard","video_url":null,"error":"storyboard generation failed after 2 attempts: first scene kind must be 'title'","used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":65,"llm_tokens_out":8,"created_at":1781686550658,"started_at":1781686570573,"finished_at":1781686642131,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":1,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"Create a 60-second cinematic launch film for an AI operating system called \"Atlas\".\n\nAtlas is an AI teammate that automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting.\n\nThe tone should feel like a mix of Apple, Linear, Arc Browser, and Stripe.\n\nThe audience is startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives.\n\nDo not create a feature slideshow.\n\nCreate an emotional narrative.\n\nThe video should begin by showing the chaos of modern work.\n\nHundreds of notifications.\n\nTabs multiplying.\n\nMeetings stacking.\n\nDocuments scattered.\n\nPeople drowning in busywork.\n\nThen introduce Atlas as the solution.\n\nShow Atlas understanding context across tools.\n\nAutomating tasks.\n\nWriting reports.\n\nSummarizing meetings.\n\nFinding information instantly.\n\nCoordinating projects.\n\nEnd with the idea that humans should focus on thinking while Atlas handles execution.\n\nUse premium motion design.\n\nUse kinetic typography.\n\nUse dynamic camera movement.\n\nUse depth, particles, animated gradients, and cinematic transitions.\n\nThe final feeling should be:\n\n\"Work just changed forever.\"\n\nDuration: 60 seconds.\n\nExpected Script Output\nScene 1 — The Chaos\n\nVoiceover:\n\nWork was supposed to get easier. Instead, it became noise.\n\nVisuals:\n\nNotification storm\nSlack bubbles\nEmail floods\nCalendar collisions\nBrowser tabs multiplying endlessly\n\nMotion:\n\nFast camera movement\nParallax layers\nAlert explosions\nScene 2 — Drowning\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery day begins with a hundred decisions that shouldn't exist.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEndless task cards\nDocuments stacking\nMeeting windows expanding\n\nMotion:\n\nCards overwhelm screen\nCamera trapped in clutter\nScene 3 — The Breaking Point\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe problem isn't effort. It's fragmentation.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWork apps floating apart\nData scattered everywhere\n\nMotion:\n\nSystems drifting apart in 3D space\nScene 4 — Atlas Appears\n\nVoiceover:\n\nMeet Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nCalm light emerges\nNoise fades\nElegant AI core appears\n\nMotion:\n\nMassive cinematic reveal\nParticle convergence\nScene 5 — Understanding Everything\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas understands your work the way a teammate does.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEmails\nDocs\nMeetings\nTasks\n\nall connecting into one intelligence layer\n\nMotion:\n\nNeural network animations\nData flowing\nScene 6 — Meetings\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery meeting summarized before you ask.\n\nVisuals:\n\nTranscript transforms into insights\n\nMotion:\n\nText morphing\nHighlight extraction\nScene 7 — Research\n\nVoiceover:\n\nHours of research condensed into seconds.\n\nVisuals:\n\nHundreds of pages collapsing into one answer\n\nMotion:\n\nDocuments flying toward center\nScene 8 — Projects\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas keeps every project moving.\n\nVisuals:\n\nRoadmaps\nTimelines\nTeam coordination\n\nMotion:\n\nDynamic progress systems\nScene 9 — The Transformation\n\nVoiceover:\n\nLess management. More momentum.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWorkspace becomes clean\nFocus returns\n\nMotion:\n\nClutter dissolves\nScene 10 — Future of Work\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe future isn't working harder. It's working with Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nBeautiful hero shot\nGlobal network\nProduct UI showcase\n\nMotion:\n\nEpic pullback\nCinematic ending","websiteUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"blockframe"}},"autopilot":0,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 60-second horizontal cinematic launch film for 'Atlas,' an AI operating system designed to be an AI teammate for startup founders, PMs, engineers, and executives. The film opens by vividly depicting the overwhelming chaos of modern work – endless notifications, multiplying tabs, stacked meetings, and scattered documents – portraying people drowning in busywork. It then introduces Atlas as the elegant solution, showcasing its ability to understand context across tools, automate repetitive tasks like writing reports and summarizing meetings, and instantly find information. The narrative culminates in the powerful idea that humans should focus on strategic thinking while Atlas handles execution, leaving the viewer with the profound feeling that 'Work just changed forever.' The visual style should be premium, employing kinetic typography, dynamic camera movement, depth, particles, animated gradients, and cinematic transitions, drawing inspiration from the sophisticated aesthetics of Apple, Linear, Arc Browser, and Stripe.","audience":"Startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives","tone":"sophisticated, innovative, empowering, cinematic","goal":"To convey that Atlas fundamentally changes the nature of work, shifting focus from execution to strategic thinking, and to create a sense of awe and anticipation for its launch.","keyMessages":["Work just changed forever.","Atlas is your AI teammate, automating repetitive tasks.","Focus on thinking, Atlas handles execution.","Understand context across all your tools.","Hours of work condensed into seconds."],"mustIncludeFacts":["AI operating system called \"Atlas\"","Automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting","Understands context across tools","Automating tasks","Writing reports","Summarizing meetings","Finding information instantly","Coordinating projects","Humans should focus on thinking while Atlas handles execution"],"brandColors":["#FFFFFF","#000000","#007AFF","#FF2D55"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"epic cinematic orchestral, with moments of subtle electronic undertones","voProfile":"male, mid-40s, authoritative yet inspiring, clear, deliberate pacing"},"script":{"title":"Atlas: Work Just Changed Forever","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":4,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"The modern workday. Drowning in noise.","onScreenText":["Notifications.","Tabs.","Meetings."],"visualDirection":"Rapid cuts of overflowing inboxes, multiple browser tabs, and stacked calendar alerts. Chaotic energy.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"notification bell icon","role":"inset"},{"type":"icon","query":"browser tab icon","role":"inset"},{"type":"icon","query":"calendar icon","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":4,"duration":5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Scattered documents, endless busywork. Where does real progress happen?","onScreenText":["Busywork."],"visualDirection":"A visual metaphor of scattered papers and digital fragments swirling chaotically. A sense of being overwhelmed.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"scattered digital documents and papers","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":9,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Introducing Atlas. Your AI teammate.","onScreenText":["Atlas","AI Teammate"],"visualDirection":"The chaos resolves into a clean, central logo animation for 'Atlas.' Particles and subtle gradients emerge.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["sparkle"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":13.5,"duration":5.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"It understands context across all your tools, automating repetitive tasks.","onScreenText":["Context across tools","Automate tasks"],"visualDirection":"Abstract visualization of data flowing between different application icons (email, calendar, project management), converging into Atlas.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"email icon","role":"inset"},{"type":"icon","query":"calendar icon","role":"inset"},{"type":"icon","query":"project management icon","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s5","start":19,"duration":4,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Writing reports, summarizing meetings, finding information.","onScreenText":["Reports","Summaries","Info"],"visualDirection":"Quick, dynamic animations showing report generation, meeting summaries appearing, and instant search results.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"abstract data visualization of report generation","role":"background"}],"sfx":["pop","click"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s6","start":23,"duration":4,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"Hours of work condensed into seconds.","onScreenText":["Hours to seconds"],"visualDirection":"A visual countdown or progress bar rapidly accelerating, symbolizing immense time saving.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["ding"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s7","start":27,"duration":3,"purpose":"cta","voiceover":"Focus on thinking. Atlas handles execution. Work just changed forever.","onScreenText":["Work just changed forever."],"visualDirection":"The Atlas logo fills the screen, radiating confidence. The final tagline appears prominently.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["riser"],"musicCue":"outro"}],"music":{"mood":"epic cinematic orchestral, with subtle electronic undertones","query":"epic cinematic orchestral electronic"},"voice":{"style":"male, mid-40s, authoritative yet inspiring, clear, deliberate pacing","pace":"deliberate"}},"script_warnings":[],"usage":{"llm":{"inputTokens":65,"outputTokens":8,"callCount":1,"inputCostUsd":0.000098,"outputCostUsd":0.000072,"totalCostUsd":0.00017},"tts":{"inputChars":431,"inputTokensEst":111,"outputTokensEst":1640,"callCount":8,"inputCostUsd":0.000067,"outputCostUsd":0.003936,"totalCostUsd":0.004003},"external":{"freesound_search":1,"openrouter_tts":8,"openrouter_chat":1,"freesound_download":1},"totalCostUsd":0.004172},"stage_timings":{"briefMs":2572,"scriptMs":4198}},{"id":"f8qmomazl5","kind":"project","prompt":"Create a 60-second cinematic launch film for an AI operating system called \"Atlas\".\n\nAtlas is an AI teammate that automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting.\n\nThe tone should feel like a mix of Apple, Linear, Arc Browser, and Stripe.\n\nThe audience is startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives.\n\nDo not create a feature slideshow.\n\nCreate an emotional narrative.\n\nThe video should begin by showing the chaos of modern work.\n\nHundreds of notifications.\n\nTabs multiplying.\n\nMeetings stacking.\n\nDocuments scattered.\n\nPeople drowning in busywork.\n\nThen introduce Atlas as the solution.\n\nShow Atlas understanding context across tools.\n\nAutomating tasks.\n\nWriting reports.\n\nSummarizing meetings.\n\nFinding information instantly.\n\nCoordinating projects.\n\nEnd with the idea that humans should focus on thinking while Atlas handles execution.\n\nUse premium motion design.\n\nUse kinetic typography.\n\nUse dynamic camera movement.\n\nUse depth, particles, animated gradients, and cinematic transitions.\n\nThe final feeling should be:\n\n\"Work just changed forever.\"\n\nDuration: 60 seconds.\n\nExpected Script Output\nScene 1 — The Chaos\n\nVoiceover:\n\nWork was supposed to get easier. Instead, it became noise.\n\nVisuals:\n\nNotification storm\nSlack bubbles\nEmail floods\nCalendar collisions\nBrowser tabs multiplying endlessly\n\nMotion:\n\nFast camera movement\nParallax layers\nAlert explosions\nScene 2 — Drowning\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery day begins with a hundred decisions that shouldn't exist.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEndless task cards\nDocuments stacking\nMeeting windows expanding\n\nMotion:\n\nCards overwhelm screen\nCamera trapped in clutter\nScene 3 — The Breaking Point\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe problem isn't effort. It's fragmentation.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWork apps floating apart\nData scattered everywhere\n\nMotion:\n\nSystems drifting apart in 3D space\nScene 4 — Atlas Appears\n\nVoiceover:\n\nMeet Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nCalm light emerges\nNoise fades\nElegant AI core appears\n\nMotion:\n\nMassive cinematic reveal\nParticle convergence\nScene 5 — Understanding Everything\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas understands your work the way a teammate does.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEmails\nDocs\nMeetings\nTasks\n\nall connecting into one intelligence layer\n\nMotion:\n\nNeural network animations\nData flowing\nScene 6 — Meetings\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery meeting summarized before you ask.\n\nVisuals:\n\nTranscript transforms into insights\n\nMotion:\n\nText morphing\nHighlight extraction\nScene 7 — Research\n\nVoiceover:\n\nHours of research condensed into seconds.\n\nVisuals:\n\nHundreds of pages collapsing into one answer\n\nMotion:\n\nDocuments flying toward center\nScene 8 — Projects\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas keeps every project moving.\n\nVisuals:\n\nRoadmaps\nTimelines\nTeam coordination\n\nMotion:\n\nDynamic progress systems\nScene 9 — The Transformation\n\nVoiceover:\n\nLess management. More momentum.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWorkspace becomes clean\nFocus returns\n\nMotion:\n\nClutter dissolves\nScene 10 — Future of Work\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe future isn't working harder. It's working with Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nBeautiful hero shot\nGlobal network\nProduct UI showcase\n\nMotion:\n\nEpic pullback\nCinematic ending","duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"720p","width":1280,"height":720,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"blockframe","status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":null,"error":null,"used_fallback":1,"llm_tokens_in":103522,"llm_tokens_out":25272,"created_at":1781687083795,"started_at":1781687091775,"finished_at":1781687418410,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":"auto","captions_enabled":1,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"Create a 60-second cinematic launch film for an AI operating sys