e problem isn't effort. It's fragmentation.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWork apps floating apart\nData scattered everywhere\n\nMotion:\n\nSystems drifting apart in 3D space\nScene 4 — Atlas Appears\n\nVoiceover:\n\nMeet Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nCalm light emerges\nNoise fades\nElegant AI core appears\n\nMotion:\n\nMassive cinematic reveal\nParticle convergence\nScene 5 — Understanding Everything\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas understands your work the way a teammate does.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEmails\nDocs\nMeetings\nTasks\n\nall connecting into one intelligence layer\n\nMotion:\n\nNeural network animations\nData flowing\nScene 6 — Meetings\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery meeting summarized before you ask.\n\nVisuals:\n\nTranscript transforms into insights\n\nMotion:\n\nText morphing\nHighlight extraction\nScene 7 — Research\n\nVoiceover:\n\nHours of research condensed into seconds.\n\nVisuals:\n\nHundreds of pages collapsing into one answer\n\nMotion:\n\nDocuments flying toward center\nScene 8 — Projects\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas keeps every project moving.\n\nVisuals:\n\nRoadmaps\nTimelines\nTeam coordination\n\nMotion:\n\nDynamic progress systems\nScene 9 — The Transformation\n\nVoiceover:\n\nLess management. More momentum.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWorkspace becomes clean\nFocus returns\n\nMotion:\n\nClutter dissolves\nScene 10 — Future of Work\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe future isn't working harder. It's working with Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nBeautiful hero shot\nGlobal network\nProduct UI showcase\n\nMotion:\n\nEpic pullback\nCinematic ending","websiteUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"blockframe"}},"autopilot":1,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 60-second horizontal cinematic launch film for 'Atlas,' an AI operating system designed to be an AI teammate for startup founders, PMs, engineers, and executives. The film opens by depicting the overwhelming chaos of modern work—notifications, endless tabs, stacked meetings, scattered documents—leading to a feeling of drowning in busywork. It then introduces Atlas as a calm, intelligent solution that understands context across tools, automates repetitive tasks like writing reports and summarizing meetings, and coordinates projects. The narrative emphasizes the shift from human execution to human thinking, with Atlas handling the busywork. The video should use premium motion design, kinetic typography, dynamic camera movement, depth, particles, animated gradients, and cinematic transitions, culminating in the powerful statement: 'Work just changed forever.'","audience":"Startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives","tone":"cinematic, premium, intelligent, transformative, bold","goal":"To make the viewer feel that their current way of working is unsustainable and that Atlas is the revolutionary solution, inspiring awe and a desire to learn more.","keyMessages":["Work just changed forever.","Atlas is your AI teammate.","Automate repetitive work and focus on thinking.","Understand context across all your tools.","From chaos to clarity with Atlas."],"mustIncludeFacts":["AI operating system called \"Atlas\"","AI teammate that automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting","Hundreds of notifications","Tabs multiplying","Meetings stacking","Documents scattered","Humans should focus on thinking while Atlas handles execution"],"brandColors":["#FFFFFF","#000000","#FF5733","#33AFFF"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"epic cinematic orchestral, building tension then resolving to inspiring","voProfile":"male or female, authoritative yet warm, capable of conveying both the pain of chaos and the relief of Atlas's solution, clear and deliberate pacing"},"script":{"title":"Atlas: Work Just Changed Forever","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"The modern workday. A relentless flood.","onScreenText":["Notifications.","Endless tabs."],"visual