rm for beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare, and personal care products in India. It helps retailers, shop owners, pharmacies, salons, and resellers find products and buy in bulk with low MOQ. You get GST invoices and delivery across India - all from one place, with 100% authentic and original product quality.\n\nCentralized Hub\n\nAccess beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare and personal care products through a single interface for simpler bulk procurement.\n\nVerification First\n\nCheck supplier information, GST billing, product details and support terms before placing larger orders.\n\nScalable Growth\n\nStart with smaller quantities where available, then increase order size as your demand becomes predictable.\n\nBUILT FOR BUSINESS BUYING\nSource beauty stock with less guesswork\n\nBulkdoor helps retailers, pharmacies, salons and resellers buy beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare and personal care products through one B2B catalogue, with low MOQ options, GST billing and order support built into the sourcing flow.\n\n50+\nBRANDS\n500+\nSKUS\nGST\nBILLING\nPan-India\nDELIVERY\nBrowse Wholesale Products\nTalk to Sales\nBuyer Confidence\n\nA simple first-order path for new B2B buyers.\n\n01\nChoose the right Products\n\nSelect brands, categories, pack sizes, MOQ and wholesale pricing before adding stock.\n\n02\nVerify business details\n\nUse GST billing, product information and seller support to confirm your purchase terms.\n\n03\nStart with a controlled order\n\nChoose quantity and place your order easily. You can start small with low MOQ.\n\n04\nTrack delivery and reorder\n\nGet regular updates and use support to manage your inventory flow.\n\nWhat We Offer ?\n\nExplore a wide range of professional beauty product categories\n\nCosmetics\n\nA wide range of makeup products from trusted beauty brands.\n\nSkincare\n\nSkincare products for pharmacies, salons, beauty retailers and resellers.\n\nBeauty Tools\n\nProfessional beauty tools for precise and effective application.\n\nHaircare\n\nProfessional haircare products for healthy, beautiful hair.\n\nFragrances\n\nPopular perfumes and fragrances for every preference.\n\nOur Services\nVerified Supplier Sourcing\n\nSource through brand, distributor and supplier channels reviewed for business suitability, invoice readiness and product information quality.\n\nAuthentic Products\n\nBulkdoor prioritizes genuine inventory, clear product details and GST billing so business buyers can verify what they are purchasing before scaling orders.\n\nQUALITY GUARANTEED\nLogistics Support\n\nTracked fulfillment support from dispatch to delivery, with order updates designed for retailers, salons, resellers and distributors.\n\nMarket Analytics\n\nUse category demand, brand availability and wholesale pricing signals to plan inventory more carefully and reduce dead stock.\n\n85%\nACCURACY\n24/7\nUPTIME\n4.8/5\nRATING\nHow To Use Bulkdoor?\n\nGet started in 4 simple steps\n\n1\nLogin\n\nQuick access using your Mobile Number and OTP.\n\n2\nBrowse Brands\n\nExplore beauty, skincare, haircare and personal care products from listed brands.\n\n3\nSelect Quantity\n\nChoose the exact quantities you need for your business inventory.\n\n4\nOrder & Delivery\n\nSet payment method and tracked delivery to your doorstep.\n\nGame Changer for Small Businesses\nLow MOQ Options.\nWholesale Pricing.\n\nStart with s","brandColors":["#0F314F","#0B243B","#304E6A","#2A445B"],"ogImage":"https://www.bulkdoor.in/logo.png","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":0,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"Create a 30-second horizontal motion-graphics explainer for Bulkdoor, India’s B2B beauty, cosmetics, skincare, haircare, and personal care wholesale marketplace. Start with a fast problem hook: retailers, pharmacies, salons, and resellers dealing with guesswork and extra wholesaler layers. Then reveal Bulkdoor as a centralized hub to source beauty stock from 50+ brands and 500+ SKUs, emphasizing verification-first buying (verified suppliers, GST billing, product details) and 100% authentic/original quality. Show a simple 4-step flow—Login with mobile + OTP, Browse Brands, Select Quantity (low MOQ), then Order & Delivery with tracked delivery and pan-India coverage. End with buyer confidence: GST invoices, logistics support, and the promise of scalable growth from controlled first orders.","audience":"Retailers, pharmacies, salons, and resellers in India who need to buy beauty/cosmetics/skincare/haircare/personal-care products in bulk and want low MOQ, GST billing, and verified sourcing.","tone":"confident, energetic, trustworthy, modern","goal":"Make B2B buyers feel safe choosing Bulkdoor for bulk beauty purchasing—and prompt them to start shopping/login.","keyMessages":["Verification-first sourcing that builds buyer confidence","Centralized B2B marketplace for wholesale beauty in India","Low MOQ + wholesale pricing + GST billing + tracked pan-India delivery","Simple 4-step buying flow to start small and scale up","100% authentic/original product quality with verified suppliers"],"mustIncludeFacts":["India's #1 B2B Beauty, Cosmetics & Skincare Wholesale Marketplace (Bulkdoor)","Buy 50+ brands in bulk","500+ SKUs","MOQ from 6 units","100% authentic direct sourcing from verified suppliers","Free doorstep delivery across India","GST billing","Pan-India delivery","4-step process: Login (mobile number + OTP), Browse Brands, Select Quantity, Order & Delivery"],"brandColors":["#0F314F","#0B243B","#304E6A","#2A445B"],"suggestedFramePack":"bauhaus-print","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"upbeat confident corporate","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, clear and authoritative, brisk delivery with upbeat confidence"},"script":{"title":"Bulkdoor: Verified Bulk Beauty Hub","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3.2,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Guesswork is expensive in bulk beauty.","onScreenText":["Bulk beauty guesswork?"],"visualDirection":"Fast chaotic stacks of products and invoices blur across screen, then snap into a sharp grid labeled “Wholesale”.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact","riser"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3.2,"duration":3.6,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Retailers, pharmacies, salons—need trusted stock without extra wholesaler layers.","onScreenText":["Trusted stock. Fewer layers."],"visualDirection":"Four buyer icons (retailer, pharmacy cross, salon chair, reseller) slide in from different edges and converge into one pathway.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"retailer pharmacy salon reseller icons","role":"texture"}],"sfx":["transition"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6.8,"duration":3.8,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Bulkdoor is India’s #1 B2B beauty wholesale marketplace.","onScreenText":["India’s #1 B2B Bulkdoor"],"visualDirection":"Bold “Bulkdoor” wordmark pops center while a dynamic map outline of India fills with animated dots.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"India map dot animation hub","role":"background"}],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s4","start":10.6,"duration":4.2,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Buy 50 plus brands, 500 plus SKUs—direct from verified suppliers with 100% authentic sourcing.","onScreenText":["50+ brands","500+ SKUs"],"visualDirection":"Brand tiles and SKU cards stream into a single container labeled “Verified Sourcing”, with a checkmark sweep across the container.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"brand tiles ui animation checks","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["sparkle","ding"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s5","start":14.8,"duration":4.1,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Need GST billing and free doorstep delivery across India? You get both—pan-India.","onScreenText":["GST billing","Free pan-India delivery"],"visualDirection":"An invoice sheet animates “GST” stamp, then a delivery truck route fans out across India with “doorstep” callouts.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"GST invoice stamp delivery truck pan india","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["click","whoosh"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s6","start":18.9,"duration":4.3,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"Start with low MOQ—from 6 units. Login with mobile number and OTP.","onScreenText":["MOQ from 6 units","Login via OTP"],"visualDirection":"A phone screen mock slides in; “Enter mobile” then “OTP” fields animate, followed by a stack size meter settling at “6”.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"mobile otp login screen animation","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["transition"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s7","start":23.2,"duration":4.3,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"Browse brands, select quantity, then place your order—tracked delivery included.","onScreenText":["Browse brands","Select quantity"],"visualDirection":"A carousel of brand badges scrolls horizontally; quantity stepper ticks up, then a “tracked” timeline bar animates forward.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"beauty product grid browse brands quantity stepper","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh","pop"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s8","start":27.5,"duration":2.5,"purpose":"cta","voiceover":"Shop with confidence—GST invoice, logistics support, and scalable growth with Bulkdoor.","onScreenText":["Start shopping on Bulkdoor"],"visualDirection":"Final verified checklist locks in with a confident glow; a “Start” button pulse appears over the India map.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"verified checklist GST invoice logistics support icon","role":"texture"}],"sfx":["riser","impact"],"musicCue":"outro"}],"music":{"mood":"upbeat confident corporate","query":"upbeat corporate electronics"},"voice":{"style":"male, mid-30s, clear and authoritative, brisk delivery with upbeat confidence","pace":"brisk"}},"script_warnings":["scene s8: VO is 11 words but ~6 fit in 2.5s — will be tightened or feel rushed"],"website_screenshot":"C:\\MERN\\Internshit website\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\2al76qgaqk\\ingest\\website.png","website_screenshots":["C:\\MERN\\Internshit website\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\2al76qgaqk\\ingest\\website.png","C:\\MERN\\Internshit website\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\2al76qgaqk\\ingest\\website_section2.png","C:\\MERN\\Internshit website\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\2al76qgaqk\\ingest\\website_section3.png"],"website_title":"Bulkdoor - India's #1 B2B Beauty, Cosmetics & Skincare Wholesale Marketplace | Bulk Buy 50+ Brands","usage":{"llm":{"inputTokens":0,"outputTokens":0,"callCount":0,"inputCostUsd":0,"outputCostUsd":0,"totalCostUsd":0},"tts":{"inputChars":0,"inputTokensEst":0,"outputTokensEst":0,"callCount":0,"inputCostUsd":0,"outputCostUsd":0,"totalCostUsd":0},"external":{"freesound_search":1,"freesound_download":1},"totalCostUsd":0},"stage_timings":{"ingestMs":14922,"briefMs":5526,"scriptMs":26407}},{"id":"30gtycrwtq","kind":"project","prompt":"Create a 60-second cinematic launch film for an AI operating system called \"Atlas\".\n\nAtlas is an AI teammate that automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting.\n\nThe tone should feel like a mix of Apple, Linear, Arc Browser, and Stripe.\n\nThe audience is startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives.\n\nDo not create a feature slideshow.\n\nCreate an emotional narrative.\n\nThe video should begin by showing the chaos of modern work.\n\nHundreds of notifications.\n\nTabs multiplying.\n\nMeetings stacking.\n\nDocuments scattered.\n\nPeople drowning in busywork.\n\nThen introduce Atlas as the solution.\n\nShow Atlas understanding context across tools.\n\nAutomating tasks.\n\nWriting reports.\n\nSummarizing meetings.\n\nFinding information instantly.\n\nCoordinating projects.\n\nEnd with the idea that humans should focus on thinking while Atlas handles execution.\n\nUse premium motion design.\n\nUse kinetic typography.\n\nUse dynamic camera movement.\n\nUse depth, particles, animated gradients, and cinematic transitions.\n\nThe final feeling should be:\n\n\"Work just changed forever.\"\n\nDuration: 60 seconds.\n\nExpected Script Output\nScene 1 — The Chaos\n\nVoiceover:\n\nWork was supposed to get easier. Instead, it became noise.\n\nVisuals:\n\nNotification storm\nSlack bubbles\nEmail floods\nCalendar collisions\nBrowser tabs multiplying endlessly\n\nMotion:\n\nFast camera movement\nParallax layers\nAlert explosions\nScene 2 — Drowning\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery day begins with a hundred decisions that shouldn't exist.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEndless task cards\nDocuments stacking\nMeeting windows expanding\n\nMotion:\n\nCards overwhelm screen\nCamera trapped in clutter\nScene 3 — The Breaking Point\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe problem isn't effort. It's fragmentation.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWork apps floating apart\nData scattered everywhere\n\nMotion:\n\nSystems drifting apart in 3D space\nScene 4 — Atlas Appears\n\nVoiceover:\n\nMeet Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nCalm light emerges\nNoise fades\nElegant AI core appears\n\nMotion:\n\nMassive cinematic reveal\nParticle convergence\nScene 5 — Understanding Everything\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas understands your work the way a teammate does.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEmails\nDocs\nMeetings\nTasks\n\nall connecting into one intelligence layer\n\nMotion:\n\nNeural network animations\nData flowing\nScene 6 — Meetings\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery meeting summarized before you ask.\n\nVisuals:\n\nTranscript transforms into insights\n\nMotion:\n\nText morphing\nHighlight extraction\nScene 7 — Research\n\nVoiceover:\n\nHours of research condensed into seconds.\n\nVisuals:\n\nHundreds of pages collapsing into one answer\n\nMotion:\n\nDocuments flying toward center\nScene 8 — Projects\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas keeps every project moving.\n\nVisuals:\n\nRoadmaps\nTimelines\nTeam coordination\n\nMotion:\n\nDynamic progress systems\nScene 9 — The Transformation\n\nVoiceover:\n\nLess management. More momentum.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWorkspace becomes clean\nFocus returns\n\nMotion:\n\nClutter dissolves\nScene 10 — Future of Work\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe future isn't working harder. It's working with Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nBeautiful hero shot\nGlobal network\nProduct UI showcase\n\nMotion:\n\