lm for Atlas, an AI operating system designed for startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives. The film opens by immersing the viewer in the overwhelming chaos of modern work—notifications, endless tabs, scattered documents, and busywork. Atlas is then introduced as the elegant solution, a powerful AI teammate that seamlessly understands context across tools, automating repetitive tasks like email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting. The narrative emphasizes a shift from fragmentation to focus, culminating in the profound realization that humans can now concentrate on strategic thinking while Atlas handles execution. The visual style should be premium, kinetic, and dynamic, employing depth, particles, and cinematic transitions to evoke a feeling that \"Work just changed forever.\"","audience":"Startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives drowning in operational overhead","tone":"cinematic, premium, transformative, empowering, sophisticated","goal":"Make the viewer feel that the chaos of modern work is finally solved, and that Atlas is the essential future of productivity","keyMessages":["Modern work is chaos: endless notifications, tabs, and busywork.","Atlas is your AI teammate, understanding context across all your tools.","Automate repetitive work: emails, meetings, research, project management, and reporting.","Focus on thinking; Atlas handles execution.","Work just changed forever."],"mustIncludeFacts":["Atlas is an AI operating system","Atlas is an AI teammate","Automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting","Humans should focus on thinking while Atlas handles execution","The final feeling should be: \"Work just changed forever.\""],"brandColors":["#1A1A2E","#E0E0E0","#007AFF"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"pulsing, atmospheric, modern electronic, impactful","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, articulate, confident, commanding but empathetic"},"script":{"title":"Atlas: The Future of Work","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"The modern workday. A symphony of chaos.","onScreenText":["Notifications","Endless tabs","Scattered documents"],"visualDirection":"Rapid cuts of overflowing inboxes, frantic typing, blurred screens, and a cascade of digital alerts. Energetic and overwhelming.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"chaotic digital workspace montage","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":5,"duration":6,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Operational overhead. Busywork. It’s drowning us.","onScreenText":["Drowning in busywork?"],"visualDirection":"A slow-motion shot of a single person overwhelmed by digital elements, with a focus on their stressed expression. Particles of digital noise swirl around them.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"stressed person overwhelmed by digital data","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":11,"duration":6,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Introducing Atlas. Your AI teammate, understanding context across all your tools.","onScreenText":["Atlas: Your AI Teammate"],"visualDirection":"The chaos begins to coalesce. Abstract digital threads connect different application icons, forming a cohesive network. Atlas logo appears subtly.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"network of connected app icons","role":"background"}],"sfx":["pop","sparkle"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":17,"duration":7,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Automating repetitive tasks: email, meetings, research, project management, reporting.","onScreenText":["Automate Email, Meetings, Research, PM, Reporting"],"visualDirection":"Elegant, fast-paced animations showing tasks being completed automatically: emails sent, meeting summaries generated, research compiled, project boards updated. Clean and efficient.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"abstract visualization o