tiplying endlessly\n\nMotion:\n\nFast camera movement\nParallax layers\nAlert explosions\nScene 2 — Drowning\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery day begins with a hundred decisions that shouldn't exist.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEndless task cards\nDocuments stacking\nMeeting windows expanding\n\nMotion:\n\nCards overwhelm screen\nCamera trapped in clutter\nScene 3 — The Breaking Point\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe problem isn't effort. It's fragmentation.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWork apps floating apart\nData scattered everywhere\n\nMotion:\n\nSystems drifting apart in 3D space\nScene 4 — Atlas Appears\n\nVoiceover:\n\nMeet Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nCalm light emerges\nNoise fades\nElegant AI core appears\n\nMotion:\n\nMassive cinematic reveal\nParticle convergence\nScene 5 — Understanding Everything\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas understands your work the way a teammate does.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEmails\nDocs\nMeetings\nTasks\n\nall connecting into one intelligence layer\n\nMotion:\n\nNeural network animations\nData flowing\nScene 6 — Meetings\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery meeting summarized before you ask.\n\nVisuals:\n\nTranscript transforms into insights\n\nMotion:\n\nText morphing\nHighlight extraction\nScene 7 — Research\n\nVoiceover:\n\nHours of research condensed into seconds.\n\nVisuals:\n\nHundreds of pages collapsing into one answer\n\nMotion:\n\nDocuments flying toward center\nScene 8 — Projects\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas keeps every project moving.\n\nVisuals:\n\nRoadmaps\nTimelines\nTeam coordination\n\nMotion:\n\nDynamic progress systems\nScene 9 — The Transformation\n\nVoiceover:\n\nLess management. More momentum.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWorkspace becomes clean\nFocus returns\n\nMotion:\n\nClutter dissolves\nScene 10 — Future of Work\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe future isn't working harder. It's working with Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nBeautiful hero shot\nGlobal network\nProduct UI showcase\n\nMotion:\n\nEpic pullback\nCinematic ending","websiteUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"blockframe"}},"autopilot":1,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 60-second cinematic launch film for Atlas, an AI operating system designed for startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives. The film opens by immersing the viewer in the overwhelming chaos of modern work — a relentless deluge of notifications, multiplying tabs, stacked meetings, and scattered documents, illustrating how busywork drowns human potential. It then dramatically introduces Atlas as the intelligent solution, showcasing how it seamlessly understands context across various tools, automates tasks, summarizes meetings, conducts instant research, and coordinates complex projects. The narrative culminates in the powerful idea that humans are freed to focus on high-level thinking, while Atlas expertly handles execution. The visual style should be premium motion design with kinetic typography, dynamic camera movements, depth, particles, animated gradients, and cinematic transitions, evoking a feeling that 'Work just changed forever.'","audience":"Startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives struggling with modern work complexity.","tone":"premium, intelligent, transformative, sophisticated, decisive","goal":"Inspire a belief that Atlas fundamentally changes work for the better, empowering users to focus on strategic thinking.","keyMessages":["Atlas: Your AI teammate for modern work.","Automates repetitive tasks across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting.","Focus on thinking, Atlas handles execution.","Understands context, summarizes meetings, finds information instantly.","Work just changed forever."],"mustIncludeFacts":["Atlas is an AI operating system.","Atlas is an AI teammate that automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting.","Humans should focus on thinking while Atlas handles execution.","Atlas understands context across tools.","Atlas automates tasks.","Atlas writes reports.","Atlas summarizes meetings.","Atlas finds information instantly.","Atlas coordinates projects."],"brandColors":["#0A0A0A","#666666","#007AFF"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"epic, sophisticated, driving, ambient electronica","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, articulate, confident, with a visionary yet grounded delivery"},"script":{"title":"Atlas: Work Reimagined","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"The modern workday. A tidal wave of tasks.","onScreenText":["Notifications.","Tabs.","Meetings."],"visualDirection":"A chaotic, overwhelming rush of digital elements – notifications, browser tabs, calendar alerts – floods the screen with dynamic, disorienting motion.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact","riser"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":4.5,"duration":5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Drowning in busywork, your true potential is lost.","onScreenText":["Busywork drowns potential."],"visualDirection":"The chaotic digital elements from the previous scene begin to fragment and obscure a human silhouette, symbolizing lost focus.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"abstract particles obscuring human silhouette","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":9.5,"duration":6,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Introducing Atlas. Your AI teammate for modern work.","onScreenText":["Atlas: Your AI Teammate."],"visualDirection":"The chaos abruptly clears. A clean, sophisticated UI element representing Atlas emerges, radiating calm and order. Animated particles suggest intelligence and connectivity.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"AI brain network icon","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["pop","transition"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":15.5,"duration":7,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"It understands context, automates tasks, summarizes meetings, and finds information instantly.","onScreenText":["Automates Tasks.","Summarizes Meetings.","Instant Research."],"visualDirection":"Dynamic split screens or layered animations showcase Atlas interacting seamlessly with different tools (email, calendar, docs). Data flows and transforms intelligently, illustrating its capabilities.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"abstract data flow animation","role":"background"},{"type":"icon","query":"checklist icon","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["click","ding"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s5","start":22.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Atlas handles execution. You focus on thinking.","onScreenText":["Focus on Thinking.","Atlas Executes."],"visualDirection":"A human figure is shown confidently looking forward, engaged in strategic thought, while behind them, complex tasks are shown being effortlessly managed by Atlas's abstract visual representation.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"human head profile with gears and lightbulb","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s6","start":27,"duration":3,"purpose":"cta","voiceover":"Work just changed forever.","onScreenText":["Atlas. Work Changed."],"visualDirection":"The Atlas logo appears centered and strong, with a final, impactful animation. The background resolves into a sophisticated, branded gradient, leaving a lasting impression.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"outro"}],"music":{"mood":"epic, sophisticated, driving, ambient electronica","query":"epic ambient electronica"},"voice":{"style":"male, mid-30s, articulate, confident, with a visionary yet grounded delivery","pace":"conversational"}},"script_warnings":[],"usage":{"llm":{"inputTokens":77601,"outputTokens":15055,"callCount":2,"inputCostUsd":0.116402,"outputCostUsd":0.135495,"totalCostUsd":0.251897},"tts":{"inputChars":0,"inputTokensEst":0,"outputTokensEst":0,"callCount":0,"inputCostUsd":0,"outputCostUsd":0,"totalCostUsd":0},"external":{"freesound_search":1,"openrouter_chat":2,"freesound_download":1,"asset_library_hit":8,"hyperframes_lint":1,"hyperframes_render":1},"totalCostUsd":0.251897},"stage_timings":{"briefMs":16647,"scriptMs":11741,"productionMs":318248},"assets":[{"path":"assets/images/0.jpg","type":"image","sceneId":"s1","startSec":0,"durationSec":4.5,"style":"background","alt":"chaotic overwhelming rush digital","license":"curated-library","sourceUrl":null,"source":"library:assetcollection","fromCache":true},{"path":"assets/images/1.jpg","type":"image","sceneId":"s2","startSec":4.5,"durationSec":5,"style":"background","alt":"abstract particles obscuring human silhouette","license":"curated-library","sourceUrl":null,"source":"library:assetcollection","fromCache":true},{"path":"assets/images/2.png","type":"image","sceneId":"s3","startSec":9.5,"durationSec":6,"style":"inset","alt":"AI brain network icon","license":"curated-library","sourceUrl":null,"source":"library:vector-illustrations","fromCache":true},{"path":"assets/images/3.jpg","type":"image","sceneId":"s4","startSec":15.5,"durationSec":7,"style":"background","alt":"abstract data flow animation","license":"curated-library","sourceUrl":null,"source":"library:assetcollection","fromCache":true},{"path":"assets/images/4.png","type":"image","sceneId":"s4","startSec":15.5,"durationSec":7,"style":"inset","alt":"checklist icon","license":"curated-library","sourceUrl":null,"source":"library:vector-illustrations","fromCache":true},{"path":"assets/images/5.jpg","type":"image","sceneId":"s5","startSec":22.5,"durationSec":4.5,"style":"background","alt":"human head profile with gears and lightbulb","license":"curated-library","sourceUrl":null,"source":"library:assetcollection","fromCache":true},{"path":"assets/images/6.png","type":"image","sceneId":"s6","startSec":27,"durationSec":3,"style":"background","alt":"atlas logo appears centered","license":"curated-library","sourceUrl":null,"source":"library:vetors","fromCache":true},{"path":"assets/images/7.jpg","type":"image","sceneId":"s6","startSec":27,"durationSec":3,"style":"inset","alt":"atlas logo appears centered","license":"curated-library","sourceUrl":null,"source":"library:vetors","fromCache":true}],"final_attempt":"fallback","qa":{"pass":true,"issues":[],"skipped":true}},{"id":"te97vtvi2m","kind":"project","prompt":"Create a 60-second cinematic launch film for an AI operating system called \"Atlas\".\n\nAtlas is an AI teammate that automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting.\n\nThe tone should feel like a mix of Apple, Linear, Arc Browser, and Stripe.\n\nThe audience is startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives.\n\nDo not create a feature slideshow.\n\nCreate an emotional narrative.\n\nThe video should begin by showing the chaos of modern work.\n\nHundreds of notifications.\n\nTabs multiplying.\n\nMeetings stacking.\n\nDocuments scattered.\n\nPeople drowning in busywork.\n\nThen introduce Atlas as the solution.\n\nShow Atlas understanding context across tools.\n\nAutomating tasks.\n\nWriting reports.\n\nSummarizing meetings.\n\nFinding information instantly.\n\nCoordinating projects.\n\nEnd with the idea that humans should focus on thinking while Atlas handles execution.\n\nUse premium motion design.\n\nUse kinetic typography.\n\nUse dynamic camera movement.\n\nUse depth, particles, animated gradients, and cinematic transitions.\n\nThe final feeling should be:\n\n\"Work just changed forever.\"\n\nDuration: 60 seconds.\n\nExpected Script Output\nScene 1 — The Chaos\n\nVoiceover:\n\nWork was supposed to get easier. Instead, it became noise.\n\nVisuals:\n\nNotification storm\nSlack bubbles\nEmail floods\nCalendar collisions\nBrowser tabs multiplying endlessly\n\nMotion:\n\nFast camera movement\nParallax layers\nAlert explosions\nScene 2 — Drowning\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery day begins with a hundred decisions that shouldn't exist.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEndless task cards\nDocuments stacking\nMeeting windows expanding\n\nMotion:\n\nCards overwhelm screen\nCamera trapped in clutter\nScene 3 — The Breaking Point\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe problem isn't effort. It's fragmentation.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWork apps floating apart\nData scattered everywhere\n\nMotion:\n\nSystems drifting apart in 3D space\nScene 4 — Atlas Appears\n\nVoiceover:\n\nMeet Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nCalm light emerges\nNoise fades\nElegant AI core appears\n\nMotion:\n\nMassive cinematic reveal\nParticle convergence\nScene 5 — Understanding Everything\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas understands your work the way a teammate does.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEmails\nDocs\nMeetings\nTasks\n\nall connecting into one intelligence layer\n\nMotion:\n\nNeural network animations\nData flowing\nScene 6 — Meetings\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery meeting summarized before you ask.\n\nVisuals:\n\nTranscript transforms into insights\n\nMotion:\n\nText morphing\nHighlight extraction\nScene 7 — Research\n\nVoiceover:\n\nHours of research condensed into seconds.\n\nVisuals:\n\nHundreds of pages collapsing into one answer\n\nMotion:\n\nDocuments flying toward center\nScene 8 — Projects\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas keeps every project moving.\n\nVisuals:\n\nRoadmaps\nTimelines\nTeam coordination\n\nMotion:\n\nDynamic progress systems\nScene 9 — The Transformation\n\nVoiceover:\n\nLess management. More momentum.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWorkspace becomes clean\nFocus returns\n\nMotion:\n\nClutter dissolves\nScene 10 — Future of Work\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe future isn't working harder. It's working with Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nBeautiful hero shot\nGlobal network\nProduct UI showcase\n\nMotion:\n\nEpic pullback\nCinematic ending","duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"720p","width":1280,"height":720,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"blockframe","status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":null,"error":null,"used_fallback":1,"llm_tokens_in":188498,"llm_tokens_out":98645,"created_at":1781694011175,"started_at":1781694034258,"finished_at":1781694965817,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":"auto","captions_enabled":1,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"Create a 60-second cinematic launch film for an AI operating system called \"Atlas\".\n\nAtlas is an AI teammate that automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting.\n\nThe tone should feel like a mix of Apple, Linear, Arc Browser, and Stripe.\n\nThe audience is startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives.\n\nDo not create a feature slideshow.\n\nCreate an emotional narrative.\n\nThe video should begin by showing the chaos of modern work.\n\nHundreds of notifications.\n\nTabs multiplying.\n\nMeetings stacking.\n\nDocuments scattered.\n\nPeople drowning in busywork.\n\nThen introduce Atlas as the solution.\n\nShow Atlas understanding context across tools.\n\nAutomating tasks.\n\nWriting reports.\n\nSummarizing meetings.\n\nFinding information instantly.\n\nCoordinating projects.\n\nEnd with the idea that humans should focus on thinking while Atlas handles execution.\n\nUse premium motion design.\n\nUse kinetic typography.\n\nUse dynamic camera movement.\n\nUse depth, particles, animated gradients, and cinematic transitions.\n\nThe final feeling should be:\n\n\"Work just changed forever.\"\n\nDuration: 60 seconds.\n\nExpected Script Output\nScene 1 — The Chaos\n\nVoiceover:\n\nWork was supposed to get easier. Instead, it became noise.\n\nVisuals:\n\nNotification storm\nSlack bubbles\nEmail floods\nCalendar collisions\nBrowser tabs multiplying endlessly\n\nMotion:\n\nFast camera movement\nParallax layers\nAlert explosions\nScene 2 — Drowning\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery day begins with a hundred decisions that shouldn't exist.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEndless task cards\nDocuments stacking\nMeeting windows expanding\n\nMotion:\n\nCards overwhelm screen\nCamera trapped in clutter\nScene 3 — The Breaking Point\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe problem isn't effort. It's fragmentation.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWork apps floating apart\nData scattered everywhere\n\nMotion:\n\nSystems drifting apart in 3D space\nScene 4 — Atlas Appears\n\nVoiceover:\n\nMeet Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nCalm light emerges\nNoise fades\nElegant AI core appears\n\nMotion:\n\nMassive cinematic reveal\nParticle convergence\nScene 5 — Understanding Everything\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas understands your work the way a teammate does.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEmails\nDocs\nMeetings\nTasks\n\nall connecting into one intelligence layer\n\nMotion:\n\nNeural network animations\nData flowing\nScene 6 — Meetings\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery meeting summarized before you ask.\n\nVisuals:\n\nTranscript transforms into insights\n\nMotion:\n\nText morphing\nHighlight extraction\nScene 7 — Research\n\nVoiceover:\n\nHours of research condensed into seconds.\n\nVisuals:\n\nHundreds of pages collapsing into one answer\n\nMotion:\n\nDocuments flying toward center\nScene 8 — Projects\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas keeps every project moving.\n\nVisuals:\n\nRoadmaps\nTimelines\nTeam coordination\n\nMotion:\n\nDynamic progress systems\nScene 9 — The Transformation\n\nVoiceover:\n\nLess management. More momentum.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWorkspace becomes clean\nFocus returns\n\nMotion:\n\nClutter dissolves\nScene 10 — Future of Work\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe future isn't working harder. It's working with Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nBeautiful hero shot\nGlobal network\nProduct UI showcase\n\nMotion:\n\nEpic pullback\nCinematic ending","websiteUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"blockframe"}},"autopilot":1,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 60-second cinematic launch film for \"Atlas,\" an AI operating system designed as a teammate to automate repetitive work for startup founders, PMs, engineers, and executives. The film opens by vividly depicting the overwhelming chaos of modern work—notifications, endless tabs, stacked meetings, scattered documents—and the feeling of people drowning in busywork. It then dramatically introduces Atlas as the elegant solution, showcasing its ability to understand context across various tools, automate tasks like writing reports and summarizing meetings, and coordinate projects. The narrative culminates in the powerful idea that humans should focus on strategic thinking while Atlas handles execution, leaving the viewer with the profound feeling that 'Work just changed forever.' The visual style is premium, featuring kinetic typography, dynamic camera movement, depth, particles, animated gradients, and cinematic transitions, aiming for an emotional and transformative experience.","audience":"Startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives who are overwhelmed by the complexities and repetitive tasks of modern work.","tone":"cinematic, premium, innovative, transformative, reassuring","goal":"To make the viewer feel that Atlas is the revolutionary solution to modern work chaos and inspire them to embrace this new era of productivity.","keyMessages":["Work just changed forever.","Atlas is your AI teammate that automates repetitive work.","Focus on thinking, Atlas handles execution.","Understand context across all your tools.","From chaos to clarity: Meet Atlas."],"mustIncludeFacts":["Atlas is an AI operating system","Atlas is an AI teammate","Automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting","Hundreds of notifications, tabs multiplying, meetings stacking, documents scattered, people drowning in busywork","Atlas understands context across tools","Automating tasks, writing reports, summarizing meetings, finding information instantly, coordinating projects","Humans should focus on thinking while Atlas handles execution","Work just changed forever."],"brandColors":["#FFFFFF","#000000","#FF00FF","#00FFFF"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"epic orchestral, driving electronica, cinematic","voProfile":"male or female, authoritative yet warm, confident, slightly dramatic delivery"},"script":{"title":"Atlas: Work Redefined","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"The modern workday. A storm of notificati