onSec":3,"style":"inset","alt":"atlas logo fills powerful","license":"curated-library","sourceUrl":null,"source":"library:vetors","fromCache":true}],"final_attempt":"fallback","qa":{"pass":true,"issues":[],"skipped":true}},{"id":"rpa3am4a5k","kind":"project","prompt":"Create a 60-second cinematic launch film for an AI operating system called \"Atlas\".\n\nAtlas is an AI teammate that automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting.\n\nThe tone should feel like a mix of Apple, Linear, Arc Browser, and Stripe.\n\nThe audience is startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives.\n\nDo not create a feature slideshow.\n\nCreate an emotional narrative.\n\nThe video should begin by showing the chaos of modern work.\n\nHundreds of notifications.\n\nTabs multiplying.\n\nMeetings stacking.\n\nDocuments scattered.\n\nPeople drowning in busywork.\n\nThen introduce Atlas as the solution.\n\nShow Atlas understanding context across tools.\n\nAutomating tasks.\n\nWriting reports.\n\nSummarizing meetings.\n\nFinding information instantly.\n\nCoordinating projects.\n\nEnd with the idea that humans should focus on thinking while Atlas handles execution.\n\nUse premium motion design.\n\nUse kinetic typography.\n\nUse dynamic camera movement.\n\nUse depth, particles, animated gradients, and cinematic transitions.\n\nThe final feeling should be:\n\n\"Work just changed forever.\"\n\nDuration: 60 seconds.\n\nExpected Script Output\nScene 1 — The Chaos\n\nVoiceover:\n\nWork was supposed to get easier. Instead, it became noise.\n\nVisuals:\n\nNotification storm\nSlack bubbles\nEmail floods\nCalendar collisions\nBrowser tabs multiplying endlessly\n\nMotion:\n\nFast camera movement\nParallax layers\nAlert explosions\nScene 2 — Drowning\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery day begins with a hundred decisions that shouldn't exist.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEndless task cards\nDocuments stacking\nMeeting windows expanding\n\nMotion:\n\nCards overwhelm screen\nCamera trapped in clutter\nScene 3 — The Breaking Point\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe problem isn't effort. It's fragmentation.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWork apps floating apart\nData scattered everywhere\n\nMotion:\n\nSystems drifting apart in 3D space\nScene 4 — Atlas Appears\n\nVoiceover:\n\nMeet Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nCalm light emerges\nNoise fades\nElegant AI core appears\n\nMotion:\n\nMassive cinematic reveal\nParticle convergence\nScene 5 — Understanding Everything\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas understands your work the way a teammate does.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEmails\nDocs\nMeetings\nTasks\n\nall connecting into one intelligence layer\n\nMotion:\n\nNeural network animations\nData flowing\nScene 6 — Meetings\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery meeting summarized before you ask.\n\nVisuals:\n\nTranscript transforms into insights\n\nMotion:\n\nText morphing\nHighlight extraction\nScene 7 — Research\n\nVoiceover:\n\nHours of research condensed into seconds.\n\nVisuals:\n\nHundreds of pages collapsing into one answer\n\nMotion:\n\nDocuments flying toward center\nScene 8 — Projects\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas keeps every project moving.\n\nVisuals:\n\nRoadmaps\nTimelines\nTeam coordination\n\nMotion:\n\nDynamic progress systems\nScene 9 — The Transformation\n\nVoiceover:\n\nLess management. More momentum.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWorkspace becomes clean\nFocus returns\n\nMotion:\n\nClutter dissolves\nScene 10 — Future of Work\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe future isn't working harder. It's working with Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nBeautiful hero shot\nGlobal network\nProduct UI showcase\n\nMotion:\n\nEpic pullback\nCinematic ending","duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"720p","width":1280,"height":720,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"blockframe","status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":null,"error":null,"used_fallback":1,"llm_tokens_in":79064,"llm_tokens_out":31089,"created_at":1781695182467,"started_at":1781695201892,"finished_at":1781695657162,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":"auto","captions_enabled":1,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"Create a 60-second cinematic launch film for an AI operating system called \"Atlas\".\n\nAtlas is an AI teammate that automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting.\n\nThe tone should feel like a mix of Apple, Linear, Arc Browser, and Stripe.\n\nThe audience is startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives.\n\nDo not create a feature slideshow.\n\nCreate an emotional narrative.\n\nThe video should begin by showing the chaos of modern work.\n\nHundreds of notifications.\n\nTabs multiplying.\n\nMeetings stacking.\n\nDocuments scattered.\n\nPeople drowning in busywork.\n\nThen introduce Atlas as the solution.\n\nShow Atlas understanding context across tools.\n\nAutomating tasks.\n\nWriting reports.\n\nSummarizing meetings.\n\nFinding information instantly.\n\nCoordinating projects.\n\nEnd with the idea that humans should focus on thinking while Atlas handles execution.\n\nUse premium motion design.\n\nUse kinetic typography.\n\nUse dynamic camera movement.\n\nUse depth, particles, animated gradients, and cinematic transitions.\n\nThe final feeling should be:\n\n\"Work just changed forever.\"\n\nDuration: 60 seconds.\n\nExpected Script Output\nScene 1 — The Chaos\n\nVoiceover:\n\nWork was supposed to get easier. Instead, it became noise.\n\nVisuals:\n\nNotification storm\nSlack bubbles\nEmail floods\nCalendar collisions\nBrowser tabs multiplying endlessly\n\nMotion:\n\nFast camera movement\nParallax layers\nAlert explosions\nScene 2 — Drowning\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery day begins with a hundred decisions that shouldn't exist.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEndless task cards\nDocuments stacking\nMeeting windows expanding\n\nMotion:\n\nCards overwhelm screen\nCamera trapped in clutter\nScene 3 — The Breaking Point\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe problem isn't effort. It's fragmentation.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWork apps floating apart\nData scattered everywhere\n\nMotion:\n\nSystems drifting apart in 3D space\nScene 4 — Atlas Appears\n\nVoiceover:\n\nMeet Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nCalm light emerges\nNoise fades\nElegant AI core appears\n\nMotion:\n\nMassive cinematic reveal\nParticle convergence\nScene 5 — Understanding Everything\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas understands your work the way a teammate does.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEmails\nDocs\nMeetings\nTasks\n\nall connecting into one intelligence layer\n\nMotion:\n\nNeural network animations\nData flowing\nScene 6 — Meetings\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery meeting summarized before you ask.\n\nVisuals:\n\nTranscript transforms into insights\n\nMotion:\n\nText morphing\nHighlight extraction\nScene 7 — Research\n\nVoiceover:\n\nHours of research condensed into seconds.\n\nVisuals:\n\nHundreds of pages collapsing into one answer\n\nMotion:\n\nDocuments flying toward center\nScene 8 — Projects\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas keeps every project moving.\n\nVisuals:\n\nRoadmaps\nTimelines\nTeam coordination\n\nMotion:\n\nDynamic progress systems\nScene 9 — The Transformation\n\nVoiceover:\n\nLess management. More momentum.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWorkspace becomes clean\nFocus returns\n\nMotion:\n\nClutter dissolves\nScene 10 — Future of Work\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe future isn't working harder. It's working with Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nBeautiful hero shot\nGlobal network\nProduct UI showcase\n\nMotion:\n\nEpic pullback\nCinematic ending","websiteUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"blockframe"}},"autopilot":1,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 60-second horizontal launch film for \"Atlas,\" an AI operating system designed to be an AI teammate for startup founders, PMs, engineers, and executives. The film opens by dramatically illustrating the overwhelming chaos of modern work—notifications, endless tabs, back-to-back meetings, scattered documents—before introducing Atlas as the elegant solution. It showcases Atlas's ability to understand context across tools, automate repetitive tasks like writing reports, summarizing meetings, and coordinating projects. The narrative culminates in the idea that humans should focus on high-level thinking while Atlas handles execution, leaving the viewer with the profound feeling that 'Work just changed forever.' The visual style is premium, cinematic, and dynamic, employing kinetic typography, dynamic camera movement, depth, particles, animated gradients, and seamless transitions.","audience":"Startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives.","tone":"premium, cinematic, dynamic, sophisticated, transformative","goal":"To make the viewer feel that Atlas represents a fundamental, positive shift in how work is done, inspiring them to see it as the future.","keyMessages":["Atlas is your AI teammate, automating repetitive work.","Focus on thinking, let Atlas handle execution.","Work just changed forever.","Understand context across all your tools.","Automates email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting."],"mustIncludeFacts":["AI operating system called \"Atlas\"","AI teammate that automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting.","Audience: startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives.","Video begins by showing the chaos of modern work: hundreds of notifications, tabs multiplying, meetings stacking, documents scattered, people drowning in busywork.","Introduces Atlas as the solution, showing it understanding context across tools, automating tasks, writing reports, summarizing meetings, finding information instantly, coordinating projects.","Ends with the idea that humans should focus on thinking while Atlas handles execution.","Use premium motion design, kinetic typography, dynamic camera movement, depth, particles, animated gradients, and cinematic transitions.","Final feeling: \"Work just changed forever.\""],"brandColors":["#000000","#FFFFFF","#FF5733"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"cinematic, uplifting, driving, modern","voProfile":"male or female, mid-30s, confident, clear, inspiring, and authoritative"},"script":{"title":"Atlas: Your AI Teammate","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"The modern workday. A tidal wave of chaos.","onScreenText":["Notifications","Endless tabs","Back-to-back meetings"],"visualDirection":"A rapid montage of overwhelming digital clutter: notifications popping, tabs multiplying, calendar alerts stacking, documents scattering. Energetic camera movement.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"notification bell icon","role":"inset"},{"type":"icon","query":"browser tab icon","role":"inset"},{"type":"icon","query":"calendar icon","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["impact","whoosh"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":5,"duration":5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"You're drowning in busywork, not building the future.","onScreenText":["Drowning in busywork?"],"visualDirection":"A stylized human silhouette is partially submerged in a sea of digital elements. Particles swirl around them.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"abstract particles flowing","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":10,"duration":6,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Introducing Atlas. Your AI operating system. Your AI teammate.","onScreenText":["Atlas","AI Operating System"],"visualDirection":"The chaos begins to resolve. The Atlas logo appears, clean and central, with animated gradients and particles coalescing around it.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"abstract animated gradient","role":"background"}],"sfx":["riser","pop"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s4","start":16,"duration":7,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Atlas understands context across all your tools, automating reports, meetings, research, and project management.","onScreenText":["Understands context","Automates tasks"],"visualDirection":"Dynamic camera movement through a network of interconnected icons representing different tools (email, calendar, docs). Atlas's intelligence flows between them.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"email icon","role":"inset"},{"type":"icon","query":"meeting icon","role":"inset"},{"type":"icon","query":"document icon","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["click","sparkle"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s5","start":23,"duration":4,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Focus on thinking. Let Atlas handle execution.","onScreenText":["Think. Execute."],"visualDirection":"A split screen or layered effect: one side shows creative thought (lightbulb, abstract ideas), the other shows automated tasks being completed efficiently by Atlas.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"lightbulb icon","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["transition"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s6","start":27,"duration":3,"purpose":"cta","voiceover":"Work just changed forever.","onScreenText":["Work just changed forever."],"visualDirection":"The Atlas logo expands to fill the screen with a final, powerful animation, embodying transformation. The brand colors are prominent.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"outro"}],"music":{"mood":"cinematic, uplifting, driving, modern","query":"cinematic uplifting driving electronic"},"voice":{"style":"male or female, mid-30s, confident, clear, inspiring, and authoritative","pace":"conversational"}},"script_warnings":[],"usage":{"llm":{"inputTokens":79064,"outputTokens":31089,"callCount":3,"inputCostUsd":0.118596,"outputCostUsd":0.279801,"totalCostUsd":0.398397},"tts":{"inputChars":0,"inputTokensEst":0,"outputTokensEst":0,"callCount":0,"inputCostUsd":0,"outputCostUsd":0,"totalCostUsd":0},"external":{"freesound_search":1,"openrouter_chat":3,"freesound_download":1,"asset_library_hit":11,"hyperframes_lint":2,"hyperframes_render":1},"totalCostUsd":0.398397},"stage_timings":{"briefMs":6859,"scriptMs":12092,"productionMs":455270},"assets":[{"path":"assets/images/0.jpg","type":"image","sceneId":"s1","startSec":0,"durationSec":5,"style":"inset","alt":"notification bell icon","license":"curated-library","