ur work the way a teammate does.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEmails\nDocs\nMeetings\nTasks\n\nall connecting into one intelligence layer\n\nMotion:\n\nNeural network animations\nData flowing\nScene 6 — Meetings\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery meeting summarized before you ask.\n\nVisuals:\n\nTranscript transforms into insights\n\nMotion:\n\nText morphing\nHighlight extraction\nScene 7 — Research\n\nVoiceover:\n\nHours of research condensed into seconds.\n\nVisuals:\n\nHundreds of pages collapsing into one answer\n\nMotion:\n\nDocuments flying toward center\nScene 8 — Projects\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas keeps every project moving.\n\nVisuals:\n\nRoadmaps\nTimelines\nTeam coordination\n\nMotion:\n\nDynamic progress systems\nScene 9 — The Transformation\n\nVoiceover:\n\nLess management. More momentum.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWorkspace becomes clean\nFocus returns\n\nMotion:\n\nClutter dissolves\nScene 10 — Future of Work\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe future isn't working harder. It's working with Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nBeautiful hero shot\nGlobal network\nProduct UI showcase\n\nMotion:\n\nEpic pullback\nCinematic ending","duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"720p","width":1280,"height":720,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"blockframe","status":"failed","progress":null,"video_url":null,"error":"LLM budget exhausted — the OpenRouter key's spend limit is used up. Daily-limit keys reset automatically each day; otherwise add credits or raise the key's limit at openrouter.ai/settings/keys.","used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":0,"llm_tokens_out":0,"created_at":1781698227349,"started_at":null,"finished_at":1781698227424,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":"auto","captions_enabled":1,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"Create a 60-second cinematic launch film for an AI operating system called \"Atlas\".\n\nAtlas is an AI teammate that automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting.\n\nThe tone should feel like a mix of Apple, Linear, Arc Browser, and Stripe.\n\nThe audience i