epetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting.","The future isn't working harder. It's working with Atlas.","Humans should focus on thinking while Atlas handles execution."],"mustIncludeFacts":["Atlas is an AI operating system.","Atlas is an AI teammate.","Atlas automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting."],"brandColors":["#000000","#FFFFFF","#4A90E2"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"epic, futuristic, minimalist, tension-to-resolution","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, deep, confident, articulate, slightly ethereal"},"script":{"title":"Atlas: Work Just Changed Forever","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Work was supposed to get easier. Instead, it became noise.","onScreenText":["Work: Noise."],"visualDirection":"Rapid, chaotic montage of notifications, multiplying browser tabs, and overlapping calendar invites filling a screen.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":4.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Endless meetings, scattered documents, a deluge of busywork.","onScreenText":["Meetings","Documents","Busywork"],"visualDirection":"Abstract data streams and meeting bubbles swirl and fragment, creating a sense of overwhelm.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"meeting icon","role":"inset"},{"type":"icon","query":"document icon","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":9,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Introducing Atlas: the AI operating system that understands your work.","onScreenText":["Atlas: AI OS","Understands Work"],"visualDirection":"A single, elegant, glowing 'A' logo for Atlas emerges from the chaos, stabilizing the swirling elements into a cohesive, clean interface.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["riser","sparkle"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s4","start":13.5,"duration":6.5,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"An AI 