 3 — The Breaking Point\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe problem isn't effort. It's fragmentation.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWork apps floating apart\nData scattered everywhere\n\nMotion:\n\nSystems drifting apart in 3D space\nScene 4 — Atlas Appears\n\nVoiceover:\n\nMeet Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nCalm light emerges\nNoise fades\nElegant AI core appears\n\nMotion:\n\nMassive cinematic reveal\nParticle convergence\nScene 5 — Understanding Everything\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas understands your work the way a teammate does.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEmails\nDocs\nMeetings\nTasks\n\nall connecting into one intelligence layer\n\nMotion:\n\nNeural network animations\nData flowing\nScene 6 — Meetings\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery meeting summarized before you ask.\n\nVisuals:\n\nTranscript transforms into insights\n\nMotion:\n\nText morphing\nHighlight extraction\nScene 7 — Research\n\nVoiceover:\n\nHours of research condensed into seconds.\n\nVisuals:\n\nHundreds of pages collapsing into one answer\n\nMotion:\n\nDocuments flying toward center\nScene 8 — Projects\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas keeps every project moving.\n\nVisuals:\n\nRoadmaps\nTimelines\nTeam coordination\n\nMotion:\n\nDynamic progress systems\nScene 9 — The Transformation\n\nVoiceover:\n\nLess management. More momentum.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWorkspace becomes clean\nFocus returns\n\nMotion:\n\nClutter dissolves\nScene 10 — Future of Work\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe future isn't working harder. It's working with Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nBeautiful hero shot\nGlobal network\nProduct UI showcase\n\nMotion:\n\nEpic pullback\nCinematic ending","duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"720p","width":1280,"height":720,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"blockframe","status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":null,"error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":51282,"llm_tokens_out":13843,"created_at":1781699581306,"started_at":1781699592507,"finished_at":1781699821672,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":"auto","captions_enabled":1,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"Create a 60-second cinematic launch film for an AI operating system called \"Atlas\".\n\nAtlas is an AI teammate that automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting.\n\nThe tone should feel like a mix of Apple, Linear, Arc Browser, and Stripe.\n\nThe audience is startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives.\n\nDo not create a feature slideshow.\n\nCreate an emotional narrative.\n\nThe video should begin by showing the chaos of modern work.\n\nHundreds of notifications.\n\nTabs multiplying.\n\nMeetings stacking.\n\nDocuments scattered.\n\nPeople drowning in busywork.\n\nThen introduce Atlas as the solution.\n\nShow Atlas understanding context across tools.\n\nAutomating tasks.\n\nWriting reports.\n\nSummarizing meetings.\n\nFinding information instantly.\n\nCoordinating projects.\n\nEnd with the idea that humans should focus on thinking while Atlas handles execution.\n\nUse premium motion design.\n\nUse kinetic typography.\n\nUse dynamic camera movement.\n\nUse depth, particles, animated gradients, and cinematic transitions.\n\nThe final feeling should be:\n\n\"Work just changed forever.\"\n\nDuration: 60 seconds.\n\nExpected Script Output\nScene 1 — The Chaos\n\nVoiceover:\n\nWork was supposed to get easier. Instead, it became noise.\n\nVisuals:\n\nNotification storm\nSlack bubbles\nEmail floods\nCalendar collisions\nBrowser tabs multiplying endlessly\n\nMotion:\n\nFast camera movement\nParallax layers\nAlert explosions\nScene 2 — Drowning\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery day begins with a hundred decisions that shouldn't exist.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEndless task cards\nDocuments stacking\nMeeting windows expanding\n\nMotion:\n\nCards overwhelm screen\nCamera trapped in clutter\nScene 3 — The Breaking Point\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe problem isn't effort. It's fragmentation.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWork apps floating apart\nData scattered everywhere\n\nMotion:\n\nSystems drifting apart in 3D space\nScene 4 — Atlas Appears\n\nVoiceover:\n\nMeet Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nCalm light emerges\nNoise fades\nElegant AI core appears\n\nMotion:\n\nMassive cinematic reveal\nParticle convergence\nScene 5 — Understanding Everything\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas understands your work the way a teammate does.\n\nVisuals:\n\nEmails\nDocs\nMeetings\nTasks\n\nall connecting into one intelligence layer\n\nMotion:\n\nNeural network animations\nData flowing\nScene 6 — Meetings\n\nVoiceover:\n\nEvery meeting summarized before you ask.\n\nVisuals:\n\nTranscript transforms into insights\n\nMotion:\n\nText morphing\nHighlight extraction\nScene 7 — Research\n\nVoiceover:\n\nHours of research condensed into seconds.\n\nVisuals:\n\nHundreds of pages collapsing into one answer\n\nMotion:\n\nDocuments flying toward center\nScene 8 — Projects\n\nVoiceover:\n\nAtlas keeps every project moving.\n\nVisuals:\n\nRoadmaps\nTimelines\nTeam coordination\n\nMotion:\n\nDynamic progress systems\nScene 9 — The Transformation\n\nVoiceover:\n\nLess management. More momentum.\n\nVisuals:\n\nWorkspace becomes clean\nFocus returns\n\nMotion:\n\nClutter dissolves\nScene 10 — Future of Work\n\nVoiceover:\n\nThe future isn't working harder. It's working with Atlas.\n\nVisuals:\n\nBeautiful hero shot\nGlobal network\nProduct UI showcase\n\nMotion:\n\nEpic pullback\nCinematic ending","websiteUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"blockframe"}},"autopilot":1,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 60-second cinematic launch film for Atlas, an AI operating system designed for startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives. The video opens by vividly portraying the chaos and fragmentation of modern work – a deluge of notifications, multiplying tabs, endless meetings, and scattered documents, highlighting the feeling of drowning in busywork. It then dramatically introduces Atlas as the intelligent solution, showcasing how it seamlessly understands context across various tools, automates repetitive tasks, summarizes meetings, generates reports, and coordinates projects. The narrative culminates in the powerful idea that humans are freed to focus on strategic thinking while Atlas handles execution, conveying a sense of profound transformation. The visual style should be premium, utilizing kinetic typography, dynamic camera movement, depth, particles, animated gradients, and cinematic transitions to evoke the feeling that 'Work just changed forever.'","audience":"Startup founders, product managers, engineers, and executives overwhelmed by modern work complexity.","tone":"cinematic, transformative, sophisticated, empowering, visionary","goal":"Convey that Atlas is the essential, intelligent partner for a new era of work, inspiring viewers to explore its capabilities.","keyMessages":["Work was supposed to get easier. Instead, it became noise.","Atlas understands your work the way a teammate does.","Less management. More momentum.","The future isn't working harder. It's working with Atlas."],"mustIncludeFacts":["Atlas is an AI operating system","Atlas automates repetitive work across email, meetings, research, project management, and reporting"],"brandColors":["#1A1A1A","#007AFF","#FFFFFF"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"epic, futuristic, pulsing, cinematic","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, confident, articulate, slightly dramatic, inspiring"},"script":{"title":"Atlas: Work Just Changed Forever","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Work was supposed to get easier. Instead, it became noise.","onScreenText":["Noise.","Chaos."],"visualDirection":"A chaotic montage of overlapping digital screens, notifications, and rapidly switching tabs, creating a sense of overwhelming clutter.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"digital chaos notifications tabs overload","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact","riser"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":4.5,"duration":5.5,"purpose":"context",