r any keyword, extracting winning strategies and identifying content opportunities that competitors miss.\n\nAI Content Generation\n\nGenerate SEO-optimized articles instantly with ContentCraft AI, complete with strategic image placement and professional structure.\n\nReal-Time SEO Analysis\n\nGet instant SEO scoring based on 50+ ranking factors, with actionable recommendations to outperform competitors.\n\nBacklink Intelligence\n\nDiscover automated backlink opportunities and analyze competitor link-building strategies to boost your domain authority.\n\nVisual Content Creation\n\nAccess millions of stock images and AI-generated visuals, plus YouTube integration for engaging multimedia content.\n\nWordPress Integration\n\nSeamlessly publish content directly to WordPress with one-click export, maintaining all SEO optimizations and media files.\n\nHow Lexi Creates Ranking Content\n\nFollow Lexi's proven 4-step process to dominate search results\n\n1\nSERP Analysis\n\nLexi analyzes top-ranking pages for your target keyword, identifying what makes them successful and where opportunities exist.\n\n2\nContent Intelligence\n\nAI processes competitor content, extracting key topics, semantic keywords, and optimal content structure patterns.\n\n3\nStrategic Generation\n\nContentCraft AI creates comprehensive, SEO-optimized articles that incorporate competitor insights and search intent analysis.\n\n4\nOptimization & Publishing\n\nReal-time SEO analysis ensures perfect optimization before seamless publishing to your WordPress site.\n\nPlans That Start Free And Fits With Your Needs\n\nChoose the perfect plan for your content creation journey\n\nFree Forever\n$0.00\n\nExplore The Platform\n\n20 Credits (~40,000 characters)\n20 Icebreakers\n2 Long Articles (5,000 words each)\n4 Short Articles (1,000 words each)\n4 Podcasts\n4 YouTube Voice-overs\nChat & Email Support\nAccess to all tools\nGet Started For Free\nRecommended\nUnlimited (Limited Offer)\n$29.00 /month\n\nSuitable for individuals and solopreneurs\n\nUnlimited Words\nUnlimited Projects\nFast response time\nAccess to 55+ Premium AI tools\n100 Voiceovers\n100 AI Images\n24x7 Chat & Email Support\nActivate Now\nUnlimited Pro Max\n$49.00 /month\n\nSuitable for businesses and teams\n\nUnlimited Words\nUnlimited Projects\nFastest response time\nAccess to 60+ Premium AI tools\nUnlimited Voiceovers\nUnlimited AI Images\n5 Seats\nCreate and resell AI tools\nActivate Now\nTop-Notch SEO Toolkit\n\nDominate search rankings with Lexi AI Agent and advanced SEO tools\n\nBacklink Autopilot\n\nAutomatically build relevant backlinks across a network of","brandColors":["#18284B","#13213A","#0F1D33","#293756"],"ogImage":null,"hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":0,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second horizontal video promoting Writecream, an all-in-one AI platform for content creation, focusing on its ability to supercharge creativity and productivity for marketers, writers, and businesses. The video should highlight the breadth of its 75+ AI tools, especially the Lexi AI SEO Agent, showing how users can generate SEO-optimized articles, visuals, emails, and voiceovers instantly. The narrative should move from the pain points of content creation to the ease and efficiency Writecream provides, culminating in a clear call to action to start for free. The overall feel should be innovative and empowering, showcasing the future of content.","audience":"Marketers, content creators, small business owners, and freelancers looking to leverage AI for efficient content generation and SEO.","tone":"innovative, empowering, efficient, professional, cutting-edge","goal":"Encourage viewers to sign up for Writecream's free plan and explore its AI content creation capabilities.","keyMessages":["Supercharge your creativity and productivity with AI","Generate SEO-optimized articles, visuals, emails, and voiceovers instantly","75+ AI tools including Lexi AI SEO Agent","Join 1.5M+ users and start for fre