ucture\nStripe for enterprises\n\n50% of Fortune 100 companies have used Stripe to grow their businesses – from expanding internationally to reimagining the customer experience.\n\nHertz unifies commerce with Stripe.\nRead the story\n\n160\n\n countries\n\n11K+\n\n locations globally\n\nProducts used\n\n Payments, Terminal, Connect, Radar and Stripe Sigma\nURBN consolidates $5 billion in online and in-store revenue onto Stripe.\nRead the story\nInstacart powers online grocery delivery with Stripe.\nRead the story\nLe Monde improves local and international payments with Stripe.\nRead the story\nRealise value faster with dedicated experts\nProfessional services.\n\nGet tailored guidance from Stripe on implementation, complex integrations, or major migrations.\n\nView services \nStripe-certified experts.\n\nWork with a Stripe consulting partner that can integrate and deploy Stripe solutions on your behalf.\n\nView partners \nSupport plans.\n\nReceive ongoing assistance and day-to-day support for technical questions with tiered plans based on your needs.\n\nView plans \nBuild a foundation for your ","brandColors":["#FE9316","#FA86E6","#FE8F28","#FEB06F"],"ogImage":"https://images.stripeassets.com/fzn2n1nzq965/XtX984S1GJVsVOXFC7kMu/01988281e867728dfb09aa7793a6e3b9/Stripe.jpg?q=80","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":0,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second horizontal video introducing Stripe as the essential financial infrastructure for businesses of all sizes. The video should highlight Stripe's comprehensive payment solutions, flexible billing models, and global money movement capabilities. It should open with a dynamic visual representing the scale of global commerce, transition to showcase the ease and flexibility of Stripe's platform through diverse use cases (online, in-person, subscriptions), and conclude by emphasizing its reliability and growth potential for startups and enterprises alike. The tone should be authoritative and innovative, reflecting Stripe's position as a leader in financial technology.","audience":"Business owners, developers, and financial decision-makers at startups and enterprises looking for robust payment and financial infrastructure.","tone":"authoritative, innovative, reliable, global, efficient","goal":"Position Stripe as the indispensable partner for businesses aiming to grow revenue and manage financial operations seamlessly.","keyMessages":["Financial infrastructure to grow your revenue.","Accept and optimize payments globally – online and in person.","Flexible solutions for every business model.","Reliable, extensible infrastructure for every stack.","Powering businesses of all sizes."],"mustIncludeFacts":["Stripe is a financial services platform that helps all types of businesses accept payments, build flexible billing models and manage money movement.","Stripe supports 135+ currencies and payment methods.","Businesses on Stripe generated US$1.9tn in 2025.","50% of Fortune 100 companies have used Stripe to grow their businesses."],"brandColors":["#FE9316","#FA86E6","#FE8F28","#FEB06F"],"suggestedFramePack":"midnight-glass","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"modern, sophisticated, electronic, driving","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, confident, clear, professional"},"script":{"title":"Stripe: Financial Infrastructure for Growth","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":4,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"In a world of global commerce, how do businesses keep pace?","onScreenText":["Global Commerce","Keep Pace?"],"visualDirection":"A dynamic, interconnected network of glowing lines and nodes representing global transactions, rapidly expanding.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"global network data flow","role":"background"}],"sfx":["riser","impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":4,"duration":5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Stripe provides the essential financial infrastructure to grow your revenue.","onScreenText":["Stripe: Financial Infrastructure","Grow Revenue"],"vi