ful landscape, a pet — then transition to the ease of sharing these moments. It should emphasize the personal connection and community, concluding with a clear call to log in or create an account. The tone should be welcoming, vibrant, and authentic, reflecting Instagram's brand.","audience":"New or returning users interested in sharing personal moments and connecting with friends.","tone":"welcoming, vibrant, authentic, connective","goal":"Encourage viewers to log in or create an Instagram account to share their moments.","keyMessages":["Share what you're into with the people who get you.","See everyday moments from your close friends.","Connect with friends and community."],"mustIncludeFacts":["Share what you're into with the people who get you.","See everyday moments from your close friends."],"brandColors":["#14171B","#1D232D","#23252B"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"upbeat, friendly, pop","voProfile":"female, mid-20s, warm, enthusiastic, clear"},"script":{"title":"Share Your Everyday Moments on Instagram","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":4,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Life is full of moments, big and small.","onScreenText":["Everyday Moments"],"visualDirection":"A quick montage of diverse, authentic everyday moments: friends laughing, a scenic landscape, a pet playing.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"friends laughing authentic","role":"background"},{"type":"video","query":"beautiful landscape serene","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["riser"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":4,"duration":5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Share what you're into with the people who truly get you.","onScreenText":["Share Your Passions"],"visualDirection":"A hand gestures to a phone screen displaying various shared posts: hobbies, art, food.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"person sharing hobby content phone","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":9,"duration":5.5,"purpose":"feature