st deals\nFrom ₹249\n   \nGrab Big Discounts!\nMin.40% Off\nTrending Gadgets & Appliances\n     \nTrue Wireless\nMin. 50% Off\n     \nNeckband\nBig Savings\n     \nEarphones\nSpecial offer\n     \nTrimmers\nMin. 50% Off\nBrands in Spotlight\nMake your home stylish\n     \nMop Set\nNew Collection\n     \nWater Bottles & Flasks\nSpecial offer\n     \nKitchen Racks\nMin. 50% Off\n     \nPressure Cookers\nSpecial offer\nHair & Skincare Essentials\n     \nFace Wash\nMin. 50% Off\n     \nHair Care\nSpecial offer\n     \nBath Soap\nMin. 50% Off\n     \nHair Claw\nMin. 50% Off\nHang on, loading content\nFlipkart - Your go-to place for Online Shopping\n+\nABOUT\nContact Us\nAbout Us\nCareers\nFlipkart Stories\nPress\nCorporate Information\nGROUP COMPANIES\nMyntra\nCleartrip\nShopsy\nHELP\nPayments\nShipping\nCancellation & Returns\nFAQ\nCONSUMER POLICY\nCancellation & Returns\nTerms Of Use\nSecurity\nPrivacy\nSitemap\nGrievance Redressal\nEPR Compliance\nFSSAI Food Safety Connect App\nMail Us:\n\nFlipkart Internet Private Limited,\n\nBuildings Alyssa, Begonia &\n\nClove Embassy Tech Village,\n\nOuter Ring Road, Devarabeesanahalli Village,\n\nBengaluru, 560103,\n\nKarnataka, India\n\nSocial:\nRegistered Office Address:\n\nFlipkart Internet Private Limited,\n\nBuildings Alyssa, Begonia &\n\nClove Embassy Tech Village,\n\nOuter Ring Road, Devarabeesanahalli Village,\n\nBengaluru, 560103,\n\nKarnataka, India\n\nCIN : U51109KA2012PTC066107\n\nTelephone: 044-45614700 / 044-67415800\n\nBecome a Seller\nAdvertise\nGift Cards\nHelp Center\n© 2007-2026 Flipkart.com\n✕\nLogin\n\nGet access to your Orders, Wishlist and Recommendations\n\nEnter Email/Mobile number\nBy continuing, you agree to Flipkart's Terms of Use and Privacy Policy.\nRequest OTP\nNew to Flipkart? Create an account","brandColors":[],"ogImage":null,"hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":0,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 20-second horizontal promo for Flipkart, India's one-stop online shopping destination, aimed at value-hungry Indian shoppers browsing on their phones. It opens on the everyday thrill of a great deal, then rapid-fires across the breadth of the catalog — mobiles, electronics, fashion, home, groceries and more — each landing with a bold price tag like 'Min. 50% Off' and 'Under ₹199'. It layers in convenience: Flipkart Minutes delivering groceries and gadgets in a flash, plus exchange and rewards perks. It closes loud and confident on the call to start shopping. Energetic, punchy, unapologetically deal-driven.","audience":"Value-conscious Indian online shoppers browsing mobiles, electronics, fashion, home goods and groceries","tone":"loud, playful, fast, deal-driven","goal":"Make the viewer feel they're missing unbeatable deals and tap to shop Flipkart now","keyMessages":["India's ultimate one-stop online shopping destination","Trending gadgets & appliances at Min. 50% Off","Best deals under ₹199","Flipkart Minutes: groceries and gadgets in a flash","Trade in your old device with Reset & Exchange","Exclusive offers in popular sale events"],"mustIncludeFacts":["India's Ultimate One-Stop Online Shopping Destination","Trending Gadgets & Appliances — True Wireless Min. 50% Off","Best Deal Under ₹199","Min. 40% Off discounts","Flipkart Minutes: Groceries and Gadgets in a Flash","Flipkart Reset and Exchange Program: Trade-in Your Old Device"],"brandColors":["#2874F0","#FFE11B","#FB641B"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":20,"musicMood":"high-energy upbeat pop","voProfile":"male, late-20s, energetic and punchy, India-accented announcer"},"script":{"title":"Flipkart Deals You Can't Miss","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Looking for the deal of the day?","onScreenText":["The deal is ON"],"visualDirection":"A phone snaps into frame as a bright price tag bursts across it, energetic and punchy.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"excited person shopping phone closeup","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Flipkart — India's ultimate one-stop shopping destination.","onScreenText":["One-Stop Shopping"],"visualDirection":"Camera pulls back as category tiles for mobiles, fashion and home parallax past on layered planes.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"online shopping app categories grid","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Trending gadgets, true wireless at minimum fifty percent off.","onScreenText":["True Wireless","Min. 50% Off"],"visualDirection":"Quick zoom into the real product UI in a browser frame as a 50% Off tag slams down on earbuds.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"wireless earbuds product closeup","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["pop","ding"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s4","start":10,"duration":3,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Best deals under one ninety-nine. Up to forty percent off!","onScreenText":["Under ₹199","Min. 40% Off"],"visualDirection":"Price tags rapid-fire across fashion and home product cards sliding fast across the screen.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"fashion clothing accessories flatlay","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh","ding"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s5","start":13,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Flipkart Minutes — groceries and gadgets in a flash.","onScreenText":["Flipkart Minutes","In a Flash"],"visualDirection":"A delivery bag zips across frame with motion streaks as a timer ticks down fast.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"fast grocery delivery courier city","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s6","start":16.5,"duration":1.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Trade in your old device — Reset and Exchange!","onScreenText":["Reset & Exchange"],"visualDirection":"An old phone flips into a new one with a snappy swap motion and a glowing exchange icon.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image",