","framePack":"bauhaus-print"}},"autopilot":1,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 15-second horizontal promo for Lumen, a note-taking app that organizes itself. It highlights three core features: instant capture of ideas, automatic tagging for effortless organization, and a search function that understands natural language. The video should convey a sense of calm, intelligent productivity, ending with a clear call to action to try the app for free. The visual style should be clean, modern, and intuitive, reflecting the app's self-organizing nature.","audience":"Individuals who take notes (students, professionals, creatives) and struggle with organization and retrieval.","tone":"intelligent, calm, modern, efficient","goal":"Encourage viewers to try Lumen for free.","keyMessages":["Lumen organizes itself","Instant capture, automatic tagging, smart search","Try Lumen free."],"mustIncludeFacts":["Instant capture","Automatic tagging","Search that understands meaning"],"brandColors":["#FFFFFF","#000000"],"suggestedFramePack":"bauhaus-print","suggestedDuration":15,"musicMood":"calm, focused, ambient","voProfile":"neutral, clear, friendly, mid-range pitch"},"script":{"title":"Lumen: Notes That Organize Themselves","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Tired of messy notes?","onScreenText":["Messy Notes?"],"visualDirection":"A chaotic jumble of abstract shapes and lines quickly resolves into a clean, organized grid.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Lumen captures your ideas instantly.","onScreenText":["Instant Capture"],"visualDirection":"A quick animation shows a thought bubble appearing and immediately being placed into a clean, organized space.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"lightbulb idea icon","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":7,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"And organizes them with automatic tagg