ain background. It lacks sufficient visual complexity and supporting elements.","fix":"Enhance the frame by adding at least two more distinct visual elements. This could involve introducing a background animation, adding decorative shapes or particles, or incorporating a contextual graphic element that complements the main illustration."},{"atSec":15.4,"severity":"blocker","issue":"UNDER-ILLUSTRATED FRAME: The frame features a stylized illustration of a person against a dark background. It is under-illustrated and lacks the required visual layers.","fix":"Add more visual elements to enrich the frame. Consider introducing a background animation, a subtle graphic overlay, or a decorative element that complements the central illustration. Ensure there are at least 2-3 distinct visual layers present."},{"atSec":18.8,"severity":"blocker","issue":"UNDER-ILLUSTRATED FRAME: The frame contains only abstract, colorful shapes with no discernible content or supporting imagery. This frame lacks the required visual elements for a premium motion graphics product.","fix":"Add at least two distinct visual elements, such as an animated graphic overlay, a subtle particle effect, or a vector illustration, to complement the abstract background. Ensure these elements are animated and contribute to the overall visual interest."}]}},{"id":"sec69bwasa","kind":"project","prompt":"A high-energy 20-second vertical promo for Bulkdoor (bulkdoor.in). Punchy hook, clear value proposition, modern motion-design, bold legible hero text, confident voiceover, upbeat music and tasteful sound effects, strong call-to-action ending on the brand. Premium, trustworthy, fast-paced. Use clean design-system backgrounds and the real website screenshots; no off-brand stock imagery.","duration":20,"orientation":"vertical","quality":"1080p","width":1080,"height":1920,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"blockframe","status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":null,"error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":461424,"llm