1280,"height":720,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"blockframe","status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":null,"error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":41965,"llm_tokens_out":2873,"created_at":1782899018525,"started_at":1782899093340,"finished_at":1782899505684,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"https://www.writecream.com/","websiteUrl":"https://www.writecream.com/","hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"blockframe"},"website":{"url":"https://www.writecream.com/","title":"Writecream - AI SEO/GEO Writer | 1.5+ Million Users » Writecream","description":"Create SEO-optimized articles, visuals, emails & voiceovers instantly with Writecream’s 75+ AI tools and Lexi SEO Agent. Join 1.5M+ users. Start for free!","headings":["Writecream Supercharge Your Creativity and Productivity with AI","Generate in seconds using AI","Watch Lexi AI SEO Agent in Action","Intro Video","In-Depth Explanation","Revolutionary AI-Powered Content Creation","Intelligent Research Hub","AI Content Generation","Real-Time SEO Analysis","Backlink Intelligence","Visual Content Creation","WordPress Integration","How Lexi Creates Ranking Content","SERP Analysis","Content Intelligence","Strategic Generation","Optimization & Publishing","Plans That Start Free And Fits With Your Needs","Free Forever","Unlimited (Limited Offer)","Unlimited Pro Max","Top-Notch SEO Toolkit","Backlink Autopilot","AEO & GEO Optimization","75+ Languages + AI Toolkit"],"bodyText":"Skip to content\nAffiliate\nFree Tools\nAI Smart Tools\nBlog\nPricing\nLogin\n\nAccess OpenClaw 24/7 via Telegram\n\nGet Started\nGet Started\nAll-in-One AI Platform\nWritecream\nSupercharge Your Creativity\nand Productivity with AI\n\nGenerate marketing content, sales emails, blog articles, and stunning visuals in seconds with AI. From ChatGenie's instant content delivery to Lexi AI SEO Agent — create personalized cold emails, LinkedIn messages, podcasts, YouTube voice-overs, and dominate search rankings with 75+ AI-powered tools.\n\nInstant Content\nChatGenie AI\nLexi SEO Agent\nAI Images\nVoice-overs\nCold Emails\nStart Creating for Free\nView Pricing\n1.5M+\nACTIVE USERS\n75+\nAI TOOLS\n75+\nLANGUAGES\n24/7\nAI SUPPORT\nFLAGSHIP FEATURES\nGenerate in seconds using AI\n\nLet our AI assist with most time consuming to write blog articles, product descriptions and much more.\n\nGet Started For Free\nWatch Lexi AI SEO Agent in Action\n\nSee how Lexi revolutionizes SEO content creation and research\n\nIntro Video\n\nQuick overview of Writecream's powerful AI capabilities\n\nIn-Depth Explanation\n\nComprehensive walkthrough of all features and advanced techniques\n\nMeet Lexi: Your AI SEO Agent\n\nYour intelligent SEO companion that revolutionizes content research and creation. Dominate search rankings with AI-powered content strategy.\n\nRevolutionary AI-Powered Content Creation\n\nExperience the next generation of SEO content tools with Lexi\n\nIntelligent Research Hub\n\nLexi analyzes top 10 search results for any keyword, extracting winning strategies and identifying content opportunities that competitors miss.\n\nAI Content Generation\n\nGenerate SEO-optimized articles instantly with ContentCraft AI, complete with strategic image placement and professional structure.\n\nReal-Time SEO Analysis\n\nGet instant SEO scoring based on 50+ ranking factors, with actionable recommendations to outperform competitors.\n\nBacklink Intelligence\n\nDiscover automated backlink opportunities and analyze competitor link-building strategies to boost your domain authority.\n\nVisual Content Creation\n\nAccess millions of stock images and AI-generated visuals, plus YouTube integration for engaging multimedia content.\n\nWordPress Integration\n\nSeamlessly publish content directly to WordPress with one-click export, maintaining all SEO optimizations and media files.\n\nHow Lexi Creates Ranking Content\n\nFollow Lexi's proven 4-step process to dominate search results\n\n1\nSERP Analysis\n\nLexi analyzes top-ranking pages for your target keyword, identifying what makes them successful and where opportunities exist.\n\n2\nContent Intelligence\n\nAI processes competitor content, extracting key topics, semantic keywords, and optimal content structure patterns.\n\n3\nStrategic Generation\n\nContentCraft AI creates comprehensive, SEO-optimized articles that incorporate competitor insights and search intent analysis.\n\n4\nOptimization & Publishing\n\nReal-time SEO analysis ensures perfect optimization before seamless publishing to your WordPress site.\n\nPlans That Start Free And Fits With Your Needs\n\nChoose the perfect plan for your content creation journey\n\nFree Forever\n$0.00\n\nExplore The Platform\n\n20 Credits (~40,000 characters)\n20 Icebreakers\n2 Long Articles (5,000 words each)\n4 Short Articles (1,000 words each)\n4 Podcasts\n4 YouTube Voice-overs\nChat & Email Support\nAccess to all tools\nGet Started For Free\nRecommended\nUnlimited (Limited Offer)\n$29.00 /month\n\nSuitable for individuals and solopreneurs\n\nUnlimited Words\nUnlimited Projects\nFast response time\nAccess to 55+ Premium AI tools\n100 Voiceovers\n100 AI Images\n24x7 Chat & Email Support\nActivate Now\nUnlimited Pro Max\n$49.00 /month\n\nSuitable for businesses and teams\n\nUnlimited Words\nUnlimited Projects\nFastest response time\nAccess to 60+ Premium AI tools\nUnlimited Voiceovers\nUnlimited AI Images\n5 Seats\nCreate and resell AI tools\nActivate Now\nTop-Notch SEO Toolkit\n\nDominate search rankings with Lexi AI Agent and advanced SEO tools\n\nBacklink Autopilot\n\nAutomatically build relevant backlinks across a network of","brandColors":["#18284B","#13213A","#0F1C33","#283654"],"ogImage":null,"hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":0,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second horizontal promo for Writecream, showcasing how its Lexi AI SEO Agent helps content creators and marketers dominate search rankings. The video starts with the struggle of SEO research, then introduces Writecream's 75+ AI tools generating optimized articles, visuals, and voiceovers in seconds. We highlight Lexi analyzing the top 10 search results and providing real-time SEO scoring. It wraps up with a clear call-to-action to join over 1.5 million users and start creating for free.","audience":"Content creators, SEO specialists, marketers, and agency owners looking to scale traffic","tone":"confident, efficient, modern, energetic","goal":"Get the viewer to sign up for Writecream's free plan to automate their SEO content creation","keyMessages":["Supercharge your SEO content with Lexi AI Agent","Generate articles, visuals, and voiceovers in seconds","Analyze top 10 search results for winning strategies","Join 1.5 million users and start for free"],"mustIncludeFacts":["1.5M+ active users","75+ AI tools","75+ languages","Lexi SEO Agent analyzes top 10 search results","Real-time SEO scoring based on 50+ ranking factors"],"brandColors":["#18284B","#13213A","#0F1C33","#283654"],"suggestedFramePack":"blockframe","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"driving electronic beats","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, clear, confident, fast-paced"},"script":{"title":"Dominate Search with Writecream Lexi AI","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":4,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Still wasting hours trying to rank on Google?","onScreenText":["Struggling to Rank?"],"visualDirection":"A dramatic zoom-in on a laptop showing downward-trending organic traffic graphs under a dark overlay.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"frustrated man laptop office closeup","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":4,"duration":4,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Meet Writecream. Over seventy-five AI tools built to scale.","onScreenText":["Meet Writecream","75+ AI Tools"],"visualDirection":"The screen transitions sideways to reveal a clean dashboard layout sh