atus":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":null,"error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":37903,"llm_tokens_out":2020,"created_at":1782908148813,"started_at":1782908211199,"finished_at":1782908807996,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"A 20-second promo for BookMyShow � movies, sports, plays and live events. Bold, energetic, premium; feature the real site screenshots in a clean device frame; strong CTA.","websiteUrl":"https://in.bookmyshow.com","hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":20,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"auto"},"website":{"url":"https://in.bookmyshow.com","title":"Movie Tickets, Plays, Sports, Events & Cinemas nearby - BookMyShow","description":"BookMyShow offers showtimes, movie tickets, reviews, trailers, concert tickets and events near Mumbai . Also features promotional offers, coupons and mobile app.\n","headings":["Recommended Movies","Alpha","Welcome To The Jungle","Cocktail 2","Main Vaapas Aaunga","Ghabadkund","The Best Of Live Events"],"bodyText":"Search for Movies, Events, Plays, Sports and Activities\nSelect your region\nSign in\nMovies\nStream\nEvents\nPlays\nSports\nActivities\nListYourShow\nCorporates\nOffers\nGift Cards\nDetect my location\n\nPopular Cities\n\nMumbai\n\nDelhi-NCR\n\nBengaluru\n\nHyderabad\n\nChandigarh\n\nAhmedabad\n\nPune\n\nChennai\n\nKolkata\n\nKochi\n\nView All Cities\n\nRecommended Movies\nSee All ›\nAlpha\nAction/Thriller\nWelcome To The Jungle\nAction/Comedy\nCocktail 2\nComedy/Drama/Romantic\nMain Vaapas Aaunga\nDrama/Period/Romantic\nGhabadkund\nAction/Adventure/Suspense/Thriller\nThe Best Of Live Events\nList your Show\nGot a show, event, activity or a great experience? Partner with us & get listed on BookMyShow\nContact today!\n24/7 CUSTOMER CARE\nRESEND BOOKING CONFIRMATION\nSUBSCRIBE TO THE NEWSLETTER\nMOVIES IN TOP CITIES\nMovies in Mumbai\nMovies in Delhi-NCR\nMovies in Chennai\nMovies in Bengaluru\nMovies in Hyderabad\nMovies in Pune\nMovies in Ahmedabad\nMovies in Kolkata\nMovies in Kochi\nMOVIES BY GENRE\nDrama Movies\nAction Movies\nThriller Movies\nComedy Movies\nAdventure Movies\nRomantic Movies\nFamily Movies\nSci-Fi Movies\nHorror Movies\nMystery Movies\nMOVIES BY LANGUAGE\nMovies in English\nMovies in Hindi\nMovies in Telugu\nMovies in Tamil\nMovies in Malayalam\nMovies in Kannada\nMovies in Gujarati\nMovies in Marathi\nMovies in Bengali\nMovies in Punjabi\nTOP CINEMAS\nEylex Cinemas: Hinoo\nGmax Cinemas Jerome 3D 7.1 JBL: Kollam\nDenzong Cinema: Gangtok\nUsha A/C Cinema 2K 3D: Kollam\nPranavam A/C Cinemas 4K: Kollam\nINOX: ML Acropolis Mall, Siliguri\nINOX: West Point Mall, Gangtok-MN\nRempham`Ly Cinema: Aizawl\nSSR Balaka Cinemas: Agartala\nJB Cinemas 4K 3D: Nallila\nEVENTS\nMusic Shows\nWorkshops\nComedy Shows\nKids\nMeetups\nScreening\nCelebrity Wishes\nTalks\nConferences\nAward shows\nPLAYS\nTheatre\nMime\nNon-verbal\nStorytelling\nImprov Theatre\nInteractive Theatre\nMonologue\nStreet Plays\nExperimental\nPuppetry\nSPORTS EVENTS\nBowling\nMixed Martial Arts\nBasketball\nCricket\nHorse Race\nSailing\nChess\nCycling\nE Sports\nWeight Lifting\nACTIVITIES\nFood and Drinks\nAdventure\nNightlife\nQuizzes and Competitions\nTourist Attractions\nAntiques, Heritage, Museums\nAmusement Parks\nMonuments\nNavratri Celebration\nUnique Tours\nONLINE MOVIES BY LANGUAGE\nOnline Movies in Kannada\nOnline Movies in Sindhi\nOnline Movies in Bengali\nOnline Movies in Flemish\nOnline Movies in Chattisgarhi\nOnline Movies in French\nOnline Movies in Portuguese\nOnline Movies in Magahi\nOnline Movies in Hindi\nOnline Movies in Assamese\nONLINE MOVIES BY GENRE\nDrama Online Movies\nThriller Online Movies\nAction Online Movies\nComedy Online Movies\nAdventure Online Movies\nCrime Online Movies\nHorror Online Movies\nRomantic Online Movies\nMystery Online Movies\nFantasy Online Movies\nMISC\nUpcoming Movies\nMovies in Cinemas\nLive Events\nTheatre Plays\nSports Events\n