758,"end":7.950000000000001,"text":"humans and agents, from PRD to PR."},{"start":8,"end":10.324875,"text":"Built for the future. Available today."}],"srt_url":"/videos/j9j40qulbv.srt","final_attempt":"three","qa":{"pass":true,"issues":[],"skipped":true}},{"id":"jr5o7c5x4n","kind":"project","prompt":"A 15-second promo for Linear � the purpose-built tool for planning and building products, used by modern software teams.","duration":15,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"720p","width":1280,"height":720,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"midnight-glass","status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":null,"error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":10511,"llm_tokens_out":1333,"created_at":1782973709306,"started_at":1782973754998,"finished_at":1782973918464,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"A 15-second promo for Linear � the purpose-built tool for planning and building products, used by modern software teams.","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":15,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"auto"},"website":{"url":"https://linear.app","title":"Linear – The system for product development","description":"Purpose-built for planning and building products with AI agents.","headings":["The product development system for teams and agentsThe product developmentsystem for teams and agentsThe product development system for teams and agents","Faster app launch","A new species of product tool. Purpose-built for modern teams with AI workflows at its core, Linear sets a new standard for planning and building products.","Make product operations self-driving","Define the product direction","Move work forward across teams and agents","Review PRs and agent output","Understand progress at scale","Changelog","Built for the future. Available today.","Product","Features","Company","Resources","Connect","Legal"],"bodyText":"Skip to content →\nProduct\nResources\nCustomers\nPricing\nNow\nContact\nLog in\nSign up\nThe product development\nsystem for teams and agents\nThe product development system for teams and agents\n\nPurpose-built for planning and building products. Designed for the AI era.\n\nNew\nCoding Sessions →\nLinear\nInbox\nMy issues\nReviews\nPulse\nWorkspace\nInitiatives\nProjects\nMore\nFavorites\nFaster app launch\nAgent tasks\nUI Refresh\nAgents Insights\nFaster app launch\n02\n/\n145\nFaster app launch\n\nRender UI before vehicle_state sync when minimum required state is present, instead of blocking on full refresh during iOS startup.\n\nActivity\nLinear created the issue via Slack on behalf of karri · 2min ago\nTriage Intelligence added the label Performance and iOS · 2min ago\nkarri\n· 4 min ago\nRight now we show a spinner forever, which makes it look like the car disappeared...\njori\n· just now\n@Linear can you take a stab at this?\nLinear\nconnected by\njori\n·\n2 min ago\nChanged 2 files\nDraft PR awaiting your review\n·\n2 min ago\nLinear moved from Todo to In Progress · just now\nLinearOpus 4.8\njori\nconnected Linear to ENG-2703\nExamining the startup path...\nThinking...\nENG-2703\nIn Progress\nHigh\njori\nLinear\nLabels\nPerformance\niOS\nCycle\nCycle 144\nProject\nCore Performance\nA new species of product tool. Purpose-built for modern teams with AI workflows at its core, Linear sets a new standard for planning and building products.\nFIG 0.2\nBuilt for purpose\n\nLinear is shaped by the practices and principles of world-class product teams.\n\nFIG 0.3\nPowered by AI agents\n\nDesigned for workflows shared by humans and agents, from PRD to PR.\n\nFIG 0.4\nDesigned for speed\n\nReduces noise and restores momentum to help teams ship with high velocity and focus.\n\nMake product operations self-driving\n\nTurn conversations and customer feedback into actionable issues that are routed, labeled, and prioritized for the right team.\n\n1.0Intake→\nBacklog\n8\nENG-2085\nReduce UI flicker during autonomy...\nENG-2094\nAdd buffering for autonomy event streams\nENG-2092\nReduce startup delay caused by vehicle sync\nENG-2200\nFix delayed route updates during rerouting\nTodo\n71\nENG-926\nRemove UI inconsistencies\nBug\nDesign\nENG-2088\nTypeError: Cannot read properties\nBug\nENG-924\nUpgrade to Claude Opus 4.8\nAI\nENG-1882\nOptimize load times\nPerformance\nIn Progress\n3\nENG-1487\nRemove contentData from GraphQL API\n61039\nMKT-1028\nLaunch page assets\nDesign\nENG-2187\nPrevent duplicate ride requests on poor...\nBug\n62048\nDone\n53\nENG-2074\nClean up deprecated APIs...\nAPI\n61002\nENG-1912\nReduce latency in autonomy st...\n61005\nENG-1951\nReduce ETA fluctuations durin...\n61202\nENG-1960\nImprove fallback messaging\nUI\n61149\nENG-1991\nImprove rider visibility into veh...\nThread in #feedback\ndidier\n11:58 AM\nHas anyone been looking into the iOS startup performance issues?\nlena\n11:58 AM\nAnyone else noticing the iOS app feels slow to open if you haven't used it in a bit?\ndidier\n11:58 AM\nYea, we're still blocking initial render on a full vehicle_state sync every time...\nandreas\n11:58 AM\nFeels like we could render sooner and load the rest in the background. Probably also worth tracking startup timing so we know how often this happens!\n@Linear\ncreate urgent issues and assign to me\n1.1\nLinear Agent +\n1.2\nTriage +\n1.3\nCustomer Requests +\n1.4\nLinear Asks +\nDefine the product direction\n\nPlan and navigate from idea to launch. Align your team with product initiatives, strategic roadmaps, and clear, up-to-date PRDs.\n\n2.0Plan→\nFEB\nMAR\nAPR\nMAY\nJUN\nJUL\nAUG\nSEP\n2\n9\n16\n23\n2\n9\n16\n23\n30\n6\n13\n20\n27\n4\n11\n18\n25\n1\n8\n15\n22\n29\n6\n13\n20\n27\n3\n10\n17\n24\n31\n7\n14\n21\n28\nUI Refresh\nCore screens\nPolish\nSplit fares\nInternal\nPublic Beta\nAutonomy status clarity\nAlpha\nGA\nInitiatives\nCore Product\n99\nInfra stability\n28\nAutonomous systems\n16\nMobile apps\n8\nAPAC Expansion\n21\nJapan Launch\n12\nCustomer-driven priorities\n9\n2.1\nProjects +\n2.2\nDocuments +\n2.3\nInitiatives +\n2.4\nVisual planning +\nMove work forward across teams and agents\n\nBuild and deploy AI agents that work alongside your team. Work on complex task","brandColors":["#1A1A16","#28261B","#201E12"],"ogImage":"https://linear.app/static/og/homepage.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":1,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A high-tempo, ultra-sleek 15-second horizontal promo for Linear. The video target software engineers and product managers who value speed over clunky admin. It opens with a dark, high-contrast interface instantly organizing complex tasks, demonstrating how Linear makes product operations self-driving. It highlights seamless collaboration between humans and AI agents, closing with a sharp, confident call to action to build the future of product development today.","audience":"Modern software engineers, product managers, and engineering leaders who demand speed and precision","tone":"precise, premium, fast, focused","goal":"Make product teams feel that Linear is the only tool fast and refined enough for their workflow","keyMessages":["The product development system for teams and agents","Purpose-built for planning and building products","Designed for speed and high-velocity focus"],"mustIncludeFacts":["The product development system for teams and agents","Purpose-built for planning and building products"],"brandColors":["#1A1A16","#28261B","#201E12"],"suggestedFramePack":"midnight-glass","suggestedDuration":15,"musicMood":"nocturnal electronic pulse","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, calm, confident, understated"},"script":{"title":"Linear: Built for High Velocity","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Stop fighting clunky tools. Meet pure speed.","onScreenText":["Built for speed."],"visualDirection":"A high-contrast dark interface rapidly scales in, with a glowing cursor slicing through complex clutter.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact","whoosh"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Purpose-built for planning and building products.","onScreenText":["Plan & Build.","Zero friction."],"visualDirection":"The camera slides smoothly across a premium glassmorphic browser frame showing clean, self-organizing product timelines.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["click"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":7,"duration":4,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"The product development system for teams and agents.","onScreenText":["Teams + Agents","Unified workflow"],"visualDirection":"Layered cards representing human tasks and AI agent actions parallax past the camera, connecting with glowing nodes.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"abstract digital network connection dark","role":"background"}],"sfx":["transition","sparkle"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s4","start":11,"duration":4,"purpose":"cta","voiceover":"Build the future of product development today.","onScreenText":["Build the future.","Linear."],"visualDirection":"The camera pulls back to reveal a sharp, glowing logo centering over a dark, pulsing background.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["riser","impact"],"musicCue":"outro"}],"music":{"mood":"nocturnal electronic pulse","query":"dark minimal techno pulse"},"voice":{"style":"male, mid-30s, calm, confident, understated","pace":"conversational"}},"script_warnings":[],"website_screenshot":"C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\jr5o7c5x4n\\ingest\\website.png","website_screenshots":["C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\jr5o7c5x4n\\ingest\\website.png","C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\jr5o7c5x4n\\ingest\\website_section2.png","C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\jr5o7c5x4n\\ingest\\website_section3.png"],"website_title":"Linear – The system for product development","usage":{"byStage":[{"stage":"storyboard","model":"google/gemini-3.5-flash","inputTokens":10511,"outputTokens":1333,"totalTokens":11844,"callCount":1,"costUsd":0.006486}],"llm":{"inputToke