d is extremely difficult to read and fails contrast requirements.","fix":"Change the background color of the Credit Suisse card to a lighter token, or apply a high-contrast white/light-blue color overlay to the logo itself."},{"atSec":7.8,"severity":"blocker","issue":"Palette-clashing photos. The motorcycle photo and dog photo are displayed in their raw native colors, which clash with the dark purple and neon vapor-chrome design system.","fix":"Apply a color tint or gradient scrim using the design system's purple/pink/cyan palette over the motorcycle and dog images to harmonize them with the background."}]}},{"id":"jqyma3u7f9","kind":"project","prompt":"A 12-second launch promo for BrewByte, a premium cold brew coffee subscription delivered to your door. Highlight fresh beans, fast delivery, and easy monthly plans.","duration":12,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"720p","width":1280,"height":720,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"prism-launch","status":"failed","progress":"qa","video_url":null,"error":"server restarted while job was in-flight","used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":0,"llm_tokens_out":0,"created_at":1783315910376,"started_at":1783315940430,"finished_at":1783317500894,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"A 12-second launch promo for BrewByte, a premium cold brew coffee subscription delivered to your door. Highlight fresh beans, fast delivery, and easy monthly plans.","websiteUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":12,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"auto"}},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A hyper-fast, premium 12-second launch promo for BrewByte, a cold brew subscription service. The video moves with high-energy cuts from fresh roasted coffee beans to a sleek glass of iced cold brew, ending on a doorstep delivery. Designed for busy coffee lovers who crave cafe-quality cold brew at home. It establishes the brand insta