 for fast-moving remote teams who want to eliminate tool clutter and accelerate their shipping cycles. High-energy, sleek transitions, and a confident, modern tech aesthetic.","subject":"project management software interface","audience":"Remote software teams, product managers, and collaborative workgroups","tone":"energetic, modern, efficient, crisp","goal":"Get remote teams to sign up for Flowline to centralize their workflow and ship faster","keyMessages":["Plan, track, and ship in one place","Built specifically for remote teams","Eliminate tool clutter and work faster"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Flowline is a project management app","Helps remote teams plan, track and ship work faster in one place"],"brandColors":["#6366F1","#14B8A6","#F43F5E"],"suggestedFramePack":"prism-launch","suggestedDuration":18,"musicMood":"driving modern electronic","voProfile":"male, late-20s, confident, clear, fast-paced"},"script":{"title":"Flowline: Plan Track and Ship Faster","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Tired of scattered docs and endless chat?","onScreenText":["Scattered docs?","Endless chats?"],"visualDirection":"A fast-paced, chaotic montage of browser tabs and messy document icons flying past the camera.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"chaotic computer screen browser tabs","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":4,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Meet Flowline, the project management app built for remote teams.","onScreenText":["Meet Flowline","Built for remote teams"],"visualDirection":"Camera smoothly glides into a clean, modern browser mockup showcasing the Flowline workspace dashboard.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["swoosh","pop"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":7,"duration":4,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"Plan, track, and ship your work in one place.","onScreenText":["Plan.","Track.","Ship."],"visualDirection":"A high-fidelity project board zooms in as a task card glides swi