rt":17,"duration":4,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"From soundscapes to vectors, find exactly what you need to create.","onScreenText":["Photos, Music, Vectors","In One Place"],"visualDirection":"The camera pans down as layered, colorful vector cards and audio waveforms parallax past on different depth planes.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"music","role":"texture"}],"sfx":["transition"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s6","start":21,"duration":4,"purpose":"cta","voiceover":"Visit Pixabay today and start creating.","onScreenText":["Visit Pixabay","Start Creating"],"visualDirection":"The camera centers on a bold Pixabay logo lockup as a soft, warm radial pulse glows behind it.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["ding"],"musicCue":"outro"}],"music":{"mood":"modern uplifting electronica","query":"inspiring energetic electronic beat"},"voice":{"style":"male, late-20s, energetic, clean, inspiring","pace":"conversational"}},"script_warnings":[],"website_screenshot":"C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\4c3nwde3ka\\ingest\\website.png","website_screenshots":["C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\4c3nwde3ka\\ingest\\website.png","C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\4c3nwde3ka\\ingest\\website_section2.png","C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\4c3nwde3ka\\ingest\\website_section3.png"],"website_title":"6.2 million+ Stunning Free Images to Use Anywhere - Pixabay","usage":{"byStage":[{"stage":"script","model":"google/gemini-3.5-flash","inputTokens":3282,"outputTokens":1121,"totalTokens":4403,"callCount":1,"costUsd":0.003787},{"stage":"brief","model":"google/gemini-3.5-flash","inputTokens":4832,"outputTokens":437,"totalTokens":5269,"callCount":1,"costUsd":0.002542}],"llm":{"inputTokens":8114,"outputTokens":1558,"callCount":2,"inputCostUsd":0.002434,"outputCostUsd":0.003895,"totalCostUsd":0.006329},"tts":{"inputChars":0,"inputTokensEst":0,"outputTokensEst":0,"callCount":0,"inputCostUsd":0,"outputCostUsd":0,"totalCostUsd":0},"external":{"openrouter_chat":2},"totalCostUsd":0.006329},"stage_timings":{"ingestMs":12671,"briefMs":4925,"scriptMs":7980}},{"id":"70juot5rjk","kind":"project","prompt":"A punchy 20-second promo for Linear, the issue tracking and project management tool built for modern software teams.","duration":20,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"1080p","width":1920,"height":1080,"fps":30,"frame_pack":null,"status":"failed","progress":"brief","video_url":null,"error":"brief generation failed after 2 attempts: unbalanced JSON object in reply","used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":0,"llm_tokens_out":0,"created_at":1783574962454,"started_at":1783574963038,"finished_at":1783574994676,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"A punchy 20-second promo for Linear, the issue tracking and project management tool built for modern software teams.","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app/","hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":20,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"auto"},"website":{"url":"https://linear.app/","title":"Linear – The system for product development","description":"Purpose-built for planning and building products with AI agents.","headings":["The product development system for teams and agentsThe product developmentsystem for teams and agentsThe product development system for teams and agents","Faster app launch","A new species of product tool. Purpose-built for modern teams with AI workflows at its core, Linear sets a new standard for planning and building products.","Make product operations self-driving","Define the product direction","Move work forward across teams and agents","Review PRs and agent output","Understand progress at scale","Changelog","Built for the future. Available today.","Product","Features","Company","Resources","Connect","Legal"],"bodyText":"Skip to content →\nProduct\nResources\nCustomers\nPricing\nNow\nContact\nLog in\nSign up\nThe product development\nsystem for teams and agents\nThe product development system for teams and agents\n\nPurpose-built for planning and building products. Designed for the AI era.\n\nNew\nCoding Sessions →\nLinear\nInbox\nMy issues\nReviews\nPulse\nWorkspace\nInitiatives\nProjects\nMore\nFavorites\nFaster app launch\nAgent tasks\nUI Refresh\nAgents Insights\nFaster app launch\n02\n/\n145\nFaster app launch\n\nRender UI before vehicle_state sync when minimum required state is present, instead of blocking on full refresh during iOS startup.\n\nActivity\nLinear created the issue via Slack on behalf of karri · 2min ago\nTriage Intelligence added the label Performance and iOS · 2min ago\nkarri\n· 4 min ago\nRight now we show a spinner forever, which makes it look like the car disappeared...\njori\n· just now\n@Linear can you take a stab at this?\nLinear\nconnected by\njori\n·\n2 min ago\nChanged 2 files\nDraft PR awaiting your review\n·\n2 min ago\nLinear moved from Todo to In Progress · just now\nLinearOpus 4.8\njori\nconnected Linear to ENG-2703\nExamining the startup path...\nThinking...\nENG-2703\nIn Progress\nHigh\njori\nLinear\nLabels\nPerformance\niOS\nCycle\nCycle 144\nProject\nCore Performance\nA new species of product tool. Purpose-built for modern teams with AI workflows at its core, Linear sets a new standard for planning and building products.\nFIG 0.2\nBuilt for purpose\n\nLinear is shaped by the practices and principles of world-class product teams.\n\nFIG 0.3\nPowered by AI agents\n\nDesigned for workflows shared by humans and agents, from PRD to PR.\n\nFIG 0.4\nDesigned for speed\n\nReduces noise and restores momentum to help teams ship with high velocity and focus.\n\nMake product operations self-driving\n\nTurn conversations and customer feedback into actionable issues that are routed, labeled, and prioritized for the right team.\n\n1.0Intake→\nBacklog\n8\nENG-2085\nReduce UI flicker during autonomy...\nENG-2094\nAdd buffering for autonomy event streams\nENG-2092\nReduce startup delay caused by vehicle sync\nENG-2200\nFix delayed route updates during rerouting\nTodo\n71\nENG-926\nRemove UI inconsistencies\nBug\nDesign\nENG-2088\nTypeError: Cannot read properties\nBug\nENG-924\nUpgrade to Claude Opus 4.8\nAI\nENG-1882\nOptimize load times\nPerformance\nIn Progress\n3\nENG-1487\nRemove contentData from GraphQL API\n61039\nMKT-1028\nLaunch page assets\nDesign\nENG-2187\nPrevent duplicate ride requests on poor...\nBug\n62048\nDone\n53\nENG-2074\nClean up deprecated APIs...\nAPI\n61002\nENG-1912\nReduce latency in autonomy st...\n61005\nENG-1951\nReduce ETA fluctuations durin...\n61202\nENG-1960\nImprove fallback messaging\nUI\n61149\nENG-1991\nImprove rider visibility into veh...\nThread in #feedback\ndidier\n10:59 AM\nHas anyone been looking into the iOS startup performance issues?\nlena\n10:59 AM\nAnyone else noticing the iOS app feels slow to open if you haven't used it in a bit?\ndidier\n10:59 AM\nYea, we're still blocking initial render on a full vehicle_state sync every time...\nandreas\n10:59 AM\nFeels like we could render sooner and load the rest in the background. Probably also worth tracking startup timing so we know how often this happens!\n@Linear\ncreate urgent issues and assign to me\n1.1\nLinear Agent +\n1.2\nTriage +\n1.3\nCustomer Requests +\n1.4\nLinear Asks +\nDefine the product direction\n\nPlan and navigate from idea to launch. Align your team with product initiatives, strategic roadmaps, and clear, up-to-date PRDs.\n\n2.0Plan→\nFEB\nMAR\nAPR\nMAY\nJUN\nJUL\nAUG\nSEP\n2\n9\n16\n23\n2\n9\n16\n23\n30\n6\n13\n20\n27\n4\n11\n18\n25\n1\n8\n15\n22\n29\n6\n13\n20\n27\n3\n10\n17\n24\n31\n7\n14\n21\n28\nUI Refresh\nCore screens\nPolish\nSplit fares\nInternal\nPublic Beta\nAutonomy status clarity\nAlpha\nGA\nInitiatives\nCore Product\n99\nInfra stability\n28\nAutonomous systems\n16\nMobile apps\n8\nAPAC Expansion\n21\nJapan Launch\n12\nCustomer-driven priorities\n9\n2.1\nProjects +\n2.2\nDocuments +\n2.3\nInitiatives +\n2.4\nVisual planning +\nMove work forward across teams and agents\n\nBuild and deploy AI agents that work alongside your team. Work on complex task","brandColors":["#1A1A16","#28261B","#201E12"],"ogImage":"https://linear.app/static/og/homepage.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":null,"script":null,"script_warnings":null,"website_screenshot":"C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\70juot5rjk\\ingest\\website.png","website_screenshots":["C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\70juot5rjk\\ingest\\website.png","C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\70juot5rjk\\ingest\\website_section2.png","C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\70juot5rjk\\ingest\\website_section3.png"],"website_title":"Linear – The system for product development","usage":{"byStage":[],"llm":{"inputTokens":0,"outputTokens":0,"callCount":0,"inputCostUsd":0,"outputCostUsd":0,"totalCostUsd":0},"tts":{"inputChars":0,"inputTokensEst":0,"outputTokensEst":0,"callCount":0,"inputCostUsd":0,"outputCostUsd":0,"totalCostUsd":0},"external":{},"totalCostUsd":0},"stage_timings":{"ingestMs":11786}},{"id":"j449cgsw0i","kind":"project","prompt":"A punchy 20-second promo for Linear, the issue tracking tool for modern software teams. Fast, keyboard-first, beautifully designed.","duration":20,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"1080p","width":1920,"height":1080,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"midnight-glass","status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":null,"error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":41497,"llm_tokens_out":1718,"created_at":1783575034971,"started_at":1783575072106,"finished_at":1783575653335,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"A punchy 20-second promo for Linear, the issue tracking tool for modern software teams. Fast, keyboard-first, beautifully designed.","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app/","hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":20,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"auto"},"website":{"url":"https://linear.ap