or each scene. For 5.9s, 9.9s, and 13.9s, use distinct layout compositions and update the card illustration to match the copy (e.g., show a calendar UI for 'YOUR SCHEDULE' and a streak counter for 'DAILY STREAKS')."}]}},{"id":"k24cruoagq","kind":"project","prompt":"A 20-second energetic promo for Notion, the all-in-one workspace for notes, docs, and project management.","duration":20,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"1080p","width":1920,"height":1080,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"nimbus-saas","status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":"/videos/k24cruoagq.mp4","error":"server restarted while job was in-flight","used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":0,"llm_tokens_out":0,"created_at":1783584373094,"started_at":1783584422087,"finished_at":1783666016217,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"A 20-second energetic promo for Notion, the all-in-one workspace for notes, docs, and project management.","websiteUrl":"https://www.notion.com/","hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":20,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"auto"},"website":{"url":"https://www.notion.com/","title":"The AI workspace that works for you. | Notion","description":"Build Custom Agents, search across all your apps, and automate busywork. The AI workspace where teams get more done, faster.","headings":["Capture","Find","Automate","Where teams and agents Think together.","Keep work moving 24/7.","Automate repetitive work for your team.","See what Custom Agents can do","Triage product feedback→","Resolve support tickets in Slack→","Respond to security alerts faster→","Automate weekly reporting→","Create your own Custom Agent→","Ask your on-demand assistants.","You assign the tasks. Notion Agent does the work.","One search for everything.","Perfect notes, every time.","Bring all your work together.","Simple and powerful.","One source of truth for teams and agents.","Less tracking. More progress.","Trusted by teams that ship.","Get started today."],"bodyText":"Product\nSolutions\nResources\nDevelopers\nEnterprise\nPricing\nRequest a demo\nGet Notion free\nLog in\nWhere teams and agents \nThink\n together.\n\nCapture context, find answers, and automate tasks with AI built for your team.\n\nGet Notion free\nRequest a demo\nPlay\n\nTrusted by 98% of the Forbes Cloud 100\n\nKeep work moving 24/7.\nCustom Agents\nAutomate repetitive work for your team.\n→\nQ&A agents\n\nAnswers questions instantly using knowledge you already have.\n\nTask routing agents\n\nAssigns, prioritizes, and routes tasks on its own.\n\nReporting agents\n\nSummarizes, writes, and sends reports for you.\n\nCreate your own\n\nMake a Custom Agent for any work that repeats.\n\nSee what Custom Agents can do\n \nTriage product feedback→\n \nResolve support tickets in Slack→\n \nRespond to security alerts faster→\n \nAutomate weekly reporting→\n \nCreate your own Custom Agent→\nAsk your on-demand assistants.\n \nNotion Agent\nYou assign the tasks. Notion Agent does the work.\n→\n \nEnterprise Search\nOne search for everything.\n→\n \nAI Meeting Notes\nPerfect notes, every time.\n→\nBring all your work together.\n \nDocs\nSimple and powerful.\n→\n \nKnowledge Base\nOne source of truth for teams and agents.\n→\n \nProjects\nLess tracking. More progress.\n→\nYour AI everything app.\nTrusted by teams that ship.\nUsing the most AI-native tools like Notion is an important competitive advantage for us to stay small while doing a lot.\nMichael TruellCo-founder & CEO\nNotion’s thoughtful design speeds up collaboration and decisions so we can deliver impact to our customers faster.\nRenee SolorzanoSr. Director of Product Design\nNotion Custom Agents help our team go beyond doing work with AI to building AI tools that do the work for them.\nBen LevickHead of Operations & Internal AI\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nGet started today.\nGet Notion free\nRequest a demo\nEnglish (US)\nCookie settings\n© 2026 Notion Labs, Inc.\nCompany\nAbout us\nCareers\nSecurity\nStatus\nTerms & privacy\nYour privacy rights\nDownload\niOS & Android\nMac & Windows\nCalendar\nWeb Clipper\nResources\nHelp center\nPricing\nBlog\nCommunity\nConnections\nTemplates\nPartner programs\nNotion for\nEnterprise\nSmall business\nPersonal\nExplore more→","brandColors":["#B6D7F4","#69AFED","#96C7F3","#0E7DE0"],"ogImage":"https://www.notion.com/front-static/meta/teams-and-agents.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A high-energy, 20-second horizontal promo showcasing Notion as the ultimate unified workspace where teams and AI agents work together. The video moves at a brisk, productive pace, starting with the chaos of scattered tools, then transitioning into Notion's clean, unified interface. We see notes, docs, and custom AI agents automating tasks in real-time. It ends with a strong call to action for teams to get started for free, leaving them feeling organized, empowered, and ready to build.","subject":"collaborative software workspace and AI interface","audience":"Fast-growing teams, startups, and knowledge workers looking to consolidate their tools.","tone":"energetic, clean, productive, forward-looking","goal":"Get teams to sign up for Notion to centralize their docs, projects, and AI workflows.","keyMessages":["Bring all your work together in Notion","Where teams and AI agents think together","Automate repetitive work with Custom Agents","One search for 