urate answers using your own business knowledge. it gives you script and user can add that script in their website to integrate chatbot","duration":15,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"720p","width":1280,"height":720,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"sketchnote","status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":"/videos/46rt4qef1g.mp4","error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":20717,"llm_tokens_out":8623,"created_at":1783677272957,"started_at":1783679692964,"finished_at":1783679921664,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"intent":{"prompt":"Helpdesk AI is saas product which basiclly Add a powerful AI chatbot to your website in minutes. Let your customers get instant, accurate answers using your own business knowledge. it gives you script and user can add that script in their website to integrate chatbot","websiteUrl":"https://helpdesk-ai-gold.vercel.app/","hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":15,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"sketchnote"},"website":{"url":"https://helpdesk-ai-gold.vercel.app/","title":"HelpDesk AI","description":"The chatbot or Support agent that you can embed in your website","headings":["Customer SupportReimagined with AI","Three steps to get started","Create Account","Add Knowledge","Embed & Go","Why businesses choose HelpDesk AI","Plug & Play","Admin Controlled","AI Powered","Ready to transform yourcustomer support?"],"bodyText":"HelpDeskAI\nLogin\nAI-Powered Customer Support\nCustomer Support\nReimagined with AI\n\nAdd a powerful AI chatbot to your website in minutes. Let your customers get instant, accurate answers using your own business knowledge.\n\nGet Started Free\nHow It Works\nAI\nCustomer Support\nOnline\nAI\nHi! How can I help you today?\nDo you offer cash on delivery?\nAI\nYes! Cash on Delivery is available for all orders.\nType a message...\nSend\nInstant Responses\n\nSimple Setup\n\nThree steps to get started\n01\nCreate Account\n\nSign up and access your dashboard in seconds.\n\n→\n02\nAdd Knowledge\n\nEnter your FAQs, policies, and business info.\n\n→\n03\nEmbed & Go\n\nCopy one script tag and paste it into your site.\n\nFeatures\n\nWhy businesses choose HelpDesk AI\nPlug & Play\n\nAdd the chatbot to your site with a single script tag. No complex setup or coding required.\n\nAdmin Controlled\n\nYou control exactly what the AI knows and answers. Full control over your chatbot's knowledge.\n\nAI Powered\n\nPowered by advanced AI models. Your customers get instant, accurate support 24/7.\n\nReady to transform your\ncustomer support?\n\nJoin businesses using HelpDesk AI to provide instant, intelligent customer support.\n\nGet Started Free\nHelpDeskAI\n\n© 2026 HelpDesk AI. All rights reserved.","brandColors":["#7434FB","#D6CAFD","#B9ABF4","#CCB8FB"],"ogImage":null,"hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":0,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":"standard","brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 15-second horizontal explainer for HelpDesk AI, a SaaS that drops a knowledge-trained AI chatbot onto any website. Open on a visitor asking a support question and getting an instant, accurate reply. Then show the three-step setup — create an account, add FAQs and policies, paste one script tag — so any business owner sees how fast it is. Close on Plug & Play, admin-controlled knowledge, and 24/7 AI support with a free start CTA. Friendly, clear, hand-made sketchnote energy that makes embedding AI support feel simple.","subject":"website AI chatbot widget UI","audience":"Small business owners and website operators who want instant customer support without hiring agents","tone":"friendly, clear, brisk, approachable","goal":"Make the viewer feel they can add AI support in minutes — and start free","keyMessages":["Add a powerful AI chatbot to your website in minutes","Instant, accurate answers from your business knowledge","Embed with one script tag — no coding","Three steps: Create Account, Add Knowledge, Embed & Go","Admin-controlled, AI-powered support 24/7"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Add a powerful AI chatbot to your website in minutes","Instant, accurate answers using your own business knowledge","Copy one script tag and paste it into your site","Three steps: Create Account, Add Knowledge, Embed & Go","No complex setup or coding required","Customers get instant, accurate support 24/7","Get Started Free"],"brandColors":["#7434FB","#D6CAFD","#B9ABF4","#CCB8FB"],"suggestedFramePack":"sketchnote","suggestedDuration":15,"musicMood":"light upbeat acoustic indie","voProfile":"female, late-20s, warm, clear, lightly enthusiastic"},"script":{"title":"HelpDesk AI in Three Steps","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Support question? Instant answer.","onScreenText":["Instant answers"],"visualDirection":"A website visitor types a question; the HelpDesk chat widget slides in and fires back an accurate reply with a soft pop.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"chat bubble","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"Three steps. Live in minutes.","onScreenText":["Create Account","Add Knowledge","Embed & Go"],"visualDirection":"Three sketchnote step cards cascade in sequence with hand-drawn bounce, each revealing a simple icon.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"checklist","role":"inset"},{"type":"icon","query":"notebook","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Paste one script tag. No coding.","onScreenText":["One script tag","No coding"],"visualDirection":"A single script tag pastes into a site header; the real product chat UI appears live inside a browser frame.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["click","sparkle"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":10,"duration":2.5,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Your knowledge. Support twenty-four seven.","onScreenText":["24/7 AI support"],"visualDirection":"Admin knowledge tiles g