uce complete videos with narration, captions, visuals, and animations.","headings":["Turn your ideas into videos within minutes","Video Agent","Hyper-realistic Avatars","Video and Audio Dubbing","AI Studio","AI video creation has just become your superpower","Turn text into video using AI","Turn Photos into Videos","Product Placement","Create Viral Reaction Videos & Authentic UGC Instantly","Create with the World’s Most Powerful AI Models","Create AI video with lifelike avatars","Photo Avatar","Public Avatar","Digital Twin","AI video translator for any language","175+ languages and dialects","Auto-translate videos","Voice cloning and lip-sync","Create and edit AI videos with ease using AI Studio","Our company vision","Trusted by 1,00,000+ teams who value quality, simplicity, and speed","Learning & development","Marketing","Sales"],"bodyText":"|\nPlatform\nUse cases\nDevelopers\nResources\nEnterprise\nResearch\nPricing\nSign in\nSay hello to Avatar V, the most life-like avatar ever created. Make your own for free\n\nTurn your ideas into videos within minutes\n\nGo from script, image, presentation, or PDF to a finished video. No cameras, no crew, no editing skills required. Create full-length videos and hours of content, not just short clips.\n\nGet Started for Free\n14,82,51,577\nVideos generated\n12,33,97,955\nAvatars generated\n2,05,29,636\nVideos translated\nTrusted by millions worldwide to bring their stories to life.\nOne-Shot Text-to-Video\nVideo Agent\n\nType your idea, click generate, and get a share-ready video faster than you expect. No camera, editing software, or production skills required. Download it, edit it, or share it immediately.\n\nAvatar\nHyper-realistic Avatars\n\nInstantly bring portraits to life with realistic lip-syncing and natural facial expressions. Transform any character, historical figure, or your own headshot into an engaging spokesperson—ideal for social media, courses, and storytelling.\n\nTranslate\nVideo and Audio Dubbing\n\nTranslate your videos with precision. Upload any video and automatically dub it into 175+ languages and dialects using best-in-class voice cloning, accurate lip-sync, and auto-generated subtitles.\n\nText-Based Video Editor\nAI Studio\n\nThe text-based editor makes using the AI video generator as simple as writing a document. You can control tone, delivery, gestures, and emotion on a single seamless platform. It is all about AI-generated video solutions designed for a human-first storytelling experience. You no longer need to choose between speed and quality.\n\nWorkday\n\n10x faster video production speed\n\nGet Started for Free\n\nAI video creation has just become your superpower\n\nCreate training, marketing, sales, and internal content from a single workspace, with enterprise-grade security and administrative controls.\n\nText to Video\nPhoto to Video\nProduct Ads\nUGC adverts\nAI Models\nText to Video\nTurn text into video using AI\n\nCreate complete AI videos from a script using text-to-video AI. Our AI video generator manages the entire video creation process end to end and produces high-quality 1080p or 4K cinematic videos with voiceovers, visuals, and AI avatars, so you can create explainer, sales, onboarding, or YouTube content faster in multiple voices, languages, and styles. Simply describe the video you want, and generate high-quality videos with minimal effort.\n\nStart for free\nPhoto to Video\nTurn Photos into Videos\n\nTurn any image into a video in seconds. Upload an image and add a script to transform it into a dynamic AI-generated video with realistic AI lip-sync, natural speech timing, and expressive voices. Enhance your video with text overlays, background music, and smooth transitions, with no manual editing required. Create AI videos in 175+ languages and dialects with multiple AI voices and accents.\n\nStart for free\nProduct Ads\nProduct Placement\n\nSimply upload your product image and script, and our Ad Generator takes care of the rest, placing your product in your avatar’s hand. You can then edit it by adding music, captions, and voiceovers. Ideal for scaling TikTok, Instagram, and Amazon content without shipping samples or hiring a production crew.\n\nGet Started for Free\nUGC adverts\nCreate Viral Reaction Videos & Authentic UGC Instantly\n\nCreate scroll-stopping social content without needing a camera or studio. From product reviews and news updates to story-style videos where your avatar responds to trending clips, HeyGen helps you build and scale “faceless” channels and personal brands on TikTok, Instagram, and YouTube Shorts.\n\nStart for free\nAI Models\nCreate with the World’s Most Powerful AI Models\n\nAccess the latest generative technology directly inside HeyGen. Use AI video generation models like Sora, Veo, and Kling to create cinematic video B-roll, Flux for high-fidelity images, and ElevenLabs for ultra-realistic speech. Produce professional video a","brandColors":["#01C3FF","#01B3EB","#C5F1FE","#50D5FE"],"ogImage":"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/pdhqcmb1/production/579e83ff34c4c832744efaedb9681d255e58dc13-1200x630.png?fit=max&fm=png","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":0,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":"standard","brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A high-energy, 30-second horizontal promo showcasing HeyGen, the AI video platform that turns simple text and photos into production-ready videos. The video targets creators, marketers, and modern teams who need to scale their video output without cameras, crews, or editing skills. We open on a blocky, animated concept of a simple idea transforming instantly into a finished video, highlighting hyper-realistic avatars, 175+ language dubbing, and text-to-video capabilities. The video moves at a rapid, playful pace, closing with a strong call to action.","subject":"AI video generator interface and lifelike digital avatars","audience":"Marketers, creators, sales teams, and educators looking to scale video production","tone":"playful, bold, high-energy, confident","goal":"Get viewers to sign up for free and start generating AI videos instantly","keyMessages":["Turn your ideas into videos within minutes","No cameras, crews, or editing skills required","Translate and dub videos into 175+ languages","Generate realistic AI avatars and digital twins"],"mustIncludeFacts":["175+ languages and dialects supported","Trusted by 1,00,000+ teams"],"brandColors":["#01C3FF","#01B3EB","#C5F1FE","#50D5FE"],"suggestedFramePack":"brut-pop","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"fast-paced synth pop","voProfile":"male, mid-20s, energetic, enthusiastic, and punchy"},"script":{"title":"HeyGen: Ideas to Video Instantly","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Have an idea? Turn it into a video in minutes.","onScreenText":["Idea to Video","In Minutes"],"visualDirection":"A colorful, blocky text box reading 'My Idea' pops into frame, then morphs dynamically into a sleek video player interface.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["pop","transition"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":4.5,"duration":5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"No cameras, no expensive crews, and zero editing skills required.","onScreenText":["No Cameras","No Crews"],"visualDirection":"A giant clean camera icon with a bold, playful strike-through line drops center-screen as the background shifts dynamically.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"video camera","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":9.5,"duration":5.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Generate hyper-realistic AI avatars and digital twins with a single click.","onScreenText":["Realistic","AI Avatars"],"visualDirection":"The real HeyGen product UI sweeps on screen, zooming into a gallery of diverse, realistic digital avatars that blink and smile.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"smiling professional woman headshot","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["click","whoosh"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":15,"duration":5,"purpose":"feat