de Science\nAccess to unlimited projects to organize chats and documents\nAccess to Research\nAbility to use more Claude models\nClaude for Microsoft 365\nMax\n\n5–20x more usage than Pro\n\nFrom $100\nPer month billed monthly\n\nTry Claude\n\nNo commitment · Cancel anytime\n\nEverything in Pro, plus:\nChoose 5x or 20x more usage than Pro*\nHigher output limits for all tasks\nEarly access to advanced Claude features\nPriority access at high traffic times\n*Usage limits apply. Prices shown don’t include applicable tax. Prices and plans are subject to change at Anthropic’s discretion.\nFrequently asked questions\nWhat is Claude and how does it work?\nWhat should I use Claude for?\nHow much does it cost to use?\n© 2026 ANTHROPIC PBC\nProducts\nClaude\nClaude Code\nClaude Code for Enterprise\nClaude Cowork\nClaude Security\nDownload app\nPricing\nLog in\nFeatures\nClaude for Chrome\nClaude for Slack\nClaude for Microsoft 365\nSkills\nModels\nMythos\nFable\nOpus\nSonnet\nHaiku\nSolutions\nAI agents\nCode modernization\nCoding\nCustomer support\nEducation\nEnterprise\nFinancial services\nGovernment\nHealthcare\nLegal\nLife sciences\nNonprofits\nSecurity\nSmall business\nStartups\nClaude Platform\nOverview\nDeveloper docs\nPricing\nMarketplace\nClaude on AWS\nGoogle Cloud’s Vertex AI\nMicrosoft Foundry\nRegional compliance\nConsole login\nResources\nBlog\nClaude partner network\nCommunity\nConnectors\nCourses\nCustomer stories\nEngineering at Anthropic\nEvents\nPlugins\nPowered by Claude\nService partners\nTutorials\nUse cases\nCompany\nAnthropic\nCareers\nEconomic Futures\nResearch\nAnthropic news\nResponsible Scaling Policy\nSecurity and compliance\nTransparency\nHelp and security\nAvailability\nStatus\nSupport center\nTerms and policies\nPrivacy choices\nPrivacy policy\nResponsible disclosure policy\nTerms of service: Commercial\nTerms of service: Consumer\nUsage policy\nCookie settings\n\nWe use cookies to deliver and improve our services, analyze site usage, and if you agree, to customize or personalize your experience and market our services to you. You can read our Cookie Policy here.\n\nCustomize Cookie Settings\nReject All Cookies\nAccept All Cookies","brandColors":["#91AFAD","#8BA59A","#759190","#566D6B"],"ogImage":"https://claude.ai/images/claude_ogimage.png","hasRealScreenshots":0},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":0,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":"standard","brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 20-second horizontal launch for Claude, Anthropic’s AI assistant framed as a productivity thinking partner for ambitious problem solvers. It opens on the quiet friction of hard work — blank docs, half-finished ideas — then reveals Claude as the partner that writes, codes, researches, and remembers across conversations. Built for people with big ambitions who need more than a chatbot. It closes on the invitation to question what’s next and try Claude free on web, desktop, and mobile. Warm, thoughtful energy with storybook sincerity, not hard-sell hype.","subject":"AI chat interface on laptop","audience":"Ambitious professionals, creators, and problem solvers who want a smarter thinking partner","tone":"warm, thoughtful, aspirational, clear","goal":"Make the viewer feel Claude is the thinking partner that unlocks bigger work — and try it free","keyMessages":["Your thinking partner for big ambitions","Question what’s next","Write, code, research, and create","Memory across conversations","Free to start on web, desktop, and mobile"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Anthropic's AI assistant for problem solvers","Your thinking partner for big ambitions","Generate code and visualize data","Write, edit, and create content","Memory across conversations","Chat on web, iOS, Android, and on your desktop","Free for everyone","Extended thinking for complex work"],"brandColors":["#91AFAD","#8BA59A","#759190","#566D6B"],"suggestedFramePack":"paper-tales","suggestedDuration":20,"musicMood":"warm gentle piano ambient","voProfile":"female, mid-30s, warm, thoughtful, unhurried