photo of a physical desk with a phone and laptop is rendered in raw, desaturated daylight tones that clash with the warm, stylized 'paper-tales' design system.","fix":"Apply a warm color tint filter or a gradient scrim using the ground token (#FBF1E1) and accent tokens (#F7C873 / #E8938C) over the background photo to harmonize it with the rest of the video's aesthetic."},{"atSec":19.8,"severity":"minor","issue":"Groundhog set / layout repetition. The frames at 19.6s and 19.8s are identical, but since they fall within the same scene duration (s5 proof scene), this is acceptable. However, the overall layout structure of scenes s3 (11s), s4 (15.5s), and s5 (19.6s) relies on a very repetitive left-aligned text and right-aligned single icon composition.","fix":"Vary the composition archetype in scene s4 (15.5s) by centering the layout or using a vertical stack to break the repetitive visual rhythm of the scenes."}]}},{"id":"qirqinu96o","kind":"project","prompt":"Launch a productivity app","duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"1080p","width":1920,"height":1080,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"paper-tales","status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":"/videos/qirqinu96o.mp4","error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":149400,"llm_tokens_out":58798,"created_at":1784110138148,"started_at":1784110301537,"finished_at":1784111414069,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"task":null,"requeue_count":0,"intent":{"prompt":"Launch a productivity app","websiteUrl":"https://claude.ai/","hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"paper-tales"},"website":{"url":"https://claude.ai/","title":"Sign in - Claude","description":"Sign in to Claude, Anthropic's AI assistant for problem solvers.","headings":["Meet Claude","Platform","Solutions","Pricing","Resources","Question what’snext","Your thinking partner for big ambitions","Explore plans","Free","Pro","Max","Frequently asked questions","What is Claude and how does it work?","What is Claude and how does it work?","What should I use Claude for?","What should I use Claude for?","How much does it cost to use?","How much does it cost to use?","Products","Features","Models","Solutions","Claude Platform","Resources","Company"],"bodyText":"Question what’s\nnext\nYour thinking partner for big ambitions\nContinue with Google\n\nOR\n\nContinue with email\nContinue with SSO\nDownload desktop app\nExplore plans\nIndividual\nTeam and Enterprise\nIndividual\nTeam and Enterprise\nFree\n\nTry Claude\n\n$0\nFree for everyone\n\nTry Claude\nChat on web, iOS, Android, and on your desktop\nGenerate code and visualize data\nWrite, edit, and create content\nAbility to search the web\nMemory across conversations\nCreate files and execute code\nUnlock more from Claude with desktop extensions\nConnect Slack and Google Workspace services\nIntegrate any context or tool through connectors with remote MCP\nExtended thinking for complex work\nPro\n\nFor everyday productivity\n\n$17\nPer month with annual subscription discount ($200 billed up front). $20 if billed monthly.\nTry Claude\n\nNo commitment · Cancel anytime\n\nEverything in Free, plus:\nMore usage*\nIncludes Claude Code\nIncludes Claude Cowork\nIncludes Claude Design\nIncludes Claude Science\nAccess to unlimited projects to organize chats and documents\nAccess to Research\nAbility to use more Claude models\nClaude for Microsoft 365\nMax\n\n5–20x more usage than Pro\n\nFrom $100\nPer month billed monthly\n\nTry Claude\n\nNo commitment · Cancel anytime\n\nEverything in Pro, plus:\nChoose 5x or 20x more usage than Pro*\nHigher output limits for all tasks\nEarly access to advanced Claude features\nPriority access at high traffic times\n*Usage limits apply. Prices shown don’t include applicable tax. Prices and plans are subject to change at Anthropic’s discretion.\nFrequently asked questions\nWhat is Claude and how does it work?\nWhat should I use Claude for?\nHow much does it cost to use?\n© 2026 ANTHROPIC PBC\nProducts\nClaude\nClaude Code\nClaude Code for Enterprise\nClaude Cowork\nClaude Security\nDownload app\nPricing\nLog in\nFeatures\nClaude for Chrome\nClaude for Slack\nClaude for Microsoft 365\nSkills\nModels\nMythos\nFable\nOpus\nSonnet\nHaiku\nSolutions\nAI agents\nCode modernization\nCoding\nCustomer support\nEducation\nEnterprise\nFinancial services\nGovernment\nHealthcare\nLegal\nLife sciences\nNonprofits\nSecurity\nSmall business\nStartups\nClaude Platform\nOverview\nDeveloper docs\nPricing\nMarketplace\nClaude on AWS\nGoogle Cloud’s Vertex AI\nMicrosoft Foundry\nRegional compliance\nConsole login\nResources\nBlog\nClaude partner network\nCommunity\nConnectors\nCourses\nCustomer stories\nEngineering at Anthropic\nEvents\nPlugins\nPowered by Claude\nService partners\nTutorials\nUse cases\nCompany\nAnthropic\nCareers\nEconomic Futures\nResearch\nAnthropic news\nResponsible Scaling Policy\nSecurity and compliance\nTransparency\nHelp and security\nAvailability\nStatus\nSupport center\nTerms and policies\nPrivacy choices\nPrivacy policy\nResponsible disclosure policy\nTerms of service: Commercial\nTerms of service: Consumer\nUsage policy\nCookie settings\n\nWe use cookies to deliver and improve our services, analyze site usage, and if you agree, to customize or personalize your experience and market our services to you. You can read our Cookie Policy here.\n\nCustomize Cookie Settings\nReject All Cookies\nAccept All Cookies","brandColors":["#91AFAC","#8BA599","#769391","#889D93"],"ogImage":"https://claude.ai/images/claude_ogimage.png","hasRealScreenshots":0},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":0,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":"premium","brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second horizontal launch film for Claude, Anthropic’s AI assistant positioned as a productivity partner for ambitious professionals. It opens on the overwhelm of blank pages and scattered tasks, then reveals Claude as a calm thinking partner that writes, codes, researches the web, and remembers context across conversations. The arc lands on everyday wins—generate code, draft content, explore complex ideas with extended thinking—and closes with an open invitation to try free on web, iOS, Android, or desktop. Warm, sincere, and quietly confident, like a storybook for modern work.","subject":"AI chat interface on laptop screen","audience":"Ambitious professionals, builders, and knowledge workers who want an AI thinking partner for real work","tone":"warm, sincere, optimistic, thoughtful","goal":"Make viewers feel Claude is the thinking partner they need—and try it free","keyMessages":["Your thinking partner for big ambitions","Write, code, research, and create with one AI partner","Memory across conversations and extended thinking for complex work","Chat free on web, iOS, Android, and desktop","Pro unlocks more usage, Claude Code, and projects"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Anthropic's AI assistant for problem solvers","Your thinking partner for big ambitions","Free for everyone at $0","Chat on web, iOS, Android, and desktop","Generate code and visualize data","Write, edit, and create content","Ability to search the web","Memory across conversations","Extended thinking for complex work","Pro $17 per month with annual subscription discount ($20 monthly)"],"brandColors":["#91AFAC","#8BA599","#769391","#889D93"],"suggestedFramePack":"paper-tales","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"warm gentle acoustic optimism","voProfile":"female, early-30s, warm and clear, unhurried sincerity"},"script":{"title":"Claude Your Thinking Partner","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Blank pages. Scattered tasks.","onScreenText":["Blank pages","Scattered tasks"],"visualDirection":"Camera slowly pushes in on a blinking empty document as sticky notes and open tabs blur at the edges in soft chaos.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"blank laptop screen desk clutter","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact"],"