ies have used Stripe to grow their businesses – from expanding internationally to reimagining the customer experience.\n\nHertz unifies commerce with Stripe.\nRead the story\n\n160\n\n countries\n\n11K+\n\n locations globally\n\nProducts used\n\n Payments, Terminal, Connect, Radar and Stripe Sigma\nURBN consolidates $5 billion in online and in-store revenue onto Stripe.\nRead the story\nInstacart powers online grocery delivery with Stripe.\nRead the story\nLe Monde improves local and international payments with Stripe.\nRead the story\nRealise value faster with dedicated experts\nProfessional services.\n\nGet tailored guidance from Stripe on implementation, complex integrations, or major migrations.\n\nView services \nStripe-certified experts.\n\nWork with a Stripe consulting partner that can integrate and deploy Stripe solutions on your behalf.\n\nView partners \nSupport plans.\n\nReceive ongoing assistance and day-to-day support for technical questions with tiered plans based on your needs.\n\nView plans \nBuild a foundation for your ","brandColors":["#FE9316","#FA86E6","#FE8F29","#FEB06F"],"ogImage":"https://images.stripeassets.com/fzn2n1nzq965/XtX984S1GJVsVOXFC7kMu/01988281e867728dfb09aa7793a6e3b9/Stripe.jpg?q=80","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":"standard","brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 22-second vertical premium promo for Stripe, the payments infrastructure for the internet. It opens on the scale of global commerce, then lands on the real product—dashboard analytics, clean pricing, and developer docs—shown as living UI. Built for founders, product teams, and enterprises who need reliable money movement. It closes on the proof: $1.9 trillion processed and infrastructure that runs from first transaction to billionth. Confident, polished, and quietly powerful.","subject":"Stripe dashboard and payment checkout UI","audience":"Founders, product teams, and enterprise builders choosing payments infrastructure","tone":