nd developer docs that make integration feel inevitable. Built for founders, CTOs, and product teams who need infrastructure that works from the first charge to the billionth. The arc is hook on unmatched scale, substance through product UI and hard proof points, then a confident close on growing revenue with one platform. Bright, cinematic, optimistic energy — white canvas, glass product cards, and unhurried authority.","subject":"Stripe payments dashboard and checkout UI","audience":"Founders, CTOs, and product leaders building online businesses and platforms","tone":"premium, confident, luminous, precise","goal":"Make the viewer trust Stripe as the definitive payments backbone — and want to start building","keyMessages":["Financial infrastructure to grow your revenue","US$1.9tn in payments volume processed in 2025","135+ currencies and payment methods","Real product: dashboard, pricing, docs","From your first transaction to your billionth","99.999% historical uptime"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Financial infrastructure to grow your revenue","US$1.9tn in payments volume processed in 2025","135+ currencies and payment methods supported","99.999% historical uptime for Stripe services","200M+ active subscriptions managed on Stripe Billing","50% of Fortune 100 companies have used Stripe"],"brandColors":["#FE9316","#FA86E6","#FE8F29"],"suggestedFramePack":"brightlife","suggestedDuration":22,"musicMood":"bright cinematic electronica","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, calm, assured, lightly warm"},"script":{"title":"Stripe: The Internet's Financial Infrastructure","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":4,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"This is the backbone of global commerce.","onScreenText":["Financial","Infrastructure"],"visualDirection":"A luminous white canvas opens as a bright, glowing globe of light pulses gently in the center, radiating outward.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":4,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Processing