0,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":"premium","brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 25-second horizontal launch film for ChatGPT, OpenAI’s AI productivity app that turns everyday work into a conversation. It opens on the friction of modern knowledge work—blank docs, half-written emails, tangled code—then flips to ChatGPT answering in plain language: debug this, plan that, summarize the meeting, write the note. Built for ambitious professionals who want frontier intelligence without friction. The arc lands on one clear invitation: take on your most ambitious work, and get started with ChatGPT. Confident, punctual, modern—like a board that just flipped to ON TIME.","subject":"ChatGPT chat interface on laptop screen","audience":"Ambitious professionals and knowledge workers who want AI to accelerate daily work","tone":"confident, precise, modern, brisk","goal":"Make the viewer feel work just got easier—and open ChatGPT to try it","keyMessages":["Take on your most ambitious work with ChatGPT","GPT-5.6: frontier intelligence that scales with your ambition","Write, code, plan, and debug in one conversation","Get started with ChatGPT","Built by OpenAI to benefit everyone"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Take on your most ambitious work with ChatGPT","GPT-5.6: Frontier intelligence that scales with your ambition","Building safe and beneficial AGI is our mission","Get started with ChatGPT","ChatGPT helps with coding, writing, planning, summarizing meeting notes, and debugging"],"brandColors":["#0D0D0D","#F5F5F0","#10A37F"],"suggestedFramePack":"terminal-departures","suggestedDuration":25,"musicMood":"crisp mechanical electronica","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, clear, measured, quietly confident"},"script":{"title":"ChatGPT Turns Work Into Conversation","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Blank page. Half-written email.","onScreenText":["Still stuck?"],"visualDirection":"Cursor blinks on an empty white page, then a half-finished email draft snaps into view with a ha