 deep mountain rain to soft cosmic hums."},{"start":56.55,"end":60.449999999999996,"text":"Calm your nervous system with guided breathing."},{"start":61.55,"end":65.7,"text":"Synchronizing your breath to ease daily tension."},{"start":66.55,"end":71.39999999999999,"text":"Create personalized wind-down routines that work for you."},{"start":71.95,"end":76.65,"text":"Seamlessly transition from a busy day to deep rest."},{"start":77.2,"end":81.850862,"text":"Understand your night with deep sleep analytics."},{"start":82.4,"end":86.7,"text":"Track your phases to continuously improve your recovery."},{"start":87.4,"end":91.7,"text":"Completely disconnect using our full offline mode."},{"start":92.4,"end":97.95,"text":"No notifications, no distractions—just pure tranquility."},{"start":98.5,"end":102.75,"text":"Wake up naturally with the smart alarm."},{"start":103.5,"end":107.3,"text":"It gently wakes you during your lightest sleep phase."},{"start":108.5,"end":113.05,"text":"Say goodbye to groggy mornings and heavy eyes."},{"start":113.6,"end":118.44999999999999,"text":"Wake up feeling thirty percent sharper every single day."},{"start":119,"end":123.6,"text":"Ready to take on your day with effortless clarity."},{"start":124.15,"end":127.75,"text":"Over two million downloads worldwide."},{"start":129.15,"end":133.85,"text":"Trusted by ambitious people to master their rest."},{"start":134.4,"end":138.05,"text":"With an outstanding four point eight-star rating."},{"start":139.4,"end":144.1,"text":"Users report falling asleep forty-three percent faster."},{"start":154.4,"end":159.4,"text":"Reclaiming hours of lost sleep every single week."},{"start":169.4,"end":174.20000000000002,"text":"A simple, science-backed habit with life-changing results."}],"srt_url":"/videos/3yuhj9y8px.srt","final_attempt":"scene-kit","qa":{"pass":true,"issues":[],"error":"403 Key limit exceeded (daily limit). Manage it using https://openrouter.ai/workspaces/default/keys/bc6c462a6ad8c5c19bcb3a91ae