and timelines.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s13","start":47.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Initiatives that align every team.","onScreenText":["Initiatives"],"visualDirection":"Initiative cards rise into layered parallax planes as team avatars lock onto each one.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"diverse team meeting laptops office","role":"background"}],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s14","start":51.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Roadmaps that stay honest as reality shifts.","onScreenText":["Living roadmaps"],"visualDirection":"Timeline bars reflow and recolor under a gentle push-in across the real product roadmap UI.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":[],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s15","start":55.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"PRDs linked straight to the work that ships.","onScreenText":["PRDs that drive work"],"visualDirection":"A PRD document view links outward into issue threads as the camera dollies deeper into the connection.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"notebook","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["click"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s16","start":59.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"From idea to launch, one continuous path.","onScreenText":["Idea to launch"],"visualDirection":"A continuous horizontal journey from spark icon through roadmap to shipped badge, camera tracking left to right.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"rocket","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["transition"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s17","start":63.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Then agents join the work.","onScreenText":["Agents at the table"],"visualDirection":"Subtle agent markers appear beside human avatars on a project board with a soft sparkle bloom.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"sparkle","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["sparkle"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s18","start":67,"duration":5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Workflows shared by humans and agents, from PRD to PR.","onScreenText":["From PRD to PR"],"visualDirection":"Split lanes show a human drafting a PRD and an agent opening a pull request, converging into one stream.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"developer dual monitors morning light","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s19","start":72,"duration":4,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"Side by side, they move work forward.","onScreenText":["Humans + agents"],"visualDirection":"Parallel activity streams animate across the real product UI as the camera tracks horizontally.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s20","start":76,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Review pull requests and agent output in one place.","onScreenText":["Review with context"],"visualDirection":"PR review panel expands with diffs and comments layering in depth, slow push-in on the real UI.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["click"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s21","start":80.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Understand progress clearly at any scale.","onScreenText":["Progress at scale"],"visualDirection":"Dashboard metrics rise cleanly as the camera pulls back to reveal the full board at scale.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"chart","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["ding"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s22","start":84.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Linear reduces noise and restores momentum.","onScreenText":["Less noise. More momentum."],"visualDirection":"Clutter dissolves off the board leaving focused work cards glowing in quiet ambient light.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"focused woman laptop notes desk","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s23","start":88.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Ship with high velocity and focus.","onScreenText":["Velocity with focus"],"visualDirection":"Issue cards complete and archive in a crisp rhythmic sequence as the camera glides forward.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["pop","sparkle"],"musicCu