-ice-cubes-drink-cold-1206584/","source":"cache:pixabay","cdScore":61,"sees":"Clear liquid pouring into a glass with ice cubes","cdProminence":"background","visionOk":false,"kind":"photo","fit":"cover","focus":"center","effect":"zoom","quality":"high","cropFocus":"center center"}],"text_review":{"source":"llm","added":7,"llmAdded":4,"minedAdded":3,"scenesWithSubtext":5,"scenesWithBullets":3,"sceneCount":6},"layout_review":{"keptScreenshots":0,"keptPhotos":1,"demoted":0,"heroScale":0.6,"montageMax":6,"prominentTotal":1,"scenes":[{"sceneId":"s1","archetype":"hook","heroScale":0.6},{"sceneId":"s2","archetype":"text","heroScale":0.6},{"sceneId":"s3","archetype":"text","heroScale":0.6},{"sceneId":"s4","archetype":"text","heroScale":0.6},{"sceneId":"s5","archetype":"text","heroScale":0.6},{"sceneId":"s6","archetype":"cta","heroScale":0.6}],"score":{"compositionQuality":100,"source":"deterministic"}},"captions":[{"start":0,"end":1.9,"text":"Cold brew that hits hard."},{"start":3,"end":4.65,"text":"Over ice."},{"start":6.5,"end":10.05,"text":"Bold, smooth, ice-cold."},{"start":10.6,"end":12.8,"text":"Pour. Sip. Go."},{"start":17.1,"end":18.950000000000003,"text":"Grab yours now."}],"srt_url":"/videos/6kkw9io1y4.srt","last_requeue_at":1784718463559,"final_attempt":"main","qa":{"pass":false,"score":4,"issues":[{"atSec":19.2,"severity":"blocker","issue":"The decorative blue asterisk overlaps and obstructs the start of the headline 'GRAB YOURS NOW'. Additionally, the dashed oval path passes directly through the middle of the 'GRAB YOURS NOW' headline and strikes through the 'GRAB ONE NOW' label, causing a severe legibility and collision failure.","fix":"Move the blue asterisk decoration further to the left so it does not collide with the letter 'G'. Adjust the vertical scale or position of the dashed oval container so that its stroke lies completely outside the boundaries of both text elements."}]},"quality_report":{"verdict":"flagged","flags":["5 text element(s) still below WCAG AA","QA: 1 blocker(s)"],"contrast":{"checked":true,"fixed":12,"remaining":5,"passes":0},"identity":{"remapped":0},"layout":{"duplicatesRemoved":33,"collisionsScrimmed":0},"assetFloor":null,"audio":{"lufs":-14,"peak":-0.13,"lra":8,"target":-14,"layers":{"voice":5,"sfx":5,"music":true,"ambient":false,"musicEnvelope":false}},"screenshots":null,"assetQuality":72,"templateFit":68,"qa":{"pass":false,"score":4,"skipped":false,"blockers":1}}},{"id":"p1awdazo22","kind":"project","prompt":"","duration":150,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"1080p","width":1920,"height":1080,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"blueprint-atelier","frame_pack_user":0,"status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":"/videos/p1awdazo22.mp4","error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":81931,"llm_tokens_out":36700,"created_at":1784719240602,"started_at":1784719626515,"finished_at":1784721359153,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"task":null,"requeue_count":0,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","blogUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":150,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"auto"},"website":{"url":"https://linear.app","title":"Linear – The system for product development","description":"Purpose-built for planning and building products with AI agents.","headings":["The product development system for teams and agentsThe product developmentsystem for teams and agentsThe product development system for teams and agents","Faster app launch","A new species of product tool. Purpose-built for modern teams with AI workflows at its core, Linear sets a new standard for planning and building products.","Make product operations self-driving","Define the product direction","Move work forward across teams and agents","Review PRs and agent output","Understand progress at scale","Changelog","Built for the future. Available today.","Product","Features","Company","Resources","Connect","Legal"],"bodyText":"Skip to content →\nProduct\nResources\nCustomers\nPricing\nNow\nContact\nLog in\nSign up\nThe product development\nsystem for teams and agents\nThe product development system for teams and agents\n\nPurpose-built for planning and building products. Designed for the AI era.\n\nNew\nCoding Sessions →\nLinear\nInbox\nMy issues\nReviews\nPulse\nWorkspace\nInitiatives\nProjects\nMore\nFavorites\nFaster app launch\nAgent tasks\nUI Refresh\nAgents Insights\nFaster app launch\n02\n/\n145\nFaster app launch\n\nRender UI before vehicle_state sync when minimum required state is present, instead of blocking on full refresh during iOS startup.\n\nActivity\nLinear created the issue via Slack on behalf of karri · 2min ago\nTriage Intelligence added the label Performance and iOS · 2min ago\nkarri\n· 4 min ago\nRight now we show a spinner forever, which makes it look like the car disappeared...\njori\n· just now\n@Linear can you take a stab at this?\nLinear\nconnected by\njori\n·\n2 min ago\nChanged 2 files\nDraft PR awaiting your review\n·\n2 min ago\nLinear moved from Todo to In Progress · just now\nLinearOpus 4.8\njori\nconnected Linear to ENG-2703\nExamining the startup path...\nThinking...\nENG-2703\nIn Progress\nHigh\njori\nLinear\nLabels\nPerformance\niOS\nCycle\nCycle 144\nProject\nCore Performance\nA new species of product tool. Purpose-built for modern teams with AI workflows at its core, Linear sets a new standard for planning and building products.\nFIG 0.2\nPurpose-built\n\nLinear is shaped by the practices and principles of world-class product teams.\n\nFIG 0.3\nPowered by agents\n\nDesigned for workflows shared by humans and agents, from PRD to PR.\n\nFIG 0.4\nDesigned for speed\n\nReduces noise and restores momentum to help teams ship with high velocity and focus.\n\nMake product operations self-driving\n\nTurn conversations and customer feedback into actionable issues that are routed, labeled, and prioritized for the right team.\n\n1.0Intake→\nBacklog\n8\nENG-2085\nReduce UI flicker during autonomy...\nENG-2094\nAdd buffering for autonomy event streams\nENG-2092\nReduce startup delay caused by vehicle sync\nENG-2200\nFix delayed route updates during rerouting\nTodo\n71\nENG-926\nRemove UI inconsistencies\nBug\nDesign\nENG-2088\nTypeError: Cannot read properties\nBug\nENG-924\nUpgrade to Claude Opus 4.8\nAI\nENG-1882\nOptimize load times\nPerformance\nIn Progress\n3\nENG-1487\nRemove contentData from GraphQL API\n61039\nMKT-1028\nLaunch page assets\nDesign\nENG-2187\nPrevent duplicate ride requests on poor...\nBug\n62048\nDone\n53\nENG-2074\nClean up deprecated APIs...\nAPI\n61002\nENG-1912\nReduce latency in autonomy st...\n61005\nENG-1951\nReduce ETA fluctuations durin...\n61202\nENG-1960\nImprove fallback messaging\nUI\n61149\nENG-1991\nImprove rider visibility into veh...\nThread in #feedback\ndidier\n4:50 PM\nHas anyone been looking into the iOS startup performance issues?\nlena\n4:50 PM\nAnyone else noticing the iOS app feels slow to open if you haven't used it in a bit?\ndidier\n4:50 PM\nYea, we're still blocking initial render on a full vehicle_state sync every time...\nandreas\n4:50 PM\nFeels like we could render sooner and load the rest in the background. Probably also worth tracking startup timing so we know how often this happens!\n@Linear\ncreate urgent issues and assign to me\n1.1\nLinear Agent +\n1.2\nTriage +\n1.3\nCustomer Requests +\n1.4\nLinear Asks +\nDefine the product direction\n\nPlan and navigate from idea to launch. Align your team with product initiatives, strategic roadmaps, and clear, up-to-date PRDs.\n\n2.0Plan→\nFEB\nMAR\nAPR\nMAY\nJUN\nJUL\nAUG\nSEP\n2\n9\n16\n23\n2\n9\n16\n23\n30\n6\n13\n20\n27\n4\n11\n18\n25\n1\n8\n15\n22\n29\n6\n13\n20\n27\n3\n10\n17\n24\n31\n7\n14\n21\n28\nUI Refresh\nCore screens\nPolish\nSplit fares\nInternal\nPublic Beta\nAutonomy status clarity\nAlpha\nGA\nInitiatives\nCore Product\n99\nInfra stability\n28\nAutonomous systems\n16\nMobile apps\n8\nAPAC Expansion\n21\nJapan Launch\n12\nCustomer-driven priorities\n9\n2.1\nProjects +\n2.2\nDocuments +\n2.3\nInitiatives +\n2.4\nVisual planning +\nMove work forward across teams and agents\n\nBuild and deploy AI agents that work alongside your team. Work on complex tasks together ","brandColors":["#191917","#27261A","#201E12"],"ogImage":"https://linear.app/static/og/homepage.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":"standard","brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 150-second horizontal brand film for Linear, the product development system purpose-built for modern teams and AI agents. It opens on the chaos of shipping software—scattered feedback, stalled issues, endless sync—then reveals Linear as the single system that plans direction, routes work, and moves tasks forward across humans and agents, from PRD to PR. Viewers see intake becoming self-driving, roadmaps and initiatives staying clear, and agents drafting PRs beside the team. Designed for product and engineering leaders who want velocity without noise. Premium, calm-confident energy that closes on Linear as built for the future and available today.","subject":"product issue board and roadmap UI","audience":"Product leaders, eng managers, and modern software teams adopting AI agent workflows","tone":"premium, precise, confident, futuristic","goal":"Convince product teams that Linear is the system for planning and building with humans and AI agents—and sign up","keyMessages":["The product development system for teams and agents","Purpose-built for planning and building products in the AI era","Make product operations self-driving","Define product direction with initiatives, roadmaps, and PRDs","Move work forward across teams and agents—from PRD to PR","Designed for speed: less noise, more shipping momentum","Built for the future. Available today."],"mustIncludeFacts":["Purpose-built for planning and building products with AI agents","Designed for the AI era","Make product operations self-driving","Designed for workflows shared by humans and agents, from PRD to PR","Designed for speed","Built for the future. Available today.","Coding Sessions"],"brandColors":["#191917","#27261A","#201E12"],"suggestedFramePack":"blueprint-atelier","suggestedDuration":150,"musicMood":"cool precise electronica","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, calm, articulate, quietly assured"},"script":{"title":"Linear Built for the Future","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Shipping software shouldn't feel like this.","onScreenText":["Shipping is chaos"],"visualDirection":"Fast-cut montage of sticky notes, chat pings, and overlapping windows collide into frame with restless camera shake.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"messy desk sticky notes laptop","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Scattered feedback. Stalled issues.","onScreenText":["Scattered feedback"],"visualDirection":"Camera drifts across a cluttered desk as unread message bubbles stack and drift out of frame.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"frustrated engineer laptop office","role":"background"}],"sfx":[],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s3","start":7,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Endless syncs that go nowhere.","onScreenText":["Endless syncs"],"visualDirection":"A slow pan across a conference table where calendars and open notebooks pile without resolution.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"team meeting notebooks office table","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s4","start":10.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"The noise drowns out the work.","onScreenText":["Too much noise"],"visualDirection":"Layered notification icons flood the frame then blur as the camera pushes through the clutter.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"bell","role":"inset"}],"sfx":[],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s5","start":14,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Momentum dies before you ship.","onScreenText":["Momentum dies"],"visualDirection":"A progress bar freezes mid-fill while the camera slowly pulls back into empty space.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"hourglass","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s6","start":17.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"What if product ops ran themselves?","onScreenText":["What if?"],"visualDirection":"Dark frame holds a single glowing question, then a soft light bloom expands outward with a slow push-in.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["riser"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s7","start":21.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"This is Linear.","onScreenText":["Linear"],"visualDirection":"Hero reveal of the real product UI in a browser frame, camera slowly pushing into a clean issue board.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["sparkle","impact"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s8","start":26,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"The product development system for teams and agents.","onScreenText":["Teams and agents"],"visualDirection":"UI tiles for humans and agents slide into a shared workspace as the camera pans laterally across the board.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"team","role":"inset"},{"type":"icon","query":"sparkle","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s9","start":30.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Purpose-built for the AI era.","onScreenText":["Built for the AI era"],"visualDirection":"Bold typography locks center while faint grid lines animate into a precise architectural frame.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"compass","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s10","start":34.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Define product direction with clarity.","onScreenText":["Define direction"],"visualDirection":"Camera pushes into a clean planning surface as directional arrows and cards settle into place.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"product manager whiteboard planning","role":"background"}],"sfx":[],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s11","start":38.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Initiatives set the north star.","onScreenText":["Initiatives"],"visualDirection":"Initiative cards stack and rise on layered planes as the camera orbits slightly above them.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"flag","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s12","start":42.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Roadmaps keep every team aligned.","onScreenText":["Roadmaps"],"visualDirection":"A horizontal timeline unfurls left to right while milestone markers snap into place under a slow lateral pan.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"calendar","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["click"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s13","start":46.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"PRDs capture what ships next.","onScreenText":["PRDs"],"visualDirection":"A document panel expands in frame with typed lines appearing as the camera eases in tightly.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"document","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s14","start":50.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Direction stays clear—from vision to backlog.","onScreenText":["Vision to backlog"],"visualDirection":"Linked cards flow from a vision header down into a tidy backlog as the camera tracks downward.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"focused woman laptop notes desk","role":"background"}],"sfx":["transition"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s15","start":55,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Make product operations self-driving.","onScreenText":["Self-driving operations"],"visualDirection":"Workflow nodes connect themselves in sequence as the camera slowly orbits a glowing automation graph.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"checklist","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["sparkle"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s16","start":59.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"Intake becomes intelligent and automatic.","onScreenText":["Intelligent intake"],"visualDirection":"Incoming request cards sort themselves into lanes with a smooth lateral camera glide.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"inbox","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s17","start":63.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"Work routes to the right people.","onScreenText":["Right people"],"visualDirection":"Issue cards animate toward avatars as the camera pans across a collaborative board.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"diverse team laptops open office","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s18","start":67.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"And the right agents.","onScreenText":["Right agents"],"visualDirection":"Agent avatars receive tasks beside human cards while the camera pushes into the assignment row.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"robot","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s19","start":71.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Shared workflows for humans and agents.","onScreenText":["Shared workflows"],"visualDirection":"Two parallel lanes—human and agent—merge into one flowing path as the camera tracks forward.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"developer dual monitors morning light","role":"background"}],"sfx":["transition"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s20","start":76,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"From PRD all the way to PR.","onScreenText":["PRD to PR"],"visualDirection":"A continuous path animates from a PRD card through stages to a pull-request badge under a steady lateral pan.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"branch","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["ding"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s21","start":80.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Coding Sessions keep agents in flow.","onScreenText":["Coding Sessions"],"visualDirection":"A focused coding session panel opens with status chips ticking as the camera eases in on the session header.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"terminal","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["click"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s22","start":84.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Agents draft PRs beside the team.","onScreenText":["Agents draft PRs"],"visualDirection":"A draft pull-request card appears next to a teammate avatar while the camera slowly pushes into the review column.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"hands typing laptop closeup","role":"background"}],"sfx":["sparkle"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s23","start":88.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Work moves forward. Automatically.","onScreenText":["Always moving"],"visualDirection":"Cards advance column to column in a smooth conveyor motion as the camera tracks with them.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"arrow","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s24","start":92.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Designed for speed.","onScreenText":["Designed for speed"],"visualDirection":"Sharp typography hits center with a quick depth-of-field shift and subtle particle trails.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s25","start":96.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Less noise.","onScreenText":["Less noise"],"visualDirection":"Visual clutter peels away leaving a calm empty frame with a slow pull-back.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"shield","role":"inset"}],"sfx":[],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s26","start":100,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"More shipping momentum.","onScreenText":["More momentum"],"visualDirection":"A rising energy line accelerates across frame as milestone markers light in sequence.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"rocket","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["riser"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s27","start":103.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"One board. Every issue. In motion.","onScreenText":["Issue board"],"visualDirection":"Slow push-in across the real product issue board