s broken."},{"start":3.5,"end":6.75,"text":"Feedback scatters across a dozen tools."},{"start":7.5,"end":11.05,"text":"Reviews stall. Direction fades."},{"start":11.6,"end":15.75,"text":"Ideas die between conversation and code."},{"start":16.3,"end":18.25,"text":"There is another way."},{"start":19.3,"end":23.950862,"text":"Linear. The product development system for teams and agents."},{"start":24.5,"end":27.15,"text":"Designed for the AI era."},{"start":28.5,"end":31.400658,"text":"From PRD to PR."},{"start":32.5,"end":37.35,"text":"Workflows shared by humans and agents, end to end."},{"start":37.9,"end":42,"text":"Plan initiatives and roadmaps in one place."},{"start":42.55,"end":45.199999999999996,"text":"PRDs live where the work happens."},{"start":46.55,"end":50.65,"text":"Turn customer feedback into actionable issues."},{"start":51.2,"end":54.650000000000006,"text":"Routed, labeled, and prioritized."},{"start":55.2,"end":58.650000000000006,"text":"Intelligent triage that never sleeps."},{"start":59.2,"end":62.75,"text":"Make product operations self-driving."},{"start":63.3,"end":66.75,"text":"Move work forward across every team."},{"start":67.3,"end":69.75,"text":"And across every agent."},{"start":70.8,"end":74.75,"text":"Review pull requests and agent output together."},{"start":75.3,"end":80.2,"text":"Understand progress at scale without losing the details."},{"start":80.75,"end":84.2,"text":"One system. One source of truth."},{"start":84.75,"end":87.6,"text":"Built for modern product teams."},{"start":88.75,"end":92.4,"text":"Adopting AI workflows, not fighting them."},{"start":92.95,"end":96.15,"text":"Customer feedback becomes the next issue."},{"start":96.95,"end":100.45,"text":"From first conversation to final merge."},{"start":101,"end":104.1,"text":"A new species of product tool."},{"start":104.65,"end":108.75,"text":"Confident. Precise. Ready for what comes next."},{"start":109.3,"end":112.8,"text":"Self-driving operations start today."},{"start":113.35,"end":117.55,"text":"See every initiative, every agent, every ship."},{"start":126.85,"end":130.04999999999998,"text":"The system that keeps teams aligned."},{"start":141.85,"end":144.2,"text":"And agents productive."}],"srt_url":"/videos/a9nrixjhbr.srt","final_attempt":"fallback","qa":{"pass":true,"issues":[],"skipped":true},"quality_report":{"verdict":"pass","flags":[],"contrast":{"checked":true,"fixed":0,"remaining":0,"passes":0},"identity":{"remapped":1},"layout":{"duplicatesRemoved":0,"collisionsScrimmed":0},"assetFloor":null,"audio":{"lufs":-14.22,"peak":0,"lra":11.5,"target":-14,"layers":{"voice":30,"sfx":10,"music":true,"ambient":false,"musicEnvelope":false}},"screenshots":{"kept":4,"dropped":0,"repinned":1,"problems":[]},"assetQuality":71,"templateFit":69,"qa":{"pass":true,"score":null,"skipped":true,"blockers":0}}},{"id":"41n2phac6k","kind":"project","prompt":"","duration":60,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"1080p","width":1920,"height":1080,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"aurora-spectrum","frame_pack_user":1,"status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":"/videos/41n2phac6k.mp4","error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":68807,"llm_tokens_out":40228,"created_at":1784782062757,"started_at":1784782264567,"finished_at":1784783414661,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"task":null,"requeue_count":0,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://linear.app","blogUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":60,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"aurora-spectrum"},"website":{"url":"https://linear.app","title":"Linear – The system for product development","description":"Purpose-built for planning and building products with AI agents.","headings":["The product development system for teams and agentsThe product developmentsystem for teams and agentsThe product development system for teams and agents","Faster app launch","A new species of product tool. Purpose-built for modern teams with AI workflows at its core, Linear sets a new standard for planning and building products.","Make product operations self-driving","Define the product direction","Move work forward across teams and agents","Review PRs and agent output","Understand progress at scale","Changelog","Built for the future. Available today.","Product","Features","Company","Resources","Connect","Legal"],"bodyText":"Skip to content →\nProduct\nResources\nCustomers\nPricing\nNow\nContact\nLog in\nSign up\nThe product development\nsystem for teams and agents\nThe product development system for teams and agents\n\nPurpose-built for planning and building products. Designed for the AI era.\n\nNew\nCoding Sessions →\nLinear\nInbox\nMy issues\nReviews\nPulse\nWorkspace\nInitiatives\nProjects\nMore\nFavorites\nFaster app launch\nAgent tasks\nUI Refresh\nAgents Insights\nFaster app launch\n02\n/\n145\nFaster app launch\n\nRender UI before vehicle_state sync when minimum required state is present, instead of blocking on full refresh during iOS startup.\n\nActivity\nLinear created the issue via Slack on behalf of karri · 2min ago\nTriage Intelligence added the label Performance and iOS · 2min ago\nkarri\n· 4 min ago\nRight now we show a spinner forever, which makes it look like the car disappeared...\njori\n· just now\n@Linear can you take a stab at this?\nLinear\nconnected by\njori\n·\n2 min ago\nChanged 2 files\nDraft PR awaiting your review\n·\n2 min ago\nLinear moved from Todo to In Progress · just now\nLinearOpus 4.8\njori\nconnected Linear to ENG-2703\nExamining the startup path...\nThinking...\nENG-2703\nIn Progress\nHigh\njori\nLinear\nLabels\nPerformance\niOS\nCycle\nCycle 144\nProject\nCore Performance\nA new species of product tool. Purpose-built for modern teams with AI workflows at its core, Linear sets a new standard for planning and building products.\nFIG 0.2\nPurpose-built\n\nLinear is shaped by the practices and principles of world-class product teams.\n\nFIG 0.3\nPowered by agents\n\nDesigned for workflows shared by humans and agents, from PRD to PR.\n\nFIG 0.4\nDesigned for speed\n\nReduces noise and restores momentum to help teams ship with high velocity and focus.\n\nMake product operations self-driving\n\nTurn conversations and customer feedback into actionable issues that are routed, labeled, and prioritized for the right team.\n\n1.0Intake→\nBacklog\n8\nENG-2085\nReduce UI flicker during autonomy...\nENG-2094\nAdd buffering for autonomy event streams\nENG-2092\nReduce startup delay caused by vehicle sync\nENG-2200\nFix delayed route updates during rerouting\nTodo\n71\nENG-926\nRemove UI inconsistencies\nBug\nDesign\nENG-2088\nTypeError: Cannot read properties\nBug\nENG-924\nUpgrade to Claude Opus 4.8\nAI\nENG-1882\nOptimize load times\nPerformance\nIn Progress\n3\nENG-1487\nRemove contentData from GraphQL API\n61039\nMKT-1028\nLaunch page assets\nDesign\nENG-2187\nPrevent duplicate ride requests on poor...\nBug\n62048\nDone\n53\nENG-2074\nClean up deprecated APIs...\nAPI\n61002\nENG-1912\nReduce latency in autonomy st...\n61005\nENG-1951\nReduce ETA fluctuations durin...\n61202\nENG-1960\nImprove fallback messaging\nUI\n61149\nENG-1991\nImprove rider visibility into veh...\nThread in #feedback\ndidier\n10:17 AM\nHas anyone been looking into the iOS startup performance issues?\nlena\n10:17 AM\nAnyone else noticing the iOS app feels slow to open if you haven't used it in a bit?\ndidier\n10:17 AM\nYea, we're still blocking initial render on a full vehicle_state sync every time...\nandreas\n10:17 AM\nFeels like we could render sooner and load the rest in the background. Probably also worth tracking startup timing so we know how often this happens!\n@Linear\ncreate urgent issues and assign to me\n1.1\nLinear Agent +\n1.2\nTriage +\n1.3\nCustomer Requests +\n1.4\nLinear Asks +\nDefine the product direction\n\nPlan and navigate from idea to launch. Align your team with product initiatives, strategic roadmaps, and clear, up-to-date PRDs.\n\n2.0Plan→\nFEB\nMAR\nAPR\nMAY\nJUN\nJUL\nAUG\nSEP\n2\n9\n16\n23\n2\n9\n16\n23\n30\n6\n13\n20\n27\n4\n11\n18\n25\n1\n8\n15\n22\n29\n6\n13\n20\n27\n3\n10\n17\n24\n31\n7\n14\n21\n28\nUI Refresh\nCore screens\nPolish\nSplit fares\nInternal\nPublic Beta\nAutonomy status clarity\nAlpha\nGA\nInitiatives\nCore Product\n99\nInfra stability\n28\nAutonomous systems\n16\nMobile apps\n8\nAPAC Expansion\n21\nJapan Launch\n12\nCustomer-driven priorities\n9\n2.1\nProjects +\n2.2\nDocuments +\n2.3\nInitiatives +\n2.4\nVisual planning +\nMove work forward across teams and agents\n\nBuild and deploy AI agents that work alongside your team. Work on complex tasks toget","brandColors":["#191917","#27261A","#201E12"],"ogImage":"https://linear.app/static/og/homepage.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":"standard","brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 60-second horizontal product film for Linear, the system for product development built for modern teams and AI agents. It opens on the chaos of scattered feedback, stalled roadmaps, and noisy tools, then reveals Linear as a single purpose-built system that turns conversations into prioritized issues, aligns initiatives and PRDs, and lets humans and agents ship side by side—from intake to PR review. Aimed at product and engineering leaders who want speed without the noise. Closes on self-driving product ops and the line: built for the future, available today. Premium, precise, quietly confident.","subject":"Linear product roadmap and issue tracker UI","audience":"Product managers, eng leads, and AI-era product teams","tone":"premium, precise, modern, confident","goal":"Convince viewers Linear is the definitive product system for teams and agents—and sign up","keyMessages":["The product development system for teams and agents","Purpose-built for planning and building with AI","Make product operations self-driving","From PRD to PR—humans and agents, side by side","Define direction, move work, understand progress at scale","Built for the future. Available today."],"mustIncludeFacts":["Purpose-built for planning and building products with AI agents","The product development system for teams and agents","Make product operations self-driving","Designed for workflows shared by humans and agents, from PRD to PR","Turn conversations and customer feedback into actionable issues","Designed for speed to help teams ship with high velocity and focus"],"brandColors":["#191917","#27261A","#201E12"],"suggestedFramePack":"aurora-spectrum","suggestedDuration":60,"musicMood":"cinematic minimal electronica","voProfile":"male, early-30s, calm precise, quietly confident"},"script":{"title":"Linear for Teams and Agents","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Scattered feedback. Stalled roadmaps.","onScreenText":["Chaos everywhere"],"visualDirection":"Fragmented message cards and sticky notes explode outward in chaotic slow-motion, then freeze mid-air.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Noisy tools everywhere. No single system.","onScreenText":["Too many tools"],"visualDirection":"Overlapping app windows stack and jitter across a dark desk as the camera slowly pulls back through the clutter.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"cluttered desk multiple monitors office","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Linear. The product development system for teams and agents.","onScreenText":["One system","Teams + Agents"],"visualDirection":"The chaos clears as the real Linear product UI settles into a browser frame with a slow cinematic push-in.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["riser","sparkle"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s4","start":11,"duration":4,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"Turn conversations into actionable issues.","onScreenText":["Feedback → Issues"],"visualDirection":"Chat bubbles drift into the real product UI and snap into prioritized issue cards with a crisp zoom.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"chat bubble","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s5","start":15,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Purpose-built for planning and building with AI agents.","onScreenText":["Built for AI"],"visualDirection":"Camera pans across a planning board as AI agent suggestions pulse into place beside human tasks.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"sparkle","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["click"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s6","start":19,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Define direction. Align initiatives and PRDs.","onScreenText":["Direction aligned"],"visualDirection":"Real product roadmap UI zooms out as initiative cards lock into a clean hierarchy across layered depth planes.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s7","start":23.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Move work. Ship with high velocity.","onScreenText":["High velocity"],"visualDirection":"Issue cards glide across a kanban board as statuses flip, camera tracking smoothly left to right.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"focused engineer laptop dual monitors","role":"background"}],"sfx":[],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s8","start":28,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"From PRD to PR. Seamless shared workflows.","onScreenText":["PRD → PR"],"visualDirection":"A PRD document morphs into a pull-request review screen inside the real product UI as the camera pans down.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"checklist","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["transition"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s9","start":32.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Humans and agents, side by side.","onScreenText":["Side by side"],"visualDirection":"Split composition: human avatars and agent icons collaborate on the same issue board as the camera pushes in.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"diverse team collaboration laptops office","role":"background"}],"sfx":[],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s10","start":37,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Understand progress at every scale.","onScreenText":["Progress at scale"],"visualDirection":"Camera pulls back from a single issue through projects and cycles into a full portfolio view with layered depth.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["ding"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s11","start":41.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Make product operations self-driving.","onScreenText":["Self-driving ops"],"visualDirection":"Automated cycles complete themselves—cards advance, statuses resolve—while the camera orbits the board.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"gear","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["sparkle"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s12","start":46,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Designed for speed. Ship with focus.","onScreenText":["Speed. Focus."],"visualDirection":"Rapid but elegant UI interactions blur past in controlled motion, then settle on a clean completed cycle.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"hands typing laptop keyboard closeup","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s13","start":50.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"quote","voiceover":"Built for the future. Available today.","onScreenText":["Available today"],"visualDirection":"Hero product UI expands full-bleed then softens into a dark field as the Linear wordmark centers with quiet confidence.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["riser"],"musicCue":"outro"},{"id":"s14","start":55,"duration":5,"purpose":"cta","voiceover":"Start with Linear.","onScreenText":["Start with Linear"],"visualDirection":"Logo lockup holds center over a soft pulse; a single glowing CTA button rises beneath it.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"outro"}],"music":{"mood":"cinematic minimal electronica","query":"cinematic minimal electronica"},"voice":{"style":"male, early-30s, calm precise, quietly confident","pace":"calm"}},"script_warnings":[],"website_screens