nal payments with Stripe.\nRead the story\nRealise value faster with dedicated experts\nProfessional services.\n\nGet tailored guidance from Stripe on implementation, complex integrations, or major migrations.\n\nView services \nStripe-certified experts.\n\nWork with a Stripe consulting partner that can integrate and deploy Stripe solutions on your behalf.\n\nView partners \nSupport plans.\n\nReceive ongoing assistance and day-to-day support for technical questions with tiered plans based on your needs.\n\nView plans \nBuild a foundation for your ","brandColors":["#FE9316","#FA86E6","#FE8F29","#FEB06F"],"ogImage":"https://images.stripeassets.com/fzn2n1nzq965/XtX984S1GJVsVOXFC7kMu/01988281e867728dfb09aa7793a6e3b9/Stripe.jpg?q=80","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":"standard","brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 40-second horizontal brand film for Stripe, the financial infrastructure platform that powers global commerce. It opens on the scale of modern money movement—checkouts, subscriptions, and borderless payments—then lands the core promise: accept payments, run any billing model, and move money worldwide from the first transaction to the billionth. Concrete proof lands hard: US$1.9tn processed in 2025, 135+ currencies, 99.999% uptime, and enterprises like Hertz, URBN, and Instacart running on Stripe. Built for founders and finance leaders who need infrastructure that scales with them. Closes on Stripe as the backbone of growth—confident, cinematic, and decisive.","subject":"payment checkout screens and card terminals","audience":"Founders, product leaders, and enterprise finance teams scaling online and global commerce","tone":"confident, premium, ambitious, decisive","goal":"Leave viewers convinced Stripe is the infrastructure to grow revenue—and ready to request a demo or start building","keyMessages":["Financial infrastructure to grow your revenue","US$1.9tn in payments volume processed in 2025","Accept and optimise payments globally—online and in person","135+ currencies and payment methods supported","99.999% historical uptime","Powering businesses from startups to Fortune 100"],"mustIncludeFacts":["US$1.9tn in payments volume processed in 2025","135+ currencies and payment methods supported","99.999% historical uptime for Stripe services","200M+ active subscriptions managed on Stripe Billing","50% of Fortune 100 companies have used Stripe","URBN consolidates $5 billion in online and in-store revenue onto Stripe","Global GDP running on Stripe: 1.68568316%"],"brandColors":["#FE9316","#FA86E6","#FE8F29"],"suggestedFramePack":"momentum","suggestedDuration":40,"musicMood":"driving cinematic electronica","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, calm authority, measured and assured"},"script":{"title":"Stripe Powers Global Growth","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"One point nine trillion dollars.","onScreenText":["US$1.9tn"],"visualDirection":"A massive numeral slams into center frame over dark pulses of money flowing across layered planes.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Payments. Subscriptions. Money without borders.","onScreenText":["Modern commerce"],"visualDirection":"Camera rushes through stacked checkout screens and card taps on parallax layers, kinetic and urgent.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"customer tapping card terminal store","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Financial infrastructure to grow your revenue.","onScreenText":["Grow your revenue"],"visualDirection":"Slow cinematic push-in on the real Stripe product UI in a browser frame as the dashboard lights to life.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["riser"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s4","start":10.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Accept payments online and in person.","onScreenText":["Online and i