tric Kettle with Temperature Control\nUS$150.00\nUnverzichtbarer Hoodie\nMarineblau\nMittel\n€41.70\nストリーミング月次サブスクリプション\nJP¥1,886\nElectric Kettle with Temperature Control\nUS$150.00\nSubtotal\nZwischensumme\n小計\nSubtotal\nUS$150.00\n€41.70\nJP¥1,886\nUS$150.00\nTax\nVAT\nJCT\nTax\nUS$15.38\n€7.92\nJP¥189.00\nUS$15.38\nDelivery\nVersand\n消費税\nDelivery\nFree\nTotal\nSumme\n合計\nTotal\nUS$165.38\n€49.62\nJP¥2,075.00\nUS$165.38\nEnable any billing model\nPro Plan\nBilled monthly\nTokens\n₹0.95 per 1,000 units\nUsage meter\nTokens used in the last 30 days\n1,500,000,000\nMonetise through agentic commerce\nCreate a card issuing programme\nAccess borderless money movement with stablecoins and crypto\nEmbed payments in your platform\nBuilding the economic infrastructure for AI\nWatch now\nThe backbone of global commerce\n\n135+\n\ncurrencies and payment methods supported\n\nUS$1.9tn\n\nin payments volume processed in 2025\n\n99.999%\n\nhistorical uptime for Stripe services\n\n200M+\n\nactive subscriptions managed on Stripe Billing\nPowering businesses of all sizes.\n\nRun your business on a reliable platform that adapts to your needs.\n\nTransform your enterprise with agile financial infrastructure\nStripe for enterprises\n\n50% of Fortune 100 companies have used Stripe to grow their businesses – from expanding internationally to reimagining the customer experience.\n\nHertz unifies commerce with Stripe.\nRead the story\n\n160\n\n countries\n\n11K+\n\n locations globally\n\nProducts used\n\n Payments, Terminal, Connect, Radar and Stripe Sigma\nURBN consolidates $5 billion in online and in-store revenue onto Stripe.\nRead the story\nInstacart powers online grocery delivery with Stripe.\nRead the story\nLe Monde improves local and international payments with Stripe.\nRead the story\nRealise value faster with dedicated experts\nProfessional services.\n\nGet tailored guidance from Stripe on implementation, complex integrations, or major migrations.\n\nView services \nStripe-certified experts.\n\nWork with a Stripe consulting partner that can integrate and deploy Stripe solutions on your behalf.\n\nView partners \nSupport plans.\n\nReceive ongoing assistance and day-to-day support for technical questions with tiered plans based on your needs.\n\nView plans \nBuild a foundation for your ","brandColors":["#FE9316","#FA86E6","#FE8F29","#FEB06F"],"ogImage":"https://images.stripeassets.com/fzn2n1nzq965/XtX984S1GJVsVOXFC7kMu/01988281e867728dfb09aa7793a6e3b9/Stripe.jpg?q=80","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":"standard","brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 40-second horizontal brand film for Stripe, the financial infrastructure platform that helps businesses accept payments, run flexible billing, and move money at global scale. It opens on the scale of modern commerce — checkouts lighting up worldwide — then lands the spine: infrastructure built to grow revenue from the first transaction to the billionth. Concrete proof follows: $1.9tn processed in 2025, 135+ currencies and methods, 99.999% uptime, and enterprises like Hertz, URBN, and Instacart running on Stripe. Closes with a confident invitation for startups and Fortune 100s alike to build on Stripe. Premium, decisive, and infrastructure-scale.","subject":"global payment checkouts and finance dashboards","audience":"Founders, product leaders, and enterprise finance teams building or scaling digital commerce","tone":"confident, premium, decisive, modern","goal":"Leave viewers convinced Stripe is the backbone of global commerce — and ready to request an invite or contact sales","keyMessages":["Financial infrastructure to grow your revenue","US$1.9tn in payments volume processed in 2025","Accept and optimise payments globally — online and in person","135+ currencies and payment methods supported","50% of Fortune 100 companies have used Stripe","From your first transaction to your billionth"],"mustIncludeFacts":["US$1.9tn in payments volume processed in 20