ress:\n\nFlipkart Internet Private Limited,\n\nBuildings Alyssa, Begonia &\n\nClove Embassy Tech Village,\n\nOuter Ring Road, Devarabeesanahalli Village,\n\nBengaluru, 560103,\n\nKarnataka, India\n\nCIN : U51109KA2012PTC066107\n\nTelephone: 044-45614700 / 044-67415800\n\nBecome a Seller\nAdvertise\nGift Cards\nHelp Center\n© 2007-2026 Flipkart.com\n✕\nLogin\n\nGet access to your Orders, Wishlist and Recommendations\n\nEnter Email/Mobile number\nBy continuing, you agree to Flipkart's Terms of Use and Privacy Policy.\nRequest OTP\nNew to Flipkart? Create an account","brandColors":["#2874F0","#44100E","#1D6EF0","#2B69CF"],"ogImage":null,"hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":0,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":"premium","brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second horizontal launch film for Flipkart that frames the shopping app as pure productivity: one place for everything you need, faster. It opens on the chaos of scattered errands and tabs, then snaps into Flipkart as the fix — mobiles, fashion, groceries, flights, all inside one app. Punchy beats hit Flipkart Minutes for flash delivery, big sale deals, and shop-smart payments. Energetic, upbeat, and fast, it closes on the urge to open Flipkart and get it done.","subject":"shopping app UI and product packages","audience":"Busy Indian online shoppers who want deals and one-app convenience","tone":"energetic, upbeat, bold, fast","goal":"Make the viewer feel shopping just got faster — and open Flipkart now","keyMessages":["India's ultimate one-stop online shopping destination","Flipkart Minutes: groceries and gadgets in a flash","Unbeatable offers and popular sale events","Shop smart, pay smarter","Mobiles, fashion, groceries, flights — all in one app"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Flipkart: India's Ultimate One-Stop Online Shopping Destination","Flipkart Minutes: Groceries and Gadgets in a Flash","Payment and Affordability: Shop Smart, Pay Smarter","Flipkart Flights: Book Your Next Getaway Effortlessly","Flipkart Kilos: Y