day need for everything at once — mobiles, fashion, electronics, groceries — then lands on Flipkart as the single app that covers it all with big deals. Quick beats highlight category breadth, Flipkart Minutes for groceries and gadgets in a flash, and smart value like exchange and affordability. Made for everyday Indian shoppers who want one place for more, faster, cheaper. Energetic, confident, and deal-forward, ending on the urge to open Flipkart and start browsing.","subject":"smartphone shopping app and delivery packages","audience":"Everyday Indian online shoppers hunting deals across gadgets, fashion, and groceries","tone":"confident, energetic, bold, accessible","goal":"Make viewers feel Flipkart is the one app for everything they need — and open it to shop","keyMessages":["India’s ultimate one-stop online shopping destination","Mobiles, electronics, furniture, grocery, lifestyle, books and more","Flipkart Minutes: groceries and gadgets in a flash","Shop smart with exclusive offers and deals"],"mustIncludeFacts":["India's Ultimate One-Stop Online Shopping Destination","Mobiles, Electronics, Furniture, Grocery, Lifestyle, Books & More","Flipkart Minutes: Groceries and Gadgets in a Flash","Flipkart Kilos: Your Online Grocery Supermarket","Flipkart Reset and Exchange Program"],"brandColors":["#2874F0","#0D304B","#1D6EF0","#0B1B29"],"suggestedFramePack":"momentum","suggestedDuration":20,"musicMood":"bold upbeat retail electronica","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, confident, brisk, warm Indian English"},"script":{"title":"Flipkart One-Stop for Everything","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Need everything at once?","onScreenText":["Need it all?"],"visualDirection":"A chaotic whirl of product packages and icons spins into a single glowing phone as the camera pushes in hard.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Mobiles, electronics, furniture, groc