rs were unavailable) — the narration may sound different from your usual voice."]},{"id":"ezugc7igdq","kind":"project","prompt":"","duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"1080p","width":1920,"height":1080,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"daybreak-bakehouse","frame_pack_user":1,"status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":"/videos/ezugc7igdq.mp4","error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":69543,"llm_tokens_out":27140,"created_at":1784958832338,"started_at":1784959197066,"finished_at":1784959718905,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"task":null,"requeue_count":0,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://tartinebakery.com","blogUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"daybreak-bakehouse"},"website":{"url":"https://tartinebakery.com","title":"Tartine Bakery","description":"Tartine is a thoughtful expression of modern craft through good food and warm experiences. We are a product of our communities and our friends.","headings":["Welcome to Tartine","Tartine Happenings","SPECIAL ORDER CAKES","PRE ORDER CAKES & TARTS","Gift Cards","Tartine: Inside Stories, Chapter 3: Stewardship","WHO WE ARE","A thoughtful expression of modern craft.","Tartine at home"],"bodyText":"Skip to Main Content\n\nCRAVING PIZZA?\n\nCLICK HERE TO MAKE A DINNER RESERVATION @ TARTINE MANUFACTORY\nLOCATIONSABOUT US\nNATIONAL SHIPPING\nORDER\nWelcome to Tartine\n\na thoughtful expression of modern craft through good food and warm experiences.\n\nBay Area\n\n4 locations →\n\nLos Angeles\n\n7 locations →\n\nSeoul\n\n6 locations →\nTartine Happenings\nSlide 1 of 3\n\nRise Each Day. Warm Every Table. Join Tartine\n\nJOIN TARTINE\n\nCraving Tartine but you don't live in SF or LA? We're thrilled to offer nationwide shipping through Goldbelly.\n\nORDER NATIONWIDE\nSPECIAL ORDER CAKES\n\nHave a special event coming up? We can help with that.\n\nPlease note that special order cakes require a seven day lead time.\nCLICK HERE TO ORDER YOUR SPECIAL ORDER CAKE - PICK-UP FROM TARTINE BAKERY @ 600 GUERRERO ST.\nPRE ORDER CAKES & TARTS\n\nClick the link below to pre-order a cake or tart.\n\nCLICK HERE TO PRE-ORDER CAKES & TARTS- PICK-UP FROM TARTINE BAKERY @ 600 GUERRERO ST.\nGift Cards\n\nYou can now buy a Tartine gift card online. You can send as a gift or treat yourself! Tartine gift cards can be redeemed at Tartine Bakery in SF, Tartine Manufactory, Tartine Inner Sunset as well as our 5 LA locations.\n\nBUY GIFT CARD\nTartine: Inside Stories, Chapter 3: Stewardship\n\nThe final exploration in the series. Watch Chapter 3 below:\n\nWHO WE ARE\nA thoughtful expression of modern craft.\n\nTartine began with a mission: bring bread with an old-soul into the lives of our friends and family in California.\n\nLEARN ABOUT US\n\n\"Fresh out of the oven, each loaf has a shell of blistered mahogany and an interior so chewy and preternaturally moist that it shimmers in the light\"\n\nVogue\nSlide 1 of 6\n\nBREAD BOOK Available for Pre-order\n\nTartine: A Classic Revisited on Amazon\n\nTartine All Day on Amazon\n\nTartine Bread\n\nTartine\n\nTartine Book No 3\n\nTartine at home\n\nIn 2010 we published TARTINE BREAD. The baking community was in shock that we would share our secret to the iconic Tartine Country Loaf. For us, the magic is in the endless thought and experimentation that goes into making each loaf; learning to push the boundaries of what we do, so more people can enjoy it.\n\nLocations\n\nNational Shipping\n\nAbout Us\n\nJoin Tartine\n\nPress\n\ninfo@tartinebakery.com\n\ninfo@tartinemanufactory.com\n\npress@tartinebakery.com\n\nFacebook\n\n / \n\nInstagram\n\nRise each day.\nWarm every table.\n\n2021 Tartine\n\nAll rights reserved\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nSite Map\n\nTerms of Service\n\nCLOSE\n\nLocations\n\nAbout\n\nOrder\n\nJoin Tartine\n\nPress\n\nCLOSE\nCHANGE LOCATION\nEACH\nDAY\nMADE\nEACH\nDAY","brandColors":["#261B16","#322928","#32231A","#4A362D"],"ogImage":"assets/tartine-share.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second horizontal brand film for Tartine Bakery, the California craft bakery known for its iconic Country Loaf and warm, modern food experiences. It opens at dawn in a flour-dusted bakehouse — steam rising off blistered mahogany loaves — then expands into the feeling of their tables: friends sharing bread, special-order cakes, and the invitation to rise each day and warm every table. Aimed at food lovers and craft seekers who want more than a pastry. Closes on nationwide reach via Goldbelly and locations from the Bay Area to LA to Seoul, with an unhurried, golden-hour bakery energy.","subject":"artisan sourdough loaves and bakery pastries","audience":"Food-loving urbanites and craft seekers in SF, LA, Seoul — and anyone craving Tartine at home","tone":"warm, artisanal, inviting, unhurried","goal":"Make viewers crave Tartine bread and feel pulled to visit, pre-order, or ship a loaf home","keyMessages":["Rise each day. Warm every table.","A thoughtful expression of modern craft through good food","Iconic Country Loaf with blistered mahogany crust","Bay Area, Los Angeles, and Seoul locations","Nationwide shipping and special-order cakes"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Rise each day. Warm every table.","Bay Area 4 locations, Los Angeles 7 locations, Seoul 6 locations","Special order cakes require a seven day lead time","Nationwide shipping through Goldbelly","Tartine began with a mission: bring bread with an old-soul into the lives of friends and family in California","Vogue: each loaf has a shell of blistered mahogany and an interior so chewy and preternaturally moist that it shimmers in the light"],"brandColors":["#261B16","#322928","#4A362D"],"suggestedFramePack":"daybreak-bakehouse","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"warm acoustic morning folk","voProfile":"female, mid-40s, warm and unhurried, soft craft-kitchen intimacy"},"script":{"title":"Tartine Warms Every Table","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Steam rises at dawn.","onScreenText":["Dawn in the bakehouse"],"visualDirection":"Slow push-in through golden steam rising off blistered mahogany loaves in a flour-dusted bakehouse.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"sourdough loaves steam bakery dawn","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Tartine began with bread for friends and family.","onScreenText":["Old-soul bread"],"visualDirection":"Camera drifts past flour-dusted hands shaping dough in soft morning bakery light.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"baker hands shaping dough flour","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Blistered mahogany crust. An interior that shimmers.","onScreenText":["Country Loaf","Blistered mahogany"],"visualDirection":"Extreme close-up orbits the Country Loaf crust, then cuts to a glistening moist crumb interior.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"blistered sourdough crust closeup","role":"background"},{"type":"image","query":"sourdough bread slice moist interior","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["sparkle"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":11,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"A thoughtful craft, shared at the table.","onScreenText":["Modern craft"],"visualDirection":"Gentle pan across friends breaking bread at a sunlit wooden table with layered plates and glasses.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"friends sharing bread wooden table","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s5","start":15,"duration":4,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Four Bay Area. Seven Los Angeles. Six Seoul.","onScreenText":["4 Bay Area","7 Los Angeles","6 Seoul"],"visualDirection":"Soft tracking past bakery storefronts as location counts bloom one after another on screen.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"bakery storefront morning street","role":"background"}],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s6","start":19,"duration":4,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"Special cakes take seven days. Ship nationwide on Goldbelly.","onScreenText":["7-day cake orders","Ship on Goldbelly"],"visualDirection":"A special-order cake rotates on a stand, then the camera lifts to a loaf nestled in shipping packaging.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"elegant celebration cake bakery","role":"background"},{"type":"image","query":"artisan bread gift box packaging","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["click"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s7","start":23,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"quote","voiceover":"Rise each day. Warm every table.","onScreenText":["Rise each day.","Warm every table."],"visualDirection":"A fresh loaf settles onto an empty wooden table as warm light expands across the surface, slow push-in.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"fresh bread loaf wooden table light","role":"background"}],"sfx":["ding"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s8","start":26.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"cta","voiceover":"Visit. Order. Or ship Tartine home.","onScreenText":["Visit · Order · Ship"],"visualDirection":"Tartine logo locks center over a soft bakery glow as action words pulse gently beneath.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["riser","impact"],"musicCue":"outro"}],"music":{"mood":"warm acoustic morning folk","query":"warm acoustic folk"},"voice":{"style":"female, mid-40s, warm and unhurried, soft craft-kitchen intimacy","pace":"calm"}},"script_warnings":[],"website_screenshot":"C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\ezugc7igdq\\ingest\\website.png","website_screenshots":["C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\ezugc7igdq\\ingest\\website.png","C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\ezugc7igdq\\ingest\\website_section2.png","C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\ezugc7igdq\\ingest\\website_section3.png"],"website_images":[{"path":"C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\