ith ease.","headings":["All the benefits of growing your own food. None of the work.","Hungry for something better?","Hungry for something better?","Living better has never been so easy","A revolution recognized by all","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","Named Best of 2025","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","Named Best of 2025","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","How big is your appetite?","Meet Kelby, your AI gardener","Gardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible","100,000+ happy Gardyners and growing"],"bodyText":"Gardyns are now HSA/FSA eligible with Truemed! Shop now.\nShop All\nPlants\nHow It Works\nAbout\nSchools\nShop\nAll the benefits of growing your own food. None of the work.\n\nEnjoy fresh, delicious, pesticide-free produce at home, year-round. All made possible by our AI gardener.\n\nShop Now\n\n4.8/5\n\n100,000 households and growing\n\nAS SEEN IN\n\nA revolution recognized by all\n\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”\n\n2024 BIG Innovation Awards\n\nWorld's Top Green Tech Companies\nBest Invention of The Year\n“...the secret to my home grown produce.”\nNamed Best of 2025\nWinner 2023 World Changing Idea\n\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”\n\n2024 BIG Innovation Awards\n\nWorld's Top Green Tech Companies\nBest Invention of The Year\n“...the secret to my home grown produce.”\nNamed Best of 2025\nWinner 2023 World Changing Idea\n\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”\n\n2024 BIG Innovation Awards\n\nWorld's Top Green Tech Companies\nBest Invention of The Year\n“...the secret to my home grown produce.”\n6,000,000+ PLANTS SOLD\n\nOver 900 Reviews\n\n★★★★★\n4.8/5.0\nSee All \n\nFEATURED PRODUCTS\n\nHow big is your appetite?\n\nTwo ways to enjoy fresh, delicious produce at home year-round.\n\nShop Now\nHSA/FSA eligible\nGardyn Home\nMaximum harvest\nHouse\n3-4 people\n30 plants\nHSA/FSA eligible\nGardyn Studio\nThe perfect gift\nApartment\n1-2 people\n16 plants\nMEET THE PLANTS\nGrow what you love. Love what you grow.\nDiscover 100+ delicious, non-GMO varieties; from crisp greens and sweet tomatoes to flavorful herbs and tasty fruits.\nExplore 100+ Plants\nPINK SWISS CHARD\nA nutrient-packed, fully edible green with hot pink stems from Sicily, try it in salads or cooked like spinach.\nGREENS\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nMeet Kelby, your AI gardener\n\nKelby monitors your plants’ water, light, and overall health automatically, so all you have to do is harvest and eat.\n\nSee How It Works\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nGardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible\n\nThis exciting collaboration with Truemed allows you to use your Health Savings Account (HSA) or Flexible Spending Account (FSA) to purchase your Gardyn device and prepaid membership. By using pre-tax funds, you can save approximately 30% on your journey to better health.\n\nShop Now\n100,000+ happy Gardyners and growing\n\nHarvest happiness one bite at a time for a tastier, more fulfilling life. Join us.\n\n“For two years, Gardyn has been in my life, empowering me to elevate my diet with fresh, homegrown ingredients. I love its compact design and beautiful aesthetic.”\n\n— Gretchen\n\n“I love it and so does my family. I tell everyone that I meet and s","brandColors":["#8D5630","#332918","#710D12","#714D31"],"ogImage":"https://mygardyn.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Studio-2-Thumbnail-930.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second horizontal promo for Gardyn, the smart indoor hydroponic system that turns any kitchen into a vertical farm. It opens on the everyday craving for fresh, pesticide-free produce, then reveals a living tower of greens tended by Kelby, the AI gardener who handles light, water, and plant health automatically. Built for busy households who want homegrown food with none of the outdoor work. It lands on the payoff — harvest year-round, 100,000+ happy Gardyners, and the fact that Gardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible. Warm, fresh, and effortless energy throughout.","subject":"indoor hydroponic tower with leafy greens","audience":"Health-conscious home cooks and apartment dwellers who want fresh produce without outdoor gardening","tone":"warm, fresh, effortless, optimistic","goal":"Make the viewer feel homegrown food is finally easy — and want to shop a Gardyn","keyMessages":["All the benefits of growing your own food. None of the work.","Meet Kelby, your AI gardener","Fresh, pesticide-free produce year-round","100,000+ happy Gardyners and growing","Gardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible","6,000,000+ plants sold"],"mustIncludeFacts":["All the benefits of growing your own food. None of the work.","Kelby, your AI gardener monitors water, light, and plant health automatically","Fresh, delicious, pesticide-free produce at home, year-round","100,000+ happy Gardyners / 100,000 households and growing","6,000,000+ plants sold","4.8/5 rating","Gardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible with Truemed","100+ non-GMO plant varieties","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea","Named Best of 2025","Gardyn Home grows 30 plants for 3-4 people; Gardyn Studio grows 16 plants for 1-2 people"],"brandColors":["#8D5630","#332918","#710D12","#714D31"],"suggestedFramePack":"organic-garden","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"warm acoustic organic folk","voProfile":"female, mid-30s, warm and inviting, lightly upbeat"},"script":{"title":"Gardyn Grows Food Without Work","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Craving fresh greens every day?","onScreenText":["Fresh greens daily?"],"visualDirection":"Extreme close-up of glistening leafy greens fills the frame, then a gentle pull-back hints they are growing indoors under soft morning light.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"vibrant leafy greens closeup","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Outdoor gardens need space, time, and endless work.","onScreenText":["No yard. No time."],"visualDirection":"Camera pans across a bare city balcony then cuts to a hurried shopper scanning dull grocery produce under harsh lights.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"woman grocery produce aisle","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Gardyn turns any kitchen into a vertical farm.","onScreenText":["Your indoor farm"],"visualDirection":"Slow cinematic push-in on a sleek hydroponic tower packed with lush greens glowing in a bright modern kitchen, depth layers of counter and plants.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"indoor hydroponic tower kitchen","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh","sparkle"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s4","start":10.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"Meet Kelby. Your AI gardener handles light, water, health.","onScreenText":["Meet Kelby","AI gardener"],"visualDirection":"Camera orbits the tower as soft light pulses travel its columns; simple leaf and droplet icons float and lock into place around it.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"woman smiling indoor garden tower","role":"background"},{"type":"icon","query":"sparkle","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["pop","click"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s5","start":14.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Fresh pesticide-free produce. Harvest it year-round.","onScreenText":["Pesticide-free","Year-round"],"visualDirection":"Hands reach in and snip bright basil leaves from the tower, dropping them into a wooden bowl as the camera tilts up the living wall of greens.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"hands harvesting basil leaves","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s6","start":18,"duration":4,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"A hundred thousand happy Gardyners. Six million plants sold.","onScreenText":["100,000+ Gardyners","6M+ plants sold"],"visualDirection":"Bold counters spin upward over a warm collage of households posing beside their towers; cards of smiling faces parallax past the lens.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"happy family kitchen salad","role":"background"}],"sfx":["ding","sparkle"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s7","start":22,"duration":4,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Rated 4.8 stars. Now HSA eligible with Truemed.","onScreenText":["4.8 / 5","HSA / FSA eligible"],"visualDirection":"A five-star badge and HSA shield float forward and lock over a softly lit product hero, camera easing in for emphasis.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"badge","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s8","start":26,"duration":4,"purpose":"cta","voiceover":"All the benefits. None of the work. Shop Gardyn.","onScreenText":["Shop Gardyn","None of the work"],"visualDirection":"Hero tower settles dead-center with logo lockup and a glowing shop button; gentle orbital drift and soft light pulse close the film.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["riser","impact"],"musicCue":"outro"}],"music":{"mood":"warm acoustic organic folk","query":"warm acoustic folk"},"voice":{"style":"female, mid-30s, warm and inviting, lightly upbeat","pace":"conversational"}},"script_warnings":[],"website_screenshot":"C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\a629ywtw3a\\ingest\\website.png","website_screenshots":["C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\a629ywtw3a\\ingest\\website.png","C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\a629ywtw3a\\ingest\\website_section2.png","C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\a629ywtw3a\\ingest\\website_section3.png"],"website_images":[{"path":"C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\a629ywtw3a\\ingest\\site_images\\site_img_0.png","alt":"hero background","width":890,"height":696},{"path":"C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\a629ywtw3a\\ingest\\site_images\\site_img_1.jpg","alt":"hero background","width":845,"height":1051},{"path":"C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\a629ywtw3a\\ingest\\site_images\\site_img_2.png","alt":null,"width":1000,"height":573},{"path":"C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\a629ywtw3a\\ingest\\site_images\\site_img_3.png","alt":null,"width":317,"height":528},{"path":"C:\\int