,{"sceneId":"s8","archetype":"cta","heroScale":0.54}],"score":{"compositionQuality":100,"source":"deterministic"}},"captions":[{"start":0,"end":2.55,"text":"Craving fresh greens every day?"},{"start":3.1,"end":7.475,"text":"Outdoor gardens demand space, time, and endless work."},{"start":8.03,"end":11.43,"text":"Gardyn turns any kitchen into a vertical farm."},{"start":12.03,"end":16.680861999999998,"text":"Meet Kelby, your AI gardener for light, water, and health."},{"start":17.23,"end":21.605,"text":"Fresh, pesticide-free produce, harvested year-round."},{"start":22.16,"end":26.66,"text":"100,000 happy Gardyners. 6 million plants sold."},{"start":27.21,"end":32.11,"text":"Rated 4.8 stars. Now HSA eligible with Truemed."},{"start":32.66,"end":36.710044999999994,"text":"All the benefits, none of the work. Shop Gardyn."}],"srt_url":"/videos/a629ywtw3a.srt","final_attempt":"main","qa":{"pass":false,"score":6,"issues":[{"atSec":25.2,"severity":"blocker","issue":"Element collision: The polaroid graphic with the building icon overlaps and obscures the text 'plants grown' inside the '6,000,000+' stat card.","fix":"Reposition the polaroid graphic further to the right, or reduce its scale, to ensure it does not overlap the text container of the adjacent stat card."},{"atSec":6.1,"severity":"minor","issue":"The polaroid photo card overlaps the 'Pesticide-free' text card, causing tight spacing and partial clipping of the card's background.","fix":"Increase the horizontal gap between the flex items or shift the polaroid photo slightly to the right."}]},"quality_report":{"verdict":"flagged","flags":["1 screenshot(s) dropped by QA","QA: 1 blocker(s)"],"contrast":{"checked":true,"fixed":0,"remaining":0,"passes":0},"identity":{"remapped":0},"layout":{"duplicatesRemoved":0,"collisionsScrimmed":0},"assetFloor":null,"audio":{"lufs":-14,"peak":-2.44,"lra":4.8,"target":-14,"layers":{"voice":8,"sfx":6,"music":true,"ambient":false,"musicEnvelope":false}},"screenshots":{"kept":3,"dropped":1,"repinned":2,"problems":["scene-mismatch"]},"assetQuality":81,"templateFit":86,"qa":{"pass":false,"score":6,"skipped":false,"blockers":1}}},{"id":"eyelkx94nn","kind":"project","prompt":"","duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"1080p","width":1920,"height":1080,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"daybreak-bakehouse","frame_pack_user":1,"status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":"/videos/eyelkx94nn.mp4","error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":56948,"llm_tokens_out":22017,"created_at":1784961027532,"started_at":1784961659733,"finished_at":1784962404505,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"task":null,"requeue_count":0,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://tartinebakery.com","blogUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"daybreak-bakehouse"},"website":{"url":"https://tartinebakery.com","title":"Tartine Bakery","description":"Tartine is a thoughtful expression of modern craft through good food and warm experiences. We are a product of our communities and our friends.","headings":["Welcome to Tartine","Tartine Happenings","SPECIAL ORDER CAKES","PRE ORDER CAKES & TARTS","Gift Cards","Tartine: Inside Stories, Chapter 3: Stewardship","WHO WE ARE","A thoughtful expression of modern craft.","Tartine at home"],"bodyText":"Skip to Main Content\n\nCRAVING PIZZA?\n\nCLICK HERE TO MAKE A DINNER RESERVATION @ TARTINE MANUFACTORY\nLOCATIONSABOUT US\nNATIONAL SHIPPING\nORDER\nWelcome to Tartine\n\na thoughtful expression of modern craft through good food and warm experiences.\n\nBay Area\n\n4 locations →\n\nLos Angeles\n\n7 locations →\n\nSeoul\n\n6 locations →\nTartine Happenings\nSlide 1 of 3\n\nRise Each Day. Warm Every Table. Join Tartine\n\nJOIN TARTINE\n\nCraving Tartine but you don't live in SF or LA? We're thrilled to offer nationwide shipping through Goldbelly.\n\nORDER NATIONWIDE\nSPECIAL ORDER CAKES\n\nHave a special event coming up? We can help with that.\n\nPlease note that special order cakes require a seven day lead time.\nCLICK HERE TO ORDER YOUR SPECIAL ORDER CAKE - PICK-UP FROM TARTINE BAKERY @ 600 GUERRERO ST.\nPRE ORDER CAKES & TARTS\n\nClick the link below to pre-order a cake or tart.\n\nCLICK HERE TO PRE-ORDER CAKES & TARTS- PICK-UP FROM TARTINE BAKERY @ 600 GUERRERO ST.\nGift Cards\n\nYou can now buy a Tartine gift card online. You can send as a gift or treat yourself! Tartine gift cards can be redeemed at Tartine Bakery in SF, Tartine Manufactory, Tartine Inner Sunset as well as our 5 LA locations.\n\nBUY GIFT CARD\nTartine: Inside Stories, Chapter 3: Stewardship\n\nThe final exploration in the series. Watch Chapter 3 below:\n\nWHO WE ARE\nA thoughtful expression of modern craft.\n\nTartine began with a mission: bring bread with an old-soul into the lives of our friends and family in California.\n\nLEARN ABOUT US\n\n\"Fresh out of the oven, each loaf has a shell of blistered mahogany and an interior so chewy and preternaturally moist that it shimmers in the light\"\n\nVogue\nSlide 1 of 6\n\nBREAD BOOK Available for Pre-order\n\nTartine: A Classic Revisited on Amazon\n\nTartine All Day on Amazon\n\nTartine Bread\n\nTartine\n\nTartine Book No 3\n\nTartine at home\n\nIn 2010 we published TARTINE BREAD. The baking community was in shock that we would share our secret to the iconic Tartine Country Loaf. For us, the magic is in the endless thought and experimentation that goes into making each loaf; learning to push the boundaries of what we do, so more people can enjoy it.\n\nLocations\n\nNational Shipping\n\nAbout Us\n\nJoin Tartine\n\nPress\n\ninfo@tartinebakery.com\n\ninfo@tartinemanufactory.com\n\npress@tartinebakery.com\n\nFacebook\n\n / \n\nInstagram\n\nRise each day.\nWarm every table.\n\n2021 Tartine\n\nAll rights reserved\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nSite Map\n\nTerms of Service\n\nCLOSE\n\nLocations\n\nAbout\n\nOrder\n\nJoin Tartine\n\nPress\n\nCLOSE\nCHANGE LOCATION\nEACH\nDAY\nMADE\nEACH\nDAY","brandColors":["#261B16","#322928","#32231A","#4A362D"],"ogImage":"assets/tartine-share.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second horizontal brand film for Tartine Bakery, the California craft bakery known for its blistered mahogany country loaves and warm, community-rooted kitchens. It opens on steam rising from fresh bread and the daily ritual of baking, then expands into Tartine’s world — special-order cakes, nationwide shipping, and locations across the Bay Area, Los Angeles, and Seoul. Built for food lovers and neighbors who crave honest craft. It closes on the invitation to rise each day and warm every table. Cozy, artisanal, golden-morning energy.","subject":"artisan sourdough loaves and bakery counter","audience":"Food lovers, neighbors, and craft-curious bakers who value artisanal bread and warm community dining","tone":"warm, artisanal, inviting, unhurried","goal":"Make the viewer crave Tartine’s craft and want to visit, order, or ship a loaf home","keyMessages":["A thoughtful expression of modern craft through good food","Iconic country loaves with blistered mahogany crusts","Rise each day. Warm every table.","Bay Area, Los Angeles, and Seoul locations","Nationwide shipping and special-order cakes"],"mustIncludeFacts":["A thoughtful expression of modern craft through good food and warm experiences","Bay Area 4 locations, Los Angeles 7 locations, Seoul 6 locations","Special order cakes require a seven day lead time","Nationwide shipping through Goldbelly","Tartine began with a mission: bring bread with an old-soul into the lives of our friends and family in California","Rise each day. Warm every table."],"brandColors":["#261B16","#322928","#4A362D"],"suggestedFramePack":"daybreak-bakehouse","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"warm acoustic morning folk","voProfile":"female, mid-30s, soft and grounded, unhurried and inviting"},"script":{"title":"Tartine Rise Each Day","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Steam rises from fresh bread.","onScreenText":["Steam rising"],"visualDirection":"Slow push-in on curling steam lifting from a hot blistered loaf just pulled from the oven.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"steam rising fresh sourdough loaf","role":"background"}],"sfx":["riser"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Tartine began with a mission. Old-soul bread for friends and family in California.","onScreenText":["Old-soul bread"],"visualDirection":"Camera drifts across a sunlit kitchen as bakers score dough in golden morning light.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"baker scoring dough morning kitchen","role":"background"}],"sfx":[],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":8,"duration":5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"A thoughtful expression of modern craft through good food and warm experiences.","onScreenText":["Modern craft","Warm experiences"],"visualDirection":"Gentle pull-back revealing a busy artisan counter stacked with breads, soft parallax layers of shelves behind.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"artisan bakery counter fresh breads","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":13,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Iconic country loaves with blistered mahogany crusts.","onScreenText":["Blistered mahogany"],"visualDirection":"Slow orbit around a country loaf as light catches the blistered mahogany crust bubbles.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"blistered mahogany crust sourdough closeup","role":"background"}],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s5","start":16.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Bay Area four locations, Los Angeles seven, Seoul six.","onScreenText":["Bay Area · 4","Los Angeles · 7","Seoul · 6"],"visualDirection":"Three location cards cascade into frame over warm bakery interiors that dissolve between cities, gen