untry loaves with blistered mahogany crusts."},{"start":20.25,"end":25.875,"text":"Four Bay Area locations, seven in Los Angeles, six in Seoul."},{"start":26.43,"end":28.220714285714287,"text":"Get Goldbelly shipping."},{"start":28.220714285714287,"end":31.88,"text":"Special-order cakes require seven days' notice."},{"start":32.43,"end":38.055,"text":"Visit, order, or ship. Rise each day and warm every table."}],"srt_url":"/videos/eyelkx94nn.srt","final_attempt":"main","qa":{"pass":true,"score":10,"issues":[]},"quality_report":{"verdict":"pass","flags":[],"contrast":{"checked":true,"fixed":2,"remaining":0,"passes":1},"identity":{"remapped":0},"layout":{"duplicatesRemoved":0,"collisionsScrimmed":0},"assetFloor":null,"audio":{"lufs":-14,"peak":-2.65,"lra":5.5,"target":-14,"layers":{"voice":7,"sfx":6,"music":true,"ambient":false,"musicEnvelope":false}},"screenshots":{"kept":4,"dropped":0,"repinned":0,"problems":[]},"assetQuality":83,"templateFit":84,"qa":{"pass":true,"score":10,"skipped":false,"blockers":0}}},{"id":"1axxjulwp9","kind":"project","prompt":"","duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"1080p","width":1920,"height":1080,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"organic-garden","frame_pack_user":1,"status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":"/videos/1axxjulwp9.mp4","error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":62228,"llm_tokens_out":27401,"created_at":1784961027759,"started_at":1784962571637,"finished_at":1784963301636,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"task":null,"requeue_count":1,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://mygardyn.com","blogUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"organic-garden"},"website":{"url":"https://mygardyn.com","title":"Gardyn: Hydroponic System - Growing Vegetables, Herbs & Flowers","description":"Discover our range of smart indoor hydroponic systems, perfect for growing fresh vegetables, herbs and flowers at home with ease.","headings":["All the benefits of growing your own food. None of the work.","Hungry for something better?","Hungry for something better?","Living better has never been so easy","A revolution recognized by all","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","Named Best of 2025","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","Named Best of 2025","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","How big is your appetite?","Meet Kelby, your AI gardener","Gardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible","100,000+ happy Gardyners and growing"],"bodyText":"Gardyns are now HSA/FSA eligible with Truemed! Shop now.\nShop All\nPlants\nHow It Works\nAbout\nSchools\nShop\nAll the benefits of growing your own food. None of the work.\n\nEnjoy fresh, delicious, pesticide-free produce at home, year-round. All made possible by our AI gardener.\n\nShop Now\n\n4.8/5\n\n100,000 households and growing\n\nAS SEEN IN\n\nA revolution recognized by all\n\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”\n\n2024 BIG Innovation Awards\n\nWorld's Top Green Tech Companies\nBest Invention of The Year\n“...the secret to my home grown produce.”\nNamed Best of 2025\nWinner 2023 World Changing Idea\n\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”\n\n2024 BIG Innovation Awards\n\nWorld's Top Green Tech Companies\nBest Invention of The Year\n“...the secret to my home grown produce.”\nNamed Best of 2025\nWinner 2023 World Changing Idea\n\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”\n\n2024 BIG Innovation Awards\n\nWorld's Top Green Tech Companies\nBest Invention of The Year\n“...the secret to my home grown produce.”\n6,000,000+ PLANTS SOLD\n\nOver 900 Reviews\n\n★★★★★\n4.8/5.0\nSee All \n\nFEATURED PRODUCTS\n\nHow big is your appetite?\n\nTwo ways to enjoy fresh, delicious produce at home year-round.\n\nShop Now\nHSA/FSA eligible\nGardyn Home\nMaximum harvest\nHouse\n3-4 people\n30 plants\nHSA/FSA eligible\nGardyn Studio\nThe perfect gift\nApartment\n1-2 people\n16 plants\nMEET THE PLANTS\nGrow what you love. Love what you grow.\nDiscover 100+ delicious, non-GMO varieties; from crisp greens and sweet tomatoes to flavorful herbs and tasty fruits.\nExplore 100+ Plants\nPINK SWISS CHARD\nA nutrient-packed, fully edible green with hot pink stems from Sicily, try it in salads or cooked like spinach.\nGREENS\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nMeet Kelby, your AI gardener\n\nKelby monitors your plants’ water, light, and overall health automatically, so all you have to do is harvest and eat.\n\nSee How It Works\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nGardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible\n\nThis exciting collaboration with Truemed allows you to use your Health Savings Account (HSA) or Flexible Spending Account (FSA) to purchase your Gardyn device and prepaid membership. By using pre-tax funds, you can save approximately 30% on your journey to better health.\n\nShop Now\n100,000+ happy Gardyners and growing\n\nHarvest happiness one bite at a time for a tastier, more fulfilling life. Join us.\n\n“For two years, Gardyn has been in my life, empowering me to elevate my diet with fresh, homegrown ingredients. I love its compact design and beautiful aesthetic.”\n\n— Gretchen\n\n“I love it and so does my family. I tell everyone that I meet and s","brandColors":["#2E5015","#2C3215","#17360E","#0D3427"],"ogImage":"https://mygardyn.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Studio-2-Thumbnail-930.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second horizontal promo for Gardyn, the smart indoor hydroponic system that turns any kitchen into a high-tech vertical farm. It opens on the craving for fresh, pesticide-free produce, then reveals leafy greens and herbs thriving indoors with zero dirt and zero guesswork — powered by Kelby, the AI gardener that handles light, water, and plant health automatically. Built for busy households who want year-round harvests without a green thumb. It lands on social proof — 100,000+ Gardyners, six million plants sold — and the invitation to grow at home, now HSA/FSA eligible. Calm, fresh, and quietly futuristic.","subject":"indoor vertical hydroponic garden with leafy greens","audience":"Health-conscious home cooks and apartment dwellers who want fresh produce without outdoor gardening","tone":"fresh, optimistic, calm, modern","goal":"Make the viewer feel growing food at home is effortless — and ready to shop Gardyn","keyMessages":["All the benefits of growing your own food. None of the work.","Fresh, pesticide-free produce year-round","Meet Kelby, your AI gardener","100,000+ happy Gardyners","6,000,000+ plants sold","Now HSA/FSA eligible"],"mustIncludeFacts":["All the benefits of growing your own food. None of the work.","Fresh, delicious, pesticide-free produce at home, year-round","Meet Kelby, your AI gardener","100,000+ happy Gardyners","6,000,000+ plants sold","4.8/5 rating","Gardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible","100+ non-GMO plant varieties","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea"],"brandColors":["#2E5015","#2C3215","#17360E","#0D3427"],"suggestedFramePack":"organic-garden","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"warm organic ambient","voProfile":"female, mid-30s, warm and grounded, gently upbeat"},"script":{"title":"Gardyn Grows Food for You","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Craving fresh greens at home?","onScreenText":["Fresh greens?"],"visualDirection":"Extreme close-up of crisp leafy greens unfurling toward camera under soft glowing light with gentle rotation and sparkle on droplets.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"macro fresh lettuce leaves dew","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"All the benefits. None of the work.","onScreenText":["None of the work"],"visualDirection":"A soft wipe transforms a busy kitchen counter into a clean modern space as a tall vertical garden unit rises into frame with layered parallax.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"bright modern apartment kitchen empty","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":7,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Fresh, delicious, pesticide-free produce at home, year-round.","onScreenText":["Pesticide-free","Year-round","Zero dirt"],"visualDirection":"Slow cinematic orbit around the full Gardyn vertical unit packed with thriving greens and herbs standing proudly in a sunlit kitchen.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"indoor vertical hydroponic tower greens kitchen","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":11,"duration":4,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"Meet Kelby, your AI gardener. Handles light, water, and health.","onScreenText":["Meet Kelby","AI gardener"],"visualDirection":"Camera pushes in along glowing grow lights and healthy plant columns as a soft sparkle icon pulses beside subtle status indicators on the unit.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"sparkle","role":"inset"},{"type":"image","query":"closeup LED grow lights on plants","role":"background"}],"sfx":["pop","sparkle"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s5","start":15,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Over one hundred non-GMO plant varieties.","onScreenText":["100+ non-GMO"],"visualDirection":"A lively grid of assorted leafy greens and herbs slides and parallax past the camera on multiple depth planes in rich color.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"assorted fresh herbs basil mint parsley","role":"background"}],"sfx":["transition"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s6","start":18.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"One hundred thousand happy Gardyners. Six million plants sold.","onScreenText":["100,000+ Gardyners","6,000,000+ plants"],"visualDirection":"Large numbers count up and lock with a soft bounce while circular insets of smiling home cooks harvesting greens float into layered composition.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"happy woman harvesting indoor greens kitchen","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["ding","sparkle"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s7","start":22.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"