repinned":1,"problems":[]},"assetQuality":85,"templateFit":89,"qa":{"pass":false,"score":4,"skipped":false,"blockers":2}}},{"id":"tr8ytrk7kx","kind":"project","prompt":"","duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","quality":"1080p","width":1920,"height":1080,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"organic-garden","frame_pack_user":1,"status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":"/videos/tr8ytrk7kx.mp4","error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":61529,"llm_tokens_out":27908,"created_at":1784963649129,"started_at":1784963980579,"finished_at":1784964508164,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"task":null,"requeue_count":0,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://mygardyn.com","blogUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"horizontal","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"organic-garden"},"website":{"url":"https://mygardyn.com","title":"Gardyn: Hydroponic System - Growing Vegetables, Herbs & Flowers","description":"Discover our range of smart indoor hydroponic systems, perfect for growing fresh vegetables, herbs and flowers at home with ease.","headings":["All the benefits of growing your own food. None of the work.","Hungry for something better?","Hungry for something better?","Living better has never been so easy","A revolution recognized by all","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","Named Best of 2025","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","Named Best of 2025","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","How big is your appetite?","Meet Kelby, your AI gardener","Gardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible","100,000+ happy Gardyners and growing"],"bodyText":"Gardyns are now HSA/FSA eligible with Truemed! Shop now.\nShop All\nPlants\nHow It Works\nAbout\nSchools\nShop\nAll the benefits of growing your own food. None of the work.\n\nEnjoy fresh, delicious, pesticide-free produce at home, year-round. All made possible by our AI gardener.\n\nShop Now\n\n4.8/5\n\n100,000 households and growing\n\nAS SEEN IN\n\nA revolution recognized by all\n\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”\n\n2024 BIG Innovation Awards\n\nWorld's Top Green Tech Companies\nBest Invention of The Year\n“...the secret to my home grown produce.”\nNamed Best of 2025\nWinner 2023 World Changing Idea\n\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”\n\n2024 BIG Innovation Awards\n\nWorld's Top Green Tech Companies\nBest Invention of The Year\n“...the secret to my home grown produce.”\nNamed Best of 2025\nWinner 2023 World Changing Idea\n\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”\n\n2024 BIG Innovation Awards\n\nWorld's Top Green Tech Companies\nBest Invention of The Year\n“...the secret to my home grown produce.”\n6,000,000+ PLANTS SOLD\n\nOver 900 Reviews\n\n★★★★★\n4.8/5.0\nSee All \n\nFEATURED PRODUCTS\n\nHow big is your appetite?\n\nTwo ways to enjoy fresh, delicious produce at home year-round.\n\nShop Now\nHSA/FSA eligible\nGardyn Home\nMaximum harvest\nHouse\n3-4 people\n30 plants\nHSA/FSA eligible\nGardyn Studio\nThe perfect gift\nApartment\n1-2 people\n16 plants\nMEET THE PLANTS\nGrow what you love. Love what you grow.\nDiscover 100+ delicious, non-GMO varieties; from crisp greens and sweet tomatoes to flavorful herbs and tasty fruits.\nExplore 100+ Plants\nPINK SWISS CHARD\nA nutrient-packed, fully edible green with hot pink stems from Sicily, try it in salads or cooked like spinach.\nGREENS\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nMeet Kelby, your AI gardener\n\nKelby monitors your plants’ water, light, and overall health automatically, so all you have to do is harvest and eat.\n\nSee How It Works\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nGardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible\n\nThis exciting collaboration with Truemed allows you to use your Health Savings Account (HSA) or Flexible Spending Account (FSA) to purchase your Gardyn device and prepaid membership. By using pre-tax funds, you can save approximately 30% on your journey to better health.\n\nShop Now\n100,000+ happy Gardyners and growing\n\nHarvest happiness one bite at a time for a tastier, more fulfilling life. Join us.\n\n“For two years, Gardyn has been in my life, empowering me to elevate my diet with fresh, homegrown ingredients. I love its compact design and beautiful aesthetic.”\n\n— Gretchen\n\n“I love it and so does my family. I tell everyone that I meet and s","brandColors":["#8A5530","#714C31","#4D2F17","#322B13"],"ogImage":"https://mygardyn.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Studio-2-Thumbnail-930.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second horizontal promo for Gardyn, the smart indoor hydroponic system that grows fresh vegetables, herbs, and flowers at home with almost no work. It opens on the dream of pesticide-free produce year-round, then reveals a sleek vertical garden tower thriving in a kitchen, tended by Kelby — the AI gardener that monitors water, light, and plant health so you only harvest and eat. Aimed at busy households and apartment dwellers who want farm-fresh food without a backyard or green thumb. Closes on social proof — 100,000+ Gardyners, millions of plants grown — and the ease of getting started, now HSA/FSA eligible. Warm, alive, and effortlessly optimistic.","subject":"indoor vertical hydroponic garden with leafy greens","audience":"Busy urban households and apartment dwellers who want fresh produce without outdoor gardening","tone":"warm, fresh, effortless, optimistic","goal":"Make the viewer feel home-grown food is finally easy — and shop a Gardyn","keyMessages":["All the benefits of growing your own food. None of the work.","Fresh, pesticide-free produce at home, year-round","Meet Kelby, your AI gardener","100,000+ happy Gardyners and growing","100+ non-GMO varieties to grow and love","Now HSA/FSA eligible"],"mustIncludeFacts":["100,000+ happy Gardyners / 100,000 households","6,000,000+ plants sold","4.8/5 rating","Kelby monitors water, light, and plant health automatically","Pesticide-free produce year-round","Gardyn Home holds 30 plants (3–4 people); Gardyn Studio holds 16 plants (1–2 people)","100+ non-GMO plant varieties","HSA/FSA eligible with Truemed (save approximately 30%)","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea; Named Best of 2025; Best Invention of The Year"],"brandColors":["#8A5530","#714C31","#4D2F17","#322B13"],"suggestedFramePack":"organic-garden","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"warm organic acoustic","voProfile":"female, mid-30s, warm and inviting, unhurried with a soft smile"},"script":{"title":"Gardyn Makes Growing Effortless","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Fresh pesticide-free produce year-round?","onScreenText":["Pesticide-free","Year-round"],"visualDirection":"Lush green leaves slowly unfurl and fill the frame under warm golden light as the camera gently rises.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["riser"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"No backyard. No green thumb. No time.","onScreenText":["No backyard needed"],"visualDirection":"Quick cuts of a cramped city apartment windowsill and a busy counter with takeout, camera panning restlessly then softening.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"busy apartment kitchen small space","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Introducing Gardyn. Your smart indoor garden.","onScreenText":["Meet Gardyn"],"visualDirection":"Slow cinematic push-in on a sleek vertical tower overflowing with vibrant herbs and greens standing in a sunlit modern kitchen.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"vertical garden tower kitchen leafy greens","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s4","start":10.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Meet Kelby. Your AI gardener monitors water, light, and health.","onScreenText":["Meet Kelby","AI gardener"],"visualDirection":"Camera slowly circles the thriving tower as soft glowing status icons pulse beside healthy leaves and a friendly sparkle mark settles in.","assetNeeds":[{"