de-free produce at home, year-round. All made possible by our AI gardener.\n\nShop Now\n\n4.8/5\n\n100,000 households and growing\n\nLiving better has never been so easy\n\nReal food.\n\nEnjoy having fresh, delicious produce at your fingertips, year-round.\n\nTrust your food.\n\nNo pesticides. No chemicals. No harmful bacteria. Just pure food.\n\nNo green thumb needed.\n\nNo gardening expertise required. Gardyn growing is easy by design.\n\nNourish your body. And your soul.\n\nExperience all the benefits of growing your food at home.\n\nReal food.\n\nEnjoy having fresh, delicious produce at your fingertips, year-round.\n\nTrust your food.\n\nNo pesticides. No chemicals. No harmful bacteria. Just pure food.\n\nNo green thumb needed.\n\nNo gardening expertise required. Gardyn growing is easy by design.\n\nNourish your body. And your soul.\n\nExperience all the benefits of growing your food at home.\n\nReal food.\n\nEnjoy having fresh, delicious produce at your fingertips, year-round.\n\nTrust your food.\n\nNo pesticides. No chemicals. No harmful bacteria. Just pure food.\n\nNo green thumb needed.\n\nNo gardening expertise required. Gardyn growing is easy by design.\n\nNourish your body. And your soul.\n\nExperience all the benefits of growing your food at home.\n\nFEATURED PRODUCTS\n\nHow big is your appetite?\n\nTwo ways to enjoy fresh, delicious produce at home year-round.\n\nShop Now\nHSA/FSA eligible\nGardyn Home\nMaximum harvest\nHouse\n3-4 people\n30 plants\nHSA/FSA eligible\nGardyn Studio\nThe perfect gift\nApartment\n1-2 people\n16 plants\nMEET THE PLANTS\nGrow what you love. Love what you grow.\nDiscover 100+ delicious, non-GMO varieties; from crisp greens and sweet tomatoes to flavorful herbs and tasty fruits.\nExplore 100+ Plants\nPINK SWISS CHARD\nA nutrient-packed, fully edible green with hot pink stems from Sicily, try it in salads or cooked like spinach.\nGREENS\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nMeet Kelby, your AI gardener\n\nKelby monitors your plants’ water, light, and overall health automatically, so all you have to do is harvest and eat.\n\nSee How It Works\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nGardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible\n\nThis exciting collaboration with Truemed allows you to use your Health Savings Account (HSA) or Flexible Spending Account (FSA) to purchase your Gardyn device and prepaid membership. By using pre-tax funds, you can save approximately 30% on your journey to better health.\n\nShop Now\n100,000+ happy Ga","brandColors":["#132A15","#8B522F","#B5AF92","#0E3428"],"ogImage":"https://mygardyn.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Studio-2-Thumbnail-930.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second vertical promo for Gardyn, the smart indoor hydroponic system that grows fresh vegetables, herbs, and flowers at home with almost no work. It opens on the craving for real food — pesticide-free greens at your fingertips year-round — then reveals a vertical garden tower thriving indoors while Kelby, the AI gardener, quietly handles light, water, and plant health. Built for busy households who want pure food without a green thumb. It lands on the payoff: 100,000+ happy Gardyners, HSA/FSA eligibility, and an easy path to harvest and eat. Warm, alive, and effortless.","subject":"indoor hydroponic tower with leafy greens","audience":"Health-conscious home cooks and apartment dwellers who want fresh produce without outdoor gardening","tone":"warm, optimistic, effortless, fresh","goal":"Make the viewer feel home-grown produce is finally easy — and tap to shop Gardyn","keyMessages":["All the benefits of growing your own food. None of the work.","Fresh, pesticide-free produce year-round","Meet Kelby, your AI gardener","100,000+ happy Gardyners and growing","Gardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible","No green thumb needed"],"mustIncludeFacts":["100,000+ happy Gardyners and growing","Gardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible","Save approximately 30% with HSA/FSA via Truemed","Kelby monitors plants’ water, light, and overall health automatically","100+ non-GMO plant varieties","Gardyn Home grows 30 plants for 3-4 people; Gardyn Studio grows 16 plants for 1-2 people","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea","4.8/5 rating"],"brandColors":["#132A15","#8B522F","#B5AF92","#0E3428"],"suggestedFramePack":"organic-garden","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"warm acoustic organic","voProfile":"female, mid-30s, warm and unhurried, gently encouraging"},"script":{"title":"Fresh Food Without The Work","scenes":[