guidelines"}],"website_auth_wall":false,"usage":{"byStage":[{"stage":"script","model":"grok-4-5","inputTokens":3465,"outputTokens":5883,"totalTokens":9348,"callCount":1,"costUsd":0.016891},{"stage":"brief","model":"grok-4-5","inputTokens":9685,"outputTokens":1191,"totalTokens":10876,"callCount":1,"costUsd":0.010606}],"llm":{"inputTokens":13150,"outputTokens":7074,"callCount":2,"inputCostUsd":0.01052,"outputCostUsd":0.016978,"totalCostUsd":0.027498},"tts":{"inputChars":0,"inputTokensEst":0,"outputTokensEst":0,"callCount":0,"inputCostUsd":0,"outputCostUsd":0,"totalCostUsd":0},"external":{"openrouter_chat":2},"totalCostUsd":0.027498},"stage_timings":{"ingestMs":50713,"briefMs":31591,"scriptMs":489771},"last_requeue_at":1784976905951},{"id":"we8fs34dxw","kind":"project","prompt":"","duration":30,"orientation":"vertical","quality":"1080p","width":1080,"height":1920,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"hype-wave","frame_pack_user":1,"status":"failed","progress":null,"video_url":null,"error":"server restarted while job was in-flight","used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":0,"llm_tokens_out":0,"created_at":1784974410073,"started_at":null,"finished_at":1784976906171,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"task":null,"requeue_count":2,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://gumroad.com","blogUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"vertical","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"hype-wave"},"website":{"url":"https://gumroad.com","title":"Earn your first dollar online with Gumroad","description":"Start selling what you know, see what sticks, and get paid. Simple and effective.","headings":["Go from 0 to $1","We want you to try them, lots of them, and find out what works.","$1,992,651","Max Ulichney","Steph Smith","trendsvc","Daniel Vassallo","Unlimited possibilities","Don't take risks. That's scary!","Place small bets. That's exciting!","Share your work. Someone out there needs it."],"bodyText":"9.4K\nDiscover\nBlog\nPricing\nFeatures\nAbout\nGumclaw\nLog in\nStart selling\nGo from 0 to $1\nAnyone can earn their first dollar online. Just start with what you know, see what sticks, and get paid. It's that easy.\nStart selling\nSearch marketplace\n\nContribute or fork on \nGitHub\n\nSell anything\n\nVideo lessons. Monthly subscriptions. Whatever! Gumroad was created to help you experiment with all kinds of ideas and formats.\n\nMake your own road\n\nWhether you need more balance, flexibility, or just a different gig, we make it easy to chart a new path.\n\nSell to anyone\n\nGo from 0 to $1 and automated workflows.\n\nLet your customers pay in their own currency.\n\nChoose between one-time, recurring, or fixed-length payments in your currency of choice.\n\nSell anywhere\n\nCreate and customize your storefront with our all-in-one platform or choose to use your personal site instead. Seamlessly connect your Gumroad account to thousands of apps in your current stack.\n\nInstead of building a company...\n\n...start selling a side project!\n\nYou know all those great ideas you have?\nThe Gumroad Way\nStart Small\nGet Better Together\nLearn Quickly\nWe want you to try them, lots of them, and find out what works.\n\nYou don't have to be a tech expert or even understand how to start a business. You just gotta take what you know and sell it.\n\nFind out how\n$1,992,651\nThe amount of income earned by Gumroad digital entrepreneurs last week.\n\nI launched MaxPacks as an experimental side gig; but within 2 years those Procreate brushes were earning more than my 6-figure salary in CG. Leaving in favor of Gumroad enabled me to explore other aspects of my art, develop new hobbies, and finally prioritize my personal life.\n\nMax Ulichney\n\nSells Procreate brush packs\n\nFor years, I had a goal to develop 'passive' income streams, but struggled to make that a reality. Last year, I started selling informational products on Gumroad and since then have made $10k+ per month building products that I love.\n\nSteph Smith\n\nSells content tutorials\n\nOriginally, I took pre-orders for my Trend Reports on Gumroad. But I received... exactly $0. So I changed tactics: I made half of my report free, and the other half paid. Today, 99% of Trends.VC revenue is recurring in the form of annual and quarterly subscriptions.\n\ntrendsvc\n\nSells business insights and expertise\n\nI love Gumroad because it can't be any simpler. I upload a file, set a price, and I can start selling on the internet. The money I make from my sales lands directly in my bank account every Friday.\n\nDaniel Vassallo\n\nSells business insights and expertise\n\nUnlimited possibilities\n\nDiscover the best-selling products and creators on Gumroad\n\nblender\nmeditation\ncomic\nnotion template\ntextures\nprocreate\n3d model\nhypnosis\nmanga\ninvesting\nmockup\nbrushes\nspark ar\nsubliminal messages\nanime\ninstagram\nfont\nblender\nmeditation\ncomic\nnotion template\ntextures\nprocreate\n3d model\nhypnosis\nmanga\ninvesting\nmockup\nbrushes\nspark ar\nsubliminal messages\nanime\ninstagram\nfont\nart\nafter effects\neducation\nfitness\nsci-fi\nvrchat\nableton\ncertification exams\nvj loops\nworkout program\npoetry\navatar\nsample pack\nlearning\nluts\nyoga\nfiction\nassets\nsheet music\nart\nafter effects\neducation\nfitness\nsci-fi\nvrchat\nableton\ncertification exams\nvj loops\nworkout program\npoetry\navatar\nsample pack\nlearning\nluts\nyoga\nfiction\nassets\nsheet music\nreference photos\ncoloring page\nsingles\nprogramming\nkdp interior\nstock photos\nprintable\njazz\nwindows\nebook\nphotobash\nproductivity\ninstrumental music\ntheme\nlow content books\nreference photos\ncoloring page\nsingles\nprogramming\nkdp interior\nstock photos\nprintable\njazz\nwindows\nebook\nphotobash\nproductivity\ninstrumental music\ntheme\nlow content books\nDon't take risks.\nThat's scary!\n\nInstead of selling a book...\n\n...start by selling a blog post!\n\nPlace small bets.\nThat's exciting!\nShare your work.\nSomeone out there needs it.\nStart selling\nSubscribe to get tips and tactics to grow the way you want.\n→\nⒸ Gumroad, Inc.\nDiscover\nBlog\nPricing\nFeatures\nAbout\nGumclaw\nSmall Bets\nH","brandColors":["#ED89D8","#FD90E9","#E5B1D8","#965488"],"ogImage":"https://assets.gumroad.com/images/opengraph_image.png","hasRealScreenshots":1},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second vertical promo for Gumroad that tells creators they can earn their first dollar online starting with what they already know. It hooks on the jump from zero to one dollar, then races through the Gumroad way—sell anything from brush packs to tutorials, place small bets instead of big risks, and get paid. Social proof lands hard with nearly two million dollars earned by digital entrepreneurs last week. Energetic, loud, and inviting, it closes on the line that someone out there needs your work—and a clear push to start selling.","subject":"creators selling digital products online","audience":"Indie creators, freelancers, and makers who want to monetize knowledge or side projects","tone":"bold, electric, optimistic, loud","goal":"Make the viewer feel starting is easy—and tap Start selling on Gumroad","keyMessages":["Go from 0 to $1","Anyone can earn their first dollar online","Place small bets. That's exciting!","Sell anything—lessons, subs, files","Share your work. Someone needs it."],"mustIncludeFacts":["Go from 0 to $1","$1,992,651 earned by Gumroad digital entrepreneurs last week","Anyone can earn their first dollar online","Sell video lessons, monthly subscriptions, and more","Place small bets instead of taking big risks","Share your work. Someone out there needs it."],"brandColors":["#ED89D8","#FD90E9","#E5B1D8","#965488"],"suggestedFramePack":"hype-wave","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"bright pop electro hype","voProfile":"female, mid-20s, punchy, upbeat, street-confident"},"script":{"title":"From Zero to First Dollar","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Go from zero to one dollar.","onScreenText":["0 → $1"],"visualDirection":"A giant zero shatters into a glowing one-dollar bill that flies toward camera with electric spark trails.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact","riser"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Anyone can earn their first dollar online.","onScreenText":["Anyone can"],"visualDirection":"Camera rushes past empty desks as successive creator faces light up with first-sale notifications.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"young creators smiling laptop desk","role":"background"}],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Sell video lessons, subscriptions, and more.","onScreenText":["Lessons. Subs. Files."],"visualDirection":"Real Gumroad store UI in a browser frame scrolls through product cards that fly out and stack in 3D layers.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s4","start":10,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"Place small bets instead of big risks.","onScreenText":["Small bets"],"visualDirection":"Tiny glowing chips cascade into a neat pile while a massive locked vault door swings shut and fades.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"chip","role":"inset"},{"type":"image","query":"hands casually uploading file laptop","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s5","start":13.5,"duration":5,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Nearly two million earned by creators last week.","onScreenText":["$1,992,651","last week"],"visualDirection":"A massive counter races upward to the exact figure as confetti and creator avatars flood the frame.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"excited freelancers celebrating laptops office","role":"background"}],"sfx":["ding","sparkle"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s6","start":18.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"quote","voiceover":"Share your work. Someone out there needs it.","onScreenText":["Someone needs it"],"visualDirection":"A creator hits share; the artwork launches outward and lands gently in a smiling buyer's hands with heart particles.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"artist sharing tablet work closeup","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s7","start":22.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Your store. Your rules.","onScreenText":["Live in minutes"],"visualDirection":"Slow cinematic push-in across the real Gumroad dashboard UI floating in a browser frame, products stacking into view.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["click"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s8","start":26,"duration":4,"purpose":"cta","voiceover":"Start selling on Gumroad.","onScreenText":["Start selling"],"visualDirection":"Logo locks center over a pulsing Start Selling button; camera zooms hard into the glow as the frame fills with brand color.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["riser","impact"],"musicCue":"outro"}],"music":{"mood":"bright pop electro hype","query":"bright pop electro"},"voice":{"style":"female, mid-20s, punchy, upbeat, street-confident","pace":"brisk"}},"script_warnings":[],"website_screenshot":"C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\we8fs34dxw\\ingest\\website.png","website_screenshots":["C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\we8fs34dxw\\ingest\\website.png"],"website_images":[{"path":"C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\we8fs34dxw\\ingest\\site_images\\site_img_1.png","alt":"Sell anything feature illustration","width":968,"height":1214},{"path":"C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\we8fs34dxw\\ingest\\site_images\\site_img_6.png","alt":"Sell to anyone feature illustration","width":795,"height":838}],"website_bg":"#242423","website_dark":true,"website_title":"Earn your first dollar online with Gumroad","website_pages":[{"url":"https://gumroad.com/discover","text":"Discover"},{"url":"https://gumroad.com/blog","text":"Blog"},{"url":"https://gumroad.com/pricing","text":"Pricing"},{"url":"https://gu