s Tee"],"bodyText":"WANT MORE A24?\n\nGet our emails. Letters from our filmmakers, new trailers, podcasts, merch, and more. Not too often — just enough.\n\nEMAIL\nI understand that my information will be used in accordance with A24's Privacy Policy.\nBackrooms 2026\nThe Invite 2026\nTony 2026\nOnslaught 2026\nPrimetime 2026\nMisty Green 2026\nSHOP\nBackrooms Blu-ray\nSHOP NOW\nPODCAST\nGenuine Curiosity with Devonté Hynes & Thomas Bangalter\nLISTEN NOW\nSHOP\nSing Sing Screenplay Book\nSHOP NOW\nWATCH NOW\nThe Death of Robin Hood\nSHOP\nAAA24 Membership\nSHOP NOW\nPODCAST\nFunny Together with Olivia Wilde & Seth Rogen\nLISTEN NOW\nSHOP\nThe Invite Original Motion Picture Soundtrack\nSHOP NOW\nWATCH NOW\nMother Mary\nPODCAST\nBoth Peninsulas with Lee Sung Jin & David Chase\nLISTEN NOW\nSHOP\nAsync Research Institute Crewneck\nSHOP NOW\nSHOP\nNY Logo Hat\nSHOP NOW\nWATCH NOW\nThe Drama\nSHOP\nCap'n Clark's Tee\nSHOP NOW\nSHOP\nOn Location in New York City\nSHOP NOW\nJOBS\nSHOP\nAPP\nMEMBERSHIP\nTERMS OF USE\nPRIVACY POLICY\nDO NOT SELL OR SHARE MY PERSONAL INFORMATION\nMORE A24\nFACEBOOK\nTWITTER\nINSTAGRAM\nYOUTUBE\nWANT MORE A24?\nGet our emails. Letters from our filmmakers, new trailers, podcasts, merch, and more. Not too often — just enough.\nEMAIL\nTHIS WEBSITE IS NOT ENDORSED OR APPROVED BY, AND IS NOT IN ANY WAY AFFILIATED WITH, THE AMERICAN AUTOMOBILE ASSOCIATION, INC. (“AAA”).\nFilms\nTelevision\nDocs\nShop\nMembership\nNotes\nApp","brandColors":["#362615","#CFB88D","#492E1A","#CCAB75"],"ogImage":"https://atwenty-four.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/images/new-web-sharecard-every-film.jpg?w=1200&auto=compress%2Cformat&fit=crop&dm=1768430544&s=87326e843bc56f9ca2402380e835d0e5","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second vertical brand film for A24, the independent studio behind Everything Everywhere All at Once, Moonlight, Hereditary, Uncut Gems, Midsommar, Euphoria, and Beef. It opens like a premiere night — marquee glow, grain, a roll call of defining titles — then pivots to the next wave of 2026 films and the AAA24 membership world of merch, podcasts, and exclusive access. Made for cinephiles who chase the films that set culture on fire. Closes with an invitation into A24’s orbit: watch, join, go further. Dark, cinematic, and coolly confident.","subject":"cinema marquee lights and film posters","audience":"Cinephiles and culture-curious viewers who seek bold independent film and prestige TV","tone":"cinematic, cultish, cool, prestigious","goal":"Make the viewer feel A24 is the essential home of daring cinema — and want to watch or join AAA24","keyMessages":["The studio behind Everything Everywhere All at Once, Moonlight, Hereditary, Uncut Gems","Films and TV that define culture","New titles arriving 2026","AAA24 Membership — merch, podcasts, exclusive access","Films, television, docs, and more"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Studio behind Marty Supreme, Materialists, Everything Everywhere All at Once, Hereditary, Moonlight, Uncut Gems, Midsommar, Euphoria, Beef","Upcoming titles include Backrooms, The Invite, Tony, Onslaught, Primetime, Misty Green (2026)","AAA24 Membership"],"brandColors":["#362615","#CFB88D","#492E1A","#CCAB75"],"suggestedFramePack":"premiere-night","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"dark cinematic indie pulse","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, hushed, deliberate, trailer-cool"},"script":{"title":"A24 Sets Culture on Fire","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"These films set culture on fire.","onScreenText":["A24"],"visualDirection":"Marquee bulbs ignite one by one in extreme close-up, thick film grain, slow push into the glow.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"cinema marquee neon bulbs night","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact","riser"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":4,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"The studio behind Everything Everywhere All at Once.","onScree