 Agent does the work.","One search for everything.","Perfect notes, every time.","Bring all your work together.","Simple and powerful.","One source of truth for teams and agents.","Less tracking. More progress.","Trusted by teams that ship.","Get started today."],"bodyText":"Product\nSolutions\nResources\nDevelopers\nEnterprise\nPricing\nRequest a demo\nLog in\nGet Notion free\nWhere teams and agents \nCreate\n together.\n\nCapture context, find answers, and automate tasks with AI built for your team.\n\nGet Notion free\nRequest a demo\nPlay\n\nTrusted by 98% of the Forbes Cloud 100\n\nKeep work moving 24/7.\nCustom Agents\nAutomate repetitive work for your team.\n→\nQ&A agents\n\nAnswers questions instantly using knowledge you already have.\n\nTask routing agents\n\nAssigns, prioritizes, and routes tasks on its own.\n\nReporting agents\n\nSummarizes, writes, and sends reports for you.\n\nCreate your own\n\nMake a Custom Agent for any work that repeats.\n\nSee what Custom Agents can do\n \nTriage product feedback→\n \nResolve support tickets in Slack→\n \nRespond to security alerts faster→\n \nAutomate weekly reporting→\n \nCreate your own Custom Agent→\nAsk your on-demand assistants.\n \nNotion Agent\nYou assign the tasks. Notion Agent does the work.\n→\n \nEnterprise Search\nOne search for everything.\n→\n \nAI Meeting Notes\nPerfect notes, every time.\n→\nBring all your work together.\n \nDocs\nSimple and powerful.\n→\n \nKnowledge Base\nOne source of truth for teams and agents.\n→\n \nProjects\nLess tracking. More progress.\n→\nYour AI everything app.\nTrusted by teams that ship.\nUsing the most AI-native tools like Notion is an important competitive advantage for us to stay small while doing a lot.\nMichael TruellCo-founder & CEO\nNotion’s thoughtful design speeds up collaboration and decisions so we can deliver impact to our customers faster.\nRenee SolorzanoSr. Director of Product Design\nNotion Custom Agents help our team go beyond doing work with AI to building AI tools that do the work for them.\nBen LevickHead of Operations & Internal AI\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nGet started today.\nGet Notion free\nRequest a demo\nEnglish (US)\nCookie settings\n© 2026 Notion Labs, Inc.\nCompany\nAbout us\nCareers\nSecurity\nStatus\nTerms & privacy\nYour privacy rights\nDownload\niOS & Android\nMac & Windows\nCalendar\nWeb Clipper\nResources\nHelp center\nPricing\nBlog\nCommunity\nConnections\nTemplates\nPartner programs\nNotion for\nEnterprise\nStartups\nSmall business\nPersonal\nExplore more→","brandColors":["#CBE4FA","#C4DCF1","#B5C9DB","#94A7B9"],"ogImage":"https://www.notion.com/front-static/meta/teams-and-agents.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second vertical promo for Notion, the AI workspace where teams and custom agents create together. It opens on the drag of scattered docs, tickets, and endless busywork, then snaps to Notion capturing context, finding answers across every app, and automating the work that used to eat the day. Built for teams that ship—freelancers to Fortune 100. The arc lands on Custom Agents running 24/7 and a clear invite to get Notion free. Confident, modern, and fast without feeling cold.","subject":"team workspace app and AI agents UI","audience":"Product, ops, and knowledge teams who want AI to cut busywork and ship faster","tone":"confident, modern, productive, brisk","goal":"Make the viewer feel their team’s work can 