m experiences.\n\nBay Area\n\n4 locations →\n\nLos Angeles\n\n7 locations →\n\nSeoul\n\n6 locations →\nTartine Happenings\nSlide 1 of 3\n\nRise Each Day. Warm Every Table. Join Tartine\n\nJOIN TARTINE\n\nCraving Tartine but you don't live in SF or LA? We're thrilled to offer nationwide shipping through Goldbelly.\n\nORDER NATIONWIDE\nSPECIAL ORDER CAKES\n\nHave a special event coming up? We can help with that.\n\nPlease note that special order cakes require a seven day lead time.\nCLICK HERE TO ORDER YOUR SPECIAL ORDER CAKE - PICK-UP FROM TARTINE BAKERY @ 600 GUERRERO ST.\nPRE ORDER CAKES & TARTS\n\nClick the link below to pre-order a cake or tart.\n\nCLICK HERE TO PRE-ORDER CAKES & TARTS- PICK-UP FROM TARTINE BAKERY @ 600 GUERRERO ST.\nGift Cards\n\nYou can now buy a Tartine gift card online. You can send as a gift or treat yourself! Tartine gift cards can be redeemed at Tartine Bakery in SF, Tartine Manufactory, Tartine Inner Sunset as well as our 5 LA locations.\n\nBUY GIFT CARD\nTartine: Inside Stories, Chapter 3: Stewardship\n\nThe final exploration in the series. Watch Chapter 3 below:\n\nWHO WE ARE\nA thoughtful expression of modern craft.\n\nTartine began with a mission: bring bread with an old-soul into the lives of our friends and family in California.\n\nLEARN ABOUT US\n\n\"Fresh out of the oven, each loaf has a shell of blistered mahogany and an interior so chewy and preternaturally moist that it shimmers in the light\"\n\nVogue\nSlide 1 of 6\n\nBREAD BOOK Available for Pre-order\n\nTartine: A Classic Revisited on Amazon\n\nTartine All Day on Amazon\n\nTartine Bread\n\nTartine\n\nTartine Book No 3\n\nTartine at home\n\nIn 2010 we published TARTINE BREAD. The baking community was in shock that we would share our secret to the iconic Tartine Country Loaf. For us, the magic is in the endless thought and experimentation that goes into making each loaf; learning to push the boundaries of what we do, so more people can enjoy it.\n\nLocations\n\nNational Shipping\n\nAbout Us\n\nJoin Tartine\n\nPress\n\ninfo@tartinebakery.com\n\ninfo@tartinemanufactory.com\n\npress@tartinebakery.com\n\nFacebook\n\n / \n\nInstagram\n\nRise each day.\nWarm every table.\n\n2021 Tartine\n\nAll rights reserved\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nSite Map\n\nTerms of Service\n\nCLOSE\n\nLocations\n\nAbout\n\nOrder\n\nJoin Tartine\n\nPress\n\nCLOSE\nCHANGE LOCATION\nEACH\nDAY\nMADE\nEACH\nDAY","brandColors":["#261B16","#322928","#32231A","#4A362D"],"ogImage":"assets/tartine-share.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second vertical brand film for Tartine Bakery, the California craft bakery known for its blistered Country Loaf and warm community tables. It opens on steam rising from fresh bread and the daily ritual of bakers at work, then expands to the promise of modern craft — special-order cakes, nationwide shipping, and locations from the Bay Area to LA and Seoul. Built for food lovers who care how things are made. It closes on the motto Rise each day. Warm every table. Cozy, honest, artisanal morning energy.","subject":"fresh artisanal bread loaves and bakery","audience":"Craft-food lovers and urban bakers seeking warm, thoughtfully made bread and cakes","tone":"warm, artisanal, cozy, inviting","goal":"Make the viewer crave Tartine and want to visit, order, or ship a loaf home","keyMessages":["A thoughtful expression of modern craft","Rise each day. Warm every table.","Iconic Country Loaf with blistered mahogany crust","Bay Area, Los Angeles, and Seoul locations","Nationwide shipping and special-order cakes"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Thoughtful expression of modern craft through good food and warm experiences","Bay Area 4 locations, Los Angeles 7 locations, Seoul 6 locations","Nationwide shipping through Goldbelly","Special order cakes require a seven day lead time","Mission to bring bread with an old-soul into the lives of friends and family in California","Vogue: shell of blistered mahogany and an interior so chewy and preternaturally moist that it shimmers in the light","Rise each day. Warm every table."],"brandColors":["#261B16","#322928","#4A362D"],"suggestedFramePack":"daybreak-bakehouse","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"warm acoustic morning folk","voProfile":"female, mid-30s, soft and grounded, unhurried warmth"},"script":{"title":"Tartine Rise Each Day","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Steam rises from the crust.","onScreenText":["Steam rises"],"visualDirection":"Extreme close-up of a blistered loaf as steam curls upward, slow push-in through warm morning haze.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"steaming artisanal bread loaf closeup","role":"background"}],"sfx":["riser"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Hands that know the dough.","onScreenText":["Daily ritual"],"visualDirection":"Camera drifts past flour-dusted hands shaping loaves on a wooden bench in soft dawn light.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"baker hands kneading dough flour","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"The iconic Country Loaf. Blistered mahogany crust.","onScreenText":["Country Loaf","Blistered mahogany"],"visualDirection":"Hero product spin of the Country Loaf under soft side light, crust texture filling the frame.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"sourdough country loaf blistered crust","role":"background"}],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":10.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Interior so chewy it shimmers.","onScreenText":["As Vogue said","Shimmers in light"],"visualDirection":"A knife parts the loaf; camera glides across the moist interior catching morning light.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"sliced sourdough bread crumb closeup","role":"background"}],"sfx":["sparkle"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s5","start":15,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Old-soul bread for California families.","onScreenText":["Modern craft","Warm experiences"],"visualDirection":"Slow pan through a cozy bakery with community tables and soft morning patrons.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"cozy bakery cafe wooden tables","role":"background"}],"sfx":[],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s6","start":18.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Four Bay Area. Seven L.A. Six Seoul.","onScreenText":["4 Bay Area","7 Los Angeles","6 Seoul"],"visualDirection":"Location pins bloom across a warm map, then soft cut to sunlit bakery exteriors.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"sunlit bakery storefront exterior morning","role":"background"}],"sfx":["ding"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s7","start":22.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"Ship nationwide on Goldbelly. Cakes need seven days.","onScreenText":["Ship via Goldbelly","Cakes · 7 days"],"visualDirection":"A loaf gift box slides into frame beside a special-order cake as the camera orbits gently.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"packaged artisan bread gift box","role":"background"},{"type":"image","query":"decorated layer cake bakery counter","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s8","start":26,"duration":4,"purpose":"cta","voiceover":"Rise each day. Warm every table.","onScreenText":["Rise each day.","Warm every table."],"visualDirection":"Motto locks over a glowing table of bread and coffee; brand mark settles center with a soft pulse.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"family breaking bread wooden table","role":"background"}],"sfx":["riser","impact"],"musicCue":"outro"}],"music":{"mood":"warm acoustic morning folk","query":"warm acoustic morning folk"},"voice":{"style":"female, mid-30s, soft and grounded, unhurried warmth","pace":"calm"}},"script_warnings":[],"website_screenshot":"C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\expcg8ao9k\\ingest\\website.png","website_screenshots":["C:\\int