null,"requeue_count":0,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://mygardyn.com","blogUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"vertical","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"organic-garden"},"website":{"url":"https://mygardyn.com","title":"Gardyn: Hydroponic System - Growing Vegetables, Herbs & Flowers","description":"Discover our range of smart indoor hydroponic systems, perfect for growing fresh vegetables, herbs and flowers at home with ease.","headings":["All the benefits of growing your own food. None of the work.","Hungry for something better?","Hungry for something better?","Living better has never been so easy","A revolution recognized by all","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","Named Best of 2025","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","Named Best of 2025","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","How big is your appetite?","Meet Kelby, your AI gardener","Gardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible","100,000+ happy Gardyners and growing"],"bodyText":"Gardyns are now HSA/FSA eligible with Truemed! Shop now.\nShop All\nPlants\nHow It Works\nAbout\nSchools\nShop\nAll the benefits of growing your own food. None of the work.\n\nEnjoy fresh, delicious, pesticide-free produce at home, year-round. All made possible by our AI gardener.\n\nShop Now\n\n4.8/5\n\n100,000 households and growing\n\nLiving better has never been so easy\n\nReal food.\n\nEnjoy having fresh, delicious produce at your fingertips, year-round.\n\nTrust your food.\n\nNo pesticides. No chemicals. No harmful bacteria. Just pure food.\n\nNo green thumb needed.\n\nNo gardening expertise required. Gardyn growing is easy by design.\n\nNourish your body. And your soul.\n\nExperience all the benefits of growing your food at home.\n\nReal food.\n\nEnjoy having fresh, delicious produce at your fingertips, year-round.\n\nTrust your food.\n\nNo pesticides. No chemicals. No harmful bacteria. Just pure food.\n\nNo green thumb needed.\n\nNo gardening expertise required. Gardyn growing is easy by design.\n\nNourish your body. And your soul.\n\nExperience all the benefits of growing your food at home.\n\nReal food.\n\nEnjoy having fresh, delicious produce at your fingertips, year-round.\n\nTrust your food.\n\nNo pesticides. No chemicals. No harmful bacteria. Just pure food.\n\nNo green thumb needed.\n\nNo gardening expertise required. Gardyn growing is easy by design.\n\nNourish your body. And your soul.\n\nExperience all the benefits of growing your food at home.\n\nFEATURED PRODUCTS\n\nHow big is your appetite?\n\nTwo ways to enjoy fresh, delicious produce at home year-round.\n\nShop Now\nHSA/FSA eligible\nGardyn Home\nMaximum harvest\nHouse\n3-4 people\n30 plants\nHSA/FSA eligible\nGardyn Studio\nThe perfect gift\nApartment\n1-2 people\n16 plants\nMEET THE PLANTS\nGrow what you love. Love what you grow.\nDiscover 100+ delicious, non-GMO varieties; from crisp greens and sweet tomatoes to flavorful herbs and tasty fruits.\nExplore 100+ Plants\nPINK SWISS CHARD\nA nutrient-packed, fully edible green with hot pink stems from Sicily, try it in salads or cooked like spinach.\nGREENS\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nMeet Kelby, your AI gardener\n\nKelby monitors your plants’ water, light, and overall health automatically, so all you have to do is harvest and eat.\n\nSee How It Works\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nGardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible\n\nThis exciting collaboration with Truemed allows you to use your Health Savings Account (HSA) or Flexible Spending Account (FSA) to purchase your Gardyn device and prepaid membership. By using pre-tax funds, you can save approximately 30% on your journey to better health.\n\nShop Now\n100,000+ happy Ga","brandColors":["#AB7050","#734C2F","#8B5532","#936C4E"],"ogImage":"https://mygardyn.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Studio-2-Thumbnail-930.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second vertical promo for Gardyn, the smart indoor hydroponic system that grows fresh vegetables, herbs, and flowers at home with zero gardening expertise. It opens on the everyday hunger for better food, then reveals a living vertical garden of crisp greens and herbs tended by Kelby, the AI gardener who handles water, light, and plant health automatically. Built for busy households who want pesticide-free produce year-round without the work. Closes on social proof — 100,000+ happy Gardyners — and the easy path in: HSA/FSA eligible. Warm, organic, and quietly confident energy.","subject":"vertical indoor hydroponic garden with leafy greens","audience":"Health-conscious urban households and apartment dwellers who want fresh food without outdoor space or gardening skill","tone":"warm, organic, optimistic, calm","goal":"Make the viewer feel growing fresh food at home is effortless — and shop Gardyn now","keyMessages":["All the benefits of growing your own food. None of the work.","Fresh, pesticide-free produce year-round","Meet Kelby, your AI gardener","No green thumb needed","100,000+ happy Gardyners","Now HSA/FSA eligible"],"mustIncludeFacts":["100,000+ happy Gardyners","Kelby, your AI gardener monitors water, light, and plant health automatically","No pesticides. No chemicals. No harmful bacteria.","Gardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible with Truemed — save approximately 30%","100+ non-GMO plant varieties","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea","Named Best of 2025","4.8/5 rating"],"brandColors":["#AB7050","#734C2F","#8B5532"],"suggestedFramePack":"organic-garden","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"warm organic acoustic ambient","voProfile":"female, mid-30s, warm and grounded, unhurried natural delivery"},"script":{"title":"Grow Fresh Food Without Work","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Craving fresher food at home?","onScreenText":["Fresher food?"],"visualDirection":"Slow push-in on a plate of vibrant greens that dissolves into a sparse urban kitchen, building quiet longing.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"fresh salad greens plate closeup","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"No space. No time. No green thumb.","onScreenText":["No green thumb needed"],"visualDirection":"Camera drifts past wilted store herbs and a crowded apartment windowsill, energy low and constrained.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"wilted herbs grocery bag","role":"background"}],"sfx":[],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Gardyn brings a living vertical garden home.","onScreenText":["All the benefits.","None of the work."],"visualDirection":"Dramatic reveal of the tall Gardyn tower packed with lush greens and herbs, camera slowly circling it in a bright living room.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"vertical indoor garden tower leafy greens","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s4","start":10.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Meet Kelby, your AI gardener.","onScreenText":["Meet Kelby"],"visualDirection":"Soft light sweeps across the tower sensors as a gentle sparkle icon pulses beside thriving plants.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"sparkle","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s5","start":14.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"Kelby monitors water, light, and plant health automatically.","onScreenText":["Water. Light. Health."],"visualDirection":"Camera pans up the tower as water mist and lights adjust on their own, no hands intervening.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"thriving leafy greens indoor tower closeup","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s6","start":18.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Fresh, pesticide-free produce year-round.","onScreenText":["Pesticide-free","100+ varieties"],"visualDirection":"Hands harvest crisp lettuce and basil from the tower into a wooden bowl, camera tracking the motion.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"hands harvesting lettuce indoor garden","role":"