enu","Industries and Solutions","Integrations","Most Popular","Resources","Account","Email & SMS marketing minus the learning curve","Recommended for your business","See what’s working at a glance","Personalize every interaction","Grow your contact list","Switching is as easy as 1, 2, 3","Reach more customers with SMS","Discover new ways to drive sales","Send high-quality content with ease","Save time on repetitive tasks","Discover 300+ integrations","Count on award-winning support","Make Mailchimp work for you"],"bodyText":"___\nSkip to main content\n\nSave 50% for 12 months - limited time offer. Get started today.\n\nIndustries and Solutions\nIntegrations\nResources\nSwitch to Mailchimp\nSales: +1 (855) 998-5048\nPricing\nLog In\nMain Menu\nEmail & SMS marketing minus the learning curve\n\nDrive revenue with intuitive marketing analytics, automations, and AI tools.\n\nSign Up\nMailchimp has a four and half star rating\n\n*Based on 33,000+ reviews across\n\nRecommended for your business\nCustomize my experience\nReach more customers with SMS\n\nBoost results and use integrated SMS to reach your audience with the right message on the right device.\n\nLearn about SMS marketing\nDiscover new ways to drive sales\n\nUse AI-powered tools to create effective, targeted emails that turn shoppers into buyers.\n\nLearn about driving sales\nSend high-quality content with ease\n\nWith our drag-and-drop builder, AI-powered tools, and 300+ beautiful templates, designing emails is a breeze.\n\nSee our content creation tools\nSave time on repetitive tasks\n\nUse always-on automations to help drive revenue with less attention from you and your team.\n\nCheck out marketing automations\nDiscover 300+ integrations\n\nMailchimp seamlessly connects to the apps and platforms your business already uses.\n\nVisit the integrations directory\nCount on award-winning support\n\nEvery paid Mailchimp plan includes 24/7 live chat and email support. We’re here to help—around the clock.\n\nSee support options\nSee pricing\nMake Mailchimp work for you\n\nGot a second to answer a couple questions? We can personalize your visit with the info that matters most to you and your business.\n\nWhich of the following best describes your industry?\nSelect\nWhat are the top 3 things you want to achieve?\nSelect up to 3\nDrive sales revenue\nSave time with automation\nAttract more customers\nOptimize marketing performance\nSend SMS campaigns\nManage customer relationships\nDesign effective emails\nSwitch from another marketing tool\nNo thank you\nCustomize my experience\nBusinesses like yours are thriving with Mailchimp\nView all case studies\nRequest demo\nStart Free Trial\nTry our Standard plan for 50% off!\n\nSpend less to grow more with 50% off for 12 months, even if you change to our Premium or Essentials plans. Cancel or downgrade to our basic Free plan at any time.\n\nGenerative AI features\n\nActionable insights into audience growth and conversion funnels\n\nEnhanced automations\n\nCustom-coded email templates\n\nCustomizable Popup forms\n\nPersonalized onboarding\n\nSee all plans\n₹ INR\n$ USD\nStandard\n\nSend up to 6,000 emails each month.\n\nContacts\n0-500\n501-1,500\n1,501-2,500\n2,501-5,000\n5,001-10,000\n10,001-15,000\n15,001-20,000\n20,001-25,000\n25,001-30,000\n30,001-40,000\n40,001-50,000\n50,001-75,000\n75,001-100,000\n100,001-130,000\n130,001-150,000\n150,001-200,000\n200,001-250,000\n250,001-500,000\n500,001-1,000,000\n1,000,000+\n\nSave 50%\n\n₹\n575\n/mo for 12 months\n\n₹575 per month for 12 months\n\nThen, starts at ₹1,150/month†\nper month†\n\nBuy Now\n\n†See Offer Terms. Overages apply if contact or email send limit is exceeded. Learn More\ntooltip\n\nOne marketing platform to unite 300+ apps\n\nMailchimp integrates with hundreds of tools to help you save time and get more done.\n\nView all integrations\nQuickBooks Online\nSync real-time data between QuickBooks and Mailchimp\nCanva\nCreate custom designs in Canva and seamlessly share them\nSalesforce\nEasy to set up bi-directional sync with Salesforce\nStripe\nSync Stripe customer and order data\nSquarespace\nConnect commerce and website data to Mailchimp\nWooCommerce\nAccess powerful marketing features\nQuickBooks Online\nSync real-time data between QuickBooks and Mailchimp\nCanva\nCreate custom designs in Canva and seamlessly share them\nSalesforce\nEasy to set up bi-directional sync with Salesforce\nStripe\nSync Stripe customer and order data\nSquarespace\nConnect commerce and website data to Mailchimp\nWooCommerce\nAccess powerful marketing features\nMeta Lead Ads\nConnect leads from Facebook, Messenger, or Instagram\nSquare\nBring customer data and marketing tools together\nShop","brandColors":["#241D13","#524734","#353026","#302719"],"ogImage":"https://mailchimp.com/ctf/images/yzco4xsimv0y/1SB1jCYU95Dh5YDdrucTh0/add18363e44ff00d54254592c7c0860c/Intuit_Mailchimp_-_Wordmark_2023_-_Recirculation_.png","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second vertical promo for Mailchimp, the email and SMS marketing platform that removes the learning curve. It opens on the chaos of growing a business without a marketing system, then snaps into Mailchimp’s drag-and-drop builder, AI-powered campaigns, and always-on automations turning shoppers into buyers. Aimed at small-business owners and marketers who want revenue without complexity. Hits the limited-time 50% off Standard plan, 300+ integrations, and 4.5-star trust from 33,000+ reviews, then closes on a free-trial CTA. Loud, confident poster energy—big type, fast beats, impossible to miss.","subject":"email campaign on laptop and phone","audience":"Small-business owners, e-commerce sellers, and marketers who need simple email and SMS growth tools","tone":"bold, upbeat, confident, punchy","goal":"Make the viewer feel marketing is finally easy—and start a free Mailchimp trial","keyMessages":["Email & SMS marketing minus the learning curve","Drive revenue with AI, automations, and analytics","Save 50% for 12 months","300+ integrations and beautiful templates","4.5 stars from 33,000+ reviews","Get started free with award-winning support"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Save 50% for 12 months","4.5 star rating based on 33,000+ reviews","300+ integrations","300+ beautiful templates","Every paid plan includes 24/7 live chat and email support","AI-powered tools for targeted emails","Get started for free"],"brandColors":["#241D13","#524734","#353026"],"suggestedFramePack":"poster-pop","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"bold upbeat indie pop","voProfile":"female, mid-30s, bright and decisive, high-energy short lines"},"script":{"title":"Mailchimp Makes Marketing Easy","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Marketing chaos holding you back?","onScreenText":["Chaos?"],"visualDirection":"Chaotic papers and sticky notes explode toward camera then freeze mid-air with high energy.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"messy desk papers sticky notes closeup","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Complicated tools. Steep learning curves.","onScreenText":["Learning curve pain"],"visualDirection":"Slow push-in on a frustrated small-business owner rubbing temples at a cluttered laptop desk.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"frustrated woman laptop desk office","role":"background"}],"sfx":[],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Mailchimp: email and SMS minus the learning curve.","onScreenText":["Minus the learning curve"],"visualDirection":"Dramatic hero reveal of the real Mailchimp product UI in a browser frame, camera pushing in confidently.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["whoosh","pop"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s4","start":10.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Drag and drop. Three hundred plus templates.","onScreenText":["300+ tem