.notion.com/fi","text":"Suomi"},{"url":"https://www.notion.com/sv","text":"Svenska"},{"url":"https://www.notion.com/vi","text":"Tiếng Việt"},{"url":"https://www.notion.com/he","text":"עברית"},{"url":"https://www.notion.com/ar","text":"العربية"},{"url":"https://www.notion.com/th","text":"ภาษาไทย"},{"url":"https://www.notion.com/ko","text":"한국어"},{"url":"https://www.notion.com/ja","text":"日本語"}],"website_auth_wall":false,"usage":{"byStage":[],"llm":{"inputTokens":0,"outputTokens":0,"callCount":0,"inputCostUsd":0,"outputCostUsd":0,"totalCostUsd":0},"tts":{"inputChars":0,"inputTokensEst":0,"outputTokensEst":0,"callCount":0,"inputCostUsd":0,"outputCostUsd":0,"totalCostUsd":0},"external":{},"totalCostUsd":0},"stage_timings":{"ingestMs":39531,"briefMs":83452,"scriptMs":134358},"audio_notes":["Voiceover used the free fallback voice (paid TTS providers were unavailable) — the narration may sound different from your usual voice."]},{"id":"i0ngnwubt9","kind":"project","prompt":"","duration":30,"orientation":"vertical","quality":"1080p","width":1080,"height":1920,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"lantern-night","frame_pack_user":1,"status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":"/videos/i0ngnwubt9.mp4","error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":70042,"llm_tokens_out":22576,"created_at":1785125945682,"started_at":1785126613987,"finished_at":1785127095268,"client_ip":"::ffff:127.0.0.10","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"task":null,"requeue_count":0,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://obsidian.md","blogUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"vertical","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"lantern-night"},"website":{"url":"https://obsidian.md","title":"Obsidian - Sharpen your thinking","description":"The free and flexible app for your private thoughts.","headings":["Sharpen your thinking.","Spark ideas.","Sync securely.","Publish instantly.","It’s your time to shine."],"bodyText":"Download\nPricing\nSync\nPublish\nEnterprise\nCommunity\nAccount\nSharpen your thinking.\n\nThe free and flexible app for your private thoughts.\n\nGet Obsidian for Windows\nMore platforms\nWriting is telepathy\nEvergreen notes\nGraph of Writing is t...\nClippings\nDaily\nIdeas\nWriting is telepathy\nMeta\nProjects\nReferences\nEvergreen notes\nCalmness is a superpower\nTravel\nCreativity is combinatory u...\nEmergence\nRecipes\nBooks\nHealth\nWhat if it were easy\nTools\nSpecialization is for insects\nFirst principles\nPhilosophy\nA little bit every day\n1,000 true fans\nNotes\nWriting is telepathy\n#evergreen\n\nFrom On Writing\n\nIdeas can travel through time and space\n\nIdeas can travel through time and space without being uttered out loud. The process of telepathy requires two places:\n\nA sending place, a transmission place — where the writer sends ideas, such as a desk\nA receiving place — where the reader receives the ideas/imagery such as a couch, a comfortable chair, in bed\nQuote\nLook, here’s a table covered with red cloth. On it is a cage the size of a small fish aquarium. In the cage is a white rabbit with a pink nose and pink-rimmed eyes. On its back, clearly marked in blue ink, is the numeral 8. The most interesting thing here isn’t even the carrot-munching rabbit in the cage, but the number on its back. I never opened my mouth and you never opened yours. We’re not even in the same year together, let alone the same room... except we are together. We are close. We’re having a meeting of the minds. We’ve engaged in an act of telepathy.\n1 backlink\n206 words\n1139 char\n9:49\nJapan Trip Planning\n#projects\n#travel\nTo-do\nSchedule flights\nAsk for recommendations\n✓\nKeiko\n✓\nAndrew\nGarrett\nResearch ryokans in\nKyoto\nItinerary\n1\nYour thoughts are yours.\nObsidian stores notes privately on your device, so you can access them quickly, even offline. No one else can read them, not even us.\nYour mind is unique.\nWith thousands of plugins and themes, you can shape Obsidian to fit your way of thinking.\nYour knowledge should last.\nObsidian uses open file formats, so you’re never locked in. You own your data for the long term.\nFree without limits.\nDownload now\nSpark ideas.\n\nFrom personal notes to journaling, knowledge bases, and project management, Obsidian gives you the tools to come up with ideas and organize them.\n\nLinks\nCreate connections between your notes. Link anything and everything — ideas, people, places, books, and beyond. Invent your own personal Wikipedia.\n\nIn Meditations on First Philosophy the philosopher René Descartes describes a series of doubts about the nature of reality, arriving at the famous phrase:\n\n[[I thin]]\nI think therefore I am\nJust think about it\nThinking, Fast and Slow\n\nBooks/\nThe Thing\n\nMovies/\n\nHe argues that doubting requires thinking, and therefore, the act of thinking confirms his existence.\n\nGraph\nVisualize the relationships between your notes. Find hidden patterns in your thinking through a visually engaging and interactive graph.\nCanvas\nAn infinite space to research, brainstorm, diagram, and lay out your ideas. Canvas is a limitless playground for your mind. Learn more.\nLecture 1\n\nRationalists\n\nReason and innate knowledge → acquire knowledge\nFundamental truths and principles can be known independent of experience\nA priori reasoning\nReason and deduction\n\nEmpiricists\n\nExperience and sensory perception → acquire knowledge\nAll knowledge is derived from experience and observation of the external world\nA posteriori reasoning\nCogito, ergo sum\n\nIn Meditations on First Philosophy the philosopher René Descartes describes a series of doubts about the nature of reality, arriving at the famous phrase:\n\nI think therefore I am\n\nHe argues that doubting requires thinking, and therefore, the act of thinking confirms his existence.\n\nPhilosophers\nPlugins\nBuild your ideal thinking space. With thousands of plugins and our open API, it’s easy to tailor Obsidian to fit your personal workflow. Learn more.\nCommunity plugins\nCalendar by Liam Cain\nCalendar view of your daily","brandColors":["#8B4CF8","#6931C7","#341D59","#282831"],"ogImage":"https://obsidian.md/images/banner.png","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second vertical video introducing Obsidian, the private and flexible note-taking app. The video targets thinkers, researchers, and writers who feel overwhelmed by scattered ideas. It transitions from the chaos of disconnected thoughts to the calm clarity of Obsidian's local-first editor, showcasing the interactive Graph View and infinite Canvas. The narrative highlights absolute privacy, offline access, and open file formats, leaving the viewer feeling empowered to own their knowledge. The tone is deeply focused, intellectual, and serene.","subject":"a digital mind-map graph interface","audience":"Writers, researchers, and developers seeking private, structured note-taking","tone":"thoughtful, focused, calm, intellectual","goal":"Download Obsidian to build a private, connected personal knowledge base","keyMessages":["Sharpen your thinking by connecting your ideas","Your thoughts are yours, stored privately on your device","Visualize connections with an interactive graph view","Never locked in with open file formats"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Stores notes privately on your device","Access them quickly, even offline","Uses open file formats","Interactive graph view to visualize relationships"],"brandColors":["#8B4CF8","#6931C7","#341D59","#282831"],"suggestedFramePack":"lantern-night","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"calm focus-inducing electronica","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, warm, articulate, measured"},"script":{"title":"Obsidian: Own Your Thoughts","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":4,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Is your mind scattered across a dozen different tabs?","onScreenText":["Scattered thoughts?"],"visualDirection":"Camera slowly floats over a dark, chaotic web of disconnected words and floating notes.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","role":"background","query":"thoughtful writer desk nighttime laptop"}],"sfx":["transition"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":4,"duration":4,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Bring them home. Meet Obsidian, a private space for your thoughts.","onScreenText":["Meet Obsidian.","Your private space."],"visualDirection":"The chaos resolves instantly as the clean, dark Obsidian editor UI slides smoothly into focus.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":8,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Your notes are stored privately on your device. Fully offline.","onScreenText":["Stored privately.","100% Offline."],"visualDirection":"A stylized glowing shield icon appears, pulsing gently alongside local file directories.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","role":"inset","query":"shield"}],"sfx":["click"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":12.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Connect ideas together, and watch your thoughts form an interactive graph.","onScreenText":["Connect ideas.","Interactive graph."],"visualDirection":"The camera pans across a beautiful, glowing network of connected dots mapping out visual relationships.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["sparkle"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s5","start":17,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Built on open file formats, so you are never locked in.","onScreenText":["Open file formats.","Never locked in."],"visualDirection":"A neat grid of markdown documents slides into view, showing clean plain-text structures.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","role":"inset","query":"document"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s6","start":21.5,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Map out your biggest projects on an infinite visual canvas.","onScreenText":["Infinite visual canvas."],"visualDirection":"The camera pulls back to reveal a vast, zoomable canvas with i