hy":"Showcases open format proof with visual assets."},{"id":"s6","type":"glasscard","media":1,"why":"Shows the canvas interface via screenshot."},{"id":"s7","type":"glowcta","media":0,"why":"Closing call to action for the user."},{"id":"s4","type":"specrows","media":0,"why":"Lists features of the interactive graph."}]},"captions":[{"start":0,"end":4.050045,"text":"Is your mind scattered across a dozen different tabs?"},{"start":4.6,"end":9.6,"text":"Bring them home. Meet Obsidian, your private thinking space."},{"start":10.15,"end":14.65,"text":"Your notes stay private and fully offline on your device."},{"start":15.2,"end":18.65,"text":"Connect your ideas into an interactive thought graph."},{"start":19.7,"end":24.299999999999997,"text":"Built on open file formats, so you are never locked in."},{"start":24.85,"end":30.1,"text":"Map out your biggest projects on an infinite visual canvas."},{"start":30.65,"end":35,"text":"Download Obsidian today to build your personal knowledge base."}],"srt_url":"/videos/i0ngnwubt9.srt","final_attempt":"main","qa":{"pass":false,"score":6,"issues":[{"atSec":22.8,"severity":"blocker","issue":"Side-by-side squeeze layout (P2) on a 9:16 portrait frame. The two columns ('01 Themes' with 'Plain' card and '02 Wikipedia' with 'Obsidian: Own' card) sit left-and-right of each other, squeezing the content and making the text/images illegibly small.","fix":"Stack the two content blocks vertically. Place the '01 Themes' column on top and the '02 Wikipedia' column below it, utilizing the full height of the 9:16 canvas."}]},"quality_report":{"verdict":"flagged","flags":["QA: 1 blocker(s)"],"contrast":{"checked":true,"fixed":4,"remaining":0,"passes":0},"identity":{"remapped":0},"layout":{"duplicatesRemoved":0,"collisionsScrimmed":0},"assetFloor":null,"audio":{"lufs":-13.46,"peak":-0.15,"lra":3.4,"target":-14,"layers":{"voice":7,"sfx":6,"music":true,"ambient":false,"musicEnvelope":false}},"screenshots":{"kept":4,"dropped":0,"repinned":0,"problems":[]},"assetQuality":76,"templateFit":75,"qa":{"pass":false,"score":6,"skipped":false,"blockers":1}}},{"id":"ai5zauuuyo","kind":"project","prompt":"","duration":30,"orientation":"vertical","quality":"1080p","width":1080,"height":1920,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"hype-wave","frame_pack_user":1,"status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":"/videos/ai5zauuuyo.mp4","error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":58497,"llm_tokens_out":20828,"created_at":1785125948265,"started_at":1785127095321,"finished_at":1785127387515,"client_ip":"::ffff:127.0.0.11","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"task":null,"requeue_count":0,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://gumroad.com","blogUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"vertical","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"hype-wave"},"website":{"url":"https://gumroad.com","title":"Earn your first dollar online with Gumroad","description":"Start selling what you know, see what sticks, and get paid. Simple and effective.","headings":["Go from 0 to $1","We want you to try them, lots of them, and find out what works.","$1,992,651","Max Ulichney","Steph Smith","trendsvc","Daniel Vassallo","Unlimited possibilities","Don't take risks. That's scary!","Place small bets. That's exciting!","Share your work. Someone out there needs it."],"bodyText":"9.4K\nDiscover\nBlog\nPricing\nFeatures\nAbout\nGumclaw\nLog in\nStart selling\nGo from 0 to $1\nAnyone can earn their first dollar online. Just start with what you know, see what sticks, and get paid. It's that easy.\nStart selling\nSearch marketplace\n\nContribute or fork on \nGitHub\n\nSell anything\n\nVideo lessons. Monthly subscriptions. Whatever! Gumroad was created to help you experiment with all kinds of ideas and formats.\n\nMake your own road\n\nWhether you need more balance, flexibility, or just a different gig, we make it easy to chart a new path.\n\nSell to anyone\n\nGo from 0 to $1 and automated workflows.\n\nLet your customers pay in their own currency.\n\nChoose between one-time, recurring, or fixed-length payments in your currency of choice.\n\nSell anywhere\n\nCreate and customize your storefront with our all-in-one platform or choose to use your personal site instead. Seamlessly connect your Gumroad account to thousands of apps in your current stack.\n\nInstead of building a company...\n\n...start selling a side project!\n\nYou know all those great ideas you have?\nThe Gumroad Way\nStart Small\nGet Better Together\nLearn Quickly\nWe want you to try them, lots of them, and find out what works.\n\nYou don't have to be a tech expert or even understand how to start a business. You just gotta take what you know and sell it.\n\nFind out how\n$1,992,651\nThe amount of income earned by Gumroad digital entrepreneurs last week.\n\nI launched MaxPacks as an experimental side gig; but within 2 years those Procreate brushes were earning more than my 6-figure salary in CG. Leaving in favor of Gumroad enabled me to explore other aspects of my art, develop new hobbies, and finally prioritize my personal life.\n\nMax Ulichney\n\nSells Procreate brush packs\n\nFor years, I had a goal to develop 'passive' income streams, but struggled to make that a reality. Last year, I started selling informational products on Gumroad and since then have made $10k+ per month building products that I love.\n\nSteph Smith\n\nSells content tutorials\n\nOriginally, I took pre-orders for my Trend Reports on Gumroad. But I received... exactly $0. So I changed tactics: I made half of my report free, and the other half paid. Today, 99% of Trends.VC revenue is recurring in the form of annual and quarterly subscriptions.\n\ntrendsvc\n\nSells business insights and expertise\n\nI love Gumroad because it can't be any simpler. I upload a file, set a price, and I can start selling on the internet. The money I make from my sales lands directly in my bank account every Friday.\n\nDaniel Vassallo\n\nSells business insights and expertise\n\nUnlimited possibilities\n\nDiscover the best-selling products and creators on Gumroad\n\nblender\nmeditation\ncomic\nnotion template\ntextures\nprocreate\n3d model\nhypnosis\nmanga\ninvesting\nmockup\nbrushes\nspark ar\nsubliminal messages\nanime\ninstagram\nfont\nblender\nmeditation\ncomic\nnotion template\ntextures\nprocreate\n3d model\nhypnosis\nmanga\ninvesting\nmockup\nbrushes\nspark ar\nsubliminal messages\nanime\ninstagram\nfont\nart\nafter effects\neducation\nfitness\nsci-fi\nvrchat\nableton\ncertification exams\nvj loops\nworkout program\npoetry\navatar\nsample pack\nlearning\nluts\nyoga\nfiction\nassets\nsheet music\nart\nafter effects\neducation\nfitness\nsci-fi\nvrchat\nableton\ncertification exams\nvj loops\nworkout program\npoetry\navatar\nsample pack\nlearning\nluts\nyoga\nfiction\nassets\nsheet music\nreference photos\ncoloring page\nsingles\nprogramming\nkdp interior\nstock photos\nprintable\njazz\nwindows\nebook\nphotobash\nproductivity\ninstrumental music\ntheme\nlow content books\nreference photos\ncoloring page\nsingles\nprogramming\nkdp interior\nstock photos\nprintable\njazz\nwindows\nebook\nphotobash\nproductivity\ninstrumental music\ntheme\nlow content books\nDon't take risks.\nThat's scary!\n\nInstead of selling a book...\n\n...start by selling a blog post!\n\nPlace small bets.\nThat's exciting!\nShare your work.\nSomeone out there needs it.\nStart selling\nSubscribe to get tips and tactics to grow the way you want.\n→\nⒸ Gumroad, Inc.\nDiscover\nBlog\nPricing\nFeatures\nAbout\nGumclaw\nSmall Bets\nH","brandColors":["#ED89D8","#FD90E9","#E5B1D8","#965488"],"ogImage":"https://assets.gumroad.com/images/opengraph_image.png","hasRealScreenshots":1},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A high-energy, 30-second vertical promo for Gumroad designed to inspire creators and side-hustlers to monetize their knowledge. The video moves rapidly from the intimidating idea of starting a traditional business to the exciting reality of 'placing small bets' with simple digital products—like selling a blog post, a template, or a brush pack. It highlights real creator success stories and massive weekly platform payouts to build immediate trust, closing with a bold call to action to start selling and earn their first dollar online today.","subject":"digital products on a laptop screen","audience":"Creators, writers, designers, and side-hustlers looking to monetize their skills","tone":"energetic, encouraging, bold, fast","goal":"Inspire the viewer to sign up and launch their first simple digital product on Gumroad","keyMessages":["Go from 0 to $1 by selling what you know","Don't take big risks—place small bets instead","Sell anything from templates and tutorials to subscriptions","Get paid directly to your bank account every Friday"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Gumroad entrepreneurs earned $1,992,651 last week","Max Ulichney's Procreate brush side gig outearned his 6-figure CG salary within 2 years","Steph Smith made $10k+ per month selling content tutorials"],"brandColors":["#ED89D8","#FD90E9","#E5B1D8","#965488"],"suggestedFramePack":"hype-wave","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"electric high-energy pop","voProfile":"non-binary, mid-20s, enthusiastic, fast-paced, conversational"},"script":{"title":"Start Small Sell Big on Gumroad","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Forget big risks. Place small bets instead.","onScreenText":["Forget big risks.","Place small bets."],"visualDirection":"A bold split-screen contrasts a massive, daunting office building with a single sleek 3D coin landing on a minimalist grid.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"coin","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Go from zero to one dollar fast.","onScreenText":["Sell what you know.","$0 → $1"],"visualDirection":"A smooth camera push-in on a stylized laptop screen displa