2E1A","#CCAB75"],"ogImage":"https://atwenty-four.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/images/new-web-sharecard-every-film.jpg?w=1200&auto=compress%2Cformat&fit=crop&dm=1768430544&s=87326e843bc56f9ca2402380e835d0e5","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second vertical cinematic teaser for A24, the studio behind 'Everything Everywhere All at Once' and 'Moonlight'. Designed for indie film lovers and culture curators, the video builds hype for their upcoming 2026 slate—including 'Backrooms' and 'The Invite'—alongside exclusive AAA24 membership perks, podcasts, and limited merch drops. Set against a dark, moody theater aesthetic with golden marquee lights, the video moves with slow, high-tension cinematic pacing, inviting viewers to join the inner circle of modern cinema.","subject":"cinematic film strip and theater marquee","audience":"Indie film lovers, cinephiles, and pop culture curators","tone":"enigmatic, prestigious, moody, cinematic","goal":"Build hype for A24's 2026 slate and drive sign-ups for the AAA24 Membership","keyMessages":["From the studio behind Everything Everywhere All at Once, Moonlight, and Euphoria","Get ready for the 2026 slate including Backrooms, The Invite, and Onslaught","Go deeper with exclusive podcasts and screenplay books","Join AAA24 for ultimate insider access"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Everything Everywhere All at Once","Moonlight","Hereditary","Backrooms 2026","The Invite 2026","AAA24 Membership"],"brandColors":["#362615","#CFB88D","#492E1A","#CCAB75"],"suggestedFramePack":"premiere-night","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"moody cinematic synth","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, low-pitched, gritty, enigmatic"},"script":{"title":"A24 2026 Slate and AAA24","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"From the minds behind Moonlight, Hereditary, and Everything Everywhere...","onScreenText":["Moonlight","Hereditary","Everything Everywhere"],"visualDirection":"A vertical film strip glides slowly past a warm, glowing theater marquee in pitch darkness.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"vintage theater marquee lights dark cinematic","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact","riser"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":5,"duration":6,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Comes a new vision. Prepare for Backrooms and The Invite in 2026.","onScreenText":["2026 Slate","Backrooms 2026","The Invite 2026"],"visualDirection":"The camera slowly pushes down a tense, dimly lit yellow hallway that flickers ominously.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"empty yellow hallway liminal space","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":11,"duration":6,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Go deeper with exclusive podcasts and physical screenplay books.","onScreenText":["Exclusive Podcasts","Screenplay Books"],"visualDirection":"A slow, cinematic pan across beautifully bound black and gold books on a dark wooden table.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"aesthetic screenplay book dark moody lighting","role":"background"}],"sfx":["transition"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":17,"duration":6,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"This is more than movies. This is the ultimate insider access.","onScreenText":["Insider Access","AAA24"],"visualDirection":"A moody, low-angle shot of a person sitting alone in a dark theater, bathed in a gold glow.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"person sitting in dark cinema back of head","role":"background"}],"sfx":["sparkle"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s5","start":23,"duration":7,"purpose":"cta","voiceover":"Join the AAA24 Membership today.","onScreenText":["Join AAA24 Membership","Step Inside"],"visualDirection":"A bold, gold geometric logo resolves in the center of a dark, textured background with soft light rays.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"gold glitter textured dark background","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact","ding"],"musicCue"