tle":"The AI workspace that works for you. | Notion","description":"Build Custom Agents, search across all your apps, and automate busywork. The AI workspace where teams get more done, faster.","headings":["Capture","Find","Automate","Where teams and agents Create together.","AI where your team works.","Bring everything into one system of record.","Get answers, instantly—with citations.","Keep work moving 24/7 with agents.","See what Notion can do","Triage product feedback→","Resolve support tickets in Slack→","Respond to security alerts faster→","Automate weekly reporting→","Create your own developer tools→","Trusted by teams that ship.","Get started today."],"bodyText":"Product\nSolutions\nResources\nDevelopers\nEnterprise\nPricing\nRequest a demo\nLog in\nGet Notion free\nWhere teams and agents \nCreate\n together.\n\nCapture context, find answers, and automate tasks with AI built for your team.\n\nGet Notion free\nRequest a demo\nPlay\n\nTrusted by 98% of the Forbes Cloud 100\n\nAI where your team works.\n \nCapture knowledge\nBring everything into one system of record.\n→\n \nFind answers\nGet answers, instantly—with citations.\n→\n \nAutomate busywork\nKeep work moving 24/7 with agents.\n→\nSee what Notion can do\n \nTriage product feedback→\n \nResolve support tickets in Slack→\n \nRespond to security alerts faster→\n \nAutomate weekly reporting→\n \nCreate your own developer tools→\nTrusted by teams that ship.\nUsing the most AI-native tools like Notion is an important competitive advantage for us to stay small while doing a lot.\nMichael TruellCo-founder & CEO\nNotion’s thoughtful design speeds up collaboration and decisions so we can deliver impact to our customers faster.\nRenee SolorzanoSr. Director of Product Design\nNotion Custom Agents help our team go beyond doing work with AI to building AI tools that do the work for them.\nBen LevickHead of Operations & Internal AI\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nGet started today.\nGet Notion free\nRequest a demo\nEnglish (US)\nCookie settings\n© 2026 Notion Labs, Inc.\nCompany\nAbout us\nCareers\nSecurity\nStatus\nTerms & privacy\nYour privacy rights\nDownload\niOS & Android\nMac & Windows\nCalendar\nWeb Clipper\nResources\nHelp center\nPricing\nBlog\nCommunity\nConnections\nTemplates\nPartner programs\nNotion for\nEnterprise\nStartups\nSmall business\nPersonal\nExplore more→","brandColors":["#CBE4FA","#C4DCF1","#B5C9DB","#94A7B9"],"ogImage":"https://www.notion.com/front-static/meta/teams-and-agents.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A sleek, fast-paced 30-second vertical video showcasing Notion as the ultimate AI-native workspace. The narrative flows from the chaos of scattered apps to a unified system where teams and AI agents build, search, and automate together. Combining clean workspace UI mockups with bold, block-based motion design, it highlights instant answers with citations and 24/7 automation. It speaks directly to modern teams and startups looking to ship faster, closing with Notion's massive scale and a clear call to action to get started free.","subject":"AI workspace software dashboard UI","audience":"Modern product teams, tech startups, and knowledge workers looking to centralize docs and automate tasks.","tone":"efficient, authoritative, visionary, clean","goal":"Convince teams that Notion AI can centralize their knowledge and automate their workflows, prompting them to sign up.","keyMessages":["The AI workspace where teams and agents create together","Get answers instantly across all your apps with citations","Keep work moving 24/7 with Custom Agents","Bring all your knowledge into one system of record"],"mustIncludeFacts":["100M users in over 50 countries","62% of Fortune 100 use Notion","Over 50% of YC companies","G2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years"],"brandColors":["#CBE4FA","#C4DCF1","#B5C9DB","#94A7B9"],"suggestedFramePack":"story-blocks","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"minimal high-tech electronica","voProfile":"male, mid-30s, calm, articulate, confident"},"script":{"title":"Notion: The AI-Native Workspace","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Still searching through scattered apps?","onScreenText":["Scattered apps?","Lost knowledge?"],"visualDirection":"A grid of colorful app icons violently scatters outward as a dark central block expands in a sleek vertical layout.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"folder","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["whoosh","impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Meet Notion. The AI-native workspace.","onScreenText":["Meet Notion.","AI-Native Workspace"],"visualDirection":"A clean Notion workspace UI slides up smoothly, revealing a central search bar glowing with a soft blue accent.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["transition"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Get instant answers across all your apps, with citations.","onScreenText":["Instant Answers","With Citations"],"visualDirection":"A cursor clicks the search bar, typing a question, and a clean structured answer with superscript citations pops up.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["click","pop"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":10.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Keep work moving twenty-four seven with Custom Agents.","onScreenText":["Custom Agents","Work 24/7"],"visualDirection":"A split-screen block layout shows task cards moving across a kanban board automatically as a small robot icon pulses.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"robot","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["sparkle"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s5","start":14.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Bring all your knowledge into one system of record.","onScreenText":["One System","Of Record"],"visualDirection":"Blocks of text, tables, and documents slide from the edges and lock together into a single master dashboard.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"focused woman laptop notes desk","role":"background"}],"sfx":["transition"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s6","start":18,"duration":4,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Powering half of YC and sixty-two percent of Fortune companies.","onScreenText":["Over 50% of YC","62% of Fortune 100"],"visualDirection":"Two large block panels split the screen, displaying bold vector logos of modern startups and enterprise icons.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"office building","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["ding"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s7","start":22,"duration":4,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"With one hundred million users, it's G2's top-rated platform.","onScreenText":["100M+ Users","G2 #1 Knowledge Base"],"visualDirection":"A giant '100M' counter spins rapidly next to a G2 badge icon that shines.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"trophy","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["sparkle","ding"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s8","start":26,"duration":4,"purpose":"cta","voiceover":"Get started free today.","onScreenText":["Get Started Free","notion.so"],"visualDirection":"The camera pulls back to reveal the Notion logo centering over a clean white background with a glowing button.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["riser","impact"],"musicCue":"outro"}],"music":{"mood":"minimal high-tech electronica","query":"minimal tech electronic beat"},"voice":{"style":"male, mid-30s, calm, articulate, confident","pace":"conversational"}},"script_warnings":[],"website_screenshot":"C:\\internshi