DE SQUEEZE & ELEMENT COLLISION: The layout uses a multi-column side-by-side grid which is too squeezed for 9:16, causing the UI screenshot card to collide with and overlap the left 'Customer Stories' card, clipping the text ('Class IT strated ents').","fix":"Stack the content blocks vertically instead of side-by-side. Remove the overlapping UI screenshot or scale and position it below the text card with an explicit gap."}]},"quality_report":{"verdict":"flagged","flags":["1 screenshot(s) dropped by QA","QA: 3 blocker(s)"],"contrast":{"checked":true,"fixed":1,"remaining":0,"passes":0},"identity":{"remapped":0},"layout":{"duplicatesRemoved":4,"collisionsScrimmed":0},"assetFloor":null,"audio":{"lufs":-13.63,"peak":-0.11,"lra":3.6,"target":-14,"layers":{"voice":8,"sfx":6,"music":true,"ambient":false,"musicEnvelope":false}},"screenshots":{"kept":3,"dropped":1,"repinned":1,"problems":["error-page"]},"assetQuality":81,"templateFit":83,"qa":{"pass":false,"score":4,"skipped":false,"blockers":3}}},{"id":"ov72jrmewj","kind":"project","prompt":"","duration":30,"orientation":"vertical","quality":"1080p","width":1080,"height":1920,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"daybreak-bakehouse","frame_pack_user":1,"status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":"/videos/ov72jrmewj.mp4","error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":49691,"llm_tokens_out":15947,"created_at":1785129699212,"started_at":1785130389845,"finished_at":1785130607634,"client_ip":"::ffff:127.0.0.20","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"task":null,"requeue_count":0,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://tartinebakery.com","blogUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"vertical","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"daybreak-bakehouse"},"website":{"url":"https://tartinebakery.com","title":"Tartine Bakery","description":"Tartine is a thoughtful expression of modern craft through good food and warm experiences. We are a product of our communities and our friends.","headings":["Welcome to Tartine","Tartine Happenings","SPECIAL ORDER CAKES","PRE ORDER CAKES & TARTS","Gift Cards","Tartine: Inside Stories, Chapter 3: Stewardship","WHO WE ARE","A thoughtful expression of modern craft.","Tartine at home"],"bodyText":"Skip to Main Content\n\nCRAVING PIZZA?\n\nCLICK HERE TO MAKE A DINNER RESERVATION @ TARTINE MANUFACTORY\nLOCATIONSABOUT US\nNATIONAL SHIPPING\nORDER\nWelcome to Tartine\n\na thoughtful expression of modern craft through good food and warm experiences.\n\nBay Area\n\n4 locations →\n\nLos Angeles\n\n7 locations →\n\nSeoul\n\n6 locations →\nTartine Happenings\nSlide 1 of 3\n\nRise Each Day. Warm Every Table. Join Tartine\n\nJOIN TARTINE\n\nCraving Tartine but you don't live in SF or LA? We're thrilled to offer nationwide shipping through Goldbelly.\n\nORDER NATIONWIDE\nSPECIAL ORDER CAKES\n\nHave a special event coming up? We can help with that.\n\nPlease note that special order cakes require a seven day lead time.\nCLICK HERE TO ORDER YOUR SPECIAL ORDER CAKE - PICK-UP FROM TARTINE BAKERY @ 600 GUERRERO ST.\nPRE ORDER CAKES & TARTS\n\nClick the link below to pre-order a cake or tart.\n\nCLICK HERE TO PRE-ORDER CAKES & TARTS- PICK-UP FROM TARTINE BAKERY @ 600 GUERRERO ST.\nGift Cards\n\nYou can now buy a Tartine gift card online. You can send as a gift or treat yourself! Tartine gift cards can be redeemed at Tartine Bakery in SF, Tartine Manufactory, Tartine Inner Sunset as well as our 5 LA locations.\n\nBUY GIFT CARD\nTartine: Inside Stories, Chapter 3: Stewardship\n\nThe final exploration in the series. Watch Chapter 3 below:\n\nWHO WE ARE\nA thoughtful expression of modern craft.\n\nTartine began with a mission: bring bread with an old-soul into the lives of our friends and family in California.\n\nLEARN ABOUT US\n\n\"Fresh out of the oven, each loaf has a shell of blistered mahogany and an interior so chewy and preternaturally moist that it shimmers in the light\"\n\nVogue\nSlide 1 of 6\n\nBREAD BOOK Available for Pre-order\n\nTartine: A Classic Revisited on Amazon\n\nTartine All Day on Amazon\n\nTartine Bread\n\nTartine\n\nTartine Book No 3\n\nTartine at home\n\nIn 2010 we published TARTINE BREAD. The baking community was in shock that we would share our secret to the iconic Tartine Country Loaf. For us, the magic is in the endless thought and experimentation that goes into making each loaf; learning to push the boundaries of what we do, so more people can enjoy it.\n\nLocations\n\nNational Shipping\n\nAbout Us\n\nJoin Tartine\n\nPress\n\ninfo@tartinebakery.com\n\ninfo@tartinemanufactory.com\n\npress@tartinebakery.com\n\nFacebook\n\n / \n\nInstagram\n\nRise each day.\nWarm every table.\n\n2021 Tartine\n\nAll rights reserved\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nSite Map\n\nTerms of Service\n\nCLOSE\n\nLocations\n\nAbout\n\nOrder\n\nJoin Tartine\n\nPress\n\nCLOSE\nCHANGE LOCATION\nEACH\nDAY\nMADE\nEACH\nDAY","brandColors":["#261B16","#322928","#32231A","#4A362D"],"ogImage":"assets/tartine-share.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second vertical brand film for Tartine Bakery, capturing the sensory warmth of artisanal baking. The video opens with early morning golden light spilling over flour-dusted counters, transitioning to their iconic sourdough Country Loaf being sliced open to show its shimmering interior. Built for food lovers and neighbors in the Bay Area, LA, and Seoul, it highlights their philosophy of modern craft and daily connection. It closes with an invitation to visit their locations or order nationwide via Goldbelly, leaving viewers with a deep craving for fresh, warm bread.","subject":"fresh sourdough bread and morning pastries","audience":"Artisanal bread lovers, pastry enthusiasts, and local café goers","tone":"warm, artisanal, honest, comforting","goal":"Make the viewer feel the comfort of fresh baking and drive them to visit Tartine or order online","keyMessages":["Rise each day. Warm every table.","A thoughtful expression of modern craft through good food.","Our iconic Country Loaf, fresh out of the oven.","Visit us in the Bay Area, LA, and Seoul, or order nationwide."],"mustIncludeFacts":["Bay Area has 4 locations, Los Angeles has 7, and Seoul has 6.","Nationwide shipping is offered through Goldbelly.","Special order cakes require a seven day lead time."],"brandColors":["#261B16","#322928","#4A362D","#FDFBF7"],"suggestedFramePack":"daybreak-bakehouse","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"warm acoustic folk guitar","voProfile":"female, mid-30s, warm, intimate, unhurried"},"script":{"title":"Tartine Bakery Modern Craft","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":4.5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Rise each day. Warm every table.","onScreenText":["Rise each day.","Warm every table."],"visualDirection":"Slow, cinematic camera push-in on flour dusting a rustic wooden counter in golden morning light.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"flour dusted bakery counter morning light","role":"background"}],"sfx":["transition"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":4.5,"duration":5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Our iconic Country Loaf, fresh from the oven.","onScreenText":["The Country Loaf","Freshly Baked"],"visualDirection":"A baker pulls a steaming, deeply blistered sourdough loaf from a stone deck oven.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"video","query":"baker pulling sourdough bread oven","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":9.5,"duration":5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"A thoughtful expression of modern craft through good food.","onScreenText":["Modern craft.","Good food."],"visualDirection":"Extreme close-up of a baker's hands gently shaping soft dough on a wooden surface.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"baker hands shaping bread dough","role":"background"}],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":14.5,"duration":5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Special order cakes require a seven-day lead time.","onScreenText":["Special Order Cakes","7-Day Lead Time"],"visualDirection":"A beautifully frosted, elegant cake rotates slowly on a marble stand under soft window light.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"elegant frosted cake marble stand","role":"background"}],"sfx":["sparkle"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s5","start":19.5,"duration":5,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"Visit us in the Bay Area, LA, and Seoul.","onScreenText":["Bay Area: 4 Locations","Los Angeles: 7 Locations","Seoul: 6 Locations"],"visualDirection":"A warm, sun-drenched cafe interior with guests sitting at tables enjoying pastries.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"cozy modern cafe interior patrons","role":"background"}],"sfx":["transition"],"musicCue":"lift"},{"id":"s6","start":24.5,"duration":5.5,"purpose":"cta","voiceover":"Or order nationwide through Goldbelly. Taste Tartine today.","onScreenText":["Order Nationwide","Via Goldbelly","Visit Tartine"],"visualDirection":"A clean transition to a stylishly packaged pastry box on a kitchen table, landing on the Tartine logo.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"pastry box delivery kitchen counter","role":"background"}],"sfx":["ding"],"musicCue":"outro"}],"music":{"mood":"warm acoustic folk guitar","query":"warm acoustic folk guitar"},"voice":{"style":"female, mid-30s, warm, intimate, unhurried","pace":"calm"}},"script_warnings":[],"website_screenshot":"C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\ov72jrmewj\\ingest\\website.png","website_screenshots":["C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\ov72jrmewj\\ingest\\website.png","C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\ov72jrmewj\\ingest\\website_section2.png","C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\ov72jrmewj\\ingest\\website_section3.png"],"website_images":[{"path":"C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\ov72jrmewj\\ingest\\site_images\\site_img_0.jpeg","alt":"hero background","width":1580,"height":1053},{"path":"C:\\internship\\KEYFRAME\\server\\jobs\\ov72jrmewj\\ingest\\site_images\\site_img_1.j