ntroduces the brand with a warm hero image."},{"id":"s2","type":"feature","media":1,"why":"Showcases the iconic product with website context."},{"id":"s3","type":"statement","media":0,"why":"Provides a quiet, bold statement on brand philosophy."},{"id":"s5","type":"stats","media":0,"why":"Uses stats to prove the scale of locations."},{"id":"s6","type":"cta","media":0,"why":"Final call to action for nationwide ordering."},{"id":"s4","type":"montage","media":2,"why":"Displays the range of cake offerings visually."}]},"captions":[{"start":0,"end":4,"text":"Rise each day. Warm every table."},{"start":4.55,"end":9.1,"text":"Our iconic Country Loaf, fresh from the oven."},{"start":9.65,"end":14.05,"text":"A thoughtful expression of modern craft through good food."},{"start":14.65,"end":19.1,"text":"Special order cakes require a seven-day lead time."},{"start":19.65,"end":23.700045,"text":"Visit us in the Bay Area, LA, and Seoul."},{"start":24.65,"end":29.2,"text":"Or order nationwide through Goldbelly. Taste Tartine today."}],"srt_url":"/videos/ov72jrmewj.srt","final_attempt":"main","qa":{"pass":false,"score":4,"issues":[{"atSec":17.7,"severity":"blocker","issue":"Broken image placeholders (dashed boxes with generic image icons) are visible for 'Seasonal fruit' and 'Pre-order'. Additionally, the active images (a loaf of bread and a map) are completely off-topic for the headline 'Special Order Cakes'.","fix":"Replace the broken placeholders and off-topic images with four harmonized, high-quality photos of actual cakes that align with the 'daybreak-bakehouse' palette."},{"atSec":22.7,"severity":"blocker","issue":"Element collision on the location cards where the large numbers ('4', '7', '6') overlap and collide with the region labels ('BA', 'LA', 'SE').","fix":"Modify the stat tile component to place the number and region label inside a flex container with an explicit horizontal gap (e.g., gap: 12px) so they sit cleanly side-by-side."}]},"quality_report":{"verdict":"flagged","flags":["1 text element(s) still below WCAG AA","1 screenshot(s) dropped by QA","QA: 2 blocker(s)"],"contrast":{"checked":true,"fixed":0,"remaining":1,"passes":0},"identity":{"remapped":0},"layout":{"duplicatesRemoved":0,"collisionsScrimmed":0},"assetFloor":null,"audio":{"lufs":-14,"peak":-1.79,"lra":5.6,"target":-14,"layers":{"voice":6,"sfx":5,"music":true,"ambient":false,"musicEnvelope":false}},"screenshots":{"kept":3,"dropped":1,"repinned":0,"problems":["scene-mismatch"]},"assetQuality":85,"templateFit":88,"qa":{"pass":false,"score":4,"skipped":false,"blockers":2}}},{"id":"elgcs19wn3","kind":"project","prompt":"","duration":30,"orientation":"vertical","quality":"1080p","width":1080,"height":1920,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"organic-garden","frame_pack_user":1,"status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":"/videos/elgcs19wn3.mp4","error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":70186,"llm_tokens_out":24018,"created_at":1785129699528,"started_at":1785130607669,"finished_at":1785130950235,"client_ip":"::ffff:127.0.0.21","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"task":null,"requeue_count":0,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://mygardyn.com","blogUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"vertical","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"organic-garden"},"website":{"url":"https://mygardyn.com","title":"Gardyn: Hydroponic System - Growing Vegetables, Herbs & Flowers","description":"Discover our range of smart indoor hydroponic systems, perfect for growing fresh vegetables, herbs and flowers at home with ease.","headings":["All the benefits of growing your own food. None of the work.","Hungry for something better?","Hungry for something better?","Living better has never been so easy","A revolution recognized by all","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","Named Best of 2025","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","Named Best of 2025","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","How big is your appetite?","Meet Kelby, your AI gardener","Gardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible","100,000+ happy Gardyners and growing"],"bodyText":"Gardyns are now HSA/FSA eligible with Truemed! Shop now.\nShop All\nPlants\nHow It Works\nAbout\nSchools\nShop\nAll the benefits of growing your own food. None of the work.\n\nEnjoy fresh, delicious, pesticide-free produce at home, year-round. All made possible by our AI gardener.\n\nShop Now\n\n4.8/5\n\n100,000 households and growing\n\nLiving better has never been so easy\n\nReal food.\n\nEnjoy having fresh, delicious produce at your fingertips, year-round.\n\nTrust your food.\n\nNo pesticides. No chemicals. No harmful bacteria. Just pure food.\n\nNo green thumb needed.\n\nNo gardening expertise required. Gardyn growing is easy by design.\n\nNourish your body. And your soul.\n\nExperience all the benefits of growing your food at home.\n\nReal food.\n\nEnjoy having fresh, delicious produce at your fingertips, year-round.\n\nTrust your food.\n\nNo pesticides. No chemicals. No harmful bacteria. Just pure food.\n\nNo green thumb needed.\n\nNo gardening expertise required. Gardyn growing is easy by design.\n\nNourish your body. And your soul.\n\nExperience all the benefits of growing your food at home.\n\nReal food.\n\nEnjoy having fresh, delicious produce at your fingertips, year-round.\n\nTrust your food.\n\nNo pesticides. No chemicals. No harmful bacteria. Just pure food.\n\nNo green thumb needed.\n\nNo gardening expertise required. Gardyn growing is easy by design.\n\nNourish your body. And your soul.\n\nExperience all the benefits of growing your food at home.\n\nFEATURED PRODUCTS\n\nHow big is your appetite?\n\nTwo ways to enjoy fresh, delicious produce at home year-round.\n\nShop Now\nHSA/FSA eligible\nGardyn Home\nMaximum harvest\nHouse\n3-4 people\n30 plants\nHSA/FSA eligible\nGardyn Studio\nThe perfect gift\nApartment\n1-2 people\n16 plants\nMEET THE PLANTS\nGrow what you love. Love what you grow.\nDiscover 100+ delicious, non-GMO varieties; from crisp greens and sweet tomatoes to flavorful herbs and tasty fruits.\nExplore 100+ Plants\nPINK SWISS CHARD\nA nutrient-packed, fully edible green with hot pink stems from Sicily, try it in salads or cooked like spinach.\nGREENS\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nMeet Kelby, your AI gardener\n\nKelby monitors your plants’ water, light, and overall health automatically, so all you have to do is harvest and eat.\n\nSee How It Works\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nGardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible\n\nThis exciting collaboration with Truemed allows you to use your Health Savings Account (HSA) or Flexible Spending Account (FSA) to purchase your Gardyn device and prepaid membership. By using pre-tax funds, you can save approximately 30% on your journey to better health.\n\nShop Now\n100,000+ happy Ga","brandColors":["#724E32","#710C10","#8A572E","#302918"],"ogImage":"https://mygardyn.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Studio-2-Thumbnail-930.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second vertical social ad introducing Gardyn, the smart indoor hydroponic system that offers all the benefits of growing your own fresh food with none of the work. The video targets health-conscious urbanites and busy families who want pesticide-free produce year-round. It shows how the AI gardener, Kelby, automates light and water to eliminate all gardening guesswork. The ad closes with a compelling call-to-action highlighting that Gardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible, allowing buyers to save approximately 30% using pre-tax funds. The visual tone is lush, clean, vibrant, and deeply organic.","subject":"indoor hydroponic garden growing fresh vegetables","audience":"Health-conscious urban dwellers, busy families, and wellness seekers looking for fresh, pesticide-free produce at home without the hassle of traditional gardening.","tone":"warm, fresh, effortless, modern, organic","goal":"Inspire viewers to purchase a Gardyn system by making home-grown, pesticide-free food feel completely effortless and financially accessible through HSA/FSA savings.","keyMessages":["All the benefits of growing your own food, none of the work.","AI-powered gardening with Kelby automates water and light.","Enjoy fresh, pesticide-free, non-GMO produce year-round.","Now HSA/FSA eligible—save approximately 30% with pre-tax funds."],"mustIncludeFacts":["Gardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible with Truemed","Save approximately 30% on your journey to better health","100,000+ happy Gardyners","Discover 100+ delicious, non-GMO varieties","No pesticides. No chemicals."],"brandColors":["#724E32","#710C10","#302918"],"suggestedFramePack":"organic-garden","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"warm acoustic morning ambient","voProfile":"female, mid-30s, warm, conversational, reassuring"},"script":{"title":"Gardyn: Effortless Indoor Growing","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":4,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Love fresh food, but hate the work of gardening?","onScreenText":["Fresh food.","Zero work."],"visualDirection":"Slow camera push-in on a lush, glowing indoor vertical garden filled with vibrant green lettuce.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["sparkle"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":4,"duration":4,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Meet Gardyn. Fresh, pesticide-free produce year-round.","onScreenText":["No pesticides.","No chemicals."],"visualDirection":"A hand gently plucks a crisp, bright red cherry tomato from an indoor vertical branch.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"hand picking fresh cherry tomato indoor","role":"background"}],"sfx":["pop"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":8,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Kelby, your AI gardener, automates light and water.","onScreenText":["AI-powered","Kelby automates"],"visualDirection":"Clean UI overlay showing automated light scheduling over a time-lapse of growing greens.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"sparkle","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["click"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s4","start":12,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Discover over one hundred delicious n