uct\nSolutions\nResources\nDevelopers\nEnterprise\nPricing\nRequest a demo\nLog in\nGet Notion free\nWhere teams and agents \nShip\n together.\n\nCapture context, find answers, and automate tasks with AI built for your team.\n\nGet Notion free\nRequest a demo\nPlay\n\nTrusted by 98% of the Forbes Cloud 100\n\nAI where your team works.\n \nCapture knowledge\nBring everything into one system of record.\n→\n \nFind answers\nGet answers, instantly—with citations.\n→\n \nAutomate busywork\nKeep work moving 24/7 with agents.\n→\nSee what Notion can do\n \nTriage product feedback→\n \nResolve support tickets in Slack→\n \nRespond to security alerts faster→\n \nAutomate weekly reporting→\n \nCreate your own developer tools→\nTrusted by teams that ship.\nUsing the most AI-native tools like Notion is an important competitive advantage for us to stay small while doing a lot.\nMichael TruellCo-founder & CEO\nNotion’s thoughtful design speeds up collaboration and decisions so we can deliver impact to our customers faster.\nRenee SolorzanoSr. Director of Product Design\nNotion Custom Agents help our team go beyond doing work with AI to building AI tools that do the work for them.\nBen LevickHead of Operations & Internal AI\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nGet started today.\nGet Notion free\nRequest a demo\nEnglish (US)\nCookie settings\n© 2026 Notion Labs, Inc.\nCompany\nAbout us\nCareers\nSecurity\nStatus\nTerms & privacy\nYour privacy rights\nDownload\niOS & Android\nMac & Windows\nCalendar\nWeb Clipper\nResources\nHelp center\nPricing\nBlog\nCommunity\nConnections\nTemplates\nPartner programs\nNotion for\nEnterprise\nStartups\nSmall business\nPersonal\nExplore more→","brandColors":["#CBE4FA","#C4DCF1","#B5C9DB","#94A7B9"],"ogImage":"https://www.notion.com/front-static/meta/teams-and-agents.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A fast-paced, high-impact 30-second vertical video introducing Notion as the ultimate AI-native workspace. The narrative transitions from the chaos of scattered apps to a unified hub where teams and custom AI agents work side-by-side. Designed for modern teams, builders, and startups, the video uses bold color blocks to showcase key capabilities: instant cited answers, automated busywork, and custom developer tools. It closes with social proof of Notion's massive global scale and a clear call to action to get started.","subject":"software workspace UI on laptop screen","audience":"Modern product teams, startups, and developers looking to integrate AI into their workflow","tone":"efficient, collaborative, innovative, confident","goal":"Get teams to sign up for Notion and start building custom AI agents to automate their work","keyMessages":["Where teams and AI agents ship together","Get answers instantly with citations","Keep work moving 24/7 with custom agents","Bring everything into one system of record"],"mustIncludeFacts":["100M users in over 50 countries","62% of Fortune 100 use Notion","Over 50% of YC companies","G2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years"],"brandColors":["#CBE4FA","#C4DCF1","#B5C9DB","#94A7B9"],"suggestedFramePack":"story-blocks","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"punchy minimal tech-hop","voProfile":"male, mid-20s, energetic, clear, forward-leaning"},"script":{"title":"Notion AI Native Workspace","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Tired of scattered apps and siloed teams?","onScreenT