 clipped on the left, cutting off the first letters of the text (e.g., showing 'RTINE WAY' instead of 'TARTINE WAY').","fix":"Adjust the horizontal alignment, scale, or padding of the screenshot image within the tablet mockup container to prevent left-edge clipping."},{"atSec":29.6,"severity":"blocker","issue":"The screenshot image inside the tablet mockup is clipped on the left, cutting off the first letter of every line of text (e.g., showing 'ift', 'artine', 'he', 'atch' instead of 'gift', 'Tartine', 'The', 'Watch').","fix":"Adjust the horizontal alignment, scale, or padding of the screenshot image within the tablet mockup container to ensure the left edge of the text is fully visible."}]},"quality_report":{"verdict":"flagged","flags":["1 text element(s) still below WCAG AA","QA: 2 blocker(s)"],"contrast":{"checked":true,"fixed":0,"remaining":1,"passes":0},"identity":{"remapped":0},"layout":{"duplicatesRemoved":0,"collisionsScrimmed":0},"assetFloor":null,"audio":{"lufs":-14,"peak":-2.55,"lra":6.3,"target":-14,"layers":{"voice":8,"sfx":6,"music":true,"ambient":false,"musicEnvelope":false}},"screenshots":{"kept":4,"dropped":0,"repinned":1,"problems":[]},"assetQuality":83,"templateFit":85,"qa":{"pass":false,"score":6,"skipped":false,"blockers":2}}},{"id":"g3bzdzebt2","kind":"project","prompt":"","duration":30,"orientation":"vertical","quality":"1080p","width":1080,"height":1920,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"organic-garden","frame_pack_user":1,"status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":"/videos/g3bzdzebt2.mp4","error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":70761,"llm_tokens_out":24966,"created_at":1785215978721,"started_at":1785217779030,"finished_at":1785218258052,"client_ip":"::ffff:127.0.0.31","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"task":null,"requeue_count":0,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://mygardyn.com","blogUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"vertical","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"organic-garden"},"website":{"url":"https://mygardyn.com","title":"Gardyn: Hydroponic System - Growing Vegetables, Herbs & Flowers","description":"Discover our range of smart indoor hydroponic systems, perfect for growing fresh vegetables, herbs and flowers at home with ease.","headings":["All the benefits of growing your own food.None of the work.","Hungry for something better?","Hungry for something better?","Living better has never been so easy","A revolution recognized by all","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","Named Best of 2025","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","Named Best of 2025","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea","\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”","World's Top Green Tech Companies","Best Invention of The Year","“...the secret to my home grown produce.”","How big is your appetite?","Meet Kelby, your AI gardener","Gardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible","100,000+ happy Gardyners and growing"],"bodyText":"Gardyns are now HSA/FSA eligible with Truemed! Shop now.\nShop All\nPlants\nHow It Works\nAbout\nSchools\nShop\nAll the benefits of growing your own food.\nNone of the work.\n\nEnjoy fresh, delicious, pesticide-free produce at home, year-round. All made possible by our AI gardener.\n\nShop Now\n\n4.8/5\n\n100,000 households and growing\n\nAS SEEN IN\n\nA revolution recognized by all\n\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”\n\n2024 BIG Innovation Awards\n\nWorld's Top Green Tech Companies\nBest Invention of The Year\n“...the secret to my home grown produce.”\nNamed Best of 2025\nWinner 2023 World Changing Idea\n\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”\n\n2024 BIG Innovation Awards\n\nWorld's Top Green Tech Companies\nBest Invention of The Year\n“...the secret to my home grown produce.”\nNamed Best of 2025\nWinner 2023 World Changing Idea\n\"...a high-tech vertical farm for your kitchen.”\n\n2024 BIG Innovation Awards\n\nWorld's Top Green Tech Companies\nBest Invention of The Year\n“...the secret to my home grown produce.”\n6,000,000+ PLANTS SOLD\n\nOver 900 Reviews\n\n★★★★★\n4.8/5.0\nSee All \n\nFEATURED PRODUCTS\n\nHow big is your appetite?\n\nTwo ways to enjoy fresh, delicious produce at home year-round.\n\nShop Now\nHSA/FSA eligible\nGardyn Home\nMaximum harvest\nHouse\n3-4 people\n30 plants\nHSA/FSA eligible\nGardyn Studio\nThe perfect gift\nApartment\n1-2 people\n16 plants\nMEET THE PLANTS\nGrow what you love. Love what you grow.\nDiscover 100+ delicious, non-GMO varieties; from crisp greens and sweet tomatoes to flavorful herbs and tasty fruits.\nExplore 100+ Plants\nPINK SWISS CHARD\nA nutrient-packed, fully edible green with hot pink stems from Sicily, try it in salads or cooked like spinach.\nGREENS\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n\nMeet Kelby, your AI gardener\n\nKelby monitors your plants’ water, light, and overall health automatically, so all you have to do is harvest and eat.\n\nSee How It Works\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nPlant care that never sleeps\n\nGardyn automatically manages light and water scheduling, for strong plants without guesswork – no green thumb needed.\n\nSmart growing powered by Kelby\n\nCameras and sensors monitor your Gardyn. Kelby, your smart gardening assistant, personalizes your care plan to help your plants thrive.\n\nExpert plant help, at your fingertips\n\nThe Gardyn app keeps you updated with real-time alerts and harvest reminders, so you know exactly when to pick, taste, and enjoy.\n\nGardyn is now HSA/FSA eligible\n\nThis exciting collaboration with Truemed allows you to use your Health Savings Account (HSA) or Flexible Spending Account (FSA) to purchase your Gardyn device and prepaid membership. By using pre-tax funds, you can save approximately 30% on your journey to better health.\n\nShop Now\n100,000+ happy Gardyners and growing\n\nHarvest happiness one bite at a time for a tastier, more fulfilling life. Join us.\n\n“For two years, Gardyn has been in my life, empowering me to elevate my diet with fresh, homegrown ingredients. I love its compact design and beautiful aesthetic.”\n\n— Gretchen\n\n“I love it and so does my family. I tell everyone that I meet and s","brandColors":["#4E520B","#2D1711","#907052","#0B3628"],"ogImage":"https://mygardyn.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Studio-2-Thumbnail-930.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second vertical promo for Gardyn, the smart indoor hydroponic system that grows fresh vegetables, herbs, and flowers at home with almost no effort. It opens on the desire for pesticide-free, year-round harvests, then reveals a vertical kitchen garden tended by Kelby, the AI gardener that monitors water, light, and plant health so you only harvest and eat. Aimed at busy households hungry for better food without outdoor gardening. Closes on social proof — 100,000+ Gardyners, millions of plants sold — and the easy next step to shop, including HSA/FSA eligibility. Warm, fresh, and quietly high-tech.","subject":"indoor hydroponic tower with leafy greens","audience":"Home cooks and apartment dwellers who want fresh produce without outdoor gardening","tone":"warm, fresh, inviting, quietly premium","goal":"Make the viewer crave effortless home-grown food and tap to shop Gardyn","keyMessages":["All the benefits of growing your own food — none of the work","Fresh, pesticide-free produce year-round","Meet Kelby, your AI gardener","100,000+ happy Gardyners and growing","6,000,000+ plants sold","Now HSA/FSA eligible"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Smart indoor hydroponic systems for vegetables, herbs, and flowers","Kelby, AI gardener that monitors water, light, and plant health","100,000+ households / happy Gardyners","6,000,000+ plants sold","4.8/5 rating from over 900 reviews","100+ non-GMO plant varieties","Gardyn Home grows 30 plants for 3–4 people; Gardyn Studio grows 16 for 1–2","HSA/FSA eligible with Truemed; save approximately 30% with pre-tax funds","Pesticide-free produce year-round","Winner 2023 World Changing Idea; Named Best of 2025"],"brandColors":["#4E520B","#2D1711","#907052","#0B3628"],"suggestedFramePack":"organic-garden","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"warm organic acoustic","voProfile":"female, mid-30s, warm and grounded, gently upbeat"},"script":{"title":"Gardyn Grows Dinner Effortlessly","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Crave pesticide-free produce year-round?","onScreenText":["Pesticide-free. Year-round."],"visualDirection":"Tight slow push-in on glistening leafy greens beaded with water, lush and appetizing.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"fresh leafy greens water droplets closeup","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"All the benefits of growing, none of the work.","onScreenText":["Grow. Without the work."],"visualDirection":"Camera drifts through a warm apartment kitchen past a glowing vertical garden tucked beside the counter.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"apartment kitchen vertical garden corner","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Gardyn grows veggies, herbs, and flowers indoors.","onScreenText":["Smart indoor hydroponics"],"visualDirection":"Hero reveal of the full Gardyn tower turning slowly as layered leaves catch soft morning light.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"indoor hydroponic tower leafy greens","role":"background"}],"sfx":["swoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s4","start":10.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Kelby, your AI gardener, tends water, light, and health.","onScreenText":["Meet Kelby","AI gardener"],"visualDirection":"Soft status lights pulse up the tower while clean icon tiles for water, light, and leaf health orbit into frame.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"icon","query":"droplet","role":"inset"},{"type":"icon","query":"leaf","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["pop","sparkle"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s5","start":14.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"Just harvest and eat. Thirty plants at home.","onScreenText":["Home: 30 plants","Studio: 16 plants"],"visualDirection":"Hands snip fresh lettuce from the tower as plant-count labels float up and settle beside two tower sizes.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"hands harvesting lettuce indoor garden","role":"background"}],"sfx":["click"],"musicCue":"steady"},{"id":"s6","start":18,"duration":4,"purpose":"proof","voiceover":"A hundred thousand Gardyners. Six million plants sold.","onScreenText":["100,000+ Gardyners","6,000,000+ plants"],"visualDirection":"Bold counters race upward over a warm montage of households picking herbs and greens at home.","assetNe