y on a cream background.","fix":"Swap the color of the '$1' text element at 0.6s to the dark blue/black token to match its appearance at 1.7s."},{"atSec":21,"severity":"minor","issue":"Massive empty space at the bottom half of the frame (editorial whitespace archetype).","fix":"This is an intentional template style, but could be improved by slightly raising the bottom decorative elements or scaling up the main text block."}]},"quality_report":{"verdict":"flagged","flags":["1 text element(s) still below WCAG AA","QA: 2 blocker(s)"],"contrast":{"checked":true,"fixed":12,"remaining":1,"passes":2},"identity":{"remapped":0},"layout":{"duplicatesRemoved":0,"collisionsScrimmed":0},"assetFloor":null,"audio":{"lufs":-14.57,"peak":0.02,"lra":2.6,"target":-14,"layers":{"voice":9,"sfx":7,"music":true,"ambient":false,"musicEnvelope":false}},"screenshots":{"kept":4,"dropped":0,"repinned":1,"problems":[]},"assetQuality":87,"templateFit":88,"qa":{"pass":false,"score":4,"skipped":false,"blockers":2}}},{"id":"16cg493zy5","kind":"project","prompt":"","duration":30,"orientation":"vertical","quality":"1080p","width":1080,"height":1920,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"poster-pop","frame_pack_user":1,"status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":"/videos/16cg493zy5.mp4","error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":70421,"llm_tokens_out":19666,"created_at":1785215979487,"started_at":1785219481185,"finished_at":1785219752759,"client_ip":"::ffff:127.0.0.34","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"task":null,"requeue_count":0,"intent":{"prompt":"","websiteUrl":"https://mailchimp.com","blogUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"vertical","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"poster-pop"},"website":{"url":"https://mailchimp.com","title":"Email & SMS Marketing Platform | Mailchimp","description":"Utilize real-time user behavior data and artificial intelligence to convert more customers. Easy to use, get started for free!","headings":["Industries and Solutions","Integrations","Most Popular","Most Popular","Resources","Account","Main Menu","Industries and Solutions","Integrations","Most Popular","Resources","Account","Email & SMS marketing minus the learning curve","Recommended for your business","See what’s working at a glance","Personalize every interaction","Grow your contact list","Switching is as easy as 1, 2, 3","Reach more customers with SMS","Discover new ways to drive sales","Send high-quality content with ease","Save time on repetitive tasks","Discover 300+ integrations","Count on award-winning support","Make Mailchimp work for you"],"bodyText":"___\nSkip to main content\n\nSave 50% for 12 months - limited time offer. Get started today.\n\nIndustries and Solutions\nIntegrations\nResources\nSwitch to Mailchimp\nSales: +1 (855) 531-0892\nPricing\nLog In\nMain Menu\nEmail & SMS marketing minus the learning curve\n\nDrive revenue with intuitive marketing analytics, automations, and AI tools.\n\nSign Up\nMailchimp has a four and half star rating\n\n*Based on 33,000+ reviews across\n\nRecommended for your business\nCustomize my experience\nReach more customers with SMS\n\nBoost results and use integrated SMS to reach your audience with the right message on the right device.\n\nLearn about SMS marketing\nDiscover new ways to drive sales\n\nUse AI-powered tools to create effective, targeted emails that turn shoppers into buyers.\n\nLearn about driving sales\nSend high-quality content with ease\n\nWith our drag-and-drop builder, AI-powered tools, and 300+ beautiful templates, designing emails is a breeze.\n\nSee our content creation tools\nSave time on repetitive tasks\n\nUse always-on automations to help drive revenue with less attention from you and your team.\n\nCheck out marketing automations\nDiscover 300+ integrations\n\nMailchimp seamlessly connects to the apps and platforms your business already uses.\n\nVisit the integrations directory\nCount on award-winning support\n\nEvery paid Mailchimp plan includes 24/7 live chat and email support. We’re here to help—around the clock.\n\nSee support options\nSee pricing\nMake Mailchimp work for you\n\nGot a second to answer a couple questions? We can personalize your visit with the info that matters most to you and your business.\n\nWhich of the following best describes your industry?\nSelect\nWhat are the top 3 things you want to achieve?\nSelect up to 3\nDrive sales revenue\nSave time with automation\nAttract more customers\nOptimize marketing performance\nSend SMS campaigns\nManage customer relationships\nDesign effective emails\nSwitch from another marketing tool\nNo thank you\nCustomize my experience\nBusinesses like yours are thriving with Mailchimp\nView all case studies\nRequest demo\nStart Free Trial\nTry our Standard plan for 50% off!\n\nSpend less to grow more with 50% off for 12 months, even if you change to our Premium or Essentials plans. Cancel or downgrade to our basic Free plan at any time.\n\nGenerative AI features\n\nActionable insights into audience growth and conversion funnels\n\nEnhanced automations\n\nCustom-coded email templates\n\nCustomizable Popup forms\n\nPersonalized onboarding\n\nSee all plans\n₹ INR\n$ USD\nStandard\n\nSend up to 6,000 emails each month.\n\nContacts\n0-500\n501-1,500\n1,501-2,500\n2,501-5,000\n5,001-10,000\n10,001-15,000\n15,001-20,000\n20,001-25,000\n25,001-30,000\n30,001-40,000\n40,001-50,000\n50,001-75,000\n75,001-100,000\n100,001-130,000\n130,001-150,000\n150,001-200,000\n200,001-250,000\n250,001-500,000\n500,001-1,000,000\n1,000,000+\n\nSave 50%\n\n₹\n575\n/mo for 12 months\n\n₹575 per month for 12 months\n\nThen, starts at ₹1,150/month†\nper month†\n\nBuy Now\n\n†See Offer Terms. Overages apply if contact or email send limit is exceeded. Learn More\ntooltip\n\nOne marketing platform to unite 300+ apps\n\nMailchimp integrates with hundreds of tools to help you save time and get more done.\n\nView all integrations\nQuickBooks Online\nSync real-time data between QuickBooks and Mailchimp\nCanva\nCreate custom designs in Canva and seamlessly share them\nSalesforce\nEasy to set up bi-directional sync with Salesforce\nStripe\nSync Stripe customer and order data\nSquarespace\nConnect commerce and website data to Mailchimp\nWooCommerce\nAccess powerful marketing features\nQuickBooks Online\nSync real-time data between QuickBooks and Mailchimp\nCanva\nCreate custom designs in Canva and seamlessly share them\nSalesforce\nEasy to set up bi-directional sync with Salesforce\nStripe\nSync Stripe customer and order data\nSquarespace\nConnect commerce and website data to Mailchimp\nWooCommerce\nAccess powerful marketing features\nMeta Lead Ads\nConnect leads from Facebook, Messenger, or Instagram\nSquare\nBring customer data and marketing tools together\nShop","brandColors":["#241D13","#524734","#353026","#302719"],"ogImage":"https://mailchimp.com/ctf/images/yzco4xsimv0y/1SB1jCYU95Dh5YDdrucTh0/add18363e44ff00d54254592c7c0860c/Intuit_Mailchimp_-_Wordmark_2023_-_Recirculation_.png","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second vertical promo for Mailchimp that turns email and SMS marketing into something anyone can start today. It opens on the overwhelm of growing a business, then snaps into Mailchimp’s drag-and-drop builder, AI-powered emails, always-on automations, and SMS that reaches customers on the right device. Built for small businesses and solo marketers who want revenue without a steep learning curve. Closes hard on 300+ integrations, award-winning 24/7 support, a free start, and the limited-time 50% off Standard for 12 months — bold, poster-loud, impossible to scroll past.","subject":"email marketing app and phone SMS","audience":"Small business owners and solo marketers who need simple email and SMS growth tools","tone":"bold, kinetic, confident, approachable","goal":"Get the viewer to start a free Mailchimp trial or claim the 50% off offer","keyMessages":["Email & SMS marketing minus the learning curve","AI tools, automations, and analytics that drive revenue","Drag-and-drop builder with 300+ templates","300+ integrations with tools you already use","Start free — or save 50% for 12 months"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Email & SMS marketing platform","Save 50% for 12 months — limited time offer","Four and a half star rating based on 33,000+ reviews","300+ beautiful templates","300+ integrations","24/7 live chat and email support on every paid plan","Get started for free","AI-powered tools and always-on automations"],"brandColors":["#241D13","#524734","#353026","#302719"],"suggestedFramePack":"poster-pop","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"punchy upbeat pop percussion","voProfile":"female, early-30s, bright, punchy, sales-confident"},"script":{"title":"Mailchimp Email SMS Made Easy","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Growing a business feels endless.","onScreenText":["Growing feels endless"],"visualDirection":"Task lists, invoices, and alerts slam into a chaotic vertical stack, then freeze mid-tumble.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"overwhelmed entrepreneur messy desk laptop","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Email and SMS — minus the learning curve.","onScreenText":["Email + SMS","No learning curve"],"visualDirection":"Chaos wipes clean as a bold Mailchimp wordmark and product hero snap into a poster lockup.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Drag, drop, done — three hundred plus templates.","onScreenText":["Drag-and-drop","300+ templates"],"visualDirection":"Real product UI in a browser frame — blocks snap into a campaign as template cards fan past on layered planes.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["pop","click"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s4","start":10,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceove