moving 24/7 with agents.\n→\nSee what Notion can do\n \nTriage product feedback→\n \nResolve support tickets in Slack→\n \nRespond to security alerts faster→\n \nAutomate weekly reporting→\n \nCreate your own developer tools→\nTrusted by teams that ship.\nUsing the most AI-native tools like Notion is an important competitive advantage for us to stay small while doing a lot.\nMichael TruellCo-founder & CEO\nNotion’s thoughtful design speeds up collaboration and decisions so we can deliver impact to our customers faster.\nRenee SolorzanoSr. Director of Product Design\nNotion Custom Agents help our team go beyond doing work with AI to building AI tools that do the work for them.\nBen LevickHead of Operations & Internal AI\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nGet started today.\nGet Notion free\nRequest a demo\nEnglish (US)\nCookie settings\n© 2026 Notion Labs, Inc.\nCompany\nAbout us\nCareers\nSecurity\nStatus\nTerms & privacy\nYour privacy rights\nDownload\niOS & Android\nMac & Windows\nCalendar\nWeb Clipper\nResources\nHelp center\nPricing\nBlog\nCommunity\nConnections\nTemplates\nPartner programs\nNotion for\nEnterprise\nStartups\nSmall business\nPersonal\nExplore more→","brandColors":["#CBE4FA","#C4DCF1","#B5C9DB","#94A7B9"],"ogImage":"https://www.notion.com/front-static/meta/teams-and-agents.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":3},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":1,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second vertical promo for Notion, the AI workspace where teams and agents create together. It opens on the chaos of scattered tools and unanswered questions, then reveals Notion as one system of record: capture knowledge, find answers instantly with citations, and automate busywork with custom agents that keep work moving 24/7. Aimed at teams that ship — startups to Fortune 100 — it lands on hard proof (100M users, 62% of Fortune 100) and a clean CTA to get Notion free. Confident, modern, and brisk, with bold color-block storytelling and product UI moments.","subject":"Notion AI workspace app UI","audience":"Product, ops, and engineering teams at startups and enterprises who need one AI-powered system of record","tone":"confident, modern, brisk, optimistic","goal":"Make the viewer feel their team could ship faster with AI agents — and tap to get Notion free","keyMessages":["Where teams and agents create together","Capture knowledge in one system of record","Get answers instantly—with citations","Automate busywork with agents 24/7","Trusted by 62% of Fortune 100","Get Notion free"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Trusted by 98% of the Forbes Cloud 100","G2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years","100M users in over 50 countries","Over 50% of YC companies","1.4M+ community members","62% of Fortune 100 use Notion","Get answers, instantly—with citations","Keep work moving 24/7 with agents"],"brandColors":["#CBE4FA","#C4DCF1","#B5C9DB","#94A7B9"],"suggestedFramePack":"story-blocks","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"bright confident electronica","voProfile":"female, early-30s, clear and assured, lightly upbeat"},"script":{"title":"Teams And Agents Create Together","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Drowning in apps and tabs?","onScreenText":["Too many tools"],"visualDirection":"App icons and browser tabs slam into a chaotic collage, camera jittering with kinetic energy.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Your knowledge is sc