n empty house running full heat and a climbing bill — then flips to the app reading routines and dialing temperature down the moment everyone leaves. Built for homeowners who want coziness without the cost. It closes on automatic savings: comfort when you’re home, lower bills when you’re not. Fast cuts, modern fintech-meets-home energy, confident and efficient.","subject":"wall thermostat and phone app UI","audience":"Homeowners who want lower energy bills without sacrificing comfort","tone":"punchy, modern, confident, efficient","goal":"Make the viewer feel energy savings are automatic — and want to try the app","keyMessages":["Learns your schedule automatically","Cuts energy bills without the hassle","Comfort when you're home, savings when you're not","Smart thermostat control from your phone"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Learns your schedule","Cuts energy bills"],"brandColors":["#0D9488","#0F172A","#F8FAFC"],"suggestedFramePack":"lumen-motion","suggestedDuration":20,"musicMood":"crisp upbeat electronica","voProfile":"female, early-30s, clear, brisk, confidently upbeat"},"script":{"title":"Smart Savings On Autopilot","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Empty house running full heat.","onScreenText":["Empty house.","Full heat."],"visualDirection":"Fast push through an empty sunlit living room as a wall thermostat glows high and heat shimmers across the frame.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"empty modern living room daylight","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Your energy bill keeps climbing.","onScreenText":["Bills climbing"],"visualDirection":"A bold bill total ticks upward in the foreground while the empty room softens behind layered planes.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"homeowner reviewing paper bill","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["riser"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"This 