inished lists. It opens on everyday chaos — scattered sticky notes, overflowing calendars, a phone buzzing nonstop — then slams into a clean smartphone interface that snaps tasks into order. Deep cinematic voice drives a dramatic arc from overwhelm to control. Closes hard on the invite to download and take the day back. Loud, thumb-stopping, high-impact energy.","subject":"smartphone productivity app interface","audience":"Ambitious professionals and creators who feel buried by daily tasks","tone":"dramatic, bold, cinematic, high-energy","goal":"Make the viewer feel urgent need to download and reclaim their day","keyMessages":["Chaos ends here","One app. Total focus.","Your day, under control","Download and start now"],"mustIncludeFacts":[],"brandColors":["#FED336","#FED84E","#FEEDAF"],"suggestedFramePack":"hype-wave","suggestedDuration":15,"musicMood":"epic cinematic bass pulse","voProfile":"male, deep 40s baritone, cinematic, dramatic and measured"},"script":{"title":"From Chaos to Total Focus","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":2.5,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Drowning in the noise?","onScreenText":["Buried?"],"visualDirection":"Hard slam-zoom into a buzzing phone as notification badges explode toward camera in frantic layers.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"phone buzzing notifications hand","role":"background"}],"sfx":["impact","riser"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":2.5,"duration":3,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Lists half done. Phones never quiet.","onScreenText":["Half-finished.","Nonstop."],"visualDirection":"Sticky notes and calendar pages tumble past in chaotic parallax, camera whipping through the mess.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"scattered sticky notes desk","role":"background"},{"type":"icon","query":"checklist","role":"inset"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":5.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"Chaos ends here.","onScreenText":["Chaos ends here"],"visualDirection":"Hard cut 