emed graphic."},{"atSec":14.8,"severity":"blocker","issue":"Text contrast failure on 'DAY'. The light yellow/grey text is illegible against the bright yellow background.","fix":"Change the color of 'DAY' to a solid dark navy or the accent blue (#2b5bff) to ensure proper contrast."}]},"quality_report":{"verdict":"flagged","flags":["4 text element(s) still below WCAG AA","1 screenshot(s) dropped by QA","QA: 6 blocker(s)"],"contrast":{"checked":true,"fixed":10,"remaining":4,"passes":2},"identity":{"remapped":0},"layout":{"duplicatesRemoved":0,"collisionsScrimmed":0},"assetFloor":null,"audio":{"lufs":-14,"peak":-0.06,"lra":1.9,"target":-14,"layers":{"voice":5,"sfx":4,"music":true,"ambient":false,"musicEnvelope":false}},"screenshots":{"kept":0,"dropped":1,"repinned":0,"problems":["wrong-content"]},"assetQuality":67,"templateFit":76,"qa":{"pass":false,"score":3,"skipped":false,"blockers":6}}},{"id":"6qgbwjoaiy","kind":"project","prompt":"A vertical promo showing what Notion actually does: the workspace, AI answers, and how teams run on it","duration":30,"orientation":"vertical","quality":"1080p","width":1080,"height":1920,"fps":30,"frame_pack":"story-blocks","frame_pack_user":1,"status":"done","progress":"finalizing","video_url":"/videos/6qgbwjoaiy.mp4","error":null,"used_fallback":0,"llm_tokens_in":73514,"llm_tokens_out":23933,"created_at":1785237090644,"started_at":1785237367804,"finished_at":1785237788376,"client_ip":"::1","voice_style":null,"captions_enabled":0,"upload_path":null,"task":null,"requeue_count":0,"intent":{"prompt":"A vertical promo showing what Notion actually does: the workspace, AI answers, and how teams run on it","websiteUrl":"https://www.notion.com","blogUrl":null,"hasReferenceVideo":false,"preferences":{"duration":30,"orientation":"vertical","voiceStyle":"auto","framePack":"story-blocks"},"website":{"url":"https://www.notion.com","title":"The AI workspace that works for you. | Notion","description":"Build Custom Agents, search across all your apps, and automate busywork. The AI workspace where teams get more done, faster.","headings":["Capture","Find","Automate","Where teams and agents Ship together.","AI where your team works.","Bring everything into one system of record.","Get answers, instantly—with citations.","Keep work moving 24/7 with agents.","See what Notion can do","Triage product feedback→","Resolve support tickets in Slack→","Respond to security alerts faster→","Automate weekly reporting→","Create your own developer tools→","Trusted by teams that ship.","Get started today."],"bodyText":"Product\nSolutions\nResources\nDevelopers\nEnterprise\nPricing\nRequest a demo\nLog in\nGet Notion free\nWhere teams and agents \nShip\n together.\n\nCapture context, find answers, and automate tasks with AI built for your team.\n\nGet Notion free\nRequest a demo\nPlay\n\nTrusted by 98% of the Forbes Cloud 100\n\nAI where your team works.\n \nCapture knowledge\nBring everything into one system of record.\n→\n \nFind answers\nGet answers, instantly—with citations.\n→\n \nAutomate busywork\nKeep work moving 24/7 with agents.\n→\nSee what Notion can do\n \nTriage product feedback→\n \nResolve support tickets in Slack→\n \nRespond to security alerts faster→\n \nAutomate weekly reporting→\n \nCreate your own developer tools→\nTrusted by teams that ship.\nUsing the most AI-native tools like Notion is an important competitive advantage for us to stay small while doing a lot.\nMichael TruellCo-founder & CEO\nNotion’s thoughtful design speeds up collaboration and decisions so we can deliver impact to our customers faster.\nRenee SolorzanoSr. Director of Product Design\nNotion Custom Agents help our team go beyond doing work with AI to building AI tools that do the work for them.\nBen LevickHead of Operations & Internal AI\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nG2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years\n\n100M users in over 50 countries\n\nOver 50% of YC companies\n\n1.4M+ community members\n\n62% of Fortune 100 use Notion\n\nGet started today.\nGet Notion free\nRequest a demo\nEnglish (US)\nCookie settings\n© 2026 Notion Labs, Inc.\nCompany\nAbout us\nCareers\nSecurity\nStatus\nTerms & privacy\nYour privacy rights\nDownload\niOS & Android\nMac & Windows\nCalendar\nWeb Clipper\nResources\nHelp center\nPricing\nBlog\nCommunity\nConnections\nTemplates\nPartner programs\nNotion for\nEnterprise\nStartups\nSmall business\nPersonal\nExplore more→","brandColors":["#CBE4FA","#C4DCF1","#B5C9DB","#94A7B9"],"ogImage":"https://www.notion.com/front-static/meta/teams-and-agents.jpg","hasRealScreenshots":6},"__ingested":true},"autopilot":0,"render3d":0,"compose_mode":null,"brief":{"improvedPrompt":"A 30-second vertical promo that finally shows what Notion actually does. It opens on a messy stack of tools and tabs, then snaps into one clean workspace where a team captures docs, wikis, and projects in a single system of record. Mid-film, AI answers a real question instantly—with citations—then Custom Agents keep work moving after hours: triage feedback, resolve tickets, ship weekly reports. Built for product, ops, and leadership teams who want one place to run. Confident, clear, and brisk, it closes on the proof: 100M users and the teams that ship, with a tap to get Notion free.","subject":"Notion workspace UI and team dashboards","audience":"Product, ops, and leadership teams evaluating an AI workspace","tone":"confident, clear, modern, brisk","goal":"Make the viewer grasp Notion as the AI workspace teams run on—and start free","keyMessages":["One AI workspace where teams and agents ship together","Capture everything into a single system of record","Get answers instantly—with citations","Automate busywork 24/7 with Custom Agents","Trusted by 62% of Fortune 100 and 100M users"],"mustIncludeFacts":["Trusted by 98% of the Forbes Cloud 100","G2’s #1 knowledge base for 3 consecutive years","100M users in over 50 countries","Over 50% of YC companies","62% of Fortune 100 use Notion","Get answers, instantly—with citations","Keep work moving 24/7 with agents","Bring everything into one system of record"],"brandColors":["#CBE4FA","#C4DCF1","#94A7B9"],"suggestedFramePack":"story-blocks","suggestedDuration":30,"musicMood":"bright clean electronica","voProfile":"female, mid-30s, clear and confident, lightly upbeat, unhurried"},"script":{"title":"Notion Where Teams Ship Together","scenes":[{"id":"s1","start":0,"duration":3,"purpose":"hook","voiceover":"Too many tools. Too much chaos.","onScreenText":["Tools everywhere?"],"visualDirection":"A frantic cascade of app icons and browser tabs collides into frame, stacking chaotic and fast.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["impact"],"musicCue":"intro"},{"id":"s2","start":3,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"context","voiceover":"Docs, wikis, projects—scattered everywhere.","onScreenText":["Scattered work"],"visualDirection":"Camera rushes across a cluttered desk of sticky notes and open notebooks, motion blur settling into unease.","assetNeeds":[{"type":"image","query":"messy desk sticky notes laptop","role":"background"}],"sfx":["whoosh"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s3","start":6.5,"duration":4,"purpose":"feature","voiceover":"One AI workspace where teams and agents ship.","onScreenText":["One AI workspace"],"visualDirection":"Chaos snaps clean as the real Notion product UI fills a browser frame; slow push-in across a team dashboard.","assetNeeds":[],"sfx":["swoosh","pop"],"musicCue":"build"},{"id":"s4","start":10.5,"duration":3.5,"purpose":"how","voiceover":"Capture everything into one system of record.","onScreenText":["System of record"],"visualDirection":"Pages and cards cascade into a unified sidebar on the real product UI; camera pans 